  ('686141315907417263', 'Jersey Shore: Family Vacation', 2018, 'Reality', 'Anthony Beltempo, SallyAnn Salsano', null, 'Pauly D., JWoww, Vinny Guadagnino, Mike Sorrentino, Deena Cortese', 'TV-14', 'The cast of Jersey Shore swore they would always do a vacation together. Now, five years, five kids, three marriages, and who knows how many GTL sessions later, the gang is back together and on vacation in a swanky house in Miami Beach.', 'The cast of Jersey Shore swore they would always do a vacation together. Now, five years, five kids, three marriages, and who knows how many GTL sessions later, the gang is back together and on vacation in a swanky house in Miami Beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9bzs5aESomtSrKi39NKrre5tC7.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:78533'),
