  ('454334354152495721', 'Jim Button and Luke the Engine Driver', 1977, 'Kids, Family, Animation', 'Michael Ende, Manfred Jenning', null, 'Manfred Jenning, Winfried Küppers, Gerhard Jentsch, Arno Bergler, Rose Oehmichen', null, 'The story begins on a tiny island called Morrowland, which has just enough space for a small palace, a train station and rails all around the island, a grocery store, a small house, a king, two subjects, a locomotive named Emma, and a locomotive engineer by the name of Luke.', 'The story begins on a tiny island called Morrowland, which has just enough space for a small palace, a train station and rails all around the island, a grocery store, a small house, a king, two subjects, a locomotive named Emma, and a locomotive engineer by the name of Luke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZgk2UkEkxjQN7HBMlanTT6kdtT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76571'),
  ('358652305522774003', 'Jim Gaffigan: The Pale Tourist', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'Jim Gaffigan', null, 'In The Pale Tourist, Gaffigan boldly goes where no stand-up comedian has gone before: everywhere. The two hour-long specials were filmed as part of Gaffigan''s The Pale Tourist worldwide tour, in which he traveled the world--in each country meeting people, eating the food, and learning a bit about the history. He would then transform those experiences into a stand-up set of all-new material and perform it for locals and expatriates, before heading on to another destination and doing it all over again.', 'In The Pale Tourist, Gaffigan boldly goes where no stand-up comedian has gone before: everywhere. The two hour-long specials were filmed as part of Gaffigan''s The Pale Tourist worldwide tour, in which he traveled the world--in each country meeting people, eating the food, and learning a bit about the history. He would then transform those experiences into a stand-up set of all-new material and perform it for locals and expatriates, before heading on to another destination and doing it all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3kkAJuJsuw2zpLYDuAEK34bnJu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105031'),
  ('622838757213171441', 'Jim Henson''s Creature Shop Challenge', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Brian Henson, Gigi Edgley, Beth Hathaway, Kirk R. Thatcher', null, 'Ten aspiring creature creators competing to out-imagine one another in a series of challenges where they build everything from mechanical characters to whimsical beasts, bringing high-end creature designs to life. The contestants compete for a prize worth up to $100,000 including the opportunity for the job of a lifetime - a contract working at the world-renowned Jim Henson’s Creature Shop™.', 'Ten aspiring creature creators competing to out-imagine one another in a series of challenges where they build everything from mechanical characters to whimsical beasts, bringing high-end creature designs to life. The contestants compete for a prize worth up to $100,000 including the opportunity for the job of a lifetime - a contract working at the world-renowned Jim Henson’s Creature Shop™.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipRoUJMkjJyac65xX6AXVT3zZDX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61569'),
  ('189931219242439905', 'Jimbo Presents: It''s My Special Show!', 2023, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Jimbo', 'TV-14', 'Join RuPaul’s Drag Race All Stars 8 Winner Jimbo as she clowns around in her own special studio - interviewing esteemed guests, playing out-of-this-world games, and taking it to the streets of Hollywood. Grab a front row seat into the mind of the world’s first self-proclaimed Drag Clown. It’s My Special Show!', 'Join RuPaul’s Drag Race All Stars 8 Winner Jimbo as she clowns around in her own special studio - interviewing esteemed guests, playing out-of-this-world games, and taking it to the streets of Hollywood. Grab a front row seat into the mind of the world’s first self-proclaimed Drag Clown. It’s My Special Show!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaMvw33vuj9Kk7xQ7xLU7x5beDl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232178'),
  ('775639736360867951', 'Jimihen!! Jimiko o Kae Chau Jun Isei Kouyuu', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mahito Kawamura, Usa Fujisaki, Hibiki Nanashino', 'TV-MA', 'The story follows Rena Yukuhasahi, a reserved office lady and Ryouhei Hachiya, a businessman and fellow colleague. Yukuhasahi appears to be the most reserved girl in the company, but becomes a super beautiful woman when she dresses up. Flustered in the presence of her transformed self, Hachiya insists on taking her out, only to find themselves in front of a love hotel.', 'The story follows Rena Yukuhasahi, a reserved office lady and Ryouhei Hachiya, a businessman and fellow colleague. Yukuhasahi appears to be the most reserved girl in the company, but becomes a super beautiful woman when she dresses up. Flustered in the presence of her transformed self, Hachiya insists on taking her out, only to find themselves in front of a love hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/to5FshluwPdO9d3Ucs7fagJL7OU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113360'),
