  ('59397395317254229', 'JK', 2006, 'Drama', 'Maria Adelaide Amaral, Alcides Nogueira', 'Maria Adelaide Amaral, Geraldo Carneiro, Alcides Nogueira', 'José Wilker, Marília Pêra, Wagner Moura, Débora Falabella, José de Abreu, Débora Bloch, Letícia Sabatella, Caco Ciocler', null, 'For decades, doctor Juscelino Kubitschek enters politics and becomes president of Brazil.', 'For decades, doctor Juscelino Kubitschek enters politics and becomes president of Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5qML9KnmwL3XyMacEKRRMiL5Mv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24731'),
