  ('34022911203340244', 'Join or Die with Craig Ferguson', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Craig Ferguson', 'TV-PG', 'Featuring comedian Craig Ferguson debating provocative and timely topics in his unorthodox and iconoclastic manner. Each episode features a panel of guests which will include celebrities, comedians and experts, as well as the American public through social media. History is back on the History Channel.', 'Featuring comedian Craig Ferguson debating provocative and timely topics in his unorthodox and iconoclastic manner. Each episode features a panel of guests which will include celebrities, comedians and experts, as well as the American public through social media. History is back on the History Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NZBqM4G73GQrTSj5czGxnH0wMH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65330'),
  ('1057126178003066012', 'Joint Venture', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cauê Laratta, Marcelo Starobinas, Chico Mattoso', null, 'Luis Navarro, Daniel Furlan, Leilah Moreno, Gabriel Salazar, Jorge Neto, Maxx Oliveira, Gabriel Milane', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a fictional modern-day Sao Paulo, where marijuana has been legalized, this series follows 29-year-old Biriba, a drug dealer who decides to give up his criminal life and enter the legal drug sales industry. Unfortunately for Biriba, going straight is more difficult than he could have imagined.', 'Set in a fictional modern-day Sao Paulo, where marijuana has been legalized, this series follows 29-year-old Biriba, a drug dealer who decides to give up his criminal life and enter the legal drug sales industry. Unfortunately for Biriba, going straight is more difficult than he could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCLY9HHbqPesoElsQsABK2VwCau.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91907'),
  ('567621682206739988', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure', 1993, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jurota Kosugi, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Chikao Ohtsuka, Katsuji Mori, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Nobuo Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'Jotaro Kujo is a popular high school student – at least until that day when he thinks he is possessed by a ghost, which is why he locks himself up. During a fight between his grandfather and his grandfather’s friend Muhammad Abdul, he notices that the ghost is his “Stand”, named "Star Platinium", his fighting aura. Later, his mother also gets such a “Stand” and thus falls ill. Jotaro learns that a man named Dio Brando, who was defeated by Jotaro’s great-great-grandfather a hundred years ago, is to blame. He joins his grandfather and Abdul to destroy Dio once and for all.', 'Jotaro Kujo is a popular high school student – at least until that day when he thinks he is possessed by a ghost, which is why he locks himself up. During a fight between his grandfather and his grandfather’s friend Muhammad Abdul, he notices that the ghost is his “Stand”, named "Star Platinium", his fighting aura. Later, his mother also gets such a “Stand” and thus falls ill. Jotaro learns that a man named Dio Brando, who was defeated by Jotaro’s great-great-grandfather a hundred years ago, is to blame. He joins his grandfather and Abdul to destroy Dio once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PO6QwTuCQKucMAx72gREkWYwiF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60862'),
  ('832364798274976462', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Yohei Azakami, Kaito Ishikawa, Rie Takahashi, Kenta Miyake', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the intergenerational feud between the Joestar Family and various forces of evil, the most prominent of which is Dio Brando and his followers.', 'Follow the intergenerational feud between the Joestar Family and various forces of evil, the most prominent of which is Dio Brando and his followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogAWwbh3frWtiTyyXrZaVFtqCgp.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:45790'),
  ('256881500915994876', 'JOKER GAME', 2016, 'Drama, Animation, Mystery', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Taking place in the year 1937 on the eve of World War II, the story involves a mysterious spy training organization known as the "D Agency." The organization is established by Lieutenant Colonel Yuuki from the Imperial Japanese Army. His ideals lead him to recruit people beyond military academy graduates and personnel, while training them to become skilled agents in arts of manipulation. These agents would become a specialized team to conduct operations. One such antihero agent, under the name Jirou Gamou, goes on a harrowing mission to uncover secret documents titled "Black Notes," while battling forces from within and without his own ranks.', 'Taking place in the year 1937 on the eve of World War II, the story involves a mysterious spy training organization known as the "D Agency." The organization is established by Lieutenant Colonel Yuuki from the Imperial Japanese Army. His ideals lead him to recruit people beyond military academy graduates and personnel, while training them to become skilled agents in arts of manipulation. These agents would become a specialized team to conduct operations. One such antihero agent, under the name Jirou Gamou, goes on a harrowing mission to uncover secret documents titled "Black Notes," while battling forces from within and without his own ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mvFLm2y4N6Et5JOFsSb9nhKPcd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65949'),
  ('799615443751812589', 'Joko & Klaas gegen ProSieben', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Joko Winterscheidt, Klaas Heufer-Umlauf, Steven Gätjen', null, 'Joko and Klaas are teaming up against ProSieben. In this game show, the duo must duel against various team-ProSieben celebrities to gain an advantage in the final round. If Joko & Klaas emerge victorious, they can do whatever they want the following day for 15 minutes at 8:15pm, during prime time. If they lose the finale, their channel can decide on an adequate punishment - funny, embarrassing, or annoying.', 'Joko and Klaas are teaming up against ProSieben. In this game show, the duo must duel against various team-ProSieben celebrities to gain an advantage in the final round. If Joko & Klaas emerge victorious, they can do whatever they want the following day for 15 minutes at 8:15pm, during prime time. If they lose the finale, their channel can decide on an adequate punishment - funny, embarrassing, or annoying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au4sRREFREWY5ltRkbCesGckbGV.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:89719'),
  ('579160783348625671', 'Joko Anwar''s Nightmares and Daydreams', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Joko Anwar', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Tales of supernatural sci-fi phenomena unfold in this collection of seven mind-bending, interconnected stories imagined by writer-director Joko Anwar.', 'Tales of supernatural sci-fi phenomena unfold in this collection of seven mind-bending, interconnected stories imagined by writer-director Joko Anwar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEn6tQQzUPzXw0Jn2foySOaBM6F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228958'),
  ('547277878499942922', 'Joko Winterscheidt Presents: The World''s Most Dangerous Show', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Joko Winterscheidt', null, 'Joko Winterscheidt takes on one of humanity''s biggest challenges: the climate crisis. Joko reaches his limits on this journey, driven to despair by the state of the world. But he also meets people who are fighting for a better, more sustainable world and who give Joko hope.', 'Joko Winterscheidt takes on one of humanity''s biggest challenges: the climate crisis. Joko reaches his limits on this journey, driven to despair by the state of the world. But he also meets people who are fighting for a better, more sustainable world and who give Joko hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRfmw4aYhVd4x8GGxfbbuRubZ2s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227684'),
  ('27886334916525329', 'Jon & Kate Plus 8', 2007, 'Reality', 'Bill Hayes', null, 'Jon Gosselin, Kate Gosselin', 'TV-PG', 'With a set of twins AND a set of sextuplets, the Gosselins are hardly your typical American family! Jon and Kate are the parents of this adorable bunch, and they are battling all odds to make sure their brood has a normal, happy childhood.', 'With a set of twins AND a set of sextuplets, the Gosselins are hardly your typical American family! Jon and Kate are the parents of this adorable bunch, and they are battling all odds to make sure their brood has a normal, happy childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4nHUhKUxE41jTeyuSYYBhxKMkV.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:12551'),
  ('717884517772034221', 'Jon Benjamin Has a Van', 2011, 'Comedy', 'H. Jon Benjamin', null, 'H. Jon Benjamin, Leo Allen', null, 'Jon Benjamin Has a Van is a live-action television comedy series that aired in the summer of 2011 on Comedy Central. The series stars Jon Benjamin as a reporter who tours around in a van to deliver uninteresting news to the viewers and to unsuspecting people while utilizing scripted scenes for narrative reasons. The series'' cancellation was announced in April 2012. Special guests include Patton Oswalt, David Cross, Jon Glaser, Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker, Matt Walsh, Ian Roberts, Jay Johnston, Bob Odenkirk, Chloé Dumas, Jerry Minor, Andy Richter, Larry Murphy, Rich Fulcher, Chris Parnell, Brendon Small, and Metallica guitarist Kirk Hammett.', 'Jon Benjamin Has a Van is a live-action television comedy series that aired in the summer of 2011 on Comedy Central. The series stars Jon Benjamin as a reporter who tours around in a van to deliver uninteresting news to the viewers and to unsuspecting people while utilizing scripted scenes for narrative reasons. The series'' cancellation was announced in April 2012. Special guests include Patton Oswalt, David Cross, Jon Glaser, Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker, Matt Walsh, Ian Roberts, Jay Johnston, Bob Odenkirk, Chloé Dumas, Jerry Minor, Andy Richter, Larry Murphy, Rich Fulcher, Chris Parnell, Brendon Small, and Metallica guitarist Kirk Hammett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3epRDwLQZxF2CB8PTRuTaprtTZx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39522'),
  ('131331333734968205', 'Jon blir bonde', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jon Almaas, Ellen Christin Heider', null, 'Jon Almaas and his wife Ellen''s dream of moving to a farm becomes reality, but life as a farmer becomes tougher than Jon had expected.', 'Jon Almaas and his wife Ellen''s dream of moving to a farm becomes reality, but life as a farmer becomes tougher than Jon had expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jax2VagatQd3XcRXPIBG0WnYUcS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:282483'),
  ('412289680507707664', 'Jonah From Tonga', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Chris Lilley', 'Chris Lilley', 'Chris Lilley, Tama Tauali''i, Jason Moleli, Lafaele Tauali''i, Tana Laasia, Eigaiwe Hunt, Doug Bowles', 'TV-14', 'Fourteen year old breakdancer and mischievous delinquent, Jonah Takalua, returns from Tonga to start a new life at Holy Cross High School. Dominating the playground with his gang Fobba-licious, amusing himself with endless filfthy jokes and a schoolyard rivalry with the Rangas, Jonah challenges the school system, getting himself into more trouble than ever before.', 'Fourteen year old breakdancer and mischievous delinquent, Jonah Takalua, returns from Tonga to start a new life at Holy Cross High School. Dominating the playground with his gang Fobba-licious, amusing himself with endless filfthy jokes and a schoolyard rivalry with the Rangas, Jonah challenges the school system, getting himself into more trouble than ever before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jj2kHoKOoLqwPkspckHo5EvdJi0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61011'),
  ('160162836814263013', 'JONAS L.A.', 2009, 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Roger S.H. Schulman', null, 'Kevin Jonas, Joe Jonas, Nick Jonas, Chelsea Kane, Nicole Gale Anderson', 'TV-G', 'Brothers Kevin, Joe and Nick Lucas are global rock stars — the band JONAS! When the trio aren''t on tour, the guys live in New Jersey on Jonas Street (the inspiration for the band''s name) with their parents, Tom and Sandy, and little brother Frankie. They attend Horace Mantis Academy with their childhood friend Stella Malone, who offers the boys endless style tips, and her best friend, star athlete Macy Misa.', 'Brothers Kevin, Joe and Nick Lucas are global rock stars — the band JONAS! When the trio aren''t on tour, the guys live in New Jersey on Jonas Street (the inspiration for the band''s name) with their parents, Tom and Sandy, and little brother Frankie. They attend Horace Mantis Academy with their childhood friend Stella Malone, who offers the boys endless style tips, and her best friend, star athlete Macy Misa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEsIQerKBbhFq8XIfktCv6EsDgm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12712'),
  ('103409024048594187', 'Jonathan Creek', 1997, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'David Renwick', null, 'Alan Davies, Sarah Alexander', null, 'Working from his home in a converted windmill, Jonathan Creek is a magician with a natural ability for solving puzzles. He soon puts this ability to the use of solving impossible crimes and mysterious murders.', 'Working from his home in a converted windmill, Jonathan Creek is a magician with a natural ability for solving puzzles. He soon puts this ability to the use of solving impossible crimes and mysterious murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvBej2dWaOBTVVJkdnPxoMX75aD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1895'),
  ('102238966107675718', 'Jonathan Strange & Mr Norrell', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Harness', null, 'Bertie Carvel, Eddie Marsan, Marc Warren, Charlotte Riley, Alice Englert, Samuel West, Enzo Cilenti, Paul Kaye', 'TV-14', 'With magic long since lost to England, two men are destined to bring it back; the reclusive Mr. Norrell and daring novice Jonathan Strange. So begins a dangerous battle between two great minds.', 'With magic long since lost to England, two men are destined to bring it back; the reclusive Mr. Norrell and daring novice Jonathan Strange. So begins a dangerous battle between two great minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aq6aqgHo3nzRTT84kV7DrJ8Ifyc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62717'),
