  ('643270013446268863', 'Jonny Quest', 1964, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Doug Wildey, Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Tim Matheson, Mike Road, Danny Bravo, Don Messick', null, 'The adventures of the 10-year-old son of a government scientist.', 'The adventures of the 10-year-old son of a government scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2KUXlkfGdUz8wKir0gznnXymsh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:962'),
  ('654105096896396331', 'Joran: The Princess of Snow and Blood', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Suzuko Mimori, Shouta Aoi, Raychell, Ayasa Ito, Chikahiro Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'The year is 1931. Prince Tokugawa Yoshinobu holds absolute control over Japan. Remnants of the Meiji era’s culture can be seen around the city, but scientific technology and Japanese esoteric cosmology Onmyodo are also developing. Yet lurking behind the glitz is Kuchinawa, a dissident group planning the assassination of the prince. Tasked to extinguish these dissidents is Nue, the government’s secret executioner group. Sawa Yukimura, who works for this organization, suffered at the hands of the Kuchinawa boss. Her entire family was murdered and she dedicated her life to avenging their death.', 'The year is 1931. Prince Tokugawa Yoshinobu holds absolute control over Japan. Remnants of the Meiji era’s culture can be seen around the city, but scientific technology and Japanese esoteric cosmology Onmyodo are also developing. Yet lurking behind the glitz is Kuchinawa, a dissident group planning the assassination of the prince. Tasked to extinguish these dissidents is Nue, the government’s secret executioner group. Sawa Yukimura, who works for this organization, suffered at the hands of the Kuchinawa boss. Her entire family was murdered and she dedicated her life to avenging their death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvM2DRD7QXMb15VM5HTcPj81o2C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117945'),
  ('1023517031303568834', 'Jordskott', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Henrik Björn', 'Henrik Björn', 'Moa Gammel, Göran Ragnerstam, Ann Petrén, Hans Mosesson, Elina Du Rietz', null, 'Detective Inspector Eva Thörnblad returns to Silver Height seven years after her daughter Josefine disappeared by a lake in the woods. The body was never found and the girl was believed to have drowned. Now a boy has vanished without a trace and Thörnblad wants to find out if there is a link to her daughter''s disappearance. At the same time , she will take care of the legacy of her father, the great entrepreneur Johan Thörnblad, who built an empire of timber and timber processing on the large forest owned by his ancestors. As the plot deepens more children are kidnapped and what initially seems like a police drama takes a more sinister and stranger twist with each episode.', 'Detective Inspector Eva Thörnblad returns to Silver Height seven years after her daughter Josefine disappeared by a lake in the woods. The body was never found and the girl was believed to have drowned. Now a boy has vanished without a trace and Thörnblad wants to find out if there is a link to her daughter''s disappearance. At the same time , she will take care of the legacy of her father, the great entrepreneur Johan Thörnblad, who built an empire of timber and timber processing on the large forest owned by his ancestors. As the plot deepens more children are kidnapped and what initially seems like a police drama takes a more sinister and stranger twist with each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Qg4FsXXJSA9tyyjAJNRJeypF51.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62097'),
  ('563502505677367324', 'Jorel''s Brother', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Drama', 'Juliano Enrico', null, 'Andrei Duarte, Juliano Enrico, Hugo Picchi Neto, César Marchetti, Tânia Gaidarji, Melissa Garcia, Cecília Lemes', 'NR', 'This Brazilian TV show tells the story of young Jorel''s Brother daily life, including dealing with his family, school and friends.', 'This Brazilian TV show tells the story of young Jorel''s Brother daily life, including dealing with his family, school and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkH0kJj4qTCKV2gH2lrDH6AHW03.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:74606'),
  ('497504668506696044', 'Jormungand', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Shizuka Itoh, Mutsumi Tamura, Sayaka Ohara, Unsho Ishizuka, Ami Koshimizu, Hitoshi Yanai, Go Shinomiya', 'TV-MA', 'Jonah is a child soldier and the newest bodyguard for Koko, an international arms dealer with an entourage of hired guns. The cold-blooded kid hates Koko’s line of work, but following her into the darkest corners of the black market might be the only way he can find those responsible for his family’s slaughter. Besides, his employer isn’t like most merchants of death. She uses guile and cutthroat tactics to keep her clients armed to the teeth—all while cultivating her own warped plan for the future of world peace. With the CIA desperate for her capture, assassins eager to collect her head, and the potential for every contract to end in ultra-violence, Koko and her comrades in arms bring the boom to every corner of the world.', 'Jonah is a child soldier and the newest bodyguard for Koko, an international arms dealer with an entourage of hired guns. The cold-blooded kid hates Koko’s line of work, but following her into the darkest corners of the black market might be the only way he can find those responsible for his family’s slaughter. Besides, his employer isn’t like most merchants of death. She uses guile and cutthroat tactics to keep her clients armed to the teeth—all while cultivating her own warped plan for the future of world peace. With the CIA desperate for her capture, assassins eager to collect her head, and the potential for every contract to end in ultra-violence, Koko and her comrades in arms bring the boom to every corner of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2v886zu4uziTmmtjRWXaWjf1QeU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46279'),
  ('680961952386603826', 'Jose Jose: The Prince of Song', 2018, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jorge Jimenez', null, 'Alejandro de la Madrid, Axel Arenas, Rosa María Bianchi, Saúl Hernández, Adriana Parra, Itatí Cantoral, Pedro de Tavira, María Fernanda Yepes', 'TV-14', 'This is the fictionalized life story of the international singing legend "José José", the man known in the entertainment world as El Príncipe de la Canción (The Prince of Song). Featuring his stunning vocals, turbulent past, and world-wide popularity, this drama series is a homage to a true icon of Latin pop music. During his 40-year love affair with the music industry, José gained international fame, sold millions of records, received several Grammy nominations, and even sold out Madison Square Garden and the Radio City Music Hall. His musical notes have become the melody of the romantics in Spanish speaking countries around the world.', 'This is the fictionalized life story of the international singing legend "José José", the man known in the entertainment world as El Príncipe de la Canción (The Prince of Song). Featuring his stunning vocals, turbulent past, and world-wide popularity, this drama series is a homage to a true icon of Latin pop music. During his 40-year love affair with the music industry, José gained international fame, sold millions of records, received several Grammy nominations, and even sold out Madison Square Garden and the Radio City Music Hall. His musical notes have become the melody of the romantics in Spanish speaking countries around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSq9jBmQFF5CyrCycG9kMXppATn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76541'),
  ('581023445432303346', 'Joseon Attorney: A Morality', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Jin-young', 'Woo Do-hwan, Bona, Cha Hak-yeon, Cheon Ho-jin, Song Geon-hee, Lee Doo-seok, Choi Hyeon-jin, Lee Go-eun', null, 'Set in the Joseon era, an exhilarating legal revenge of a lawyer who avenges the death of his parents by trial begins.', 'Set in the Joseon era, an exhilarating legal revenge of a lawyer who avenges the death of his parents by trial begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9s6F4IgFyPyjSh7n7wGMRO6Mp0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206715'),
  ('766383240376131719', 'Joseon Exorcist', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Park Kye-ok', 'Kam Woo-sung, Jang Dong-yoon, Park Sung-hoon, Jung Hye-sung, Lee Yu-bi, Keum Sae-rok, Kim Dong-jun, Seo Young-hee', null, 'A fantasy-action sageuk that takes place after the establishment of the Joseon dynasty and tells the story of the undead who come back to life after being killed by the royal family. ~~ The series was cancelled after two episodes.', 'A fantasy-action sageuk that takes place after the establishment of the Joseon dynasty and tells the story of the undead who come back to life after being killed by the royal family. ~~ The series was cancelled after two episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9Q1ldFc1OpCq3G5LulYmnvnFYd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113624'),
  ('931444093878135336', 'Joseph from Egypt', 2013, 'Drama', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Ângelo Paes Leme, Ricky Tavares, Maytê Piragibe, Anna Rita Cerqueira, Leonardo Vieira, Carla Cabral, Samara Felippo, Marcela Barrozo', 'TV-14', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diXtQic9EzM3HRpvA0PfL32kkJ0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65166'),
  ('1100878334794717286', 'Joséphine, Guardian Angel', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michel Lengliney, Philippe Niang, Laurent Chouchan', null, 'Mimie Mathy', 'NR', 'Josephine Delamarre is a guardian angel that Heaven sends to earth. With her psychological insight, ability of persuasion and magical powers, she manages to help people who have problems. She appears at the beginning of each mission; when the mission is completed, she disappears with a click of her fingers.', 'Josephine Delamarre is a guardian angel that Heaven sends to earth. With her psychological insight, ability of persuasion and magical powers, she manages to help people who have problems. She appears at the beginning of each mission; when the mission is completed, she disappears with a click of her fingers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bklI8tXDDScpibUCvrAjF9KwMtF.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:42083'),
  ('321856248949698871', 'Josh', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Elis James, Josh Widdicombe, Jack Dee, Beattie Edmondson', null, 'Sitcom about flatmates Josh, Kate and Owen, and their annoying landlord Geoff.', 'Sitcom about flatmates Josh, Kate and Owen, and their annoying landlord Geoff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLzksiAMPzEzZ0A0AT1wPK0X1XR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84475'),
  ('1134551146330956145', 'Joshi Kausei', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Rika Tachibana, Tomomi Mineuchi, Yurika Kubo', null, 'A silent high school girl anime that''s still cute, even if no one talks! This is a story about three girls and their fun high school life, centering around the unfortunate beauty, Momoko, the cool girl with glasses, Shibumi, and the gentle little Mayumi. Fun alone, fun with all. The daily lives of slightly dumb yet cute high school girls.', 'A silent high school girl anime that''s still cute, even if no one talks! This is a story about three girls and their fun high school life, centering around the unfortunate beauty, Momoko, the cool girl with glasses, Shibumi, and the gentle little Mayumi. Fun alone, fun with all. The daily lives of slightly dumb yet cute high school girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXoquJVPVojqBi78eecr2jLWXaM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87463'),
  ('222791276438709085', 'Joshiraku', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryoko Shintani, Nozomi Yamamoto, Ayane Sakura, Yoshino Nanjo, Kotori Koiwai, Aoi Yuuki, Saori Goto', 'TV-14', 'Joshiraku, abbreviation of joshi rakugo, is a satirical comedy that follows the everyday life of a group of rakugoka girls. A group of girls discuss random things and usually reach an unusual or humorous conclusion that''s far from the initial discussion topic.', 'Joshiraku, abbreviation of joshi rakugo, is a satirical comedy that follows the everyday life of a group of rakugoka girls. A group of girls discuss random things and usually reach an unusual or humorous conclusion that''s far from the initial discussion topic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67zsN2RRa187v8fwYxlN8c8T19X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79040'),
  ('777063358010823814', 'Josie and the Pussycats', 1970, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Dan DeCarlo, Richard Goldwater', null, 'Sherry Alberoni, Jerry Dexter, Cathy Douglas, Patrice Holloway, Jackie Joseph, Casey Kasem, Cheryl Ladd, Don Messick', null, 'Josie and the Pussycats is an American animated television series, based upon the Archie Comics comic book series of the same name created by Dan DeCarlo. Produced for Saturday morning television by Hanna-Barbera Productions, sixteen episodes of Josie and the Pussycats aired on CBS during the 1970-71 television season, and were rerun during the 1971-72 season. In 1972, the show was re-conceptualized as Josie and the Pussycats in Outer Space, sixteen episodes of which aired on CBS during the 1972-73 season and were rerun the following season. Reruns of the original series alternated between CBS, ABC, and NBC from 1974 through 1976. This brought its national Saturday morning TV run on three networks to six years. Josie and the Pussycats featured an all-girl pop music band that toured the world with their entourage, getting mixed up in strange adventures, spy capers, and mysteries. On the small-screen, the group consisted of level-headed lead singer and guitarist Josie, intelligent tambourinist Valerie, and air-headed blonde drummer Melody. Other characters included their cowardly manager Alexander Cabot III, his conniving sister Alexandra, her cat Sebastian, and muscular roadie Alan.', 'Josie and the Pussycats is an American animated television series, based upon the Archie Comics comic book series of the same name created by Dan DeCarlo. Produced for Saturday morning television by Hanna-Barbera Productions, sixteen episodes of Josie and the Pussycats aired on CBS during the 1970-71 television season, and were rerun during the 1971-72 season. In 1972, the show was re-conceptualized as Josie and the Pussycats in Outer Space, sixteen episodes of which aired on CBS during the 1972-73 season and were rerun the following season. Reruns of the original series alternated between CBS, ABC, and NBC from 1974 through 1976. This brought its national Saturday morning TV run on three networks to six years. Josie and the Pussycats featured an all-girl pop music band that toured the world with their entourage, getting mixed up in strange adventures, spy capers, and mysteries. On the small-screen, the group consisted of level-headed lead singer and guitarist Josie, intelligent tambourinist Valerie, and air-headed blonde drummer Melody. Other characters included their cowardly manager Alexander Cabot III, his conniving sister Alexandra, her cat Sebastian, and muscular roadie Alan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5CjUqhmxHqulHBZ37hwPXBCoCP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4489'),
  ('1105556492047309247', 'Josie and the Pussycats in Outer Space', 1972, 'Animation, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Don Messick, Janet Waldo, Casey Kasem, Jerry Dexter, Sherry Alberoni, Jackie Joseph, Barbara Pariot, Frank Welker', 'TV-G', 'Josie and the gang are accidentally launched into space.', 'Josie and the gang are accidentally launched into space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdoWG0ras2rpDdZkJQvVw21W7PO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24211'),
  ('198469399253321303', 'Journal of the Mysterious Creatures', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tong Yuan', null, 'Guo Hongbo, Feng Junhua, Wan Suwan, Du Qingqing, Shen Dawei, Xie Tiantian, Xia Lei, Yixiao Wen', 'TV-14', 'Yoshihito, a 23-year-old man who has no job or girlfriend. In order to make ends meet he rents out one of the rooms in his house. While he''s showing Lily, his first tenant, around the house, she''s suddenly attacked by a vampire named Vivian, and Yoshihito notices that Lily is actually a werewolf. As Yoshihito and Lily start living in the same house, Yoshihito is scouted for an organization that maintains order of the parallel universes, and strange creatures one after another become tenants in his house.', 'Yoshihito, a 23-year-old man who has no job or girlfriend. In order to make ends meet he rents out one of the rooms in his house. While he''s showing Lily, his first tenant, around the house, she''s suddenly attacked by a vampire named Vivian, and Yoshihito notices that Lily is actually a werewolf. As Yoshihito and Lily start living in the same house, Yoshihito is scouted for an organization that maintains order of the parallel universes, and strange creatures one after another become tenants in his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0YKdEnzMvsVoWqk0zIIdW8h94.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91160'),
  ('1066394676703622787', 'Journal with Witch', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Fuko Mori', 'TV-14', 'Reclusive novelist Makio Koudai has always preferred the company of books—but when her sister and brother-in-law pass away, Makio unexpectedly becomes the guardian of her 15-year-old niece, Asa Takumi. As they navigate grief, clashing personalities, and the challenges of living together, the two slowly open their hearts to each other, discovering warmth, understanding, and the meaning of family.', 'Reclusive novelist Makio Koudai has always preferred the company of books—but when her sister and brother-in-law pass away, Makio unexpectedly becomes the guardian of her 15-year-old niece, Asa Takumi. As they navigate grief, clashing personalities, and the challenges of living together, the two slowly open their hearts to each other, discovering warmth, understanding, and the meaning of family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6lhU9a8YOWKJyfJ7J2aajzKm4k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253476'),
  ('21316691576340524', 'Journey to the Center of the Earth', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Treat Williams, Jeremy London, Tushka Bergen, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Bryan Brown, Petra Yared', 'NR', 'Remake of Jules Verne''s classic story finds adventurers seeking a mysterious hidden land. They are joined by the wife of another man, who had previously gone on a similar expedition and disappeared.', 'Remake of Jules Verne''s classic story finds adventurers seeking a mysterious hidden land. They are joined by the wife of another man, who had previously gone on a similar expedition and disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVzzmq6DPk2VqkZhF3fQpn60ekK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46459'),
  ('854108228535563974', 'Journey to the Center of the Earth', 2023, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sebastián García Huerta, Óscar Jaenada, Margarita Rosa de Francisco, Mauricio “El Diablito” Barrientos, Manuel Márquez, Gabriel Goity, Paola Miguel, Valery Sais', 'TV-PG', 'Diego and his friends spend the summer at the camp run by Pompilio Calderón, an eccentric explorer. There they find a medallion that belonged to Pola, Diego''s grandmother. Following in her footsteps, they will experience incredible adventures in a parallel dimension as they try to save the planet from disaster.', 'Diego and his friends spend the summer at the camp run by Pompilio Calderón, an eccentric explorer. There they find a medallion that belonged to Pola, Diego''s grandmother. Following in her footsteps, they will experience incredible adventures in a parallel dimension as they try to save the planet from disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0s0th8B0ccWfQ3bm3bqYnXsGoI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125462'),
  ('108011746610605626', 'Journey to the West', 1986, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jie Yang', null, 'Zhang Jinlai, Cui Jingfu, Liu Dagang, Chi Zhongrui', 'TV-Y', 'Journey to the West is a Chinese television series adapted from the classical novel of the same title. The series was first broadcast on CCTV in China on 1 October 1986. The series became an instant classic in China and is still being praised as the best and most authentic interpretation of the novel. Unadapted portions of the original story were later covered in the second season, which was released in 1999.', 'Journey to the West is a Chinese television series adapted from the classical novel of the same title. The series was first broadcast on CCTV in China on 1 October 1986. The series became an instant classic in China and is still being praised as the best and most authentic interpretation of the novel. Unadapted portions of the original story were later covered in the second season, which was released in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAl4rX85qVbGeVslvQqFRDHsQ6X.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13923'),
  ('468285604760420539', 'Journey to the West', 1996, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Chu Kang-Ki, Cheung Wa-Biu', 'Kwong Wa, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Evergreen Mak Cheung-Ching, Benny Chan Ho-Man, Joe Ma Tak-Chung, Lee Lung-Kei, Chung Nam Wah, Cheung Ying-Tsoi', null, 'Journey to the West is a Hong Kong television series adapted from the classical novel of the same title. Starring Dicky Cheung, Kwong Wah, Wayne Lai and Evergreen Mak, the series was produced by TVB and was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in November 1996. A sequel, Journey to the West II, was broadcast in 1998, but the role of the Monkey King was played by Benny Chan instead, due to contract problems between Dicky Cheung and TVB. Cheung later reprised the role in another television series The Monkey King: Quest for the Sutra, which was broadcast on TVB but not produced by the station.', 'Journey to the West is a Hong Kong television series adapted from the classical novel of the same title. Starring Dicky Cheung, Kwong Wah, Wayne Lai and Evergreen Mak, the series was produced by TVB and was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in November 1996. A sequel, Journey to the West II, was broadcast in 1998, but the role of the Monkey King was played by Benny Chan instead, due to contract problems between Dicky Cheung and TVB. Cheung later reprised the role in another television series The Monkey King: Quest for the Sutra, which was broadcast on TVB but not produced by the station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jCQdd7HEKCI0lsPrzHdiEUYWNt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13922'),
  ('483984516638366442', 'Journey to the West', 2010, 'Drama', 'Cheng Lidong', null, 'Fei Zhenxiang, Victor Chen, Xie Ning, Mou Fengbin, Joan Chen, Yu Na, Tang Guoqiang, Wu Ma', null, 'A Chinese television series adapted from the classical novel of the same title.', 'A Chinese television series adapted from the classical novel of the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwh79xPRT6D8i73N5EIuZqodXo6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33037'),
  ('856111681854364556', 'Journey to the West – Legends of the Monkey King', 1999, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Wang Dawei', 'Qiao Zhen, Cheng Yuzhu, Liu Feng, Shen Xiaoqian', null, 'Sun Wukong, who was born from a magic stone, has been imprisoned underneath a mountain for five centuries for his mischief in the heavens. One day, the Guanyin told Monkey that the Monk Tang Sanzang will set him free and Monkey will join him on a pilgrimage from China to India. The next day, Tripitaka came and set Monkey free, and the two started their Journey to the West. Along the way, they meet two new friends, Zhu Bajie and the Hermit Sha Wujing, who join them on the journey; together, they face many dangers and evil creatures and sorcerers and learn to get along.', 'Sun Wukong, who was born from a magic stone, has been imprisoned underneath a mountain for five centuries for his mischief in the heavens. One day, the Guanyin told Monkey that the Monk Tang Sanzang will set him free and Monkey will join him on a pilgrimage from China to India. The next day, Tripitaka came and set Monkey free, and the two started their Journey to the West. Along the way, they meet two new friends, Zhu Bajie and the Hermit Sha Wujing, who join them on the journey; together, they face many dangers and evil creatures and sorcerers and learn to get along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKZIOhHYlurHGu6fqavLRZASyx2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85672'),
  ('132221536092766211', 'Journeyman', 2007, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kevin Falls', null, 'Kevin McKidd, Reed Diamond, Moon Bloodgood, Brian Howe, Gretchen Egolf, Charles Henry Wyson', 'TV-14', 'This mystery-drama revolves around a newspaper reporter named Dan Vasser who suddenly begins to travel through time to change the lives of those around him. When his travels reunite him with his long-lost fiancée Livia, life with his present-day wife gets very interesting.', 'This mystery-drama revolves around a newspaper reporter named Dan Vasser who suddenly begins to travel through time to change the lives of those around him. When his travels reunite him with his long-lost fiancée Livia, life with his present-day wife gets very interesting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHFsNhZ0ISP6asuT9D4h1oF457T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3184'),
  ('729941101890907806', 'Journeys in Japan', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Bill Sullivan', 'TV-G', 'Journeys in Japan provides an eye-opening look at the many unique places to visit in Japan. English-speaking visitors travel the length of the country, exploring the culture, meeting the local people, visiting historic sites and offering travel hints rarely found in guidebooks.', 'Journeys in Japan provides an eye-opening look at the many unique places to visit in Japan. English-speaking visitors travel the length of the country, exploring the culture, meeting the local people, visiting historic sites and offering travel hints rarely found in guidebooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9y6cze7R5skd1DSg7jTrfzv0IYH.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:78201'),
  ('461487159100975528', 'Joy of Life', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mao Ni', 'Wang Juan', 'Zhang Ruoyun, Li Qin, Chen Daoming, Wu Gang, Xin Zhilei, Liu Duanduan, Song Yi, Li Xiaoran', null, 'Zhang Qing, a present-day college student in culture and history major wants to study in professor Ye''s postgraduate class, so he decides to write a historical fiction to elaborate his perspective of analyzing ancient literature history with modern concept. In the fiction, Zhang himself acts as a young man Fan Xian with mysterious life who lives in a remote seaside town of Kingdom Qing in his childhood, under the help of a mysterious mentor and a blindfolded watchman. Fan goes to the capital when he grows up, where he experiences plenty of ordeal and temper. Fan persists in adhering the rule of justice and goodness and lives his own glorious life.', 'Zhang Qing, a present-day college student in culture and history major wants to study in professor Ye''s postgraduate class, so he decides to write a historical fiction to elaborate his perspective of analyzing ancient literature history with modern concept. In the fiction, Zhang himself acts as a young man Fan Xian with mysterious life who lives in a remote seaside town of Kingdom Qing in his childhood, under the help of a mysterious mentor and a blindfolded watchman. Fan goes to the capital when he grows up, where he experiences plenty of ordeal and temper. Fan persists in adhering the rule of justice and goodness and lives his own glorious life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NXlOAFSUPBujmWbnUmqnwNZQhO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:95842'),
  ('528045953529907645', 'Ju-On: Origins', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Takashi Shimizu', null, 'Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Yuina Kuroshima, Kohki Osamura, Seiko Iwaido, Kai Inowaki, Ryushin Tei, Yuya Matsuura, Kaho Tsuchimura', 'TV-MA', 'A paranormal researcher searches obsessively for a cursed home where something terrible happened to a mother and her child long ago.', 'A paranormal researcher searches obsessively for a cursed home where something terrible happened to a mother and her child long ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18cT0p9UbJGhKDlwcOF214SXnsZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103445'),
  ('363701432814262178', 'Juacas', 2017, 'Action & Adventure', 'Carina Schulze', null, 'André Lamoglia, Marino Canguçú, Bruno Astuti, Mariana Azevedo, Juan Ciancio, Gabriel Chadan, Gabriel Falcão', null, 'Every year, in the middle of the Brazilian holiday season, CAOSS is held, a surfing championship that attracts thousands of tourists and hundreds of young people in search of the same dream: to become professional surfers. The event is very important because the team that wins the tournament has the passport secured to continue competing professionally on the official circuits. At the beginning of the series Rafa (André Lamoglia) escapes from the summer course imposed by his father, a great businessman, to pursue his dream of being a professional surfer and win the CAOSS tournament. Thus he manages to form his team made up of Billy (Bruno Astuti) and Jojo (Marino Cangucu) and which will eventually be called Juacas. The Red Sharks team will be the main rival in this championship.', 'Every year, in the middle of the Brazilian holiday season, CAOSS is held, a surfing championship that attracts thousands of tourists and hundreds of young people in search of the same dream: to become professional surfers. The event is very important because the team that wins the tournament has the passport secured to continue competing professionally on the official circuits. At the beginning of the series Rafa (André Lamoglia) escapes from the summer course imposed by his father, a great businessman, to pursue his dream of being a professional surfer and win the CAOSS tournament. Thus he manages to form his team made up of Billy (Bruno Astuti) and Jojo (Marino Cangucu) and which will eventually be called Juacas. The Red Sharks team will be the main rival in this championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WRhDUfhA7oh39GaJq3UYujoIEe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72682'),
  ('40345677408126881', 'Juan Gabriel: I Must, I Can, I Will', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Juan Gabriel, Olga Breeskin, Pati Chapoy, María Luisa Arcaraz Genesta, Daniela Romo, Rocío Dúrcal, Isela Vega, Ana Gabriel', 'TV-14', 'Rare videos and exclusive interviews reveal the genius, sacrifices and duality between the public and private lives of iconic singer-songwriter Juan Gabriel.', 'Rare videos and exclusive interviews reveal the genius, sacrifices and duality between the public and private lives of iconic singer-songwriter Juan Gabriel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHj6BA1TWnNRy8OnEkbBiRSYZH9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283396'),
  ('1148897472771440918', 'Juana Inés', 2016, 'Drama', 'Patricia Arriaga-Jordán', 'Patricia Arriaga-Jordán, Javier Peñalosa, Monika Revilla', 'Arcelia Ramírez, Arantza Ruiz, Hernán del Riego, Margarita Sanz, Lisa Owen, Yolanda Corrales, Néstor Galván, Luis Maya', null, 'She was a self-taught scholar and a nun. And she refused to apologize for being a woman born into a man''s world.', 'She was a self-taught scholar and a nun. And she refused to apologize for being a woman born into a man''s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCOiS5hJQAqBoZY52pjROwep0Mp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69920'),
  ('36207264575296837', 'Juana Iris', 1985, 'Soap, Drama', 'Julio Castillo, Carlos Téllez, Ricardo Rentería', 'Ricardo Rentería', 'Victoria Ruffo, Valentín Trujillo, Pedro Fernández, Adela Noriega, Blanca Guerra, Carmen Montejo, Adriana Roel, Eduardo Palomo', null, 'Juana Iris is a Mexican telenovela from 1985, starring Victoria Ruffo and Valentín Trujillo.', 'Juana Iris is a Mexican telenovela from 1985, starring Victoria Ruffo and Valentín Trujillo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWorB2Hx1fCA9VWXAhU1egxINhY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41708'),
  ('813800880526476706', 'Juana la virgen', 2002, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Otto Rodríguez', null, 'Daniela Alvarado, Ricardo Álamo, Roxana Díaz, Juan Carlos Alarcón, Jonathan Montenegro, Marialejandra Martin, Norkys Batista, Eduardo Serrano', 'TV-14', 'Juana la Virgen is Venezuelan telenovela written by Perla Farias and Irene Calcaño Cristina Policastro Basilio Alvarez, German Aponte and Julio Cesar Marmol Jr. and directed by Perla Farias and Tony Rodrigues. It is distributed by RCTV International all over the world.', 'Juana la Virgen is Venezuelan telenovela written by Perla Farias and Irene Calcaño Cristina Policastro Basilio Alvarez, German Aponte and Julio Cesar Marmol Jr. and directed by Perla Farias and Tony Rodrigues. It is distributed by RCTV International all over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8h8QDOQZw2GE54fwM180ebcgWd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19515'),
  ('311005703927371743', 'Juanpis González - The Series', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Alejandro Riaño, Carolina Gaitán, Julián Caicedo', 'TV-MA', 'A Colombian snob forays into the uncharted territories of dirty politics and true love while attempting to pass a test to inherit the family business.', 'A Colombian snob forays into the uncharted territories of dirty politics and true love while attempting to pass a test to inherit the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0ASqTjZAgHdmmAvGFmP2vWC0md.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155895'),
  ('624128515555677177', 'Jubei-chan the Ninja Girl: Secret of the Lovely Eyepatch', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ayaka Saito, Keiji Fujiwara, Reiko Yasuhara, Hiroko Konishi, Hiroko Konishi, Ryotaro Okiayu, Harumi Ikoma, Rie Iwatsubo', 'NR', 'Jiyu Nanohana is modern highschool girl and unwilling heir to the Yagyu Jubei school of swordsmanship.', 'Jiyu Nanohana is modern highschool girl and unwilling heir to the Yagyu Jubei school of swordsmanship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH7IwrE5vdWnA1TJYg7F9xt6JCy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34723'),
  ('984111986209310943', 'Jubilee', 2023, 'Drama', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Soumik Sen', 'Atul Sabharwal', 'Prosenjit Chatterjee, Aparshakti Khurana, Aditi Rao Hydari, Sidhant Gupta, Wamiqa Gabbi, Ram Kapoor, Nandish Singh, Shweta Basu Prasad', 'TV-MA', 'In a newly independent India, a studio boss, his movie-star wife, a trusted aide, a nautch girl and a refugee will have their paths cross in their pursuit of stardom and riches.', 'In a newly independent India, a studio boss, his movie-star wife, a trusted aide, a nautch girl and a refugee will have their paths cross in their pursuit of stardom and riches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1mIwrnnU80KGtaKDHgDFZs1DSU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222922'),
  ('1069010561669563305', 'Juda', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tzion Baruch', null, 'Tzion Baruch', 'TV-MA', 'Juda Ben Haim is a showy little thug, on his way to the biggest gambling in Romania with the money of a dangerous French mobster. A mysterious and beautiful woman shows up and changes all the picture.', 'Juda Ben Haim is a showy little thug, on his way to the biggest gambling in Romania with the money of a dangerous French mobster. A mysterious and beautiful woman shows up and changes all the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7km6cSMX5fwD74avX9f2709nRs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72670'),
  ('736835684780698697', 'Judd for the Defense', 1967, 'Drama', 'Paul Monash', null, 'Stephen Young, Carl Betz', null, 'High-priced Houston lawyer Clinton Judd and his assistant Ben Caldwell take difficult cases throughout the U.S.', 'High-priced Houston lawyer Clinton Judd and his assistant Ben Caldwell take difficult cases throughout the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHEqxBnBcPISQlOdcn7WVJSJord.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11812'),
  ('838802031564232422', 'Judge John Deed', 2001, 'War & Politics, Drama, Crime', 'G.F. Newman', null, 'Jenny Seagrove, Martin Shaw, Louisa Clein, Donald Sinden, Simon Chandler, Barbara Thorn, Caroline Langrishe, Simon Ward', 'NR', 'Judge John Deed is a British legal drama television series produced by the BBC in association with One-Eyed Dog for BBC One. It was created by G.F. Newman and stars Martin Shaw as Sir John Deed, a High Court judge who tries to seek real justice in the cases before him. It also stars Jenny Seagrove as the barrister Jo Mills, frequently the object of Deed''s desire. A pilot episode was broadcast on 9 January 2001, followed by the first full series on 26 November 2001. The sixth and last series concluded on 18 January 2007. The programme then went on an indefinite break after Shaw became involved in another television programme, and he and Seagrove expressed a wish for the format of the series to change before they filmed new episodes. By 2009, the series had officially been cancelled. The six series produced make it the longest-running BBC legal drama. The factual accuracy of the series is often criticised by legal professionals and journalists; many of the decisions taken by Deed are unlikely to happen in a real court. The romanticised vision of the court system created by Newman caused a judge to issue a warning to a jury not to let the series influence their view of trials—referring to an episode where Deed flouts rules when called up for jury duty. Another episode led to complaints about biased and incorrect information about the MMR vaccine, leading the BBC to ban repeats of it in its original form. All six series have been released on DVD in the UK.', 'Judge John Deed is a British legal drama television series produced by the BBC in association with One-Eyed Dog for BBC One. It was created by G.F. Newman and stars Martin Shaw as Sir John Deed, a High Court judge who tries to seek real justice in the cases before him. It also stars Jenny Seagrove as the barrister Jo Mills, frequently the object of Deed''s desire. A pilot episode was broadcast on 9 January 2001, followed by the first full series on 26 November 2001. The sixth and last series concluded on 18 January 2007. The programme then went on an indefinite break after Shaw became involved in another television programme, and he and Seagrove expressed a wish for the format of the series to change before they filmed new episodes. By 2009, the series had officially been cancelled. The six series produced make it the longest-running BBC legal drama. The factual accuracy of the series is often criticised by legal professionals and journalists; many of the decisions taken by Deed are unlikely to happen in a real court. The romanticised vision of the court system created by Newman caused a judge to issue a warning to a jury not to let the series influence their view of trials—referring to an episode where Deed flouts rules when called up for jury duty. Another episode led to complaints about biased and incorrect information about the MMR vaccine, leading the BBC to ban repeats of it in its original form. All six series have been released on DVD in the UK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltAeTRyVxmWeU4G0vTZZtulNFSJ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4963'),
  ('917719843850544045', 'Judge Judy', 1996, 'Crime', 'Judith Sheindlin', null, 'Judith Sheindlin, Petri Hawkins-Byrd, Steven Kamer', 'TV-PG', 'Judge Judy is an American arbitration-based reality court show presided over by retired Manhattan Family Court Judge Judith Sheindlin. The show features Sheindlin adjudicating real-life small claims disputes within a simulated courtroom set. All parties involved must sign contracts, agreeing to arbitration under Sheindlin. The series is in first-run syndication and distributed by CBS Television Distribution. Judge Judy, which premiered on September 16, 1996, reportedly revitalized the court show genre. Only two other arbitration-based reality court shows preceded it, The People''s Court and Jones and Jury. Sheindlin has been credited with introducing the "tough" adjudicating approach into the judicial genre, which has led to several imitators. The two court shows that outnumber Judge Judy''s seasons, The People''s Court and Divorce Court, have both lasted via multiple lives of production and shifting arbiters, making Sheindlin''s span as a television arbiter the longest.', 'Judge Judy is an American arbitration-based reality court show presided over by retired Manhattan Family Court Judge Judith Sheindlin. The show features Sheindlin adjudicating real-life small claims disputes within a simulated courtroom set. All parties involved must sign contracts, agreeing to arbitration under Sheindlin. The series is in first-run syndication and distributed by CBS Television Distribution. Judge Judy, which premiered on September 16, 1996, reportedly revitalized the court show genre. Only two other arbitration-based reality court shows preceded it, The People''s Court and Jones and Jury. Sheindlin has been credited with introducing the "tough" adjudicating approach into the judicial genre, which has led to several imitators. The two court shows that outnumber Judge Judy''s seasons, The People''s Court and Divorce Court, have both lasted via multiple lives of production and shifting arbiters, making Sheindlin''s span as a television arbiter the longest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRjTr7Om4qcjxVVZZW68zQA6J8x.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:3940'),
  ('150353229251061612', 'Judge of Song Dynasty', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Qian Lin-sen', 'Wang Liansheng', 'Wang Qingxiang, Liu Mintao, Tao Sun, Miao Pu, Li Hongtao, Shi Liming', null, 'Stories of a judge who lives in the Song Dynasty of China and familiar with forensic pathology.', 'Stories of a judge who lives in the Song Dynasty of China and familiar with forensic pathology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwjWpNLsc8lxDigu7LLBA41YIGN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82186'),
  ('558331875599291691', 'Judge vs. Judge', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lee Gwang-young', 'Seo In', 'Park Eun-bin, Yeon Woo-jin, Dong Ha, Na Hae-ryung, Kim Hae-sook, Lee Duck-hwa, Heo Joon-seok, Jung Yoo-min', null, 'An unconventional judge sets out to prove the innocence of her brother, a convict accused of rape and murder, with the help of a fellow justice.', 'An unconventional judge sets out to prove the innocence of her brother, a convict accused of rape and murder, with the help of a fellow justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Bc9d4rqvTacG6r64ec1dwXpl88.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74831'),
  ('1071356937303551445', 'Judging Amy', 1999, 'Drama', 'Bill D''Elia, Amy Brenneman', null, 'Amy Brenneman, Richard T. Jones, Dan Futterman, Jessica Tuck, Marcus Giamatti, Karle Warren, Jillian Armenante, Timothy Omundson', 'TV-PG', 'Judging Amy is an American television drama that was telecast from September 19, 1999, through May 3, 2005, on CBS-TV. This TV series starred Amy Brenneman and Tyne Daly. Its main character is a judge who serves in a family court, and in addition to the family-related cases that she adjudicates, many episodes of the show focus on her own experiences as a divorced mother, and on the experiences of her mother, a social worker who works in the field of child welfare. This series was based on the life experiences of Brenneman''s mother.', 'Judging Amy is an American television drama that was telecast from September 19, 1999, through May 3, 2005, on CBS-TV. This TV series starred Amy Brenneman and Tyne Daly. Its main character is a judge who serves in a family court, and in addition to the family-related cases that she adjudicates, many episodes of the show focus on her own experiences as a divorced mother, and on the experiences of her mother, a social worker who works in the field of child welfare. This series was based on the life experiences of Brenneman''s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Znl8HNStdoHHy0hqdljpDZnVRn.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2026'),
  ('938667523846909684', 'Judy Justice', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Judith Sheindlin, Kevin Rasco, Whitney Kumar, Sarah Rose', 'TV-14', 'The Honorable Judy Sheindlin, retired Judge of the Manhattan family Court, brings her signature blend of sharp wit and wisdom, hilarious candor and unwavering honesty that has made her America’s favorite judge for over 25 years, as she presides over real cases, arbitrates binding decisions and delivers what only she can: “Judy Justice.”', 'The Honorable Judy Sheindlin, retired Judge of the Manhattan family Court, brings her signature blend of sharp wit and wisdom, hilarious candor and unwavering honesty that has made her America’s favorite judge for over 25 years, as she presides over real cases, arbitrates binding decisions and delivers what only she can: “Judy Justice.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFYwkYbCoycCJbZbULRfF9QxRPB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:114294'),
  ('1022235569912679791', 'Juegos interrumpidos', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Socorro González Ocampo', null, null, null, 'A Mexican-American mother discovers her adopted son was trafficked. Facing a moral dilemma, she searches for the truth, jeopardizing her family''s emotional stability and lives.', 'A Mexican-American mother discovers her adopted son was trafficked. Facing a moral dilemma, she searches for the truth, jeopardizing her family''s emotional stability and lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWfRksV6ekEHCu3MPgncQzJ5w2s.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:263149'),
  ('834476393691860683', 'Jugglers', 2017, 'Comedy', null, 'Jo Yong', 'Choi Daniel, Baek Jin-hee, Kang Hye-jung, Lee Won-keun, Cha Joo-young, Jung Hye-in, Kim Ki-bang, Lee Ji-ha', null, 'Jwa Yoon-Yi has lived her life with a passive attitude. She has a spirit of devotion and obedience. Nam Chi-Won is the director of HB Company, but he refuses interests of other people and developing relationships. The woman and man meet as secretary and boss.', 'Jwa Yoon-Yi has lived her life with a passive attitude. She has a spirit of devotion and obedience. Nam Chi-Won is the director of HB Company, but he refuses interests of other people and developing relationships. The woman and man meet as secretary and boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj4hQYcLBCHLroTR03ozLOZ2bWF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75310'),
  ('83198900285940931', 'Juice', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Mawaan Rizwan', 'Mawaan Rizwan', 'Russell Tovey, Nabhaan Rizwan, Mawaan Rizwan, Jeff Mirza, Shahnaz Rizwan, Emily Lloyd-Saini, Kevin Eldon', null, 'Jamma desperately wants to be the centre of attention, but his family are constantly stealing his thunder. His hyperactive imagination goes into overdrive and the world transforms around him in this surreal comedy.', 'Jamma desperately wants to be the centre of attention, but his family are constantly stealing his thunder. His hyperactive imagination goes into overdrive and the world transforms around him in this surreal comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDXtSnSnHmvTABTqqDWl5ZRAHNC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229836'),
  ('246454991356050469', 'JUJUTSU KAISEN', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Yuji Itadori is a boy with tremendous physical strength, though he lives a completely ordinary high school life. One day, to save a classmate who has been attacked by curses, he eats the finger of Ryomen Sukuna, taking the curse into his own soul. From then on, he shares one body with Ryomen Sukuna. Guided by the most powerful of sorcerers, Satoru Gojo, Itadori is admitted to Tokyo Jujutsu High School, an organization that fights the curses... and thus begins the heroic tale of a boy who became a curse to exorcise a curse, a life from which he could never turn back.', 'Yuji Itadori is a boy with tremendous physical strength, though he lives a completely ordinary high school life. One day, to save a classmate who has been attacked by curses, he eats the finger of Ryomen Sukuna, taking the curse into his own soul. From then on, he shares one body with Ryomen Sukuna. Guided by the most powerful of sorcerers, Satoru Gojo, Itadori is admitted to Tokyo Jujutsu High School, an organization that fights the curses... and thus begins the heroic tale of a boy who became a curse to exorcise a curse, a life from which he could never turn back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qQzMJG27XOJsyAEEIisoJB45j2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95479'),
  ('1009157995560436558', 'Juken Sentai Gekiranger', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Hiroki Suzuki, Mina Fukui, Manpei Takagi, Riki Miura, Sôtarô, Hirofumi Araki, Yuka Hirata, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'Beast-Fist is a form of martial arts where the powers of a beast can be acquired by sensing the beast in their hearts. There are two relative schools of the Beast-Fist. One, the Beast-Fist of justice, Geki Juken Beast Arts. And one, the evil Beast-Fist of Rin Juken Akugata. The two schools of warriors learn and change in order to increase in power every day, as they are destined to clash.', 'Beast-Fist is a form of martial arts where the powers of a beast can be acquired by sensing the beast in their hearts. There are two relative schools of the Beast-Fist. One, the Beast-Fist of justice, Geki Juken Beast Arts. And one, the evil Beast-Fist of Rin Juken Akugata. The two schools of warriors learn and change in order to increase in power every day, as they are destined to clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56voge0oikHcRUuA8JEGaVyleFl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3238'),
  ('740041334602828633', 'Jules Verne''s Mysterious Island', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kyle MacLachlan, Gabrielle Anwar, Vinnie Jones, Omar Gooding, Patrick Stewart, Danielle Calvert, Jason Durr, Roy Marsden', null, 'During the Civil War five survivors escape from a prison camp in Richmond, Virginia by hot air balloon and find themselves on an uncharted island in the Pacific. Far from any kind of known civilization, the island is inhabited with carnivorous monsters, bloodthirsty pirates, and mad genius Captain Nemo, who lives on the island for his own secretive ends.', 'During the Civil War five survivors escape from a prison camp in Richmond, Virginia by hot air balloon and find themselves on an uncharted island in the Pacific. Far from any kind of known civilization, the island is inhabited with carnivorous monsters, bloodthirsty pirates, and mad genius Captain Nemo, who lives on the island for his own secretive ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ea0BBhtuAVtOosZwVdgOrtj8oRD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72644'),
  ('446918989967828263', 'Julia', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Hal Kanter', null, 'Diahann Carroll, Lloyd Nolan, Eugene Jackson, Paul Winfield, Lurene Tuttle, Ned Glass', 'TV-G', 'Julia is an American sitcom notable for being one of the first weekly series to depict an African American woman in a non-stereotypical role. Previous television series featured African American lead characters, but the characters were usually servants. The show stars actress and singer Diahann Carroll, and ran for 86 episodes on NBC from September 17, 1968 to March 23, 1971. The series was produced by Savannah Productions, Inc., Hanncar Productions, Inc., and 20th Century-Fox Television. During pre-production, the proposed series title was Mama''s Man. The series was also unique in that it was among the few situation comedies in the late 1960s that did not use a laugh track; however, 20th Century-Fox Television added them when the series was reissued for syndication and cable rebroadcasts in the late 1980s.', 'Julia is an American sitcom notable for being one of the first weekly series to depict an African American woman in a non-stereotypical role. Previous television series featured African American lead characters, but the characters were usually servants. The show stars actress and singer Diahann Carroll, and ran for 86 episodes on NBC from September 17, 1968 to March 23, 1971. The series was produced by Savannah Productions, Inc., Hanncar Productions, Inc., and 20th Century-Fox Television. During pre-production, the proposed series title was Mama''s Man. The series was also unique in that it was among the few situation comedies in the late 1960s that did not use a laugh track; however, 20th Century-Fox Television added them when the series was reissued for syndication and cable rebroadcasts in the late 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hf9pQ311qdpg6uPz2cQt5pscCtm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10094'),
  ('424174899278354282', 'Julia', 2022, 'Drama', 'Daniel Goldfarb', null, 'Sarah Lancashire, David Hyde Pierce, Bebe Neuwirth, Fran Kranz, Fiona Glascott, Brittany Bradford, Robert Joy', 'TV-MA', 'Through Julia Child’s life and her singular joie de vivre, the series explores a pivotal time in American history – the emergence of public television as a new social institution, feminism and the women''s movement, the nature of celebrity and America''s cultural evolution.', 'Through Julia Child’s life and her singular joie de vivre, the series explores a pivotal time in American history – the emergence of public television as a new social institution, feminism and the women''s movement, the nature of celebrity and America''s cultural evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebXgoq33gsIC3ULeX53gZKN86No.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:116761'),
  ('523454954882022240', 'Julia Leischik sucht: Bitte melde dich', 2012, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Julia Leischik', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8SiQkf9sBbuxK2PME4DLeWdbM7.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:75955'),
  ('35049127415181136', 'Julia vs Julia', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'By gangatv Julia vs Julia', 'By gangatv Julia vs Julia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuATf6aqjIC9ivUmkqyDMoSlnEP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101050'),
  ('1089286125414764319', 'Juliantina', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Bárbara López, Macarena Achaga', null, 'A spin-off for Juliana and Valentina from the Spanish soap opera, Amar a Muerte. Story of two girls with many differences such as social status and education, but that didn''t stop them from being very good friends who ended up falling in love. With a surprising and nothing morbid interpretation the actresses gave voice and courage to many to express their feelings without fear. A love story that shows us that Love is Love.', 'A spin-off for Juliana and Valentina from the Spanish soap opera, Amar a Muerte. Story of two girls with many differences such as social status and education, but that didn''t stop them from being very good friends who ended up falling in love. With a surprising and nothing morbid interpretation the actresses gave voice and courage to many to express their feelings without fear. A love story that shows us that Love is Love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loqrU2DvWUhghU2hPkWPaen4lSJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95314'),
  ('30561111801778927', 'Julie and the Phantoms', 2020, 'Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Cross, David Hoge', 'David Hoge, Nora Sullivan, Nora Sullivan', 'Madison Reyes, Charlie Gillespie, Sacha Carlson, Owen Patrick Joyner, Jeremy Shada, Jadah Marie', 'TV-G', 'Teenage Julie finds her passion for music and life while helping the Phantoms -- a trio of ghostly guys -- become the band they were never able to be.', 'Teenage Julie finds her passion for music and life while helping the Phantoms -- a trio of ghostly guys -- become the band they were never able to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6uNY62Rx6gpUkC7urCOrOTlaj2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106292'),
  ('650840709029320807', 'Julie Lescaut', 1992, 'Drama', 'Alexis Lecaye', null, 'Mouss Diouf, Véronique Genest, Jennifer Lauret', null, 'Julie Lescaut is a French-language police television series. It has been distributed since 1992 on TF1, La Une-RTBF and TSR; the show remains active as of 2010. It details the investigations of detective Julie Lescaut and her team. The show is aired in various other languages, including German, Japanese, Catalan, Persian, and Czech.', 'Julie Lescaut is a French-language police television series. It has been distributed since 1992 on TF1, La Une-RTBF and TSR; the show remains active as of 2010. It details the investigations of detective Julie Lescaut and her team. The show is aired in various other languages, including German, Japanese, Catalan, Persian, and Czech.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXhpkBBfsT3HcPpSaA7oLfiTwKD.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:7669'),
  ('335792446236953321', 'Julie''s Greenroom', 2017, 'Family, Kids', 'Judy Rothman Rofé, Emma Walton Hamilton, Julie Andrews', null, 'Julie Andrews, Giullian Yao Gioiello, Frankie Cordero, Jennifer Barnhart, Tyler Bunch, Stephanie D''Abruzzo, Dorien Davies, John Tartaglia', null, 'Ms. Julie teaches performing arts workshops with the help of her assistant Gus at their Wellspring Center for the Performing Arts.', 'Ms. Julie teaches performing arts workshops with the help of her assistant Gus at their Wellspring Center for the Performing Arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1FQBTHlHEhZ4RbkT1SRyH9t10w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69137'),
  ('1152683525568242006', 'Julius Caesar', 2002, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Uli Edel', null, 'Jeremy Sisto, Richard Harris, Christopher Walken, Valeria Golino, Chris Noth, Heino Ferch, Tobias Moretti, Jay Rodan', 'NR', 'Twenty year-old Julius Caesar flees Rome for his life during the reign of Sulla but through skill and ambition rises four decades later to become Rome''s supreme dictator.', 'Twenty year-old Julius Caesar flees Rome for his life during the reign of Sulla but through skill and ambition rises four decades later to become Rome''s supreme dictator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nso5Ljvy4e2uR1xt3wWC7MCeIr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48692'),
  ('736761338308007385', 'Julkalendern', 1960, 'Drama, Family, Kids', null, null, null, null, 'An annual Swedish Christmas calendar television series.', 'An annual Swedish Christmas calendar television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xvNeHD7CCAMpbkb9Q2UFB9Dva0.jpg', 66, 'tmdb:tv:126209'),
  ('236810114941330472', 'Jumanji', 1996, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ashley Johnson, William Sanderson, Pamela Adlon, Debi Derryberry, Sherman Howard, Melanie Chartoff, Bill Fagerbakke, Billy West', 'TV-Y7', 'Judy and Peter Shepherd are two kids that found a board game called "Jumanji". With each turn, the two of them are given a "game clue" and then sucked into a dangerous jungle until they solve their clue. There they meet Alan Parrish, who was trapped in the Jumanji jungle because he had never seen his clue.', 'Judy and Peter Shepherd are two kids that found a board game called "Jumanji". With each turn, the two of them are given a "game clue" and then sucked into a dangerous jungle until they solve their clue. There they meet Alan Parrish, who was trapped in the Jumanji jungle because he had never seen his clue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2s0v5wRdbJGBMrLHxr9WB2rPUJI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2118'),
  ('406409106870908759', 'Jumong', 2006, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, 'Choi Wan-gyu, Jung Hyung-soo', 'Song Il-gook, Jin Hee-kyung, Song Ji-hyo, Han Hye-jin, Bae Soo-bin, Ahn Yong-jun, Park Tam-hee, Song Ok-suk', null, 'Jumong examines the life of Jumong Taewang, founder of the kingdom of Goguryeo. Few details have been found in the historical record about Jumong, so much of the series is fictionalized.', 'Jumong examines the life of Jumong Taewang, founder of the kingdom of Goguryeo. Few details have been found in the historical record about Jumong, so much of the series is fictionalized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJj4tsSLu65tjcCx5yqHECfehD5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4734'),
  ('454539824090108669', 'Jun & Jun', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ki Hyun-woo, Yang Jun-mo, Jo Chan-hyun, Yeoreum, Jung Ye-bin, Lim Min-ho, Park Young-un, Kim Jeong-min', null, 'A former idol starts fresh as a cosmetics intern, only to face his flirty, tormenting boss—an old acquaintance. Tension rises, and sparks begin to fly.', 'A former idol starts fresh as a cosmetics intern, only to face his flirty, tormenting boss—an old acquaintance. Tension rises, and sparks begin to fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ac2W54ujGNNVXPyPvXOt3RAzDsE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229371'),
  ('542115847458720646', 'Jun Jiu Ling', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ze Xie, Pei Yun', null, 'Peng Xiaoran, Jin Han, Du Yafei, Wang Youshuo, Zhou Lijie, Hai Ling, Chen Fangtong, Liu Jun', null, 'On her wedding day, Chu Jiuling discovers her uncle, the Emperor, killed her father. Betrayed and nearly assassinated by her husband, she is rescued by a physician and takes on a new identity as Jun Jiuling. Using her medical skills and wit, she aids a noble family, infiltrates the capital, and uncovers political corruption while winning the people’s trust.', 'On her wedding day, Chu Jiuling discovers her uncle, the Emperor, killed her father. Betrayed and nearly assassinated by her husband, she is rescued by a physician and takes on a new identity as Jun Jiuling. Using her medical skills and wit, she aids a noble family, infiltrates the capital, and uncovers political corruption while winning the people’s trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkxgGrKZi9yea3smwoAwptbFFvH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132924'),
  ('719771759067212622', 'Jungle Cubs', 1996, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Jim Cummings, Pamela Adlon, Michael McKean, Rob Paulsen, Cree Summer, Dee Bradley Baker, Stephen Furst', null, 'Join cubs Baloo, Bagheera, Louie and the rest of the animals from Disney’s The Jungle Book as they live and play together in their jungle Cub House. Come along as they explore the mysterious Middle Jungle, ward off tricks from buzzards Arthur and Cecil and foil the mischievous schemes of Kaa and Shere Khan.', 'Join cubs Baloo, Bagheera, Louie and the rest of the animals from Disney’s The Jungle Book as they live and play together in their jungle Cub House. Come along as they explore the mysterious Middle Jungle, ward off tricks from buzzards Arthur and Cecil and foil the mischievous schemes of Kaa and Shere Khan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuLtd2uuU3yo5W7aStMwrTYMdQ5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10103'),
  ('547883133682988594', 'Jungle de Ikou!', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Eri Sendai, Megumi Hayashibara, Kappei Yamaguchi, Sumi Shimamoto, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Mako Hyodo, Ryusuke Ohbayashi, Akiko Yajima', 'TV-MA', 'Natsumi Rokudou, a spunky 10 year old girl from Japan receives a strange statue from her dad who''s an archaeologist. Little does Natsumi know that the statue houses Ongo, a terrible monster bent on world conquest. In a dream, a strange old man named Ahem warns Natsumi of Ongo''s return, and gives her a necklace and tells her to do a sexually suggestive dance that will protect her from peril. Once Natsumi awakens, she finds Ongo on her bed...who''s not too threatening looking. But now whenever danger rears it''s ugly head, Natsumi must swallow her modesty, and do the embarrassing dance to transform into Mii, the large breasted flower spirit of New Guinea''s past.', 'Natsumi Rokudou, a spunky 10 year old girl from Japan receives a strange statue from her dad who''s an archaeologist. Little does Natsumi know that the statue houses Ongo, a terrible monster bent on world conquest. In a dream, a strange old man named Ahem warns Natsumi of Ongo''s return, and gives her a necklace and tells her to do a sexually suggestive dance that will protect her from peril. Once Natsumi awakens, she finds Ongo on her bed...who''s not too threatening looking. But now whenever danger rears it''s ugly head, Natsumi must swallow her modesty, and do the embarrassing dance to transform into Mii, the large breasted flower spirit of New Guinea''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4keBPopOGxSbokHDdXrbQwMyduz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102177'),
  ('1110198832361169318', 'Jungle Junction', 2009, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Trevor Ricketts', null, 'Billy West, Laraine Newman, Jimmy Hibbert, Dee Bradley Baker, Jess Harnell, Keith Wickham, Jeff Bennett, Candi Milo', 'TV-Y', 'Set deep in the heart of an unexplored, road-filled Jungle, the show features a group of fun-loving animals on wheels and aims to help preschoolers develop their pre-literacy skills, as well as encouraging them to care about the environment.', 'Set deep in the heart of an unexplored, road-filled Jungle, the show features a group of fun-loving animals on wheels and aims to help preschoolers develop their pre-literacy skills, as well as encouraging them to care about the environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbvsTq54Rno0HMjeWVQwS8C5C1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:30905'),
  ('10156832796273555', 'Jungle King Taa-chan', 1993, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Goro Kishitani, Miki Narahashi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Koji Ishii, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Kotono Mitsuishi', null, 'Ta-chan is the king of jungle. He was abandoned in savanna, and has been raised by a chimpanzee, Etekichi. He has a dearest wife, Jane who used to be a top model in New York, but now she looks…Anyway, to protect animals from poachers, Ta-chan is fighting against them with his disciple, Pedro, and a master of Chinese martial arts, Ryo. This anime is based on the manga with the same title; it begins as a comical parody of Tarzan. The first several episodes are comedies, but the rest of the series consists of (rather) serious episodes.', 'Ta-chan is the king of jungle. He was abandoned in savanna, and has been raised by a chimpanzee, Etekichi. He has a dearest wife, Jane who used to be a top model in New York, but now she looks…Anyway, to protect animals from poachers, Ta-chan is fighting against them with his disciple, Pedro, and a master of Chinese martial arts, Ryo. This anime is based on the manga with the same title; it begins as a comical parody of Tarzan. The first several episodes are comedies, but the rest of the series consists of (rather) serious episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6CrujjLg9J7OfS9TpkOcb2piCl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70850'),
  ('174215682880947719', 'Juni Taisen: Zodiac War', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Shun Horie, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yuuichirou Umehara, Tomohiro Nishimura, Hiromi Igarashi, Yoko Hikasa, Ayane Sakura, Saori Hayami', 'TV-14', 'Every 12 years, mercenaries with the highest caliber of brute strength, cunning wit, and deadly precision gather to participate in the Zodiac Tournament. Each warrior bears the name and attributes of one of the 12 animals of the Chinese zodiac. With their pride and lives on the line, they engage in vicious combat until only the victor remains.', 'Every 12 years, mercenaries with the highest caliber of brute strength, cunning wit, and deadly precision gather to participate in the Zodiac Tournament. Each warrior bears the name and attributes of one of the 12 animals of the Chinese zodiac. With their pride and lives on the line, they engage in vicious combat until only the victor remains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIrzzvEo8ceLtw4NXVxNDwBcvO1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74095'),
  ('430763204892963152', 'Junior League', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Denis Nikiforov, Ekaterina Klimova, Igor Ogurtsov, Ivan Mulin, Vladimir Zaytsev, Sergey Gabrielyan, Serafima Nizovskaya, Vlad Kanopka', null, 'In the town of Podolsk, The Bears hockey club hires a new coach, Sergei Makeyev, a former National Hockey League player, who sets out to get the club to the Junior Hockey League and make The Bears a successful team.', 'In the town of Podolsk, The Bears hockey club hires a new coach, Sergei Makeyev, a former National Hockey League player, who sets out to get the club to the Junior Hockey League and make The Bears a successful team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUiI4wBTto4qJQZMucM8fc3UeUR.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:62082'),
  ('720846361424335195', 'Junji Ito Collection', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuji Mitsuya, Mami Koyama, Rie Suegara, Hiro Shimono, Hikaru Midorikawa', 'TV-MA', 'A collection of animated horror stories based on the works of Japanese artist Junji Ito.', 'A collection of animated horror stories based on the works of Japanese artist Junji Ito.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umIn2MeNsJAvzb8ztRrv2nhfJ28.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75775'),
  ('371066492889171796', 'Junji Ito Maniac: Japanese Tales of the Macabre', 2023, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'From the mind of horror manga maestro Junji Ito comes a spine-tingling selection of some of his most bizarre, disturbing and terrifying tales.', 'From the mind of horror manga maestro Junji Ito comes a spine-tingling selection of some of his most bizarre, disturbing and terrifying tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eE3vyu2F8upsQujhS8IP7QiG8Hm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203704'),
  ('971706901907127910', 'Junjo Kirari', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Taeko Asano', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Shigeru Muroi, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Seiji Fukushi, Shinobu Terajima, Haruka Igawa, Keiko Takeshita, Tomokazu Miura', null, 'The 74th NHK Asadora Drama is Junjo Kirari, which means something along the lines of "pure-hearted Kirari." The story is set in Okazaki City, Aichi Prefecture in the era around the Second World War. When the story opens in 1928, the heroine, Sakurako, is a very active seven-year-old girl. Indeed, even in the first episode she exhibits her confidence and enthusiasm. But above all else, Sakurako is interested in becoming a jazz pianist, and music features extensively in the plot.', 'The 74th NHK Asadora Drama is Junjo Kirari, which means something along the lines of "pure-hearted Kirari." The story is set in Okazaki City, Aichi Prefecture in the era around the Second World War. When the story opens in 1928, the heroine, Sakurako, is a very active seven-year-old girl. Indeed, even in the first episode she exhibits her confidence and enthusiasm. But above all else, Sakurako is interested in becoming a jazz pianist, and music features extensively in the plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AulomJRjwzM9sy9g0klD0xRpXVK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84539'),
  ('791620607974592591', 'Junjo Romantica', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Shungiku Nakamura', null, 'Hikaru Hanada, Takahiro Sakurai, Nobutoshi Canna, Kentaro Ito, Daisuke Kishio, Kazuhiko Inoue, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Kisho Taniyama', 'TV-MA', 'Three couples, three intense romances: a student’s tutor crosses the line, a loner meets a force of nature, and a carefree man faces love he can’t ignore.', 'Three couples, three intense romances: a student’s tutor crosses the line, a loner meets a force of nature, and a carefree man faces love he can’t ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkz26fcR3WTe503wkD52etcrGrc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:37548'),
  ('1122881542969702433', 'Jupiter''s Legacy', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Steven S. DeKnight', 'Hannah Rosner', 'Josh Duhamel, Ben Daniels, Leslie Bibb, Andrew Horton, Elena Kampouris, Mike Wade, Matt Lanter', 'TV-MA', 'As the world''s first generation of superheroes (who received their powers in the 1930s) become the revered elder guard in the present, their superpowered children struggle to live up to the legendary feats of their parents.', 'As the world''s first generation of superheroes (who received their powers in the 1930s) become the revered elder guard in the present, their superpowered children struggle to live up to the legendary feats of their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yxep7oJdkj3Pla9TD9gKflRApY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93484'),
  ('519671760537913702', 'Jura Tripper', 1995, 'Drama, Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Masami Kikuchi, Mariko Kouda, Michiko Neya, Ryuzou Ishino, Shin-ichiro Miki, Tetsuya Iwanaga, Tsutomu Kashiwakura, Wataru Takagi', null, 'Dino Adventure Jurassic Tripper is the title of a 1995 anime series consisting of 39 25-minute episodes. It is a loosely-based literary adaptation on the novel Deux Ans De Vacances by French author Jules Verne.', 'Dino Adventure Jurassic Tripper is the title of a 1995 anime series consisting of 39 25-minute episodes. It is a loosely-based literary adaptation on the novel Deux Ans De Vacances by French author Jules Verne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ9I17feOsJjWMuLOuLOCnn7LiO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45152'),
  ('876227402964052724', 'Jurassic World Camp Cretaceous', 2020, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Zack Stentz', null, 'Paul-Mikél Williams, Ryan Potter, Jenna Ortega, Sean Giambrone, Raini Rodriguez, Kausar Mohammed, Jameela Jamil, Glen Powell', 'TV-PG', 'Six teens attending an adventure camp on the opposite side of Isla Nublar must band together to survive when dinosaurs wreak havoc on the island.', 'Six teens attending an adventure camp on the opposite side of Isla Nublar must band together to survive when dinosaurs wreak havoc on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkCbCmlwjwT6QL44DqG7qE9ch8H.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:93741'),
  ('826347751237340649', 'Jurassic World: Chaos Theory', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', 'Scott Kreamer, Zack Stentz', null, 'Sean Giambrone', 'TV-Y7', 'The Camp Cretaceous gang comes together to unravel a mystery when they discover a global conspiracy that brings danger to dinosaurs — and to themselves.', 'The Camp Cretaceous gang comes together to unravel a mystery when they discover a global conspiracy that brings danger to dinosaurs — and to themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2Od0cY2IeayDj5osUxZSAD1QK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:237512'),
  ('294780179938274551', 'Jury Duty', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Lee Eisenberg, Gene Stupnitsky', 'Kerry O''Neill', 'Ronald Gladden, James Marsden, Edy Modica, Mekki Leeper, Kirk Fox, David Brown, Pramod Kumar, Susan James Berger', 'TV-MA', 'The inner workings of an American jury trial through the eyes of one particular juror, Ronald Gladden. Gladden is unaware the entire case is fake, everyone except him is an actor and everything that happens — inside the courtroom and out — is carefully planned.', 'The inner workings of an American jury trial through the eyes of one particular juror, Ronald Gladden. Gladden is unaware the entire case is fake, everyone except him is an actor and everything that happens — inside the courtroom and out — is carefully planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipiqT5uHeJudWy9ICSvuCby7NeI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222023'),
  ('370639091441730104', 'Jury Duty Presents: Behind the Scenes of Company Retreat', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A behind the scenes look at the making of the Company Retreat, a documentary-style comedy series that follows the annual week-long getaway for Rockin'' Grandma''s Hot Sauce through the eyes of their new temp worker, Anthony.', 'A behind the scenes look at the making of the Company Retreat, a documentary-style comedy series that follows the annual week-long getaway for Rockin'' Grandma''s Hot Sauce through the eyes of their new temp worker, Anthony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5QHNpFIeLN4z5J8gZ4STFHMLPo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:319013'),
  ('855431037982061659', 'Jury Duty Presents: Company Retreat', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Gene Stupnitsky, Lee Eisenberg', 'Rachel Hein, Alex Kavutskiy, Lily Citrin', 'Anthony Norman', 'TV-14', 'Anthony, a real temp, is hired at Rockin'' Grandma''s Hot Sauce (a fake company) for its annual retreat - the final one for the company''s CEO Doug before retirement. Doug''s son Dougie Jr. struggles to prove his leadership abilities while a polished private-equity team courts the company for acquisition.', 'Anthony, a real temp, is hired at Rockin'' Grandma''s Hot Sauce (a fake company) for its annual retreat - the final one for the company''s CEO Doug before retirement. Doug''s son Dougie Jr. struggles to prove his leadership abilities while a polished private-equity team courts the company for acquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CRKP1KJvloaUB89eDOAdFv3Tok.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312697'),
  ('941405514334336727', 'Just Add Magic', 2016, 'Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Mystery', 'Olivia Sanabia, Aubrey K. Miller, Abby Donnelly', null, 'Olivia Sanabia, Abby Donnelly, Aubrey K. Miller, Dee Wallace, Amy Hill, Catia Ojeda, Andrew Burlinson, Ellen Karsten', 'TV-Y7', 'Kelly Quinn and her two BFF''s, Darbie and Hannah, stumble upon her grandmother''s mysterious cookbook in the attic and discover some far from ordinary recipes. When the Shut''em Up Shortcake silences Kelly''s pesky little brother and the Healing Hazelnut Tart heals Darbie''s ankle, the girls discover they have the power of magic. A single-camera live-action pilot based on the popular book.', 'Kelly Quinn and her two BFF''s, Darbie and Hannah, stumble upon her grandmother''s mysterious cookbook in the attic and discover some far from ordinary recipes. When the Shut''em Up Shortcake silences Kelly''s pesky little brother and the Healing Hazelnut Tart heals Darbie''s ankle, the girls discover they have the power of magic. A single-camera live-action pilot based on the popular book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7olj5StoSFVsgkBhOihDaR56eJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62904'),
  ('76146830383108473', 'Just Add Magic: Mystery City', 2020, 'Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Andrew Orenstein', null, 'Tyler Sanders, Jenna Qureshi, Jolie Hoang-Rappaport, Shane Harper, Tess Paras, Matt Dellapina, Sydney Taylor, Elliott Smith', 'TV-Y7', 'In a spinoff of the successful series Just Add Magic, we follow the magic cookbook to Bay City as it moves to three new protectors: step-siblings Zoe and Leo, and their downstairs neighbor Ish. Each of the three brings a unique skill to the table, as the cookbook unlocks a centuries-old mystery that takes them on an historical adventure through the city streets in a race to find a secret recipe.', 'In a spinoff of the successful series Just Add Magic, we follow the magic cookbook to Bay City as it moves to three new protectors: step-siblings Zoe and Leo, and their downstairs neighbor Ish. Each of the three brings a unique skill to the table, as the cookbook unlocks a centuries-old mystery that takes them on an historical adventure through the city streets in a race to find a secret recipe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyxOHsLpn6ktH9gFngCV3AHvG9c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98078'),
  ('395515845070344781', 'Just Alice', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap', null, null, 'Verónica Orozco, Cony Camelo, Sebastián Carvajal, Michel Brown, Julián Román, Leo Deluglio, Ana María Medina, Daniela Tapia', null, 'Torn between two loves, Alicia secretly marries both a famous writer and a former priest. How long can she juggle love, lies and her double life?', 'Torn between two loves, Alicia secretly marries both a famous writer and a former priest. How long can she juggle love, lies and her double life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/207YZbjmhL6CAi6MxenjyeZLNUT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302723'),
  ('252281278017538992', 'Just an Excuse', 2022, 'Talk', 'Jo Eun-jin, Yoo Jae-suk', 'Kim Song-hwa, Kim Yi-jin, Jung Chae-hyu', 'Yoo Jae-suk', null, 'Yoo Jae-suk Welfare Content 🐓Pinggyego (Just an Excuse)🐓 It is a content where Yoo Jae-suk freely chats with his favorite friends for various excuses and provides small stories and laughter.', 'Yoo Jae-suk Welfare Content 🐓Pinggyego (Just an Excuse)🐓 It is a content where Yoo Jae-suk freely chats with his favorite friends for various excuses and provides small stories and laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n8dBK8wyGYN3Wf124ojxHHCkHF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215199'),
  ('315877396904677193', 'Just Be Happy', 2015, 'Family, Comedy', null, 'Barış Erdoğan, Volkan Sümbül, Cüneyt İnay', 'Ali Atay, Aslı Enver, Ertan Saban, Öner Erkan, Sait Genay, Tülay Bursa, Bülent Seyran, Nil Günal', 'NR', 'It''s story of an unknown town named "station" in Istanbul including love, neighborhood.', 'It''s story of an unknown town named "station" in Istanbul including love, neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFhyIxBPgEz80loY8cuIvP9RN8a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62497'),
  ('611658524226473562', 'Just Because!', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Aoi Ichikawa, Karin Isobe, Taishi Murata, Yuna Yoshino, Lynn, Arisa Sakuraba, Yuka Nukui, Reina Kondo', 'TV-PG', 'At the end of the second semester of third year of high school, four students are prepared for graduation and feel the ending to their high school life. But that changes a little with the arrival of a transfer student.', 'At the end of the second semester of third year of high school, four students are prepared for graduation and feel the ending to their high school life. But that changes a little with the arrival of a transfer student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4Ap7g0egqBt9JJA5qNfpxq4jN2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74096'),
  ('368898286777373595', 'Just Between Lovers', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim Jin-won, Yu Bo-ra', 'Yu Bo-ra', 'Lee Jun-ho, Won Jin-ah, Kang Hanna, Kim Min-gue, Lee Ki-woo, Kim Hye-jun, Yoon Se-a, Kim Kang-hyun', null, 'Two survivors of a building collapse discover support and love in each other as they overcome the pain of loss and reconstruct a hopeful future.', 'Two survivors of a building collapse discover support and love in each other as they overcome the pain of loss and reconstruct a hopeful future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZyBy282x8S8TRtC2MZev4SXl83.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74829'),
  ('307152699528132901', 'Just Beyond', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', 'Seth Grahame-Smith', 'Seth Grahame-Smith', null, 'TV-PG', 'An anthology series that tells astonishing and thought-provoking stories of a reality just beyond the one we know. Each episode introduces viewers to a new cast of characters who must go on a surprising journey of self-discovery in a supernatural world of witches, aliens, ghosts and parallel universes.', 'An anthology series that tells astonishing and thought-provoking stories of a reality just beyond the one we know. Each episode introduces viewers to a new cast of characters who must go on a surprising journey of self-discovery in a supernatural world of witches, aliens, ghosts and parallel universes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yByXllpVtTfDf2wT0qe1MSGdRFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120734'),
  ('541645413577163606', 'Just Dance', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim Kap-soo, Park Se-wan, Jang Dong-yoon, Lee Zoo-young, Joo Hae-eun, Shin Do-hyun, Jang Seong-beom, Park Soo-young', null, 'In a Girls'' Vocational High School in Geoje, six students dream to win a dance sports competition.', 'In a Girls'' Vocational High School in Geoje, six students dream to win a dance sports competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OV7EDX5Uk8sSKxsJ9CCcanmOps.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84512'),
  ('417148658213271360', 'Just Good Friends', 1983, 'Comedy', 'John Sullivan', null, 'Jan Francis, Paul Nicholas', null, 'A bittersweet sitcom about a couple who meet again five years after he jilted her at the altar.', 'A bittersweet sitcom about a couple who meet again five years after he jilted her at the altar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adwLG6hSd0ouu39IjFQtsVThemC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5654'),
  ('166111333732537982', 'Just One Look', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sydney Gallonde', 'Patrick Renault, Mehdi Quahab', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Thierry Neuvic, Thierry Frémont, Arthur Jugnot, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Julie Gayet, Joseph Malerba, Carole Richert', null, 'What if your whole life was just a lie? If the man you married fifteen years ago wasn''t who you thought he was? For Eva Beaufils, it took just one look at an old photo to turn her whole world upside down. Suddenly, her husband Bastien disappears. Eva has only one thing left in mind: find him at all costs. Even if it reawakens old wounds and puts their children at risk, Eva knows that this is the only search that can give her the answer... Can love overcome distrust?', 'What if your whole life was just a lie? If the man you married fifteen years ago wasn''t who you thought he was? For Eva Beaufils, it took just one look at an old photo to turn her whole world upside down. Suddenly, her husband Bastien disappears. Eva has only one thing left in mind: find him at all costs. Even if it reawakens old wounds and puts their children at risk, Eva knows that this is the only search that can give her the answer... Can love overcome distrust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9o1g3TIYPBuYA0OiRH7XL7nlbFA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72013'),
  ('565295082462098643', 'Just One Look', 2025, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Maria Dębska, Cezary Łukaszewicz, Marta Malikowska, Monika Krzywkowska, Piotr Stramowski, Andrzej Zieliński, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Mirosław Haniszewski', 'TV-MA', 'When an ominous photo mysteriously surfaces, Greta must confront buried truths — and her hazy memory — to save her husband from his dark secrets.', 'When an ominous photo mysteriously surfaces, Greta must confront buried truths — and her hazy memory — to save her husband from his dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XVpOMkrmq2lQ8OZeURIkjCgecR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283484'),
  ('885282134551710134', 'Just Roll with It', 2019, 'Family, Comedy', 'Adam Small, Trevor Moore', null, 'Ramon Reed, Kaylin Hayman, Suzi Barrett, Tobie Windham, J.C. Currais', 'TV-G', 'A sitcom about fun-loving newlyweds and their polar-opposite stepsiblings gets an improvisational twist as members of the studio audience vote on the direction of key scenes in each episode.', 'A sitcom about fun-loving newlyweds and their polar-opposite stepsiblings gets an improvisational twist as members of the studio audience vote on the direction of key scenes in each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQADiEmvhYdohSafdTSi7C2Y6GF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89315'),
  ('338839067609573743', 'Just Shoot Me!', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Steven Levitan', null, 'Laura San Giacomo, David Spade, Wendie Malick, George Segal, Enrico Colantoni', 'TV-PG', 'See the inner workings of a high-style magazine owned by Jack Gallo, who has hired his quick-tempered but talented daughter, Maya, to write for the publication. Challenging her at every turn is Nina, a vain and superficial former model. Then there''s photographer Elliot, a man who is very popular with his portrait subjects as well as other women. completing the core staff is her father''s assistant, Dennis, a glorified secretary who is generally disrespectful to one and all.', 'See the inner workings of a high-style magazine owned by Jack Gallo, who has hired his quick-tempered but talented daughter, Maya, to write for the publication. Challenging her at every turn is Nina, a vain and superficial former model. Then there''s photographer Elliot, a man who is very popular with his portrait subjects as well as other women. completing the core staff is her father''s assistant, Dennis, a glorified secretary who is generally disrespectful to one and all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP2JuabiJvvmVvGsHjDj4IL8gcO.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4576'),
  ('295952616522660061', 'Just the Ten of Us', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Steve Marshall', null, 'Bill Kirchenbauer, Deborah Harmon, Heather Langenkamp, Jamie Luner, Brooke Theiss, JoAnn Willette, Matt Shakman, Heidi Zeigler', null, 'Just the Ten of Us is an American sitcom starring stand-up comedian Bill Kirchenbauer as Coach Graham Lubbock, a teacher and the head of a large Catholic family with eight children living in Eureka, California. The series is a spin-off of Growing Pains, in which Kirchenbauer portrayed the same character on a recurring basis. As the series progressed, Coach Lubbock''s four eldest daughters, the teenagers Marie, Cindy, Wendy, and Connie, became the primary focus of the show.', 'Just the Ten of Us is an American sitcom starring stand-up comedian Bill Kirchenbauer as Coach Graham Lubbock, a teacher and the head of a large Catholic family with eight children living in Eureka, California. The series is a spin-off of Growing Pains, in which Kirchenbauer portrayed the same character on a recurring basis. As the series progressed, Coach Lubbock''s four eldest daughters, the teenagers Marie, Cindy, Wendy, and Connie, became the primary focus of the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDcwx7Ea53DTjTer7Qot5RV4aeV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2174'),
  ('100483100586363667', 'Justice', 2006, 'Drama', 'David McNally, Tyler Bensinger', null, 'Eamonn Walker, Victor Garber, Rebecca Mader, Kerr Smith', 'TV-14', 'Justice is an American legal drama produced by Jerry Bruckheimer that aired on Fox in the USA and CTV in Canada. The series also aired on Warner Channel in Latin America, Nine Network in Australia, and on TV2 In New Zealand. It first was broadcast on Wednesdays at 9:00 but, due to low ratings, it was rescheduled to Mondays at 9:00, in the hope viewers of the hit series Prison Break would stay tuned. On November 13, 2006, the show was put on hiatus, but two days later the network announced it was shifting it to Fridays at 8:00 to replace the canceled Vanished. Fourteen episodes of the series were ordered, of which 13 episodes were produced. Twelve of the episodes of Justice have aired in the United States with the final episode airing in Mexico, the UK and Germany.', 'Justice is an American legal drama produced by Jerry Bruckheimer that aired on Fox in the USA and CTV in Canada. The series also aired on Warner Channel in Latin America, Nine Network in Australia, and on TV2 In New Zealand. It first was broadcast on Wednesdays at 9:00 but, due to low ratings, it was rescheduled to Mondays at 9:00, in the hope viewers of the hit series Prison Break would stay tuned. On November 13, 2006, the show was put on hiatus, but two days later the network announced it was shifting it to Fridays at 8:00 to replace the canceled Vanished. Fourteen episodes of the series were ordered, of which 13 episodes were produced. Twelve of the episodes of Justice have aired in the United States with the final episode airing in Mexico, the UK and Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0OlIx96M9TkeRauRNJJXchVicr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:678'),
  ('734687248120617318', 'Justice Bao', 2008, 'Drama', 'Li Baoneng, Liu Lili, Jin Chao-Chun', null, 'Jin Chao-Chun, Kenny Ho Ka-King, Hung-Hsuan Fan, Gao Liang, 刘金全, Lung Lung, Wu Qianqian, 陈婷', null, 'Justice Bao is a Mainland Chinese television series, starring Jin Chao-chun, Kenny Ho and Fan Hung-hsuan. The three actors first portrayed their respective characters in the 1993 Taiwanese hit Justice Bao. Lung Lung from the 1993 series also reprised his role.', 'Justice Bao is a Mainland Chinese television series, starring Jin Chao-chun, Kenny Ho and Fan Hung-hsuan. The three actors first portrayed their respective characters in the 1993 Taiwanese hit Justice Bao. Lung Lung from the 1993 series also reprised his role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0TRDQkLjqbRq4olL85pMyn4G1T.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:44062'),
  ('552413289311507425', 'Justice for All', 2020, null, null, null, 'Fatima Ahmad, Lynn Clerinx, Manon Cop, Issabel De Fré, Peter Janssens, Liesbeth Meirens, Ercan Tok, Liliane Verjauw', null, 'In Justice for All, seven criminal defense lawyers reveal what happens behind the scenes of a trial. Extortion, rape, arms trafficking, and murder: it''s all part of the game for these masters.', 'In Justice for All, seven criminal defense lawyers reveal what happens behind the scenes of a trial. Extortion, rape, arms trafficking, and murder: it''s all part of the game for these masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3NBbmL3axdXA7H4KGDUIOZ17Kh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9512'),
  ('799254107807943998', 'Justice Is Mine', 2025, 'Crime', null, 'Koon Ying Au', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee, Joseph Zeng, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Dominic Lam Ka-Wah, Benjamin Tsang', null, 'Upright and incorruptible Judge Chun Yue is forced to cover up the truth after his son causes a hit-and-run that injures the son of a notorious gang leader. Seeking vengeance for his son''s injuries, the ruthless crime boss unleashes a wave of bloodshed across the city. Meanwhile, determined police officer Tong Huen remains resolute in her pursuit of justice, relentlessly chasing the truth behind the web of corruption and revenge.', 'Upright and incorruptible Judge Chun Yue is forced to cover up the truth after his son causes a hit-and-run that injures the son of a notorious gang leader. Seeking vengeance for his son''s injuries, the ruthless crime boss unleashes a wave of bloodshed across the city. Meanwhile, determined police officer Tong Huen remains resolute in her pursuit of justice, relentlessly chasing the truth behind the web of corruption and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uW0buuwtvAMBjKAnOdxRjU0di7Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281705'),
  ('747957503181382234', 'Justice League', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kevin Conroy, George Newbern, Susan Eisenberg, Phil LaMarr, Carl Lumbly, Michael Rosenbaum, Maria Canals-Barrera', 'TV-PG', 'The long-awaited rebirth of the greatest superhero team of all time: Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman, The Flash, Hawkgirl, Green Lantern, and Martian Manhunter.', 'The long-awaited rebirth of the greatest superhero team of all time: Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman, The Flash, Hawkgirl, Green Lantern, and Martian Manhunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caIAQIoM9NLZofT8fz8t47W1gYe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1618'),
  ('811772551576108505', 'Justice League Action', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Batman, Superman and Wonder Woman lead the DC Super Heroes against their most infamous foes.', 'Batman, Superman and Wonder Woman lead the DC Super Heroes against their most infamous foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdTh5kAXYwo0dwHONqCFO7y8Jmf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68837'),
  ('1044985051026543567', 'Justice League Unlimited', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Kevin Conroy, George Newbern, Susan Eisenberg, Carl Lumbly, Phil LaMarr', 'TV-Y7', 'The galaxy''s most powerful superheroes return to battle the allied villains and criminal plots that endanger the universe.', 'The galaxy''s most powerful superheroes return to battle the allied villains and criminal plots that endanger the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRRvCUREeqqnp3hHdqep83eQjdP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84200'),
  ('383816121528897658', 'Justice League: Gods and Monsters Chronicles', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bruce Timm', 'Bruce Timm', 'Michael C. Hall, Tamara Taylor, Benjamin Bratt', null, 'In an alternative history Zod is Superman''s father, Batman is a vampiric Man-Bat, and Wonder Woman is the child of Ares, God of War. When these dark heroes form an alliance, the question everyone asks is will they save the world, or rule it?', 'In an alternative history Zod is Superman''s father, Batman is a vampiric Man-Bat, and Wonder Woman is the child of Ares, God of War. When these dark heroes form an alliance, the question everyone asks is will they save the world, or rule it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sytZtuGtxKX6L6hyyMKtK41hLTa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63266'),
  ('260777441494021743', 'Justice Pao', 1993, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Chao Ta-shen', null, 'Jin Chao-Chun, Hung-Hsuan Fan, Kenny Ho Ka-King, Kao Nien Kuo, Jianyu Xu, Liu Yue-Ti, Yang Hsiung, Changsen Shao', null, 'Justice Bao is a 236-episode television series from Taiwan, first airing on Chinese Television System from February 1993 to January 1994. The show stars Jin Chao-chun as the Chinese official Bao Zheng in the Song Dynasty. It was hugely popular in Greater China as well as many other countries in the Far East. The series was originally scheduled for just 15 episodes. However, the show garnered high ratings when the initial episodes aired. Due to its popularity, CTS expanded the show to 236 episodes. The TVB and ATV Home networks in Hong Kong both bought the series in an attempt to gain viewers. Competition between the two networks during the showing of the series was so severe that identical episodes were shown on both channels on the same night. It was also one of the first dramas that used NICAM technology.', 'Justice Bao is a 236-episode television series from Taiwan, first airing on Chinese Television System from February 1993 to January 1994. The show stars Jin Chao-chun as the Chinese official Bao Zheng in the Song Dynasty. It was hugely popular in Greater China as well as many other countries in the Far East. The series was originally scheduled for just 15 episodes. However, the show garnered high ratings when the initial episodes aired. Due to its popularity, CTS expanded the show to 236 episodes. The TVB and ATV Home networks in Hong Kong both bought the series in an attempt to gain viewers. Competition between the two networks during the showing of the series was so severe that identical episodes were shown on both channels on the same night. It was also one of the first dramas that used NICAM technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jdHOuYgpx4DwU2VeniJOnNUAT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51821'),
  ('191596806440040024', 'Justice Pao', 1995, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Jin Chao-Chun, Hung-Hsuan Fan, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Ng Wai-Kwok, Liu Xiaoqing, Yeung Chak-Lam, Feng Guoqiang, Joey Man Yee-Man', null, 'Justice Bao (新包青天), a 1995–1996 series produced by ATV and starring Jin Chao-chun as Bao Zheng, with 25 cases totaling 160 episodes.', 'Justice Bao (新包青天), a 1995–1996 series produced by ATV and starring Jin Chao-chun as Bao Zheng, with 25 cases totaling 160 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvBLthbI5LhMEwytTxLZzFgn2Uj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86356'),
  ('44585306123967352', 'Justice Served', 2022, 'Action & Adventure', 'Tshepo Ty Skosana', null, 'Nompumelelo Mayiyane, Panch Gasela, Dineo Rasedile, Motshabi Tyelele, Tiisetso Thoka, Thabo Bopape, Hlomla Dandala, Jack Devnarain', 'TV-MA', 'A band of freedom fighters invade the trial of a white police officer who shot a Black man — and a hostage situation unfolds on screens nationwide.', 'A band of freedom fighters invade the trial of a white police officer who shot a Black man — and a hostage situation unfolds on screens nationwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOXZns3CxiPh5DN6CxWEKtML3Yw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205788'),
  ('735791240613240580', 'Justified', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Graham Yost', null, 'Timothy Olyphant, Walton Goggins, Nick Searcy, Jere Burns, Joelle Carter, Jacob Pitts, Erica Tazel', 'TV-MA', 'A character drama based on the 2001 Elmore Leonard short story "Fire in the Hole." Leonard''s tale centers around U.S. Marshal Raylan Givens of Kentucky, a quiet but strong-willed official of the law. The tale covers his high-stakes job, as well as his strained relationships with his ex-wife and father.', 'A character drama based on the 2001 Elmore Leonard short story "Fire in the Hole." Leonard''s tale centers around U.S. Marshal Raylan Givens of Kentucky, a quiet but strong-willed official of the law. The tale covers his high-stakes job, as well as his strained relationships with his ex-wife and father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie1quhMk09lDtvtAyQAHTu09R9Z.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1436'),
  ('834659819199642985', 'Justified: City Primeval', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dave Andron, Michael Dinner', null, 'Timothy Olyphant, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Boyd Holbrook, Adelaide Clemens, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Marin Ireland, Norbert Leo Butz, Victor Williams', 'TV-MA', 'Having left the hollers of Kentucky 15 years ago, Raylan Givens is now based in Miami, balancing life as a marshal and part-time father of a 15-year-old girl. A chance encounter on a Florida highway sends him to Detroit and he crosses paths with Clement Mansell, aka The Oklahoma Wildman, a violent sociopath who’s already slipped through the fingers of Detroit’s finest once and wants to do so again.', 'Having left the hollers of Kentucky 15 years ago, Raylan Givens is now based in Miami, balancing life as a marshal and part-time father of a 15-year-old girl. A chance encounter on a Florida highway sends him to Detroit and he crosses paths with Clement Mansell, aka The Oklahoma Wildman, a violent sociopath who’s already slipped through the fingers of Detroit’s finest once and wants to do so again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTp9cMxFMCk5b7alKb2m5wHaGxb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201304'),
  ('48405405232317682', 'Justin Bieber: Seasons', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Justin Bieber, Hailey Bieber, Allison Kaye, Ryan Good', null, 'An intimate behind-the-scenes look at Justin Bieber''s private life, including never-before-seen footage of his wedding to Hailey Bieber and his day-to-day alongside those in his inner circle.', 'An intimate behind-the-scenes look at Justin Bieber''s private life, including never-before-seen footage of his wedding to Hailey Bieber and his day-to-day alongside those in his inner circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEwk4XPTfH2zIFQqawul2B4oX05.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97141'),
  ('452075826443275938', 'Justo antes de Cristo', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Borja Cobeaga', null, 'Julián López, Xosé A. Touriñán, Cecilia Freire, César Saratxu, Eduardo Antuña, Priscilla Delgado, Marta Fernández Muro, Aníbal Gómez', 'TV-14', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6x4aR9FJPV2gHJMZDz8LKS2Rf7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88181'),
  ('367005828090656663', 'Juvenile Justice', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hong Jong-chan, Kim Min-suk', 'Kim Min-suk', 'Kim Hye-soo, Kim Moo-yul, Lee Sung-min, Lee Jung-eun, Lee Sang-hee, Park Ji-yeon, Shin Jae-whi, Geum Gwang-san', 'TV-MA', 'A tough judge balances her aversion to minor offenders with firm beliefs on justice and punishment as she tackles complex cases inside a juvenile court.', 'A tough judge balances her aversion to minor offenders with firm beliefs on justice and punishment as she tackles complex cases inside a juvenile court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xH2wTVlsUlYeFEOVGFDaamHkMCm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112833'),
  ('516846928474755852', 'Jyouou', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ryo Kurashina', null, 'Kirara Asuka, Mikie Hara, Gota Watabe, Ai Haneda, Megumi Kagurazaka', null, 'Fujisaki Aya is a young college student whose family is 150 million yen in debt after her father''s corporation went bankrupt. To earn the money, she enters the Hostess Grand Prix.', 'Fujisaki Aya is a young college student whose family is 150 million yen in debt after her father''s corporation went bankrupt. To earn the money, she enters the Hostess Grand Prix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaiApxIgfsKyVnYenEm1xivmXKm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45490'),
  ('266337741466654438', 'Jyu-Oh-Sei', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Kazuya Nakai, Koichi Domoto, Minami Takayama, Romi Park, Nana Mizuki, Minami Takayama, Kiyotaka Furushima', null, 'After their parents are murdered, young twin brothers Thor and Rai are abandoned on Chimaera, a hostile planet where criminals are sent to die. With extreme temperatures and carnivorous plants, it is a brutal world where mankind has been reduced to a savage state. The only hope of escape lies in conquering the planet and its inhabitants, rising above them all as the Beast King.', 'After their parents are murdered, young twin brothers Thor and Rai are abandoned on Chimaera, a hostile planet where criminals are sent to die. With extreme temperatures and carnivorous plants, it is a brutal world where mankind has been reduced to a savage state. The only hope of escape lies in conquering the planet and its inhabitants, rising above them all as the Beast King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KYbZeKkpWHPWl2oHC7NWHEOjNe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31700'),
  ('121401039909987296', 'K', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, 'GoRA', 'Daisuke Namikawa, Daisuke Ono, Mikako Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'Shiro is an easygoing teenager content with just being a student—until his seemingly perfect life is halted when a bloodthirsty clan, glowing red with fire, attempts to kill him in the streets. Unbeknownst to Shiro, he is suspected of murdering a member of their clan and will need a miracle to escape their vengeance. Miraculously, a young man named Kurou Yatogami swings in and aids Shiro in his getaway, only to reveal he''s also after Shiro''s life. Now a hunted man, Shiro will have to evade the clans of seven powerful kings and desperately try to prove his innocence—before it’s too late!', 'Shiro is an easygoing teenager content with just being a student—until his seemingly perfect life is halted when a bloodthirsty clan, glowing red with fire, attempts to kill him in the streets. Unbeknownst to Shiro, he is suspected of murdering a member of their clan and will need a miracle to escape their vengeance. Miraculously, a young man named Kurou Yatogami swings in and aids Shiro in his getaway, only to reveal he''s also after Shiro''s life. Now a hunted man, Shiro will have to evade the clans of seven powerful kings and desperately try to prove his innocence—before it’s too late!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52eQfCm8yGEQHNZefyHr6uIysqt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45799'),
  ('740556596779619718', 'K Street', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Steven Soderbergh, George Clooney', null, 'Mary McCormack, John Slattery, Roger Guenveur Smith, James Carville, Mary Matalin', 'TV-MA', 'An experimental fusion of reality and fiction--a fly-on-the-wall look at government, filmed in and around the corridors of power in Washington. The series ventures inside the world of powerful political consultants--a world that few people ever experience first-hand. Produced on location in Washington, D.C., the largely improvised ten-episode series combines fictional characters with appearances by real-life political figures, all centered around the biggest political news of the week.', 'An experimental fusion of reality and fiction--a fly-on-the-wall look at government, filmed in and around the corridors of power in Washington. The series ventures inside the world of powerful political consultants--a world that few people ever experience first-hand. Produced on location in Washington, D.C., the largely improvised ten-episode series combines fictional characters with appearances by real-life political figures, all centered around the biggest political news of the week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCJHpDzGbcnZDYsoyQa47EyH1or.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10093'),
  ('43117261068231885', 'K-foodie meets J-foodie', 2025, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, 'Sung Si-kyung, Ayaka Miyoshi', null, 'Korea''s top foodie Sung Si-kyung joins Japan''s beloved Yutaka Matsushige on a tasty adventure as they explore culinary gems across Korea and Japan.', 'Korea''s top foodie Sung Si-kyung joins Japan''s beloved Yutaka Matsushige on a tasty adventure as they explore culinary gems across Korea and Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99JldizwZEvXelt6p5igcKTm0pK.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:283645'),
  ('1036208434841177582', 'K-ON!', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Yoko Hikasa, Satomi Sato, Minako Kotobuki, Ayana Taketatsu', 'TV-14', 'Yui Hirasawa has no clue which club to join, but she’s determined to do something this year. As luck would have it, she discovers a flyer for the Light Music Club and decides this is the club for her. But there''s one problem: She first must learn guitar!', 'Yui Hirasawa has no clue which club to join, but she’s determined to do something this year. As luck would have it, she discovers a flyer for the Light Music Club and decides this is the club for her. But there''s one problem: She first must learn guitar!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70hf2538UAf7mzzNgvqTlWq6PDf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42253'),
  ('991423477934625371', 'K-POP Extreme Survival', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Go Eun-ah, Park Yu-hwan, Song Se-Hyun, Tagoon, Maeng Se-chang, Jo Yoon-woo, Park Hyo-ju, Hong Kyung-min', null, 'Ji Seung Yeon fails her audition piece for an English music college by severely modernizing it, secretly returning home to South Korea in shame. Hiding out at her painfully shy friend''s house, she joins him in auditioning to replace popular members of a boy band who are getting too old. Together, she and her friend make it through to a finalized group of eight competing for the few opening spots. No one but her friend and her uncle (director of the pop music company) and his assistant know she''s a girl. The leader of the boy band, not in the know, starts questioning his orientation when finding himself progressively attracted to this "boy."', 'Ji Seung Yeon fails her audition piece for an English music college by severely modernizing it, secretly returning home to South Korea in shame. Hiding out at her painfully shy friend''s house, she joins him in auditioning to replace popular members of a boy band who are getting too old. Together, she and her friend make it through to a finalized group of eight competing for the few opening spots. No one but her friend and her uncle (director of the pop music company) and his assistant know she''s a girl. The leader of the boy band, not in the know, starts questioning his orientation when finding himself progressively attracted to this "boy."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4z1UrfHax8kGb2zCnokLgEfh4EW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64412'),
  ('436021044080951232', 'K.C. Undercover', 2015, 'Kids, Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Corinne Marshall', null, 'Zendaya, Veronica Dunne, Kamil McFadden, Trinitee, Tammy Townsend, Kadeem Hardison', 'TV-Y7', 'K.C. Cooper, a high school math whiz and karate black-belt, learns that her parents are spies when they recruit her to join them in the secret government agency, The Organization. While she now has the latest spy gadgets at her disposal, K.C. has a lot to learn about being a spy, including keeping her new gig a secret from her best friend Marisa. Together, K.C. and her parents, Craig and Kira, and her younger siblings, Ernie and Judy (a humanoid robot), try to balance everyday family life while on undercover missions, near and far, to save the world.', 'K.C. Cooper, a high school math whiz and karate black-belt, learns that her parents are spies when they recruit her to join them in the secret government agency, The Organization. While she now has the latest spy gadgets at her disposal, K.C. has a lot to learn about being a spy, including keeping her new gig a secret from her best friend Marisa. Together, K.C. and her parents, Craig and Kira, and her younger siblings, Ernie and Judy (a humanoid robot), try to balance everyday family life while on undercover missions, near and far, to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52iv1yPKYR4nezoX7lMLcK9yt6q.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61915'),
  ('635799245748949519', 'Kaakee Circus', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Ameen Barif', 'Ameen Barif, Akash Chandramohan', 'Subash Selvam, Munishkanth, Rajesh Madhavan, Gauthami Nair, Vinsu Rachel Sam, Nakkalites Savithiri, Abdool Lee, Maruthupandian', null, 'A small town in Tamil Nadu wakes up to chaos when a temple donation box is stolen from the sub-jail. Soon, the investigation led by two eccentric policemen unravels secrets more than they can handle.', 'A small town in Tamil Nadu wakes up to chaos when a temple donation box is stolen from the sub-jail. Soon, the investigation led by two eccentric policemen unravels secrets more than they can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKkfWYulfD2UPovh8zXuqwp33AM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317896'),
  ('692046642698488106', 'Kaala Paani', 2023, 'Drama', 'Sameer Saxena', 'Biswapati Sarkar', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, Sukant Goel, Amey Wagh, Vikas Kumar, Arushi Sharma, Radhika Mehrotra, Chinmay Mandlekar, Aradhya Ajana', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the near future, the Andaman and Nicobar Islands are quarantined from the rest of the world as a mystery disease engulfs them, prompting the islanders to attempt an unprecedented feat in human history - escaping the Kaala Paani.', 'Set in the near future, the Andaman and Nicobar Islands are quarantined from the rest of the world as a mystery disease engulfs them, prompting the islanders to attempt an unprecedented feat in human history - escaping the Kaala Paani.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQJFHysapAr1eXB5BWNSRbfgTbU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235356'),
  ('419916394856526475', 'Kaalkoot', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sumit Saxena', 'Sumit Saxena, Arunabh Kumar', 'Vijay Varma, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Seema Biswas, Yashpal Sharma, Gopal Datt, Neetha Mohindra, Shashi Bhushan, Suzanna Mukherjee', null, 'Follows the life of Ravishankar Tripathi, a tenacious and dedicated police officer who finds himself at the forefront of a challenging acid attack case.', 'Follows the life of Ravishankar Tripathi, a tenacious and dedicated police officer who finds himself at the forefront of a challenging acid attack case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG8fUZKvsBnWfcsCGsWhUSTY6os.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230483'),
  ('213011966177261947', 'Kaamelott', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alexandre Astier', 'Christophe Fort', 'Alexandre Astier, Anne Girouard, Lionnel Astier, Joëlle Sevilla, Thomas Cousseau, Franck Pitiot, Jean-Christophe Hembert, Nicolas Gabion', 'NR', 'Kaamelott is a French comedy medieval fantasy television series created, directed, written, scored, and edited by Alexandre Astier, who also starred as the main character. The series, which originally ran for six seasons (referred to as ''books''), ran from January 3, 2005, to October 31, 2009, on M6. In this offbeat account of King Arthur''s quest for the Grail, virtually every journey, battle or adventure is stopped dead in its tracks by the knights of the round table''s most worldly traits: cowardice, greed, idiocy or misplaced chivalry. As a consequence, instead of epic adventures we are treated with the characters'' pragmatic and anachronistic take on each and every event in the Grail legend, true to the purest sitcom tradition.', 'Kaamelott is a French comedy medieval fantasy television series created, directed, written, scored, and edited by Alexandre Astier, who also starred as the main character. The series, which originally ran for six seasons (referred to as ''books''), ran from January 3, 2005, to October 31, 2009, on M6. In this offbeat account of King Arthur''s quest for the Grail, virtually every journey, battle or adventure is stopped dead in its tracks by the knights of the round table''s most worldly traits: cowardice, greed, idiocy or misplaced chivalry. As a consequence, instead of epic adventures we are treated with the characters'' pragmatic and anachronistic take on each and every event in the Grail legend, true to the purest sitcom tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6P4O0LzE4WFp4GnSkzauUTmC2P.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:11466'),
  ('30804635351315746', 'Kabaneri of the Iron Fortress', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sayaka Senbongi, Tasuku Hatanaka, Yuki Kaji, Toshiki Masuda, Maaya Uchida, Kensuke Sato, Kanae Oki, Miyuu Sawai', 'TV-MA', 'In the midst of an industrial revolution, the people of Hinomoto fight hordes of undead creatures, known as Kabane, using powerful armored trains.', 'In the midst of an industrial revolution, the people of Hinomoto fight hordes of undead creatures, known as Kabane, using powerful armored trains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9lY3DCLU3DWvUshho6hAX2hKKh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65945'),
  ('906420535720556712', 'KaBlam!', 1996, 'Kids, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Family, Mystery', 'Will McRobb, Chris Viscardi, Bob Mittenthal', null, 'Noah Segan, Julia McIlvaine, Bert Pence', 'NR', 'KaBlam! is a sketch comedy television series that ran from 1996 to 2000. It features a collection of short films in several different styles of animation, bridged by the characters of Henry and June, who introduce the shorts, and have adventures of their own. The show ended its three-year run nine months short of four years on January 22, 2000.', 'KaBlam! is a sketch comedy television series that ran from 1996 to 2000. It features a collection of short films in several different styles of animation, bridged by the characters of Henry and June, who introduce the shorts, and have adventures of their own. The show ended its three-year run nine months short of four years on January 22, 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdWa6JE3nsVoqfSga4aGTSiuFmf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:544'),
  ('1089090438373437582', 'Kaboul Kitchen', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Allan Mauduit, Marc Victor, Jean-Patrick Benes', null, 'Stéphane De Groodt, Stéphanie Pasterkamp, Benjamin Bellecour, Alexis Michalik, Marc Citti, Simon Abkarian, Fayçal Azizi, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', null, 'Kaboul Kitchen is a French comedy television series broadcast by Canal+. It was created by Marc Victor, Allan Mauduit and Jean-Patrick Benes. The series is based on the true story of Radio France Internationale journalist Marc Victor, who ran a restaurant for French expatriates in Kabul until 2008. The first series premiered on February 15, 2012 on Canal+ and ended on March 5, 2012. It set a ratings record for comedy series in the primetime slot on Canal+. A second series, which will have 12 episodes, has been commissioned. The series depicts the life of French expatriate Jacky who runs the popular restaurant Kaboul Kitchen in Kabul, Afghanistan. His daughter Sophie, who he has not seen in 20 years, arrives to do humanitarian work, while he is interested only in making money. The series won two Golden FIPA Awards at the 2012 Festival International de Programmes Audiovisuels: one for Best TV Series and one for Best TV Screenplay. It was screened at MIPTV and named fourth on The Hollywood Reporter''s list of "MIPTV A-List Projects" for the most promising series screened at the event.', 'Kaboul Kitchen is a French comedy television series broadcast by Canal+. It was created by Marc Victor, Allan Mauduit and Jean-Patrick Benes. The series is based on the true story of Radio France Internationale journalist Marc Victor, who ran a restaurant for French expatriates in Kabul until 2008. The first series premiered on February 15, 2012 on Canal+ and ended on March 5, 2012. It set a ratings record for comedy series in the primetime slot on Canal+. A second series, which will have 12 episodes, has been commissioned. The series depicts the life of French expatriate Jacky who runs the popular restaurant Kaboul Kitchen in Kabul, Afghanistan. His daughter Sophie, who he has not seen in 20 years, arrives to do humanitarian work, while he is interested only in making money. The series won two Golden FIPA Awards at the 2012 Festival International de Programmes Audiovisuels: one for Best TV Series and one for Best TV Screenplay. It was screened at MIPTV and named fourth on The Hollywood Reporter''s list of "MIPTV A-List Projects" for the most promising series screened at the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YPLRd5TrhX888aDjNhe7xQMQsF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43257'),
  ('188580501962064591', 'Kabukibu!', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Taichi Ichikawa, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ryota Osaka, Kengo Kawanishi, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yuhko Kaida, Yumi Uchiyama, Kazutomi Yamamoto', 'TV-14', 'Kurogo Kurusu, is a high school student with an almost annoying love of kabuki. The only problem for him is that his school doesn’t have a club for it. He decides to take matters into his own hands and create a kabuki club.', 'Kurogo Kurusu, is a high school student with an almost annoying love of kabuki. The only problem for him is that his school doesn’t have a club for it. He decides to take matters into his own hands and create a kabuki club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsegDjC92cUvq26xdTuVT0fH0sK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71009'),
  ('915618513456510163', 'Kabul', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Thomas Finkielkraut, Olivier Demangel', 'Joé Lavy', 'Jonathan Zaccaï, Vassilis Kukalawi, Darina Al Joundi, Shervin Alenabi, Hannah Abdoh, Gianmarco Saurino, Jeanne Goursaud, Thibaut Évrard', null, 'Kabul, August 14, 2021. The Taliban are at the gates of the city, and France prepares to evacuate its embassy. But the sudden fall of Kabul the next day rushes all the plans. French, Italian, German, American diplomats and the police must improvise the evacuation of hundreds of Afghans and refugees to the airport. While chaos reaches the city, the Afghans will soon have only two choices: to kneel or to run away.', 'Kabul, August 14, 2021. The Taliban are at the gates of the city, and France prepares to evacuate its embassy. But the sudden fall of Kabul the next day rushes all the plans. French, Italian, German, American diplomats and the police must improvise the evacuation of hundreds of Afghans and refugees to the airport. While chaos reaches the city, the Afghans will soon have only two choices: to kneel or to run away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ojU5iNNO1uXHkhxuGwPLaJgIRK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250996'),
  ('537559273695608340', 'KaDeWe', 2021, 'Drama', 'Julia von Heinz', 'Julia von Heinz, Sabine Steyer-Violet, John Quester', 'Lia von Blarer, Valerie Stoll, Joel Basman, Damian Thüne, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Martin Ontrop, Lana Cooper, Bineta Hansen', null, 'During a robbery at KaDeWe, of all places, a magical encounter occurs between Hedi, a saleswoman in the textile department, and Fritzi, the daughter of KaDeWe owner Adolf Jandorf. It is love at first sight: Against all social and family odds, the two disparate young women begin a passionate relationship. At the same time, Fritzi''s older brother and war returnee Harry is fighting for his father''s recognition as the new junior manager of KaDeWe - and against his own despair. At Harry''s side is Georg, a general manager placed in front of him by his father, who has worked his way up from a poor background to the top echelons of KaDeWe. Georg, of all people, will play a decisive role in the future fate of the department store...', 'During a robbery at KaDeWe, of all places, a magical encounter occurs between Hedi, a saleswoman in the textile department, and Fritzi, the daughter of KaDeWe owner Adolf Jandorf. It is love at first sight: Against all social and family odds, the two disparate young women begin a passionate relationship. At the same time, Fritzi''s older brother and war returnee Harry is fighting for his father''s recognition as the new junior manager of KaDeWe - and against his own despair. At Harry''s side is Georg, a general manager placed in front of him by his father, who has worked his way up from a poor background to the top echelons of KaDeWe. Georg, of all people, will play a decisive role in the future fate of the department store...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z20vFVMNUuT7v1M2Lr4U4omjJZW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153886'),
  ('623581669371587090', 'KADO: The Right Answer', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Miura, Mao Ichimichi, Takuma Terashima, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Hiroshi Naka, Hisayoshi Suganuma, Kenji Akabane, Masami Kikuchi', 'TV-14', 'Kojiro Shindo is a highly-skilled negotiator working for the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. As his plane at Haneda airport prepares to take off, a huge mysterious cube appears from the sky. ''It'' expands rapidly, and absorbs the passenger plane and its 252 passengers. The cube''s name is "Kado." A strange being called Yaha-kui zaShunina appears from within Kado and tries to make contact with humanity. Shindo, who was been absorbed by Kado, ends up taking on the role of mediator between Yaha-kui zaShunina and humanity. Who is Yaha-kui zaShunina? What does he want?', 'Kojiro Shindo is a highly-skilled negotiator working for the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. As his plane at Haneda airport prepares to take off, a huge mysterious cube appears from the sky. ''It'' expands rapidly, and absorbs the passenger plane and its 252 passengers. The cube''s name is "Kado." A strange being called Yaha-kui zaShunina appears from within Kado and tries to make contact with humanity. Shindo, who was been absorbed by Kado, ends up taking on the role of mediator between Yaha-kui zaShunina and humanity. Who is Yaha-kui zaShunina? What does he want?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/br6zPIskINk8eN4MsvXw7WYT92L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71016'),
  ('836448466411310654', 'Kagaku Sentai Dynaman', 1983, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Satoshi Okita, Junichi Haruta, Kouji Unogi, Yuu Tokita, Sayoko Hagiwara, Junshi Shimada, Takeshi Watabe, Masashi Ishibashi', null, 'The Jashinka Empire rises from the depths of the Earth to conquer the world. To stop them, Dr. Kyutaro Yumeno assembles five inventors to his laboratory, Yumeno Invention Laboratory and gives them the power to become Dynamen. Each member has their own goal, but as the Kagaku Sentai Dynaman, they are united to stop the Jashinka Empire in their tracks.', 'The Jashinka Empire rises from the depths of the Earth to conquer the world. To stop them, Dr. Kyutaro Yumeno assembles five inventors to his laboratory, Yumeno Invention Laboratory and gives them the power to become Dynamen. Each member has their own goal, but as the Kagaku Sentai Dynaman, they are united to stop the Jashinka Empire in their tracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hou7b1cRw7cpo1JS3Vk8Torr1gH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5337'),
  ('598451534743718567', 'Kageki Shojo!!', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayaka Senbongi, Yumiri Hanamori, Sumire Uesaka, You Taichi, Rico Sasaki, Risae Matsuda, Satsumi Matsuda, Kana Hanazawa', 'TV-14', 'The curtain rises on Sarasa Watanabe, a starry-eyed 5''10" student who hopes to perform as a male lead role in the all-female Kouka Acting Troupe. She forms a friendship with her new roommate, a former idol. Together, they’re in for the role of a lifetime.', 'The curtain rises on Sarasa Watanabe, a starry-eyed 5''10" student who hopes to perform as a male lead role in the all-female Kouka Acting Troupe. She forms a friendship with her new roommate, a former idol. Together, they’re in for the role of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PBHtRI3ZFdE3UkxsHBxbkzF3pl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112138'),
  ('163506407107389888', 'KAGINADO', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Yui Horie, Mariko Kouda, Yukari Tamura, Mayumi Izuka, Akemi Satou, Daisuke Ono, Asami Sanada', 'TV-14', 'This is the story of a small miracle. Stars from different universes and different times that were never meant to cross paths. By irony of fate, these stars come together in “Kaginado Academy”. What awaits them there is a lively school life full of hope and dreams. The wonderful encounters provide the stars with new radiance. What awaits beyond that radiance...?', 'This is the story of a small miracle. Stars from different universes and different times that were never meant to cross paths. By irony of fate, these stars come together in “Kaginado Academy”. What awaits them there is a lively school life full of hope and dreams. The wonderful encounters provide the stars with new radiance. What awaits beyond that radiance...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjD7y51lFYcnxRqaOZesawe5oYu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123684'),
  ('253918793651684249', 'Kaguya-sama: Love Is War', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Makoto Furukawa, Aoi Koga, Konomi Kohara, Ryota Suzuki, Miyu Tomita, Yumiri Hanamori, Momo Asakura, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Considered a genius due to having the highest grades in the country, Miyuki Shirogane leads the prestigious Shuchiin Academy''s student council as its president, working alongside the beautiful and wealthy vice president Kaguya Shinomiya. The two are often regarded as the perfect couple by students despite them not being in any sort of romantic relationship.', 'Considered a genius due to having the highest grades in the country, Miyuki Shirogane leads the prestigious Shuchiin Academy''s student council as its president, working alongside the beautiful and wealthy vice president Kaguya Shinomiya. The two are often regarded as the perfect couple by students despite them not being in any sort of romantic relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5khbC6AuNgnvnoDbjIMKCOhEtIc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:83121'),
  ('360224359080398874', 'Kaiba', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Masaaki Yuasa', null, 'Houko Kuwashima, Mamiko Noto, Romi Park, Hisao Egawa, Wasabi Mizuta, Chiwa Saito, Aiko Hibi', 'TV-MA', 'In a world where memories can be stored like computer data, a young man named Kaiba searches for his lost memories and discovers a connection with a mysterious girl.', 'In a world where memories can be stored like computer data, a young man named Kaiba searches for his lost memories and discovers a connection with a mysterious girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa2x9qWRU7UwU1PCsBOj0HqoErZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34747'),
  ('389802360669655163', 'Kaiji', 2007, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Masato Hagiwara, Fumihiko Tachiki', 'TV-MA', 'Kaiji Itou is a good-for-nothing loiterer who spends his days drinking beer and stealing hubcaps—that is, until he ends up being tricked by his former co-worker. Unable to suddenly repay his friend''s huge debt all by himself, Kaiji is offered a shady deal to participate in an illegal underground gamble on a cruise ship. This turns out to be nothing more than the beginning of his new life of hell—thrown headlong into a life-threatening roller coaster of mind games, cheating, and deceit.', 'Kaiji Itou is a good-for-nothing loiterer who spends his days drinking beer and stealing hubcaps—that is, until he ends up being tricked by his former co-worker. Unable to suddenly repay his friend''s huge debt all by himself, Kaiji is offered a shady deal to participate in an illegal underground gamble on a cruise ship. This turns out to be nothing more than the beginning of his new life of hell—thrown headlong into a life-threatening roller coaster of mind games, cheating, and deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKTG76a11adML9ecbJt07D3jH8i.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42951'),
  ('146378118842906407', 'Kaiju No. 8', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masaya Fukunishi, Asami Seto, Wataru Katoh, Fairouz Ai, Kengo Kawanishi', 'TV-14', 'In a world plagued by creatures known as Kaiju, Kafka Hibino aspired to enlist in The Defense Force. He makes a promise to enlist with his childhood friend, Mina Ashiro. Soon, life takes them in separate ways. While employed cleaning up after Kaiju battles, Kafka meets Reno Ichikawa. Reno''s determination to join The Defense Force reawakens Kafka''s promise to join Mina and protect humanity.', 'In a world plagued by creatures known as Kaiju, Kafka Hibino aspired to enlist in The Defense Force. He makes a promise to enlist with his childhood friend, Mina Ashiro. Soon, life takes them in separate ways. While employed cleaning up after Kaiju battles, Kafka meets Reno Ichikawa. Reno''s determination to join The Defense Force reawakens Kafka''s promise to join Mina and protect humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJxGs0w5RAhaX4fIUQu511rvm0S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207468'),
  ('673935183053543932', 'Kaina of the Great Snow Sea', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Rie Takahashi, Ayumu Murase, Maaya Sakamoto, Katsuyuki Konishi, Tomokazu Sugita, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Kenyu Horiuchi', 'TV-14', 'In another world, an ever-growing Sea of Snow has engulfed the planet surface. The people struggle to survive living around the routes of a massive Orbital Tree, whose branches spread into the Celestial Membrane high above the ground. Change comes to this dying world after Kaina, a boy from the Celestial Membrane, encounters a girl from the surface called Ririha.', 'In another world, an ever-growing Sea of Snow has engulfed the planet surface. The people struggle to survive living around the routes of a massive Orbital Tree, whose branches spread into the Celestial Membrane high above the ground. Change comes to this dying world after Kaina, a boy from the Celestial Membrane, encounters a girl from the surface called Ririha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49p6TsjsuwZy3FwpsCjVByaOCvK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156013'),
  ('24524464559267208', 'Kairos', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shin Sung-rok, Lee Se-young, Ahn Bo-hyun, Nam Gyu-ri, Kang Seung-yoon, Hwang Jeong-min, Shin Gu, Cho Dong-in', 'TV-14', 'Kim Seo-Jin is a man who is driven only to achieve success in his life. Thanks to his efforts, he is the youngest executive at his company. His life is perfect, with his beautiful violinist wife Kang Hyun-Chae and a daughter. His wonderful life comes to a halt when his young daughter is kidnapped. He falls deep into despair. To change the past, when his daughter was kidnapped, he contacts Han Ae-Ri approximately one month in the past. Han Ae-Ri has busy days with her studies and working a part-time job to make enough money to pay for her sick mother''s operation. One day, her mother suddenly goes missing. Han Ae-Ri falls into despair, when Kim Seo-Jin from the future contacts her.', 'Kim Seo-Jin is a man who is driven only to achieve success in his life. Thanks to his efforts, he is the youngest executive at his company. His life is perfect, with his beautiful violinist wife Kang Hyun-Chae and a daughter. His wonderful life comes to a halt when his young daughter is kidnapped. He falls deep into despair. To change the past, when his daughter was kidnapped, he contacts Han Ae-Ri approximately one month in the past. Han Ae-Ri has busy days with her studies and working a part-time job to make enough money to pay for her sick mother''s operation. One day, her mother suddenly goes missing. Han Ae-Ri falls into despair, when Kim Seo-Jin from the future contacts her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnThovHCzJ2YoKrZ0oBBZfkd26j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112119'),
  ('360291328669128792', 'Kaitou Sentai Lupinranger vs. Keisatsu Sentai Patranger', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Asahi Ito, Shogo Hama, Haruka Kudo, Kousei Yuki, Ryo Yokoyama, Kazusa Okuyama, Seiya Motoki, Yoichi Nukumizu', null, 'The Lupin Collection, a vast ensemble of dangerous items acquired by the legendary gentleman thief Arsène Lupin, is stolen by an interdimensional crime syndicate known as the Ganglars. However, they receive opposition from two Super Sentai teams: the Lupinrangers, who aim to steal back the collection to live up their namesake''s reputation and save those they have lost, and the Patrangers, who are tasked with upholding justice by retrieving the collection and taking down the Gangler.', 'The Lupin Collection, a vast ensemble of dangerous items acquired by the legendary gentleman thief Arsène Lupin, is stolen by an interdimensional crime syndicate known as the Ganglars. However, they receive opposition from two Super Sentai teams: the Lupinrangers, who aim to steal back the collection to live up their namesake''s reputation and save those they have lost, and the Patrangers, who are tasked with upholding justice by retrieving the collection and taking down the Gangler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7Rhx5M2OkSRqvW5rlB24nBHNur.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84619'),
  ('1085502598847737874', 'Kaizoku Sentai Gokaiger', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Ryota Ozawa, Yuki Yamada, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuki Shimizu, Yui Koike, Junya Ikeda, Yukari Tamura, Hirofumi Nojima', null, 'A group of young pirates from space come to Earth to obtain the "Greatest Treasure in the Universe", which can only be acquired after obtaining the Ultimate Powers of the 34 Super Sentai. However, they end up running afoul of the Space Empire Zangyack, whose earlier invasion forces were wiped out by the 34 Super Sentai long ago. As a result, the space pirates use "pirate copies" of the powers of the older teams and fight the Zangyack forces as the Gokaigers.', 'A group of young pirates from space come to Earth to obtain the "Greatest Treasure in the Universe", which can only be acquired after obtaining the Ultimate Powers of the 34 Super Sentai. However, they end up running afoul of the Space Empire Zangyack, whose earlier invasion forces were wiped out by the 34 Super Sentai long ago. As a result, the space pirates use "pirate copies" of the powers of the older teams and fight the Zangyack forces as the Gokaigers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZBhRYQGmTqptsl3WWBCkQypUHf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95707'),
  ('819625677233362591', 'Kakafukaka', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', null, '아소 쿠미코', 'Aoi Morikawa, Masaki Nakao, Kousei Yuki, Risa Nakamura', null, 'I never thought I would see him again. Aki Terada said goodbye to her first love long ago. When her current boyfriend is caught cheating on her, Aki moves out of her apartment and into a sharehouse, where she''s reuinted with her first love. When things get heated between them, he drops a major bomb… Heart and body and everything in between intersect in this fresh new adult love story.', 'I never thought I would see him again. Aki Terada said goodbye to her first love long ago. When her current boyfriend is caught cheating on her, Aki moves out of her apartment and into a sharehouse, where she''s reuinted with her first love. When things get heated between them, he drops a major bomb… Heart and body and everything in between intersect in this fresh new adult love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR9W2LzQHG1QOVAqpDguH1MqreJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89503'),
  ('646518255662720130', 'Kakegurui', 2017, 'Animation, Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Tatsuya Tokutake, Saori Hayami, Minami Tanaka, Ayaka Fukuhara, Karin Nanami, Yuuki Wakai, Tomokazu Sugita, Mayu Udono', 'TV-14', 'Run by a corrupt and sadistic school council, the “system” at Hyakkaou is based on gambling, with losers who cannot cover their debts being demeaned by their peers and forced to serve their debtholders. And if that’s not terrifying enough, some games can result in losing an eye, one’s fingernails, or even their life! But the system is shocked when transfer student Yumeko Jabami arrives. Dark, mysterious and attractive, she’s a wildcard who plays for the thrill of it…', 'Run by a corrupt and sadistic school council, the “system” at Hyakkaou is based on gambling, with losers who cannot cover their debts being demeaned by their peers and forced to serve their debtholders. And if that’s not terrifying enough, some games can result in losing an eye, one’s fingernails, or even their life! But the system is shocked when transfer student Yumeko Jabami arrives. Dark, mysterious and attractive, she’s a wildcard who plays for the thrill of it…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsZOMx3ojsER12lRHNe7TcT7YqM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72305'),
  ('973858677230770672', 'Kakegurui', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Minami Hamabe, Mahiro Takasugi, Aoi Morikawa, Taishi Nakagawa, Yurika Nakamura, Natsume Mito, Ruka Matsuda, Matsumoto Kiyo', null, 'Children from influential families in politics and businesses attend the Hyakkaou Private Academy. There, the hierarchy of the students are classified by a series of games. Students that win the games are on the ruling side and the students who lose become slaves. One day, a mysterious girl, Yumeko Jabami (Minami Hamabe), is transferred to Hyakkaou Private Academy. She looks pure and pretty, but she is actually a compulsive gambler and seeks out the thrill of taking calculated risks.', 'Children from influential families in politics and businesses attend the Hyakkaou Private Academy. There, the hierarchy of the students are classified by a series of games. Students that win the games are on the ruling side and the students who lose become slaves. One day, a mysterious girl, Yumeko Jabami (Minami Hamabe), is transferred to Hyakkaou Private Academy. She looks pure and pretty, but she is actually a compulsive gambler and seeks out the thrill of taking calculated risks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLrKRd4z9AwFNhnfpB6LpRctW7L.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76409'),
  ('441968286295571704', 'Kakegurui Twin', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Aoi Morikawa, Hayato Sano, Erika Ikuta, Shiori Akita, Atsuhiro Inukai, Mahiro Takasugi, Mijika Nagai, Minami Hamabe', null, 'It''s a year before Yumeko transferred to Hyakkaou Academy. Saotome Meari, a young girl who was born into a very ordinary family, passed her transfer examinations, and has started to attend Hyakkaou. However, the school she expected to attend has a crazy law, the Baptism of Gambling. Paired with Yumeko as her "twin," the curtain opens on Meari''s gambling mania!', 'It''s a year before Yumeko transferred to Hyakkaou Academy. Saotome Meari, a young girl who was born into a very ordinary family, passed her transfer examinations, and has started to attend Hyakkaou. However, the school she expected to attend has a crazy law, the Baptism of Gambling. Paired with Yumeko as her "twin," the curtain opens on Meari''s gambling mania!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Nqf8sxhvezmwQUgLue34g7qLpN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121860'),
  ('1134140836878574325', 'KAKEGURUI TWIN', 2022, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Minami Tanaka, Rina Honnizumi, You Taichi, Yuhko Kaida, Aoi Koga, Seiichiro Yamashita, Rie Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'Determined to climb up the social ladder, Mary Saotome invests everything she has into what her elite high school values most: high stakes gambling.', 'Determined to climb up the social ladder, Mary Saotome invests everything she has into what her elite high school values most: high stakes gambling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hc4lqS5sOHZCMoMau3xIdtgzafA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138183'),
  ('1040283901375055853', 'Kakuriyo -Bed & Breakfast for Spirits-', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida', null, 'After losing her grandfather, Aoi—a girl who can see spirits known as ayakashi—is suddenly approached by an ogre. Demanding she pay her grandfather’s debt, he makes a huge request: her hand in marriage! Refusing this absurd offer, Aoi decides to work at the Tenjin-ya bed and breakfast for the ayakashi to pay back what her family owes.', 'After losing her grandfather, Aoi—a girl who can see spirits known as ayakashi—is suddenly approached by an ogre. Demanding she pay her grandfather’s debt, he makes a huge request: her hand in marriage! Refusing this absurd offer, Aoi decides to work at the Tenjin-ya bed and breakfast for the ayakashi to pay back what her family owes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1SZWuuPcAKcX4EzuEhZsO7LtTk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78483'),
  ('729530813981406331', 'Kakushigoto', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Rie Takahashi, Natsuki Hanae, Taku Yashiro, Kiyono Yasuno, Ayane Sakura, Ayumu Murase, Maaya Uchida', 'TV-14', 'Single father Kakushi Goto has a secret. He’s a top-selling artist of popular erotic manga, but his impressionable young daughter, Hime, can never find out! Now he’s having to bend over backwards just to keep her inquisitive little mind from discovering what he does for a living.', 'Single father Kakushi Goto has a secret. He’s a top-selling artist of popular erotic manga, but his impressionable young daughter, Hime, can never find out! Now he’s having to bend over backwards just to keep her inquisitive little mind from discovering what he does for a living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0gc6bE8tOEzt8ZWkoBh4fOfONa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95433'),
  ('294895357138366823', 'Kakushite! Makina-san!!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomoyo Takayanagi, You Taichi, Yuuki Kuwahara, Hina Natsume, Eriko Matsui, Ryoko Shintani', 'TV-MA', 'Eita, a mechanical otaku, discovers that Makina, the school idol he''s secretly liked, is actually a robot built for sexual purposes. Now, he must navigate her bold advances while helping her keep her identity hidden in this chaotic romantic comedy.', 'Eita, a mechanical otaku, discovers that Makina, the school idol he''s secretly liked, is actually a robot built for sexual purposes. Now, he must navigate her bold advances while helping her keep her identity hidden in this chaotic romantic comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viiiAmBVRtTYdOtP4nXlQ3b0xPf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254174'),
  ('218334192614365024', 'Kalam Asfar', 2018, null, 'Mariam Naseer', null, 'Haya Al-Shoaibi, Ibrahim Al-Harbi, Somoud Al-Kandari, Fouad Ali, Haya Abdulsalam, Abdullah Al-Talihi, Abeer Ahmed, Lulwa Al-Mulla', null, 'The series discusses the relationship of people to each other, and influenced by the words of those around them, especially with regard to the rumors that are spread.', 'The series discusses the relationship of people to each other, and influenced by the words of those around them, especially with regard to the rumors that are spread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMqVaxun25FaCVMBPPcLd0tkv1X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76650'),
  ('824561564533562028', 'Kaleido Star', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Junichi Sato, Reiko Yoshida', null, 'Ryo Hirohashi, Takehito Koyasu, Etsuko Kozakura, Kaori Mizuhashi, Takahiro Sakurai, Hiro Shimono, Keiji Fujiwara, Aya Hisakawa', 'TV-PG', 'Sora, a young girl from Japan, comes to America in search of her dream. She wants, with all her heart, to be a member of the famous Kaleido Stage, a combination of musicals, acrobatics and magical effects. With the help of her friends, she struggles to make this dream come true.', 'Sora, a young girl from Japan, comes to America in search of her dream. She wants, with all her heart, to be a member of the famous Kaleido Stage, a combination of musicals, acrobatics and magical effects. With the help of her friends, she struggles to make this dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ihfBrym5DL1kRX3dPmORkiQGWN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12501'),
  ('345177396043671386', 'Kaleidoscope', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Eric Garcia', null, 'Giancarlo Esposito, Paz Vega, Rufus Sewell, Tati Gabrielle, Peter Mark Kendall, Rosaline Elbay, Jai Courtney, Niousha Noor', 'TV-MA', 'A master thief and his crew attempt an epic and elaborate heist worth $7 billion dollars — but betrayal, greed and other threats undermine their plans.', 'A master thief and his crew attempt an epic and elaborate heist worth $7 billion dollars — but betrayal, greed and other threats undermine their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nXJoSB5Y6R9ne7pjqL7Cs3zqY1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156902'),
  ('626674544041112209', 'Kalkofes Mattscheibe', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Oliver Kalkofe', null, 'Oliver Kalkofe', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRZyU1hloinHpqaKXV4XqBZBVE5.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:45381'),
  ('162236113120344081', 'Kally''s Mashup', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Soap, Family', 'Adam Anders, Antony Falcón', null, 'Maia Reficco, Alex Hoyer, Saraí Meza, Sara Cobo, Lalo Brito, Mariano Chiesa, Tomás Carullo Lizzio, Tupac Larriera', 'TV-Y', 'Kally is a musical prodigy trying to juggle being a classical piano virtuoso, a normal 14-year old girl, and having a secret desire to become a world-famous pop-star.', 'Kally is a musical prodigy trying to juggle being a classical piano virtuoso, a normal 14-year old girl, and having a secret desire to become a world-famous pop-star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OCPzMApwOqAjPT41SGNvtFYf9P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80398'),
