  ('1082460141385463481', 'Kamarádi', 2024, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'David Gránský, Anastázie Chocholatá, Jan Komínek', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v7ESWHnp8DVGrclk4jW9WMStGx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273851'),
  ('771291546343268719', 'Kamen Rider', 1971, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Ryutaro Imai, Maho Horiguchi, Kenta Mishima, Rina Onuki, Miki Yagi, Yuki Furukawa, Jay Kabira, Koichi Yamadera', null, 'Takeshi Hongo is a promising young man with a passion for motorcycle racing. However, his dreams are suddenly ruined when he gets kidnapped by Shocker, the evil secret organization planning to dominate the world. After being remodeled into a cyborg, Takeshi escapes and swears to protect the world from the inhuman monsters.', 'Takeshi Hongo is a promising young man with a passion for motorcycle racing. However, his dreams are suddenly ruined when he gets kidnapped by Shocker, the evil secret organization planning to dominate the world. After being remodeled into a cyborg, Takeshi escapes and swears to protect the world from the inhuman monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DIBDFHiKQawz4WPsYekl9DHwyA.jpg', 37, 'tmdb:tv:2661'),
  ('928518108640387499', 'Kamen Rider (Skyrider)', 1979, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Murakami, Takashi Tabata, Nobuo Tsukamoto, Kimiko Tanaka, Naoko Fushimi, Kaori Tatsumi, Ryumei Azuma, Mie Suzuki', null, 'Doctor Keitaro Shido, an acclaimed scientist, has been kidnapped by the terrorist organization Neo-Shocker to exploit his expertise in robotics technology. Desperate to escape, he convinces Neo-Shocker''s command to allow him to operate on an injured camper. Explaining that he can turn the camper, Hiroshi Tsukuba into a powerful Neo-Shocker warrior, they allow Doctor Shido to operate. However, he quickly turns the tables on them, transforming Hiroshi, not into a kaijin, but the powerful warrior Sky Rider, using his newfound abilities to combat the evil Neo-Shocker menace.', 'Doctor Keitaro Shido, an acclaimed scientist, has been kidnapped by the terrorist organization Neo-Shocker to exploit his expertise in robotics technology. Desperate to escape, he convinces Neo-Shocker''s command to allow him to operate on an injured camper. Explaining that he can turn the camper, Hiroshi Tsukuba into a powerful Neo-Shocker warrior, they allow Doctor Shido to operate. However, he quickly turns the tables on them, transforming Hiroshi, not into a kaijin, but the powerful warrior Sky Rider, using his newfound abilities to combat the evil Neo-Shocker menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujV9fEByLE24g6rBJ7Km1x3GtQW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278486'),
  ('257153397002832917', 'Kamen Rider Black Sun', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Tomoya Nakamura, Aoi Nakamura, Kokoro Hirasawa, Takahiro Miura, Yoh Yoshida, Baijaku Nakamura, Gaku Hamada', 'TV-MA', 'The year is 2022. It is an era of chaos, half a century after the government announced the coexistence of humans and kaijins. Aoi Izumi, a young human rights activist calling for the elimination of discrimination, meets a man named Kotaro Minami, the one called "Black Sun," who is a candidate for the next Creation King.', 'The year is 2022. It is an era of chaos, half a century after the government announced the coexistence of humans and kaijins. Aoi Izumi, a young human rights activist calling for the elimination of discrimination, meets a man named Kotaro Minami, the one called "Black Sun," who is a candidate for the next Creation King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OtFY626NJxZvyDpEaXwRgx9Kht.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135822'),
  ('662708468011169868', 'Kamen Rider Den-O', 2007, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Takeru Satoh, Rina Akiyama, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Takuya Mizoguchi, Yuriko Shiratori, Tamaki Matsumoto, Yuichi Nakamura, Toshihiko Seki', null, 'Ryotaro Nogami transforms into Kamen Rider Den-O traveling to different times using the time-traveling train DenLiner to battle the Imagin monsters and preventing them from altering the past to affect the present and future.', 'Ryotaro Nogami transforms into Kamen Rider Den-O traveling to different times using the time-traveling train DenLiner to battle the Imagin monsters and preventing them from altering the past to affect the present and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjTsShTX5Ma2W9vWO6EKq5zfxYV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259906'),
  ('70303546297310863', 'Kamen Rider Drive', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Rio Uchida, Taiko Katono, Yu Inaba, Tomoya Warabino, Shota Matsushima, Fumika Baba, Tsurutaro Kataoka', null, 'Shinnosuke Tomari is a former elite police officer in the Metropolitan Police who, after an event that traumatized one of his colleagues, has been "demoted" into the Special Investigations Division, a group that looks into the stranger happenings in the city, particularly the "Heavy Acceleration" events that leave people unable to move that the public have termed the "Slowdown." When he is chosen by the Drive Driver and Tridoron, Shinnosuke transforms into Kamen Rider Drive and is tasked with battling the Roidmudes who wish to take over the world by eliminating humanity.', 'Shinnosuke Tomari is a former elite police officer in the Metropolitan Police who, after an event that traumatized one of his colleagues, has been "demoted" into the Special Investigations Division, a group that looks into the stranger happenings in the city, particularly the "Heavy Acceleration" events that leave people unable to move that the public have termed the "Slowdown." When he is chosen by the Drive Driver and Tridoron, Shinnosuke transforms into Kamen Rider Drive and is tasked with battling the Roidmudes who wish to take over the world by eliminating humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uc5bXmCXIvTdimGDPsalgoGR1XJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153910'),
  ('493857913003180651', 'Kamen Rider Gotchard', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junsei Motojima, Reiyo Matsumoto, Yasunari Fujibayashi, Rikiya Tomizono, Oto Abe, Rikuto Kumaki, Itono Okita, Kanon Miyahara', null, 'A mysterious alchemist studies and experiments to create "living creatures" called Chemies. Unfortunately, the cards holding them that should have been kept secret are accidentally unleashed on the world. High school student Houtarou Ichinose is tasked to retrieve all the Chemies released around the world. Using the Grasshopper Chemy, Hopper-1, and the Steam Locomotive Chemy, Steamliner, he transforms into Kamen Rider Gotchard!', 'A mysterious alchemist studies and experiments to create "living creatures" called Chemies. Unfortunately, the cards holding them that should have been kept secret are accidentally unleashed on the world. High school student Houtarou Ichinose is tasked to retrieve all the Chemies released around the world. Using the Grasshopper Chemy, Hopper-1, and the Steam Locomotive Chemy, Steamliner, he transforms into Kamen Rider Gotchard!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIIhoiiE1bzRW0OjU6xqzl3CcLU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262128'),
  ('1084024226581413911', 'Kamen Rider Kiva', 2008, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Koji Seto, Kouhei Takeda, Keisuke Kato, Nana Yanagisawa, Kohei Kumai, Rina Koike, Shouma Yamamoto, Yuria Haga', null, '22 years after the disappearance of his father, Wataru Kurenai lives in an infamous "haunted house" where he is destined as Kamen Rider Kiva to fight Fangires, a species of life force-draining vampires who can assume stained glass-like monster body that his father fought years ago before his disappearance. The story is split between Wataru in the present (2008–09) and his father Otoya in the past (1986–87), slowly revealing the link between the Fangire race and Kiva.', '22 years after the disappearance of his father, Wataru Kurenai lives in an infamous "haunted house" where he is destined as Kamen Rider Kiva to fight Fangires, a species of life force-draining vampires who can assume stained glass-like monster body that his father fought years ago before his disappearance. The story is split between Wataru in the present (2008–09) and his father Otoya in the past (1986–87), slowly revealing the link between the Fangire race and Kiva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOVSU3WS65Ahwx1gSwe4krRPsIo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261680'),
  ('833399276783459888', 'Kamen Rider Outsiders', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yuya Takahashi', null, null, 'Kamen Rider Outsiders is a TTFC-exclusive series serving as a crossover between various Kamen Rider series. Immediately following the abrupt ending of Kamen Rider Genms -Smart Brain and the 1000% Crisis-, multiple Kamen Riders fight against the villainous schemes of a returning Foundation X and Zein.', 'Kamen Rider Outsiders is a TTFC-exclusive series serving as a crossover between various Kamen Rider series. Immediately following the abrupt ending of Kamen Rider Genms -Smart Brain and the 1000% Crisis-, multiple Kamen Riders fight against the villainous schemes of a returning Foundation X and Zein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siiKVH7MltghepL29f5MtYszokQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209985'),
  ('860671170355813284', 'Kamen Rider Stronger', 1975, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shigeru Araki, Kyōko Okada, Akiji Kobayashi, Akira Hamada, Hidekatsu Shibata, Gorō Naya, Shinji Nakae', null, 'Shigeru Jo joins the evil organization Black Satan after the death of his close friend and mentor Goro Numata. He, promised power, and fueled by a desire for revenge, undergoes surgery to become one of Black Satan''s super warriors. However, Shigeru knows that Black Satan were in fact the murderers of his friend; he was using Black Satan in order to gain new powers. The newly powered up Shigeru escapes from the Black Satan headquarters before they can brainwash him into following their campaign of evil and becomes Kamen Rider Stronger. While escaping from Black Satan, Stronger meets Yuriko Misaki another cyborg warrior created by Black Satan who has the ability to transform into Electronic Wave Humanoid Tackle. Together they fight the evil Black Satan and later the Delzer Army to restore peace in Japan.', 'Shigeru Jo joins the evil organization Black Satan after the death of his close friend and mentor Goro Numata. He, promised power, and fueled by a desire for revenge, undergoes surgery to become one of Black Satan''s super warriors. However, Shigeru knows that Black Satan were in fact the murderers of his friend; he was using Black Satan in order to gain new powers. The newly powered up Shigeru escapes from the Black Satan headquarters before they can brainwash him into following their campaign of evil and becomes Kamen Rider Stronger. While escaping from Black Satan, Stronger meets Yuriko Misaki another cyborg warrior created by Black Satan who has the ability to transform into Electronic Wave Humanoid Tackle. Together they fight the evil Black Satan and later the Delzer Army to restore peace in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ExTdKBV8WpL7VtubEqE6UAtMqC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278481'),
  ('61633276786257427', 'Kamen Rider V3', 1973, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Masaru Igami', 'Hiroshi Miyauchi, Akiji Kobayashi, Hizuru Ono, Hideki Kawaguchi, Akira Yamaguchi, Jôtarô Senba, Eiji Gō, Sachio Fujino', 'NR', 'Follow the adventures of Shiro Kazami, a bio-chem major at Jonan University in Tokyo. After witnessing the murder of a member of the evil organization Destron, Kazami is targeted by Destron which kills his family and leads him down a road of revenge that crosses paths with both Takeshi Hongo and Hayato Ichimonji, the original Kamen Riders and his eventual transformation into Kamen Rider V3!', 'Follow the adventures of Shiro Kazami, a bio-chem major at Jonan University in Tokyo. After witnessing the murder of a member of the evil organization Destron, Kazami is targeted by Destron which kills his family and leads him down a road of revenge that crosses paths with both Takeshi Hongo and Hayato Ichimonji, the original Kamen Riders and his eventual transformation into Kamen Rider V3!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eroBYxkKqBiEQ0gGW2zGJWns6eK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278406'),
  ('183211260241775278', 'Kamen Rider X', 1974, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryô Hayami, Akiji Kobayashi, Naoko Miyama, Chisako Kosaka, Miyuki Hayata, Yasuhiko Uchida, Osamu Saka, Ayao Wada', null, 'Robotics scientist Keitaro Jin and his son Keisuke become caught up in a campaign of terror by an evil organization known as "G.O.D.". They are attacked and the professor''s technology gets stolen, but before Keitaro dies, he performs surgery on his son, using the last of his robotics technology to transform Keisuke into the "X-Rider". To avenge his father''s death and ensure the safety of the entire world, Keisuke uses this technology as he battles the monstrous minions of G.O.D.’s Japan branch.', 'Robotics scientist Keitaro Jin and his son Keisuke become caught up in a campaign of terror by an evil organization known as "G.O.D.". They are attacked and the professor''s technology gets stolen, but before Keitaro dies, he performs surgery on his son, using the last of his robotics technology to transform Keisuke into the "X-Rider". To avenge his father''s death and ensure the safety of the entire world, Keisuke uses this technology as he battles the monstrous minions of G.O.D.’s Japan branch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFQejfh1rpPdSoM8fbp7KcToFqH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278438'),
  ('989987760948776406', 'Kamen Rider ZEZTZ', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Ryutaro Imai, Maho Horiguchi, Kenta Mishima, Rina Onuki, Miki Yagi, Yuki Tamaki, Jay Kabira, Yuki Furukawa', null, 'In a world shaped by the dreams we see in our sleep, ZEZTZ enters people''s dreams as an agent on a mission. Equipped with a cutting-edge Rider belt worn across the chest, ZEZTZ brings a bold new form to the battle.', 'In a world shaped by the dreams we see in our sleep, ZEZTZ enters people''s dreams as an agent on a mission. Equipped with a cutting-edge Rider belt worn across the chest, ZEZTZ brings a bold new form to the battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmx4Oxsg3g1WDA0fffMzMUBh7Y2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:295434'),
  ('1055435396019171870', 'Kamen Rider: Dragon Knight', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Stephen Ford, Matt Mullins, Marisa Lauren, Yvonne Arias, William O''Leary', 'TV-Y7', 'Kamen Rider: Dragon Knight is an American science fiction superhero television series that originally aired on The CW, as part of the CW4Kids programming block, from December 13, 2008 to December 26, 2009. It is an adaptation of the Japanese tokusatsu show Kamen Rider Ryuki and is the second installment in the Kamen Rider franchise to be adapted for American audiences after Saban''s Masked Rider in 1995. The series was developed for television by Steve and Michael Wang and produced by Jimmy Sprague through Adness Entertainment.', 'Kamen Rider: Dragon Knight is an American science fiction superhero television series that originally aired on The CW, as part of the CW4Kids programming block, from December 13, 2008 to December 26, 2009. It is an adaptation of the Japanese tokusatsu show Kamen Rider Ryuki and is the second installment in the Kamen Rider franchise to be adapted for American audiences after Saban''s Masked Rider in 1995. The series was developed for television by Steve and Michael Wang and produced by Jimmy Sprague through Adness Entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDujM631spHzqxxQQVfQfaCfia3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77238'),
  ('16764122975637470', 'Kamichu!', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'MAKO, Ai Nonaka, Chiwa Saito, Issei Miyazaki, Kanako Hattori, Kaori Mine, Kousuke Okano, Makoto Tsumura', null, 'Yurie is just an ordinary middle school girl in the 1980''s - until overnight she finds out that she is a Kami, or God, in the Shinto sense. When Yurie announces this fact to her best friend Mitsue, their classmate Mitsuri takes advantage of Yurie''s new divinity to revitalize her family''s dying shrine. Yurie is nicknamed Kamichu and now must go on with her godly duties while going to school and winning the heart of her crush, Kenji, while Mitsuri tries to replace her old shrine god Yashima with her.', 'Yurie is just an ordinary middle school girl in the 1980''s - until overnight she finds out that she is a Kami, or God, in the Shinto sense. When Yurie announces this fact to her best friend Mitsue, their classmate Mitsuri takes advantage of Yurie''s new divinity to revitalize her family''s dying shrine. Yurie is nicknamed Kamichu and now must go on with her godly duties while going to school and winning the heart of her crush, Kenji, while Mitsuri tries to replace her old shrine god Yashima with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKPSSO9Y8YfFrH6ZzXi1RTWjw6x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1096'),
  ('178793076635942552', 'KamiErabi GOD.app', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kazuki Ura, Sara Matsumoto, Shuichi Uchida, Natsuko Abe, Gakuto Kajiwara, Tomori Kusunoki, Fairouz Ai, Yuuki Shin', 'TV-14', 'The ultimate battle royale for divinity has begun. High schoolers must use their unique powers to compete against each other for the coveted title “God.” But as each brawl becomes more vicious than the last, alliances are formed and betrayals take place. Who will emerge victorious and claim their godly throne?', 'The ultimate battle royale for divinity has begun. High schoolers must use their unique powers to compete against each other for the coveted title “God.” But as each brawl becomes more vicious than the last, alliances are formed and betrayals take place. Who will emerge victorious and claim their godly throne?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHpMEwId7hWp3sV7ISCIExfLiCW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222798'),
  ('22901804879770215', 'KamiKatsu: Working for God in a Godless World', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junya Enoki, Akari Kito, Kana Hanazawa, Sumire Uesaka, Sho Fujisawa, Megumi Ogata, Junichi Suwabe, Show Hayami', 'TV-14', 'Yukito, the son of a questionable cult leader, lost his life due to the cult''s ridiculous training practices. Now to his surprise, he was reincarnated into another world! It was an ideal world for him without the concept of "God" or "religion" BUT...! A unique "reincarnating in other world" adventure begins: creating a "religion" in a world without God?!', 'Yukito, the son of a questionable cult leader, lost his life due to the cult''s ridiculous training practices. Now to his surprise, he was reincarnated into another world! It was an ideal world for him without the concept of "God" or "religion" BUT...! A unique "reincarnating in other world" adventure begins: creating a "religion" in a world without God?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d82CH1EMSoC2VvYSTxCZHPboJYq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:199920'),
  ('597354368785376565', 'Kamikaze', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Marie Reuther', 'TV-MA', 'Fierce and charming 18-year-old Julie is on a journey of rediscovery after losing her parents and brother in a plane crash. Suddenly, she finds herself alone in a large mansion with expensive cars in the garage, and, in theory, everything that most people only dream of: youth, beauty and money – lots of money - but material possessions hold no value to Julie anymore and she is forced to search for a reason to go on. She embarks on a wild and turbulent trip that takes her from her native Denmark to the far corners of the world.', 'Fierce and charming 18-year-old Julie is on a journey of rediscovery after losing her parents and brother in a plane crash. Suddenly, she finds herself alone in a large mansion with expensive cars in the garage, and, in theory, everything that most people only dream of: youth, beauty and money – lots of money - but material possessions hold no value to Julie anymore and she is forced to search for a reason to go on. She embarks on a wild and turbulent trip that takes her from her native Denmark to the far corners of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at19TDyTguh3eQj45G2XN1ceV7w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113664'),
  ('109485083199593339', 'Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Arina Tanemura', null, 'Houko Kuwashima, Akiko Yajima, Kumiko Nishihara, Naoko Matsui, Susumu Chiba, Akiko Yajima, Chiyoko Kawashima, Kouki Miyata', null, 'Maron seems to be a normal, ditsy kinda of school girl when in actuality she is the reincarnation of Joan of Arc. With her angel sidekick Finn, she attempts to seal demons which are hiding in pieces of art and possess weak-hearted people. However with sealing the demons the art disappears leaving the police and her best friend Miyako, the police chief''s daughter, to suspect her to be nothing but a common art thief. More strange twists occur when a smooth talking new boy in school moves in next door along with the presence of a new "art thief" Sinbad, who races against Joan to seal demons. Now Maron must race against the police and Sinbad to seal the demons and manage just to make it through school and a strange homelife.', 'Maron seems to be a normal, ditsy kinda of school girl when in actuality she is the reincarnation of Joan of Arc. With her angel sidekick Finn, she attempts to seal demons which are hiding in pieces of art and possess weak-hearted people. However with sealing the demons the art disappears leaving the police and her best friend Miyako, the police chief''s daughter, to suspect her to be nothing but a common art thief. More strange twists occur when a smooth talking new boy in school moves in next door along with the presence of a new "art thief" Sinbad, who races against Joan to seal demons. Now Maron must race against the police and Sinbad to seal the demons and manage just to make it through school and a strange homelife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XwnEYqTtRmRileoKc9SOKcLQP7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34729'),
  ('795873029871357162', 'Kamisama Kiss', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Horie, Suzuko Mimori, Daisuke Namikawa, Daisuke Kishio, Satomi Sato, Vanilla Yamazaki, Yu Kobayashi, Shuta Morishima', 'TV-PG', 'Nanami was just a normal high school girl down on her luck until a stranger’s lips marked her as the new Land God and turned her world upside down. Now, she’s figuring out the duties of a deity with the help of Tomoe, a reformed fox demon who reluctantly becomes her familiar in a contract sealed with a kiss. The new responsibilities—and boys—are a lot to handle, like the crow demon masquerading as a gorgeous pop idol and the adorable snake spirit who’s chosen the newly minted god to be his bride. As the headstrong Tomoe tries to whip her into shape, Nanami finds that love just might have cute, pointed fox ears. With romance in the air, will the human deity be able to prove herself worthy of her new title?', 'Nanami was just a normal high school girl down on her luck until a stranger’s lips marked her as the new Land God and turned her world upside down. Now, she’s figuring out the duties of a deity with the help of Tomoe, a reformed fox demon who reluctantly becomes her familiar in a contract sealed with a kiss. The new responsibilities—and boys—are a lot to handle, like the crow demon masquerading as a gorgeous pop idol and the adorable snake spirit who’s chosen the newly minted god to be his bride. As the headstrong Tomoe tries to whip her into shape, Nanami finds that love just might have cute, pointed fox ears. With romance in the air, will the human deity be able to prove herself worthy of her new title?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5E7GL8KxpFemEFl3Lv8Fu4RuSwa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62741'),
  ('93488310230158923', 'Kamisama Minarai: Himitsu no Cocotama', 2015, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Yumi Kakazu, Ryoka Yuzuki, Rikako Aikawa, Aki Toyosaki, Michiyo Murase, Megumi Han, Yuka Terasaki', null, 'This is a story of tiny gods born from the thoughts and feelings of objects that people use with great care. The fact that Cocotama wear part of the egg they hatch out of as underwear is proof that they are still apprentices. The Cocotama use a mysterious magic, and they train hard to be of use to humans and to become full gods. They live inside human houses and stealthily move around to help humans find things they have lost, although they make many mistakes.', 'This is a story of tiny gods born from the thoughts and feelings of objects that people use with great care. The fact that Cocotama wear part of the egg they hatch out of as underwear is proof that they are still apprentices. The Cocotama use a mysterious magic, and they train hard to be of use to humans and to become full gods. They live inside human houses and stealthily move around to help humans find things they have lost, although they make many mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alZBH9XDflTctNO5GIRkGmx5Zqw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97243'),
  ('1006574430118041239', 'Kamp Koral: SpongeBob''s Under Years', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Vincent Waller, Marc Ceccarelli, Luke Brookshier', null, 'Tom Kenny, Bill Fagerbakke, Rodger Bumpass, Clancy Brown, Carolyn Lawrence, Mr. Lawrence, Lori Alan, Mary Jo Catlett', 'TV-Y7', 'SpongeBob and friends spend the summer catching jellyfish, building camp-fires, and swimming in Lake Yuckymuck at Camp Coral, located in the Kelp Forest.', 'SpongeBob and friends spend the summer catching jellyfish, building camp-fires, and swimming in Lake Yuckymuck at Camp Coral, located in the Kelp Forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peZYB3aFOBoZbpFhOZogrTHVlqX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99588'),
  ('568421870452286696', 'Kampf der RealityAllstars', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Loona, Elena Miras, Serkan Yavuz, Narumol David, Schäfer Heinrich, Cosimo Citiolo, Sam Dylan, Georgina Fleur', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:318910'),
  ('361226341119932790', 'Kampf der Realitystars – Schiffbruch am Traumstrand', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The candidates live for four weeks in a “sala”, an open bamboo hut, on a tropical beach bay on Phuket. In various games they fight for the title “Realitystar 2020” and for a prize of 50,000 euros. In the course of each episode, additional candidates join the candidate field. At the “Hour of Truth”, the followers have the power to elect two of the candidates who have been drafted before them from the show and are protected from being voted out even at their first “Hour of Truth”. The candidates can earn luxury goods, or lose existing ones. In addition, the candidates must regularly assess themselves in different categories.', 'The candidates live for four weeks in a “sala”, an open bamboo hut, on a tropical beach bay on Phuket. In various games they fight for the title “Realitystar 2020” and for a prize of 50,000 euros. In the course of each episode, additional candidates join the candidate field. At the “Hour of Truth”, the followers have the power to elect two of the candidates who have been drafted before them from the show and are protected from being voted out even at their first “Hour of Truth”. The candidates can earn luxury goods, or lose existing ones. In addition, the candidates must regularly assess themselves in different categories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cwq0GOJiINF58WSwJlDMCjoFIb.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:108192'),
  ('857815112335436276', 'Kämpfer', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Yui Horie, Nana Mizuki, Yukari Tamura, Eri Nakao, Junko Minagawa, Kana Asumi, Kana Ueda', 'TV-14', 'Natsuru is selected to be a Kampfer, a mystical fighter who has to fight other Kampfers. The catch is that all Kampfers are female, and Natsuru is male... at least he was! Worse, Natusru''s best friend turns out to have a crush on his new body.', 'Natsuru is selected to be a Kampfer, a mystical fighter who has to fight other Kampfers. The catch is that all Kampfers are female, and Natsuru is male... at least he was! Worse, Natusru''s best friend turns out to have a crush on his new body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5z3iiFjp2k3AsrkcDr6FgLgCJTF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36025'),
  ('33895342507852180', 'KanColle: Kantai Collection', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rina Hidaka, Sumire Uesaka, Ayane Sakura, Saki Fujita, Nao Toyama, Ayana Taketatsu, Aya Suzaki, Yuka Otsubo', 'TV-14', 'Set in a world where humanity has lost control of the oceans to the “deep sea fleet,” the only hope to counter this threat are the Kanmusu, a group of girls who possess the spirit of Japanese warships. The story revolves around Fubuki, a destroyer who comes to the Chinjufu base to train with other Kanmusu. Watch as their stories unfold!', 'Set in a world where humanity has lost control of the oceans to the “deep sea fleet,” the only hope to counter this threat are the Kanmusu, a group of girls who possess the spirit of Japanese warships. The story revolves around Fubuki, a destroyer who comes to the Chinjufu base to train with other Kanmusu. Watch as their stories unfold!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaAFhipjK5NTukVZdBEpynGXopn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65711'),
  ('678159454154225757', 'KanColle: See You Again on Another Quiet Blue Sea', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saki Fujita, Yumi Tanibe, Aya Suzaki, Yui Horie, Iori Nomizu, Yui Ogura, Risa Taneda, Kozue Hayasaka', 'TV-14', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixqcV0r4Gp5RSFqoxp7co2aiumv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203192'),
  ('408035611588066881', 'Kandagawa Jet Girls', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yu Sasahara, Riko Kohara, Azusa Tadokoro, Aya Suzaki, Rumi Okubo, Naomi Ohzora, Lynn, Fairouz Ai', 'TV-MA', 'Jet Racing''s wet-n-wild combo of PWC racing and watergun sharpshooting has become mega-popular across the world. Rin Namiki wants in on the action, and after meeting the cool and gorgeous Misa Aoi, it looks like Rin''s dreams are finally in reach!', 'Jet Racing''s wet-n-wild combo of PWC racing and watergun sharpshooting has become mega-popular across the world. Rin Namiki wants in on the action, and after meeting the cool and gorgeous Misa Aoi, it looks like Rin''s dreams are finally in reach!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVUjq1VlKfZQPZMaSZnmPgkoRKG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93495'),
  ('272240059829184989', 'Kane & Abel', 1985, 'Drama', null, 'Robert W. Lenski, Jeffrey Archer', 'Sam Neill, David Dukes, Peter Strauss, Fred Gwynne, Ron Silver, Melissa Joan Hart, Thomas Byrd, Alberta Watson', 'NR', 'Kane & Abel is a television miniseries, based on the novel of the same name written by Jeffrey Archer, that aired on CBS in 1985. It stars Peter Strauss as Rosnovski and Sam Neill as Kane.', 'Kane & Abel is a television miniseries, based on the novel of the same name written by Jeffrey Archer, that aired on CBS in 1985. It stars Peter Strauss as Rosnovski and Sam Neill as Kane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msBIc6YXux5HXA9u5O7oQZZnlol.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29650'),
  ('282824695391877181', 'Kang''s Family', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Gang Wang', null, 'Jintang Gong, Huang Jinchang, Zhidan Su, Ding Ling, Yanfen Hu, Xinzhi Peng, Fion Cin, Ruoqi Xu', null, 'Kang''s Family; Migrant Wives, Local Husbands (Chinese: 外来媳妇本地郎 is a Cantonese sitcom produced by Guangdong Radio and Television. Filming began on April 18, 2000, and has been broadcast on GRT Pearl River Channel since November 4, 2000, with two episodes on Saturdays and Sundays at 19:00. It is the longest-running and most frequently aired sitcom in Chinese television history. As of May 15, 2021, the show has aired more than 4,000 episodes.', 'Kang''s Family; Migrant Wives, Local Husbands (Chinese: 外来媳妇本地郎 is a Cantonese sitcom produced by Guangdong Radio and Television. Filming began on April 18, 2000, and has been broadcast on GRT Pearl River Channel since November 4, 2000, with two episodes on Saturdays and Sundays at 19:00. It is the longest-running and most frequently aired sitcom in Chinese television history. As of May 15, 2021, the show has aired more than 4,000 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yubXCrUPIc83Nk53gYARF49rOYV.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:121513'),
  ('1141269043106846691', 'Kangsi Coming', 2004, 'Talk, Reality', 'Zhan Ren Xiong', null, null, null, 'KangXi Lai Le is a Taiwanese variety-comedy talk show hosted by variety show veterans Dee Hsu and Kevin Tsai. It was produced by Chungta Production from 2004 to 2009, and currently produced by Gold Star Production along with the writing and production staff of GUESS. It was first broadcast on 5 January 2004 and currently airs Monday to Friday at 22:00-23:00 on cable TV CTi Variety. In most episodes, the hosts interview a panel of celebrities in various and controversial topics while employing their signature comedic bantering. It is broadcast in Hong Kong on ATV Home under the name of Variety Show of Mr Con and Ms Csi. Although it is broadcast in Taiwan, the show is very successful and popular among Chinese speaking audiences across the world who watch uploaded re-runs over the internet or through bootleg DVDs. The show has been mentioned in other Taiwanese variety and talk shows, mainly from presenters who appeared on the show.', 'KangXi Lai Le is a Taiwanese variety-comedy talk show hosted by variety show veterans Dee Hsu and Kevin Tsai. It was produced by Chungta Production from 2004 to 2009, and currently produced by Gold Star Production along with the writing and production staff of GUESS. It was first broadcast on 5 January 2004 and currently airs Monday to Friday at 22:00-23:00 on cable TV CTi Variety. In most episodes, the hosts interview a panel of celebrities in various and controversial topics while employing their signature comedic bantering. It is broadcast in Hong Kong on ATV Home under the name of Variety Show of Mr Con and Ms Csi. Although it is broadcast in Taiwan, the show is very successful and popular among Chinese speaking audiences across the world who watch uploaded re-runs over the internet or through bootleg DVDs. The show has been mentioned in other Taiwanese variety and talk shows, mainly from presenters who appeared on the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVWEPDZHRSdd7voVled6CLLq1zB.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:6836'),
  ('850039664382409488', 'Kangxi Dynasty', 2001, 'Drama', 'Chen Jialin', 'Zhu Sujin, Hu Jianxin, Er Yue He', 'Chen Daoming, Siqin Gaowa, Ru Ping, Gao Lancun, 薛中锐, Ming Li, Su Tingshi, Li Jianqun', null, 'Kangxi Dynasty is a 2001 Chinese television series based on the novel Kangxi Da Di by Eryue He. The series is a prequel to the 1997 television series Yongzheng Dynasty, and was followed by Qianlong Dynasty in 2002.', 'Kangxi Dynasty is a 2001 Chinese television series based on the novel Kangxi Da Di by Eryue He. The series is a prequel to the 1997 television series Yongzheng Dynasty, and was followed by Qianlong Dynasty in 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWQ5g8m9y0A2kLklAGp3SAvzlmF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32196'),
  ('674266942994487455', 'Kangxi Incognito Travel', 1997, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Guoli, Deng Jie, Liu Miao, Zhao Liang, Kun Hou, Liu Long, John Lone', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piIKVNesmnsbydZlHC3kzVNhgNK.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:91066'),
  ('1098859854310749795', 'Kanıt', 2010, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Selin Atasoy Hartevioğlu, Ahmet Saatçioğlu', null, 'Sevil Atasoy, Engin Benli, Deniz Celiloğlu, Ece Güzel, Kubilay Güleçoğlu', null, 'Each episode, police inspectors Orhan and Selim try and solve puzzling cases with the help and guidance of forensics. Professor Sevil Atasoy, a forensic scientist, also joins us sometimes to tell relevant anecdotes.', 'Each episode, police inspectors Orhan and Selim try and solve puzzling cases with the help and guidance of forensics. Professor Sevil Atasoy, a forensic scientist, also joins us sometimes to tell relevant anecdotes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCqCVQOHCriAVqbFQaUxY4enLwj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65625'),
  ('368819819081816548', 'Kannagi: Crazy Shrine Maidens', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Hiro Shimono, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kana Hanazawa, Kana Hanazawa, Takanori Hoshino, Tetsuya Kakihara, Risa Hayamizu', 'TV-14', 'An art student named Jin Mikuriya carves a statue from the wood of the Kannagi tree only to have the statue come to life in the form of a goddess, who has now taken over the statue. He and "Nagi" work together to destroy the impurities that are gathering in the town.', 'An art student named Jin Mikuriya carves a statue from the wood of the Kannagi tree only to have the statue come to life in the form of a goddess, who has now taken over the statue. He and "Nagi" work together to destroy the impurities that are gathering in the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enfM3mP0uFPmI8yx6RU9AbwQOKP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34714'),
  ('766278803499552565', 'Kanokon', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Katsumi Nishino', null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Kumiko Nishihara, Risa Hayamizu, Youto Kazama, Miyu Takeuchi, Mamiko Noto, Takashi Kondo, Ui Miyazaki', 'TV-MA', 'Kouta has girl troubles of the supernatural sort. For some reason, he keeps attracting the attention (and affections) of animal spirits! Having spent most of his life in the country, Kouta is understandably nervous when he moves in with his grandma to attend a high school in the big city. He hoped to make a good impression, but having Chizuru, a beautiful fox spirit, hanging off his arm didn''t seem to be the sort of image he wanted to have. She''s not alone in her love for Kouta, either. Nozomu, a wolf spirit, as well as other youkai have their sights set on the hapless country boy.', 'Kouta has girl troubles of the supernatural sort. For some reason, he keeps attracting the attention (and affections) of animal spirits! Having spent most of his life in the country, Kouta is understandably nervous when he moves in with his grandma to attend a high school in the big city. He hoped to make a good impression, but having Chizuru, a beautiful fox spirit, hanging off his arm didn''t seem to be the sort of image he wanted to have. She''s not alone in her love for Kouta, either. Nozomu, a wolf spirit, as well as other youkai have their sights set on the hapless country boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEJU6ZiH5TEsNddFqpJgNnahswn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46414'),
  ('779825746235421990', 'Kanon', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Yui Horie, Mariko Kouda, Yukari Tamura, Akemi Satou, Mayumi Izuka, Yuko Minaguchi', 'TV-14', 'Yuichi hasn’t seen his cousin Nayuki in years. Now that he’s back, all knowledge of ever visiting has vanished. He tries to adjust to the vaguely familiar surroundings, but the gaps in his memory haunt him as time grows short. The pieces of the puzzle have appeared – an eerily silent beauty with blazing tresses, the mysterious girl with the winged backpack, and the sword-wielding demon slayer – but it’s up to Yuichi to discover how they fit together.', 'Yuichi hasn’t seen his cousin Nayuki in years. Now that he’s back, all knowledge of ever visiting has vanished. He tries to adjust to the vaguely familiar surroundings, but the gaps in his memory haunt him as time grows short. The pieces of the puzzle have appeared – an eerily silent beauty with blazing tresses, the mysterious girl with the winged backpack, and the sword-wielding demon slayer – but it’s up to Yuichi to discover how they fit together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC2kejWboF0OUBjISFv9lw9GTF2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34124'),
  ('375650216873248437', 'Kantaro: The Sweet Tooth Salaryman', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Matsuya Onoe, Ren Ishikawa, Sarutoki Minagawa, Hiroyuki Onoue, Hazuki Shimizu', null, 'A stoic book salesman leads a double life as he plays hooky from work to write his sweets blog. In his journey to attain a glimpse of sweets heaven Kantaro samples various Japanese and Western sweets.', 'A stoic book salesman leads a double life as he plays hooky from work to write his sweets blog. In his journey to attain a glimpse of sweets heaven Kantaro samples various Japanese and Western sweets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zJKJ2VydZl0AbJ9oCAegeoe9UQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78795'),
  ('912116326028327551', 'KAOS', 2024, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Charlie Covell', null, 'Jeff Goldblum', 'TV-MA', 'As discord reigns on Mount Olympus and almighty Zeus spirals into paranoia, three mortals are destined to reshape the future of humankind.', 'As discord reigns on Mount Olympus and almighty Zeus spirals into paranoia, three mortals are destined to reshape the future of humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDBTUSl3tRsOeKC1jZugBSFHy9I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102621'),
  ('335235228539401973', 'Kaoskassa', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Victor Sotberg, Christopher Robin Omdahl, Robin Hofset', null, 'Victor, Chris and Rob are back, trying to solve various tasks in their own chaotic way.', 'Victor, Chris and Rob are back, trying to solve various tasks in their own chaotic way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQofGNONBEyn3oOQehkXxvzupTd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313528'),
  ('1053439698911322484', 'Kappa Mikey', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Larry Schwarz', null, 'Stephen Moverley, Kether Donohue, Jesse Adams, Michael Sinterniklaas, Sean Schemmel, Gary Littman, Carrie Keranen', 'TV-Y7', 'Kappa Mikey is an American animated sitcom created by Larry Schwarz, who chose 4Kids Entertainment as the worldwide licensing, marketing and official promotional agent of the series. The show is Nicktoons''s first original half-hour series, bought during the same period as other Animation Collective series such as Three Delivery and Speed Racer: The Next Generation, as well as Flash shows from other studios, such as Edgar & Ellen and The Secret Show, though the latter was made from BBC. The series premiered on January 6, 2006, as Nickelodeon aired several reruns and premieres as a promotional movement from August 20, 2006 to January 2007. The series is MTV''s first global acquisition, and is currently available on iTunes.', 'Kappa Mikey is an American animated sitcom created by Larry Schwarz, who chose 4Kids Entertainment as the worldwide licensing, marketing and official promotional agent of the series. The show is Nicktoons''s first original half-hour series, bought during the same period as other Animation Collective series such as Three Delivery and Speed Racer: The Next Generation, as well as Flash shows from other studios, such as Edgar & Ellen and The Secret Show, though the latter was made from BBC. The series premiered on January 6, 2006, as Nickelodeon aired several reruns and premieres as a promotional movement from August 20, 2006 to January 2007. The series is MTV''s first global acquisition, and is currently available on iTunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv2L3sYv3cWuvHSYsBYK8Wu75rg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1634'),
  ('545832706979864456', 'Kaptaan', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jatin Satish Wagle', null, 'Saqib Saleem, Siddharth Nigam, Kavita Kaushik, Varun Badola, Arif Zakaria, Anjum Sharma, Pooja Gor, Vikram Kochhar', null, 'SSP Samardeep, a feared encounter specialist, hides a broken past behind his ruthless image. Years ago, in his pursuit of revenge, he abandoned his informant DK’s brothers. Now In Jwalabad, as Munna, Tinnu, and Shaheen battle for a ₹180-crore tender, Samar joins forces with the ruthless Kabir—only to discover he is one of those lost children, forcing him to face his past.', 'SSP Samardeep, a feared encounter specialist, hides a broken past behind his ruthless image. Years ago, in his pursuit of revenge, he abandoned his informant DK’s brothers. Now In Jwalabad, as Munna, Tinnu, and Shaheen battle for a ₹180-crore tender, Samar joins forces with the ruthless Kabir—only to discover he is one of those lost children, forcing him to face his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebRoRQdgcP6Xk83KxRy7qrVww5f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318254'),
  ('763148373353130735', 'Kara Swisher Wants to Live Forever', 2026, null, null, null, 'Kara Swisher', null, 'In Kara Swisher Wants to Live Forever, Swisher investigates the fast-growing world of longevity and anti-aging, cutting through the hype to separate real science from the wishful thinking. Fueled by the early death of her father and her own very serious health scare, she explores how far humans will go to extend their lives. Bringing decades of experience covering the technology industry, Swisher interrogates the belief among the world''s wealthiest innovators that sheer ambition can finally outsmart mortality. In each episode, she draws on her deep connections in Silicon Valley and beyond, stepping in as both reporter and test subject to examine the unconventional emerging technologies shaping how long and how well we may live.', 'In Kara Swisher Wants to Live Forever, Swisher investigates the fast-growing world of longevity and anti-aging, cutting through the hype to separate real science from the wishful thinking. Fueled by the early death of her father and her own very serious health scare, she explores how far humans will go to extend their lives. Bringing decades of experience covering the technology industry, Swisher interrogates the belief among the world''s wealthiest innovators that sheer ambition can finally outsmart mortality. In each episode, she draws on her deep connections in Silicon Valley and beyond, stepping in as both reporter and test subject to examine the unconventional emerging technologies shaping how long and how well we may live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LkVpOaxrWX2oVDtzOxvUSVY1Bv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318133'),
  ('915244283847813795', 'Karadayi', 2012, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Sema Ergenekon, Eylem Canpolat', 'Sema Ergenekon, Eylem Canpolat', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Bergüzar Korel, Çetin Tekindor, Yurdaer Okur, Erkan Avcı, Melike İpek Yalova, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Ulaş Tuna Astepe', null, 'The Kara family''s life is turned upside down because of a wrongful accusation that results in the imprisonment of Nazif Kara for a murder he didn''t commit.', 'The Kara family''s life is turned upside down because of a wrongful accusation that results in the imprisonment of Nazif Kara for a murder he didn''t commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oVAvQ6SqsC4u82mc3F3olGPLw9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:47745'),
  ('578444334469780114', 'Karagar', 2022, 'Mystery', 'Syed Ahmed Shawki', null, 'Chanchal Chowdhury, Intekhab Dinar, Tasnia Farin, Faruk Sobhan Nayeem, Jayanto Chattopadhyay, Afzal Hossain, Bijori Barkatullah, Mir Nowfel Ashrafi Jisan', null, 'A prisoner appears in Akashnagar Central Jail''s Cell No.145, which has been shut for 50 years, and claims immortality. Who is this mystery man, and what secrets does he hold inside him?', 'A prisoner appears in Akashnagar Central Jail''s Cell No.145, which has been shut for 50 years, and claims immortality. Who is this mystery man, and what secrets does he hold inside him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tLoJ31NLwhlP5PjJItBCptRV4t.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:207305'),
  ('1068852344741992294', 'Karakuri Circus', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime, Animation, Drama', 'Kazuhiro Fujita', null, 'Chihiro Ueda, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Romi Park, Masahiko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Takahiro Sakurai, Nozomu Sasaki', null, 'Narumi Katou is a middle-aged man who suffers from the bizarre ZONAPHA Syndrome: a rare and inexplicable disease that causes its victims to endure severe seizures at random, with the only cure being to watch someone laugh. One day, during Narumi''s part time job, a young boy with a giant suitcase fleeing from three adults runs into him. The boy introduces himself as Masaru Saiga, the new owner of the famous Saiga Enterprises following his father''s recent death. However, other members of his family are trying to assassinate him and claim the fortune for themselves.', 'Narumi Katou is a middle-aged man who suffers from the bizarre ZONAPHA Syndrome: a rare and inexplicable disease that causes its victims to endure severe seizures at random, with the only cure being to watch someone laugh. One day, during Narumi''s part time job, a young boy with a giant suitcase fleeing from three adults runs into him. The boy introduces himself as Masaru Saiga, the new owner of the famous Saiga Enterprises following his father''s recent death. However, other members of his family are trying to assassinate him and claim the fortune for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUhEiAZXI6OqlUnIbUjlANzY8V9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83054'),
  ('699181448671636197', 'Karamora', 2022, 'Drama', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Aleksander Fomin', null, 'Danila Kozlovsky, Daria Balabanova, Filipp Yankovsky, Andrey Smolyakov, Nikita Kukushkin, Nino Ninidze, Dmitry Chebotarev, Dmitriy Podnozov', null, 'A young anarchist Karamora and his lover, Alina are caught–up in a confrontation with members of a powerful organization which costs Alina her life. Devastated, Karamora wants vengeance but this ancient secret order’s tentacles are everywhere, with depth and reach far beyond human capabilities. Karamora uncovers classified information that goes right to the heart of this arcane organization only to find out that real power lies elsewhere. Who are they, and will Karamora find peace once the truth is revealed?', 'A young anarchist Karamora and his lover, Alina are caught–up in a confrontation with members of a powerful organization which costs Alina her life. Devastated, Karamora wants vengeance but this ancient secret order’s tentacles are everywhere, with depth and reach far beyond human capabilities. Karamora uncovers classified information that goes right to the heart of this arcane organization only to find out that real power lies elsewhere. Who are they, and will Karamora find peace once the truth is revealed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwZTVd5WQxVg4ZZPkYHijt6IqCr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156100'),
  ('573597122198553316', 'Karaoke', 1996, 'Drama', 'Dennis Potter', null, 'Albert Finney, Saffron Burrows, Hywel Bennett, Roy Hudd, Richard E. Grant, Anna Chancellor, Keeley Hawes, Simon Donald', null, 'Screenwriter Daniel Feeld experiences bizarre coincidences as his screenplay—about a karaoke bar, an employee named Sandra, and her murder by Arthur ''Pig'' Mallion—seems to mirror reality, with a karaoke bar, an employee named Sandra, and a shady owner named Mallion.', 'Screenwriter Daniel Feeld experiences bizarre coincidences as his screenplay—about a karaoke bar, an employee named Sandra, and her murder by Arthur ''Pig'' Mallion—seems to mirror reality, with a karaoke bar, an employee named Sandra, and a shady owner named Mallion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvfgOlcxGhz9OTUNWenrnwoszQz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3636'),
  ('259115208875669379', 'Karas', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Soko Wada, Asuka Shibuya, Kasumi Suzuki, Hitomi Nabatame, Takahiro Sakurai, Tetsuo Goto, Saeko Chiba, Kiyoyuki Yanada', 'TV-MA', 'In the city of Shinjuku, a conflict between a rouge Karas by the name of Eko and the "will of the city" rage in a conflict for dominance. A Karas brought about to fight the rouge has fallen, leaving the city and its inhabitants defenseless. Soon after, Otoha, a comatose patient, is chosen to become a new Karas to face off the rouge Karas Eko to decide the fate of the city and its inhabitants.', 'In the city of Shinjuku, a conflict between a rouge Karas by the name of Eko and the "will of the city" rage in a conflict for dominance. A Karas brought about to fight the rouge has fallen, leaving the city and its inhabitants defenseless. Soon after, Otoha, a comatose patient, is chosen to become a new Karas to face off the rouge Karas Eko to decide the fate of the city and its inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5PIkmbGrRYRN1MRt7wFDGD9kcu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69055'),
  ('91982545686798951', 'Kardeş Payı', 2014, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Selçuk Aydemir', null, 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Seda Bakan, Şinasi Yurtsever, Ayşe Kökçü, Ali İhsan Varol, Ayhan Taş, Korhan Herduran', null, 'The show is about two brothers and a sister. The two brothers have a plumbing company and they are trying to invent something that would make the world a better place.', 'The show is about two brothers and a sister. The two brothers have a plumbing company and they are trying to invent something that would make the world a better place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rsZr16V6yT4jyGB0QLkXi5yC5M.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61516'),
  ('158888602593597248', 'Karen Pirie', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Emer Kenny, Gareth Bryn', null, 'Lauren Lyle, Chris Jenks, Zach Wyatt, Emer Kenny, Rakhee Thakrar, Steve John Shepherd, John Michie, Julia Brown', null, 'When a 25-year-old murder in St Andrews becomes the subject of a provocative true-crime podcast, DS Karen Pirie is tasked with heading up a review. Digging up the past, Karen uncovers fresh evidence and a potential perpetrator. But when suspects start coming under attack, the cold case turns into an active investigation. Can Karen find the killer before it’s too late?', 'When a 25-year-old murder in St Andrews becomes the subject of a provocative true-crime podcast, DS Karen Pirie is tasked with heading up a review. Digging up the past, Karen uncovers fresh evidence and a potential perpetrator. But when suspects start coming under attack, the cold case turns into an active investigation. Can Karen find the killer before it’s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phknCqSIyo3YbCdsZhdXqImuqDz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:194636'),
  ('601931964890198105', 'Karen Sisco', 2003, 'Drama', 'Jason Smilovic', null, 'Carla Gugino, Bill Duke, Robert Forster, Carlos Ponce', null, 'As a U.S. Deputy Marshal, based on Miami, Florida''s Gold Coast, Karen must deal with the underbelly of South Beach nightlife and Palm Beach high life while tracking down fugitives. She also struggles to win the respect of her fellow officers. Karen occasionally gets advice from her father, a retired Miami police officer turned private investigator, who is Karen’s confidant, counselor, and confessor.', 'As a U.S. Deputy Marshal, based on Miami, Florida''s Gold Coast, Karen must deal with the underbelly of South Beach nightlife and Palm Beach high life while tracking down fugitives. She also struggles to win the respect of her fellow officers. Karen occasionally gets advice from her father, a retired Miami police officer turned private investigator, who is Karen’s confidant, counselor, and confessor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xALO8AC4Cm7cEEYREfcPgoZmeL2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1131'),
  ('898006106916736433', 'Karenjit Kaur: The Untold Story of Sunny Leone', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Niranjan Kaushik, Karan Shrikant Sharma', 'Karamvir Lamba, Marc Buckner, Sunny Leone, Raj Arjun, Grusha Kapoor, Joanna Robaczewska, Ritu Shivpuri, Bijay Anand', 'TV-MA', 'The life journey of Karenjit Kaur, showcasing her beginnings as an innocent, how she became India’s most googled celebrity, and everything which followed in between.', 'The life journey of Karenjit Kaur, showcasing her beginnings as an innocent, how she became India’s most googled celebrity, and everything which followed in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wnHWFLc6JGukOA2rYqvcAUVzHE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80579'),
  ('257628882245278898', 'Kariera Nikodema Dyzmy', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Witold Orzechowski', 'Witold Orzechowski, Jan Rybkowski, Marek Nowicki', null, null, 'Nikodem Dyzma immigrates from the eastern part of Poland to the capital in the hope for possibilities to make a living. He is in need, very poor and forced to look for basic food and shelter. Yet, on a day when an unexpected invitation appears, his life changes dramatically.', 'Nikodem Dyzma immigrates from the eastern part of Poland to the capital in the hope for possibilities to make a living. He is in need, very poor and forced to look for basic food and shelter. Yet, on a day when an unexpected invitation appears, his life changes dramatically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lL0ZAXO3l7HDZfrigIHxHLLPjVo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48418'),
  ('545490651887258127', 'Karin: Chibi Vampire', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Yuna Kagesaki', 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Aya Hisakawa, Yuka Inokuchi, Junpei Takiguchi, Emi Shinohara, Hirofumi Nojima, Sayuri Yahagi, Mikako Takahashi', null, 'Karin Maaka leads an ordinary life in spite of the fact that she is from a family of vampires. Unlike the rest of her family, she has no problem with bright lights, sleeps in a bed instead of a coffin, and loves to eat garlic. She is such an abnormal vampire that she doesn''t even suck blood - she makes it!', 'Karin Maaka leads an ordinary life in spite of the fact that she is from a family of vampires. Unlike the rest of her family, she has no problem with bright lights, sleeps in a bed instead of a coffin, and loves to eat garlic. She is such an abnormal vampire that she doesn''t even suck blood - she makes it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZmo87aANSS0QFzKdlMQke6tosu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24318'),
  ('141004981840931794', 'Karishma Kaa Karishma', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Raghuvir Shekhavat', 'Jhanak Shukla, Sanjeev Seth, Eva Grover, Tisca Chopra', null, 'Karishma Kaa Karishma was an Indian television series which is a remake of the popular 1985s American science fiction sitcom Small Wonder. The series premiered on STAR Plus on January 24, 2003, and aired every Friday at 8pm IST. It is produced by Sunil Doshi of Alliance Media & Entertainment, and starrs Jhanak Shukla as the cyber kid Karishma.', 'Karishma Kaa Karishma was an Indian television series which is a remake of the popular 1985s American science fiction sitcom Small Wonder. The series premiered on STAR Plus on January 24, 2003, and aired every Friday at 8pm IST. It is produced by Sunil Doshi of Alliance Media & Entertainment, and starrs Jhanak Shukla as the cyber kid Karishma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ao2AhAolSPRNkD71OHzOG53mMN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31530'),
  ('179866818701236441', 'Karma', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lee Il-hyung', null, 'Park Hae-soo, Shin Min-a, Lee Hee-jun, Kim Sung-kyun, Lee Kwang-soo, Gong Seung-yeon, Choi Hong-il, Park Ho-san', null, 'A fateful accident intertwines six lives in a thrilling tale of karma and crime, where each must face their own dark truths and connections.', 'A fateful accident intertwines six lives in a thrilling tale of karma and crime, where each must face their own dark truths and connections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZ7SFBgEhgSCaQFFActjcBQeIV1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233686'),
  ('463119021909494000', 'Karma’s World', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Ludacris', null, 'Asia Bryant, Ludacris, Danielle Brooks, Ramone Hamilton', 'TV-Y', 'Talented singer and high school student Karma juggles rap dreams and rhyme schemes, using her talent, ambition and big heart to solve all kinds of problems.', 'Talented singer and high school student Karma juggles rap dreams and rhyme schemes, using her talent, ambition and big heart to solve all kinds of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWoTBTcWicfHnB7hRq1EDKdV1Mw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:133620'),
  ('1118719361782320943', 'Kasam - Tere Pyaar Ki', 2016, 'Soap, Family, Drama', 'Ekta Kapoor', null, 'Kratika Sengar, Sharad Malhotra, Shivani Tomar, Saba Mirza', null, 'Rishi and Tanu who are destined to be together since birth. Their love has stood the test of time, cheating even death. This story of reincarnation will even make non believers believe in love.', 'Rishi and Tanu who are destined to be together since birth. Their love has stood the test of time, cheating even death. This story of reincarnation will even make non believers believe in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lG4aS1NE4arSjkBBlCErJToJtn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72392'),
  ('945473035533300378', 'Kashimashi - Girl Meets Girl', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yukimaru Katsura, Satoru Akahori', null, 'Kana Ueda, Yui Horie, Yukari Tamura', 'TV-14', 'Hazumu confessed his love to Yasuna, but she turned him down. To ease his heartbreak, he went to Mt. Kashimayama where he had met her for the first time. He loses his way in the mountains, and it starts to get dark. Seeing a big shooting star in the sky, he begins to formulate a wish, but quickly notes that something is very wrong. For the shooting star is actually a space ship about to crash into him. And then he died. Only with the help of the aliens could his live be saved. However, he became a girl, due to an accident during the reconstruction of his body.', 'Hazumu confessed his love to Yasuna, but she turned him down. To ease his heartbreak, he went to Mt. Kashimayama where he had met her for the first time. He loses his way in the mountains, and it starts to get dark. Seeing a big shooting star in the sky, he begins to formulate a wish, but quickly notes that something is very wrong. For the shooting star is actually a space ship about to crash into him. And then he died. Only with the help of the aliens could his live be saved. However, he became a girl, due to an accident during the reconstruction of his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSM6UxFIGpncLux4hUHMWkIee98.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28764'),
  ('417126866695979969', 'Kasia and Tomek', 2002, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Joanna Brodzik, Paweł Wilczak', null, 'Kasia and Tomek are together for nearly seven years, but have not yet decided on marriage. Each episode shows the common life of this pair of young, educated and crazy about each other people. They''ve formed a relationship, which seems to be guided by the idea that opposites attract each other. Their relationship often seem like "storm in a teacup", but in their case it seems to be the recipe for a successful relationship. Radically different temperaments, different views and demonstration proclamation of their own ideals, is this what they really are serving each other every day. Despite that, or perhaps thanks to that, they are crazy about each other, one can not exist without the other, that is (paradoxically) we are dealing with a harmonious and successful relationship!', 'Kasia and Tomek are together for nearly seven years, but have not yet decided on marriage. Each episode shows the common life of this pair of young, educated and crazy about each other people. They''ve formed a relationship, which seems to be guided by the idea that opposites attract each other. Their relationship often seem like "storm in a teacup", but in their case it seems to be the recipe for a successful relationship. Radically different temperaments, different views and demonstration proclamation of their own ideals, is this what they really are serving each other every day. Despite that, or perhaps thanks to that, they are crazy about each other, one can not exist without the other, that is (paradoxically) we are dealing with a harmonious and successful relationship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPox9Hr3ueMiZrlwkhdRgfN0uPN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:48136'),
  ('1056388410713853766', 'Kassandra', 1992, 'Drama', null, null, 'Coraima Torres, Osvaldo Ríos', null, 'Kassandra is a Venezuelan telenovela, written by Delia Fiallo and directed by Grazio D''Angelo and Olegario Barrera, involving a gypsy maiden marrying into a rich family. She does not realize, however, that she is the granddaughter of the man in the house. Her husband is killed on her wedding night, and she is blamed for the murder. Kassandra lasted 150 episodes between October 1992 and May 1993, and it achieved a significant amount of success outside Venezuela; it was extremely successful in its later airings in Italy, Russia, former Eastern Bloc nations, the republics of the former Yugoslavia, as well as the Middle East, south and east Asia. The 2005-2006 Televisa telenovela Peregrina is a remake of this show. This was the only Hispanic telenovela dubbed in Cebuano and Hiligaynon languages in Visayas and Mindanao in the Philippines, aired by GMA Iloilo, Cebu and Davao.', 'Kassandra is a Venezuelan telenovela, written by Delia Fiallo and directed by Grazio D''Angelo and Olegario Barrera, involving a gypsy maiden marrying into a rich family. She does not realize, however, that she is the granddaughter of the man in the house. Her husband is killed on her wedding night, and she is blamed for the murder. Kassandra lasted 150 episodes between October 1992 and May 1993, and it achieved a significant amount of success outside Venezuela; it was extremely successful in its later airings in Italy, Russia, former Eastern Bloc nations, the republics of the former Yugoslavia, as well as the Middle East, south and east Asia. The 2005-2006 Televisa telenovela Peregrina is a remake of this show. This was the only Hispanic telenovela dubbed in Cebuano and Hiligaynon languages in Visayas and Mindanao in the Philippines, aired by GMA Iloilo, Cebu and Davao.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knw24Hmmy6OXVCIsZfL2CRJWY6d.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:6396'),
  ('92752329827145970', 'Katana Maidens: Toji no Miko', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Hina Kino, Saori Onishi, Azumi Waki, Mao Ichimichi, Satsuki Yukino, Mai Nakahara, Eri Suzuki', null, 'Since the ancient times, the Kannagi priestesses have used their swords, or Okatana, to exorcise the creatures known as Aratama that brought chaos upon the world of man. These maidens were known as Tojis, a special task force within the police allowed to have their Okatana on their person because they are government officials, but they mostly consist of school girls who go to one of five training schools. This spring, the top Tojis from five schools across the country have been gathered for a customary tournament where they will use their abilities and fight for the top position.', 'Since the ancient times, the Kannagi priestesses have used their swords, or Okatana, to exorcise the creatures known as Aratama that brought chaos upon the world of man. These maidens were known as Tojis, a special task force within the police allowed to have their Okatana on their person because they are government officials, but they mostly consist of school girls who go to one of five training schools. This spring, the top Tojis from five schools across the country have been gathered for a customary tournament where they will use their abilities and fight for the top position.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9y7K58aKhAj8KWWqwRWm03oEeBA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75864'),
  ('39727033275207643', 'Katanagatari', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Yukari Tamura, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Mai Nakahara, Chihiro Suzuki, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Hikaru Midorikawa, Haruka Tomatsu, Ryotaro Okiayu', 'TV-PG', 'The legendary swordsmith Kiki Shikizaki created 1,000 swords in his career. The more of the swords a country owns, the higher its chances are at winning a war. When the shogun emerged victorious, he collected 988 swords, but these were merely the “practice pieces”. The last twelve swords were the crowning achievements of Kiki’s career. Each one of them is so powerful that a single man could defeat an army with it. Togame, the shogun’s strategist, gets the order to collect these swords. At first she hired a ninja, but each of the swords’ value is so high that the entire ninja clan went rogue once they got hold of one. She then put her trust in another warrior, but he kept the sword for himself. Her final hope now is Shichika, the seventh and last student of the Kyotoryuu School.', 'The legendary swordsmith Kiki Shikizaki created 1,000 swords in his career. The more of the swords a country owns, the higher its chances are at winning a war. When the shogun emerged victorious, he collected 988 swords, but these were merely the “practice pieces”. The last twelve swords were the crowning achievements of Kiki’s career. Each one of them is so powerful that a single man could defeat an army with it. Togame, the shogun’s strategist, gets the order to collect these swords. At first she hired a ninja, but each of the swords’ value is so high that the entire ninja clan went rogue once they got hold of one. She then put her trust in another warrior, but he kept the sword for himself. Her final hope now is Shichika, the seventh and last student of the Kyotoryuu School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q99zmHmEjEH4cZTcvPXnEQydsM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46374'),
  ('622459321464966086', 'Kate & Allie', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sherry Coben', null, 'Susan Saint James, Jane Curtin, Allison Smith, Frederick Koehler, Ari Meyers', null, 'Kate & Allie is an American television situation comedy which ran from March 19, 1984, to May 22, 1989. Kate & Allie first aired on CBS as a midseason replacement series and only six episodes were initially commissioned, but the favorable response from critics and viewers alike easily convinced CBS to commit to a full season in the fall of 1984. The series was created by Sherry Coben.', 'Kate & Allie is an American television situation comedy which ran from March 19, 1984, to May 22, 1989. Kate & Allie first aired on CBS as a midseason replacement series and only six episodes were initially commissioned, but the favorable response from critics and viewers alike easily convinced CBS to commit to a full season in the fall of 1984. The series was created by Sherry Coben.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZX5pGw0BZ9woVQqtmC6DlaP5e5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:917'),
  ('87948966949641949', 'Kate & Koji', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Brenda Blethyn, Jimmy Akingbola', null, 'Kate runs an old-fashioned café in a seaside town, and develops a strong, if sometimes volatile, friendship with asylum-seeking African doctor Koji. Although from different worlds, Kate and Koji are similar in ways they do not see for themselves.', 'Kate runs an old-fashioned café in a seaside town, and develops a strong, if sometimes volatile, friendship with asylum-seeking African doctor Koji. Although from different worlds, Kate and Koji are similar in ways they do not see for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB0dhE7UMSE56YcTtcMMCQgi9FV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100678'),
  ('672104351020853685', 'Kath & Kim', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Gina Riley, Jane Turner', 'Magda Szubanski', 'Jane Turner, Gina Riley, Magda Szubanski, Glenn Robbins, Peter Rowsthorn', 'TV-MA', 'Kath & Kim is a character-driven Australian television situation comedy series. The series was created by, and is written by Jane Turner and Gina Riley who play the title characters: a suburban mother and daughter with a dysfunctional relationship. The series main characters consist of Kath Day-Knight, a cheerful 50-year-old woman, her self-indulgent daughter Kim Craig, Kath''s boyfriend and second husband, the metrosexual Kel Knight, as well as Kim''s estranged husband Brett Craig and her lonely, overweight "second best friend" Sharon Strzelecki. The series is set in the fictional suburb of Fountain Lakes in Melbourne. It is primarily filmed in Patterson Lakes. The series was conceived by Turner and Riley in the early 1990s as a weekly segment of the Australian comedy series Fast Forward. The skit was then developed into a full-series. The first series of Kath & Kim premiered on ABC TV on 16 May 2002, with three further series following, while a television movie, entitled Da Kath and Kim Code, was broadcast nationally on 25 November 2005. Kath & Kim has garnered much critical acclaim since its debut, winning two Logie Awards, for "Outstanding Comedy Programme" and the "Best Television Drama Series" award at the Australian Film Institute Awards. In Australia, it has become a pop culture phenomenon, and is a success with audiences nationwide. Internationally, the series has spawned a cult fanbase, and in 2006 it was announced an American version of the series would be produced, to air on NBC. Riley and Turner served as executive producers on the US version. The American version was also picked up by Seven, which debuted the program on 12 October 2008, just three days after its debut in the United States.', 'Kath & Kim is a character-driven Australian television situation comedy series. The series was created by, and is written by Jane Turner and Gina Riley who play the title characters: a suburban mother and daughter with a dysfunctional relationship. The series main characters consist of Kath Day-Knight, a cheerful 50-year-old woman, her self-indulgent daughter Kim Craig, Kath''s boyfriend and second husband, the metrosexual Kel Knight, as well as Kim''s estranged husband Brett Craig and her lonely, overweight "second best friend" Sharon Strzelecki. The series is set in the fictional suburb of Fountain Lakes in Melbourne. It is primarily filmed in Patterson Lakes. The series was conceived by Turner and Riley in the early 1990s as a weekly segment of the Australian comedy series Fast Forward. The skit was then developed into a full-series. The first series of Kath & Kim premiered on ABC TV on 16 May 2002, with three further series following, while a television movie, entitled Da Kath and Kim Code, was broadcast nationally on 25 November 2005. Kath & Kim has garnered much critical acclaim since its debut, winning two Logie Awards, for "Outstanding Comedy Programme" and the "Best Television Drama Series" award at the Australian Film Institute Awards. In Australia, it has become a pop culture phenomenon, and is a success with audiences nationwide. Internationally, the series has spawned a cult fanbase, and in 2006 it was announced an American version of the series would be produced, to air on NBC. Riley and Turner served as executive producers on the US version. The American version was also picked up by Seven, which debuted the program on 12 October 2008, just three days after its debut in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqjm2ZQ2U2bVsn76T3CKYru5e6t.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1772'),
  ('189251223341260150', 'Katha Ankahee', 2022, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Sunjoy Waddhwa', null, 'Aditi Sharma, Adnan Khan, Azinkya Mishra, Manish Raisinghani, Sheen Dass, Rita Prajapati, preeti amin', 'TV-PG', 'Katha, a single parent, is in need of funds for her son''s medical treatment. She comes across Viaan, who offers help but his conditions put her in an awkward situation.', 'Katha, a single parent, is in need of funds for her son''s medical treatment. She comes across Viaan, who offers help but his conditions put her in an awkward situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzBZkaHENCDSY3FaFIlVPuKVjdM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215902'),
  ('964055433866142197', 'Katla', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sigurjón Kjartansson, Baltasar Kormákur', 'Sigurjón Kjartansson, Lilja Sigurðardóttir, David Mar Stefansson', 'Guðrún Ýr Eyfjörð, Íris Tanja Í. Flygenring, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Aliette Opheim, Þorsteinn Bachmann, Haraldur Ari Stefánsson, Sólveig Arnarsdóttir, Baltasar Breki Samper', 'TV-MA', 'A year after a subglacial volcano erupts, mysterious elements from prehistoric times emerge from the melting ice, bringing unforeseen consequences.', 'A year after a subglacial volcano erupts, mysterious elements from prehistoric times emerge from the melting ice, bringing unforeseen consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g1eT3Kw8C57AnQdZIcLyRU4xkw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104157'),
  ('146169070291243788', 'Katri: Girl of the Meadows', 1984, 'Animation, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Hitomi Oikawa, Hisako Kyoda, Kumiko Takizawa, Naoki Tatsuta, Toru Furuya, Akiko Takeguchi, Akio Nojima, Asami Mukaidono', null, 'Katri is a young country girl who lives in Finland during the First World War. Her mother has gone off to Germany and Katri is left to live with her grandparents. The young but diligent girl manages daily tasks of her grandparents'' property and, despite her young age, soon gets to work for a local farmer as a herd. There she makes friends with the two boys of the neighbourhood.', 'Katri is a young country girl who lives in Finland during the First World War. Her mother has gone off to Germany and Katri is left to live with her grandparents. The young but diligent girl manages daily tasks of her grandparents'' property and, despite her young age, soon gets to work for a local farmer as a herd. There she makes friends with the two boys of the neighbourhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4pNaHsEo9rhlYALpyGgs10WKIj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43702'),
  ('328973574992920780', 'Katrina: Come Hell and High Water', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Leanne Williams', null, 'Twenty years after Hurricane Katrina, survivors reflect on the disastrous storm that forever changed their lives and the systemic inequities it exposed.', 'Twenty years after Hurricane Katrina, survivors reflect on the disastrous storm that forever changed their lives and the systemic inequities it exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f16yvVS9QJf1x0dxx1bPE7cnKKR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283354'),
  ('969550033545454294', 'Katsugeki: Touken Ranbu', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kento Hama, Takuma Nagatsuka, Seiichiro Yamashita, Toru Sakurai, Soma Saito, Junko Minagawa, Junya Enoki, Ryohei Kimura', null, 'The year is 1863 as the tumultuous samurai era is coming to an end, Japan is split between the pro-shogunate and anti-shogunate factions. The fate of the world is threatened as an army of historical revisionists are sent from the future to alter the course of history. In order to bring these forces down and protect the real history, two sword warriors, spirits who are swords brought to life by Saniwa (sage), rush to Edo. The polite and thoughtful Horikawa Kunihiro and the short tempered yet skillful Izuminokami Kanesada, who served the same master, confront the invading army along with a lively gang of other warriors including Mutsunokami Yoshiyuki, Yagen Toushirou, Tombokiri, and Tsurumaru Kuninaga. As the fate of history lies in these hero''s hands, what meets the blade is yet to be uncovered...', 'The year is 1863 as the tumultuous samurai era is coming to an end, Japan is split between the pro-shogunate and anti-shogunate factions. The fate of the world is threatened as an army of historical revisionists are sent from the future to alter the course of history. In order to bring these forces down and protect the real history, two sword warriors, spirits who are swords brought to life by Saniwa (sage), rush to Edo. The polite and thoughtful Horikawa Kunihiro and the short tempered yet skillful Izuminokami Kanesada, who served the same master, confront the invading army along with a lively gang of other warriors including Mutsunokami Yoshiyuki, Yagen Toushirou, Tombokiri, and Tsurumaru Kuninaga. As the fate of history lies in these hero''s hands, what meets the blade is yet to be uncovered...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eoy0JtNxlgdEn4NAPZfq9duIWL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72028'),
  ('962121115163248567', 'Katy Keene', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Grassi, Roberto Aguirre-Sacasa', 'Evelyn Yves', 'Lucy Hale, Ashleigh Murray, Julia Chan, Jonny Beauchamp, Katherine LaNasa, Lucien Laviscount, Zane Holtz, Camille Hyde', 'TV-14', 'A group of aspiring artists living in New York City try to make their dreams come true.', 'A group of aspiring artists living in New York City try to make their dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUTZY7EHg9mWrORKFY4piD0PehY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87539'),
