  ('1042555894445686633', 'Kavanagh Q.C.', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ted Childs, Susan Rogers', null, 'John Thaw', 'TV-MA', 'John Thaw dons the silks as barrister James Kavanagh Q.C., one of the most highly respected criminal advocates in London, commanding admiration from colleagues and opponents alike. However, all this has come at a price as his dedication to work has taken its toll on his private life… Going beyond traditional courtroom dramas, “Kavanagh Q.C.” uncovers the pressures of legal battles and the problems of defining the truth, providing a compelling representation of the euphoric ups and costly downs of success and failure in the legal world.', 'John Thaw dons the silks as barrister James Kavanagh Q.C., one of the most highly respected criminal advocates in London, commanding admiration from colleagues and opponents alike. However, all this has come at a price as his dedication to work has taken its toll on his private life… Going beyond traditional courtroom dramas, “Kavanagh Q.C.” uncovers the pressures of legal battles and the problems of defining the truth, providing a compelling representation of the euphoric ups and costly downs of success and failure in the legal world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIXHr4lgRmlBOlBTj1aJdHPPE8r.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4205'),
  ('895914395172849362', 'Kavita Bhabhi', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kavita Radheshyam, Nishant Pandey', null, 'Amazingly seductive bhabhi, pleasuring people over the phone calls. She narrates make out stories to the customers in a very romantic way and charges them with a good amount. Watch a tale full of lovely stories, Kavita Bhabhi.', 'Amazingly seductive bhabhi, pleasuring people over the phone calls. She narrates make out stories to the customers in a very romantic way and charges them with a good amount. Watch a tale full of lovely stories, Kavita Bhabhi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90klBhJAEFAtNskA5NUWsaK9BFt.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99292'),
  ('1132636819021591421', 'Kaya-chan Isn''t Scary', 2026, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Azusa Tachibana, Maaya Uchida, Azusa Tadokoro, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Yuki Kaji, Fukushi Ochiai, Mamiko Noto, Haruka Tomatsu', 'TV-14', 'Kaya-chan attends Hanamugi Kindergarten, and she has an incredibly strong sixth sense. She secretly beats up the ghosts that stalk her friends and family, but in turn, she’s treated like a troublemaker since nobody understands her strange behavior. Everything changes when her teacher, Chie, discovers her secret. Kaya-chan''s fists will go flying at any sinister spirits that show up!', 'Kaya-chan attends Hanamugi Kindergarten, and she has an incredibly strong sixth sense. She secretly beats up the ghosts that stalk her friends and family, but in turn, she’s treated like a troublemaker since nobody understands her strange behavior. Everything changes when her teacher, Chie, discovers her secret. Kaya-chan''s fists will go flying at any sinister spirits that show up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUCLhwkFW8oefGDQOymH7bSzu35.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275902'),
