  ('558959594408200177', 'Keep Sweet: Pray and Obey', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Warren Jeffs', 'TV-MA', 'In interviews and rare home video footage, ex-FLDS members share the truth about their isolated community — and the events that pushed them to leave.', 'In interviews and rare home video footage, ex-FLDS members share the truth about their isolated community — and the events that pushed them to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Nmb8R9fO9ezzTDZKE5hwkPhu7M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202880'),
  ('391248192263108898', 'Keep Your Hands Off Eizouken!', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Sairi Ito, Mutsumi Tamura, Misato Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'First-year high schooler Midori Asakusa loves anime so much, she insists that "concept is everything" in animation. While she spends her time doodling endless ideas and settings in her sketchbook, she hasn''t taken the first step to creating anime, insisting that she can''t do it alone. After Asakusa''s money-loving best friend Sayaka Kanamori notices her genius and drive – and when it becomes clear that their classmate and charismatic fashion model Tsubame Mizusaki wants to be an animator – the energetic trio start an animation club. Together, the three aim to realize the "ultimate world" that exists in their minds, as they come to see the power that fiction and imagination have on their lives and the world around them.', 'First-year high schooler Midori Asakusa loves anime so much, she insists that "concept is everything" in animation. While she spends her time doodling endless ideas and settings in her sketchbook, she hasn''t taken the first step to creating anime, insisting that she can''t do it alone. After Asakusa''s money-loving best friend Sayaka Kanamori notices her genius and drive – and when it becomes clear that their classmate and charismatic fashion model Tsubame Mizusaki wants to be an animator – the energetic trio start an animation club. Together, the three aim to realize the "ultimate world" that exists in their minds, as they come to see the power that fiction and imagination have on their lives and the world around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rHoqpvvfjHqEBGuhKfPtZoRQkC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92579'),
  ('357108012977508428', 'Keeper of the Ashes: The Oklahoma Girl Scout Murders', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Kristin Chenoweth', null, 'The true story of three young Oklahoma girls, found murdered after their first night at sleep-away camp. The tragedy, as well as the manhunt and trial of their suspected killer, captivated the nation in the summer of 1977. But decades later, uncertainties surrounding the case continue to haunt the Tulsa community, local law enforcement, and the victims'' families.', 'The true story of three young Oklahoma girls, found murdered after their first night at sleep-away camp. The tragedy, as well as the manhunt and trial of their suspected killer, captivated the nation in the summer of 1977. But decades later, uncertainties surrounding the case continue to haunt the Tulsa community, local law enforcement, and the victims'' families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DQEbPib6vO7xC29N5VaQLtkugu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202173'),
  ('503264851215579311', 'Keeping Faith', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Matthew Hall', 'Eve Myles', 'TV-PG', 'Faith, a small-town Welsh lawyer, is forced to cut short her extended maternity leave when her husband and business partner, Evan, goes missing. As the truth of his actions surface, Faith must fight to protect her family and her sanity.', 'Faith, a small-town Welsh lawyer, is forced to cut short her extended maternity leave when her husband and business partner, Evan, goes missing. As the truth of his actions surface, Faith must fight to protect her family and her sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loZ2f0rbBwwnGXr6lSaOA4dGPV3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75592'),
  ('1084569202022644144', 'Keeping Up Appearances', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Roy Clarke', null, 'Patricia Routledge, Clive Swift, Judy Cornwell, Geoffrey Hughes, Josephine Tewson, David Griffin, Mary Millar', 'TV-PG', 'Hyacinth Bucket (whose name, she insists, is pronounced "Bouquet") is a suburban housewife in the West Midlands. She would be the first to tell you that she is a gracious hostess, a respected citizen, and a well-connected member of high society. If you don''t believe that, just ask her best friend Elizabeth, held captive in Hyacinth''s kitchen; or the postmen and neighbours who bristle at the sound of her voice; or Richard, her weary and compliant husband. In fact, Hyacinth''s reputation could be as perfect as her new lounge set, if not for her senile father''s love of running wild in the nip. Oh, and she would prefer it if her brother-in-law was a sharper dresser. And that her husband was more ambitious. And that her sisters were more presentable. And do take your shoes off before you come in the house, dear. Mind that you don''t brush against the wallpaper.', 'Hyacinth Bucket (whose name, she insists, is pronounced "Bouquet") is a suburban housewife in the West Midlands. She would be the first to tell you that she is a gracious hostess, a respected citizen, and a well-connected member of high society. If you don''t believe that, just ask her best friend Elizabeth, held captive in Hyacinth''s kitchen; or the postmen and neighbours who bristle at the sound of her voice; or Richard, her weary and compliant husband. In fact, Hyacinth''s reputation could be as perfect as her new lounge set, if not for her senile father''s love of running wild in the nip. Oh, and she would prefer it if her brother-in-law was a sharper dresser. And that her husband was more ambitious. And that her sisters were more presentable. And do take your shoes off before you come in the house, dear. Mind that you don''t brush against the wallpaper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dwn4Lfav9mXfJmYhHNeMLWhuZj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34'),
  ('241139002879747586', 'Keeping Up with the Kardashians', 2007, 'Reality', 'Eliot Goldberg, Ryan Seacrest', null, 'Kris Jenner, Kourtney Kardashian Barker, Kim Kardashian, Khloé Kardashian, Kendall Jenner, Kylie Jenner, Scott Disick, Tristan Thompson', 'TV-14', 'A peek inside the exploits and privileged private lives of the blended Kardashian-Jenner family, including sisters Kim, Kourtney and Khloé.', 'A peek inside the exploits and privileged private lives of the blended Kardashian-Jenner family, including sisters Kim, Kourtney and Khloé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nddXOC8wYpIDv7giLzjjqIg8WDA.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:14814'),
  ('131249969606214153', 'Kees & Co', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Simone Kleinsma, Maurits van Brakel, Lizzy van Vleuten, Tibor Lukács, Plien van Bennekom, Tina de Bruin', null, 'This is the life of Kees Heistee. Kees is married to the charming, good-natured Ben, and together they have two children: their daughter Anne, a nightmare for any mother, and their son Rudie, who has a taste for the morbid. Her best friend and next-door neighbor, Sonja, also plays a major role in her life. Kees tries to teach her family morals and values, but so far, that seems impossible...', 'This is the life of Kees Heistee. Kees is married to the charming, good-natured Ben, and together they have two children: their daughter Anne, a nightmare for any mother, and their son Rudie, who has a taste for the morbid. Her best friend and next-door neighbor, Sonja, also plays a major role in her life. Kees tries to teach her family morals and values, but so far, that seems impossible...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h49TVWIaD5wngG12BvxJRZ9Q90Y.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:37445'),
  ('593273294512383091', 'Keijo!!!!!!!!', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Lynn, Mao Ichimichi, Kaede Hondo, Saori Onishi, Rena Maeda', null, '"Keijo" is a popular gambling sport where contestants stand on platforms floating on the water and must use their butts and chests to fight against each other to push each other off the platform. Nozomi Kaminashi, a high school student, aims to join the sport after she graduates. Nozomi was raised in a poor family and hopes to make lots of money by playing Keijo. She grew up training in gymnastics, and she has good balance and flexibility. After high school, Nozomi joins a training boarding school and enters the world of Keijo.', '"Keijo" is a popular gambling sport where contestants stand on platforms floating on the water and must use their butts and chests to fight against each other to push each other off the platform. Nozomi Kaminashi, a high school student, aims to join the sport after she graduates. Nozomi was raised in a poor family and hopes to make lots of money by playing Keijo. She grew up training in gymnastics, and she has good balance and flexibility. After high school, Nozomi joins a training boarding school and enters the world of Keijo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqFfPfjDWKczferx5lm0tAsN9RT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68148'),
  ('175710030988355645', 'Keine Talkshow - Eingesperrt mit Jan Fleischhauer', 2025, 'Talk', null, null, 'Jan Fleischhauer', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:317153'),
  ('1115164379722105366', 'Keisei Saimin no Otoko', 2015, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Joe Odagiri, Sadao Abe, Kotaro Yoshida, Shosuke Tanihara, Mitsu Dan, Mimura, Miyabi Matsuura, Takahiro Fujimoto', null, 'A 3-part series of biographical dramas to commemorate the 90th anniversary of the establishment of NHK.', 'A 3-part series of biographical dramas to commemorate the 90th anniversary of the establishment of NHK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fq7XHXX1uhxGmGdEhqJclINoTbT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123640'),
  ('709842959012919366', 'Keishichou Outsider', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', null, null, 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Gaku Hamada, Moka Kamishiraishi, Toshiro Yanagiba, Hikari Ishida, Yûka, Maho Nonami, Neru Nagahama', null, 'Kagawa Eiji is a detective who looks more like a gangster. He previously worked at the Metropolitan Police Department investigating organized crime groups, but he was recently demoted to the Sakuramachi Chuo Police Station without being given a reason why. Kagawa Eiji desires to return to the Metropolitan Police Department to get answers. Meanwhile, he works with Detective Hasumi Kosuke at the Sakuramachi Chuo Police Station. Detective Hasumi Kosuke carries a big secret that has never been revealed. A case comes up, where a housekeeper, working at a professor''s house, is stabbed to death. At that time, a rookie detective, Mizuki Nao, begins to work with them. Kagawa Eiji and Hasumi Kosuke are bothered by her. She is the daughter of the assistant commissioner at the Metropolitan Police Department. They begin to work together.', 'Kagawa Eiji is a detective who looks more like a gangster. He previously worked at the Metropolitan Police Department investigating organized crime groups, but he was recently demoted to the Sakuramachi Chuo Police Station without being given a reason why. Kagawa Eiji desires to return to the Metropolitan Police Department to get answers. Meanwhile, he works with Detective Hasumi Kosuke at the Sakuramachi Chuo Police Station. Detective Hasumi Kosuke carries a big secret that has never been revealed. A case comes up, where a housekeeper, working at a professor''s house, is stabbed to death. At that time, a rookie detective, Mizuki Nao, begins to work with them. Kagawa Eiji and Hasumi Kosuke are bothered by her. She is the daughter of the assistant commissioner at the Metropolitan Police Department. They begin to work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5wuThbaqzjTmiLb12a1lCO9IKW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215270'),
  ('715300945576357831', 'Keizoku: Unsolved Cases', 1999, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Miki Nakatani, Atsuro Watabe, Shigeru Izumiya, Kenichi Yajima, Sarina Suzuki, Hidekazu Nagae, Mari Nishio, Goro Noguchi', null, 'Keizoku is a Japanese mystery thriller created first as a TV drama and later as a film. It is about Detective Jun Shibata, who handles unsolved cases with her hardened partner Tōru Mayama. The television series was broadcast in eleven episodes between 8 January and 19 March 1999. A two-hour "special drama" was then broadcast on 24 December 1999. The series has been called "epoch-making" in the police procedural genre on Japanese television.', 'Keizoku is a Japanese mystery thriller created first as a TV drama and later as a film. It is about Detective Jun Shibata, who handles unsolved cases with her hardened partner Tōru Mayama. The television series was broadcast in eleven episodes between 8 January and 19 March 1999. A two-hour "special drama" was then broadcast on 24 December 1999. The series has been called "epoch-making" in the police procedural genre on Japanese television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ33431VzskHJcaWZgeVZvVCLU8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17037'),
  ('119012108595054282', 'Kekkaishi', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroyuki Yoshino, Rie Saitou, Asako Dodo, Ryoko Shiraishi, Takeharu Oonishi, Masanori Ishii, Yohei Tadano, Atsushi Miyauchi', 'TV-14', 'Yoshimori Sumimura is a 14-year-old student at Karasumori School. Following in the tradition that''s come down through the generations, he is the twenty-second Kekkaishi of the Sumimura clan. But he’s constantly fighting with his rival, Tokine Yukimura—his childhood friend and also a Kekkaishi—about who is the rightful heir to the magical barrier arts. Protecting people from danger while growing stronger himself, Yoshimori will battle the forces of evil again tonight!', 'Yoshimori Sumimura is a 14-year-old student at Karasumori School. Following in the tradition that''s come down through the generations, he is the twenty-second Kekkaishi of the Sumimura clan. But he’s constantly fighting with his rival, Tokine Yukimura—his childhood friend and also a Kekkaishi—about who is the rightful heir to the magical barrier arts. Protecting people from danger while growing stronger himself, Yoshimori will battle the forces of evil again tonight!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z8AQd7jy9LqK01tJBcnYSU4jvT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31678'),
  ('789321982833522644', 'Kekkonshiki no Zenjitsu ni', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Karina, Mieko Harada, Ryohei Suzuki, Yusuke Yamamoto, Kenichi Endo, Erina Mano, Jun Miho, Naho Toda', null, 'Hitomi Ashizawa works at a real estate corporation as a team leader. She is engaged to physician. On the 100th day before the wedding, Hitomi Ashizawa is diagnosed with a brain tumor. Her mother appears even though they have not seen each other for the past 28 years. Her mothers with her bright personality offers Hitomi encouragement and she tries to live positively.', 'Hitomi Ashizawa works at a real estate corporation as a team leader. She is engaged to physician. On the 100th day before the wedding, Hitomi Ashizawa is diagnosed with a brain tumor. Her mother appears even though they have not seen each other for the past 28 years. Her mothers with her bright personality offers Hitomi encouragement and she tries to live positively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5J2stLBlUJ3uWjToD1cpmX5fhGj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69408'),
  ('818619168524388507', 'Kelders van Geheime', 2024, 'Soap', 'Karen Meiring, Theltom Masimila', null, 'Sandra Prinsloo, Cedwyn Joel, Vinette Ebrahim, Brümilda van Rensburg, Rushney Ferguson, Duane Williams, Riana Alfreds, Geon Nel', null, 'Kelders van Geheime (Cellars of Secrets) is a South African, Afrikaans-language telenovela based on the wheeling''s and dealings of the community that lives on Soebatskloof (a wine farm in the Cape). The series focuses on three families: the Abrahams, Syster and Marais households. These families will have to stand together, agree (or agree to disagree), and work together to earn their bread and butter – and a glass of wine.', 'Kelders van Geheime (Cellars of Secrets) is a South African, Afrikaans-language telenovela based on the wheeling''s and dealings of the community that lives on Soebatskloof (a wine farm in the Cape). The series focuses on three families: the Abrahams, Syster and Marais households. These families will have to stand together, agree (or agree to disagree), and work together to earn their bread and butter – and a glass of wine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0hqXxOTJ7pTEYQYl7HWrD50ym0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:249010'),
  ('282695165523944916', 'Kelime Oyunu', 2009, 'Reality', 'Ali İhsan Varol', null, 'Ali İhsan Varol', null, 'Kelime Oyunu (Word Game) is a Turkish game show that was awarded by the Turkish Language Association for "the correct use of Turkish and its contributions to Turkish" and broadcasted every weekday on Kanal 1, Bloomberg HT, Show TV, FOX and continues to be broadcast on teve2.', 'Kelime Oyunu (Word Game) is a Turkish game show that was awarded by the Turkish Language Association for "the correct use of Turkish and its contributions to Turkish" and broadcasted every weekday on Kanal 1, Bloomberg HT, Show TV, FOX and continues to be broadcast on teve2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6voWSntKc1KdABTWNddqu96aUV.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:275344'),
  ('1133729757198061623', 'Kemono Friends', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Riko Koike, Madoka Kan, Mashiro Yagi, Saki Ono, Kyouka Tamura, Ikuko Chikuta, Ruka Nemoto, Yui Ishikawa', null, 'Japari Park is an enormous integrated zoo built somewhere in this world. A mysterious substance found there, called "Sand Star," causes the animals to turn into humanoid beings called "Animal Girls"! These new creatures spend every day peacefully with the zoo''s visitors... but after some time, a lost child turns up in the park. The child''s attempt to find the way home turns into a great adventure with the Animal Girls!', 'Japari Park is an enormous integrated zoo built somewhere in this world. A mysterious substance found there, called "Sand Star," causes the animals to turn into humanoid beings called "Animal Girls"! These new creatures spend every day peacefully with the zoo''s visitors... but after some time, a lost child turns up in the park. The child''s attempt to find the way home turns into a great adventure with the Animal Girls!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TQq8uiRob7nboF7UBVKBach88N.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69288'),
  ('843958626204261790', 'Kemono Jihen', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsumi Fujiwara, Junichi Suwabe, Ayumu Murase, Natsuki Hanae', 'TV-14', 'When a series of animal bodies that rot away after a single night begin appearing in a remote mountain village, Inugami, a detective from Tokyo who specializes in the occult, is called to investigate. While working the case, he befriends a strange boy who works in the field every day instead of going to school. Shunned by his peers and nicknamed “Dorotabo” after a yokai that lives in the mud, he helps Inugami uncover the truth behind the killings — but supernatural forces are at work, and while Dorotabo is just a nickname, it might not be the only thing about the boy that isn’t human.', 'When a series of animal bodies that rot away after a single night begin appearing in a remote mountain village, Inugami, a detective from Tokyo who specializes in the occult, is called to investigate. While working the case, he befriends a strange boy who works in the field every day instead of going to school. Shunned by his peers and nicknamed “Dorotabo” after a yokai that lives in the mud, he helps Inugami uncover the truth behind the killings — but supernatural forces are at work, and while Dorotabo is just a nickname, it might not be the only thing about the boy that isn’t human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlEYvTnexLVEYGnX508DMwWGHYv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100022'),
  ('510451274494896464', 'Kemono Michi: Rise Up', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Akira Sekine, Yuki Yagi, Arisa Sakuraba, Tetsu Inada, Rie Suegara, Kenichirou Matsuda, Taketora', null, 'Professional wrestler and animal lover Shibata Genzo is suddenly summoned to another world. Greeted by a princess, she requests to get rid of the evil beasts roaming in this world. Outraged that he was asked to kill monsters, Genzo German suplexes the princess. Unable back to get back to Earth, he decides to live a peaceful life and manage a "monster" pet shop.', 'Professional wrestler and animal lover Shibata Genzo is suddenly summoned to another world. Greeted by a princess, she requests to get rid of the evil beasts roaming in this world. Outraged that he was asked to kill monsters, Genzo German suplexes the princess. Unable back to get back to Earth, he decides to live a peaceful life and manage a "monster" pet shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g916Xx2kh0FZUIVDbyptxvNMFW7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91584'),
  ('780578545024477821', 'Kemonozume', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hidenobu Kiuchi, Hekiru Shiina, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Kenji Utsumi, Jun Hazumi, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Daisuke Gori, Anri Katsu', null, 'Creatures known as Shokujinki have been secretly living alongside humans for hundreds of years. Though they may look like humans, Shokujinki are able to transform into uncontrollable beasts with gigantic claws and consume humans to survive. The equally secretive Kifuuken dojo specializes in killing Shokujinki by cutting off their arms, and is the only force preventing unchecked Shokujinki domination. Toshihiko Momota, the son of the leader of the Kifuuken, is instantly charmed by a mysterious woman named Yuka Kamitsuki. Their relationship is complicated, however, because unbeknownst to them both, Yuka is a Shokujinki and Toshihiko is sworn to kill her. Meanwhile, the Kifuuken is having a crisis of confidence as Toshihiko''s brother Kazuma pushes against tradition and tries to modernize the Kifuuken. As emotions are strained and the secrets of both the past and present are revealed, who will live, and who will be eaten?', 'Creatures known as Shokujinki have been secretly living alongside humans for hundreds of years. Though they may look like humans, Shokujinki are able to transform into uncontrollable beasts with gigantic claws and consume humans to survive. The equally secretive Kifuuken dojo specializes in killing Shokujinki by cutting off their arms, and is the only force preventing unchecked Shokujinki domination. Toshihiko Momota, the son of the leader of the Kifuuken, is instantly charmed by a mysterious woman named Yuka Kamitsuki. Their relationship is complicated, however, because unbeknownst to them both, Yuka is a Shokujinki and Toshihiko is sworn to kill her. Meanwhile, the Kifuuken is having a crisis of confidence as Toshihiko''s brother Kazuma pushes against tradition and tries to modernize the Kifuuken. As emotions are strained and the secrets of both the past and present are revealed, who will live, and who will be eaten?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXXzkVXra7sbf8m9T12KLWYNAXM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38806'),
  ('575465100419843889', 'Kemurikusa', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mikako Komatsu, Arisa Kiyoto, Tomomi Jiena Sumi, Kenji Nojima', null, 'A story about three sisters struggling to survive in a desolate world surrounded by decaying buildings and red fog. The story revolves around Rin, a girl with an updo. There''s also Ritsu, the big sister who has cat ears and is always calm, and Rina, the innocent, cheerful one dressed in a maid''s costume. Just what is it that these sisters are after in this mysterious world?', 'A story about three sisters struggling to survive in a desolate world surrounded by decaying buildings and red fog. The story revolves around Rin, a girl with an updo. There''s also Ritsu, the big sister who has cat ears and is always calm, and Rina, the innocent, cheerful one dressed in a maid''s costume. Just what is it that these sisters are after in this mysterious world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8RdaIzATv3pzHVtyIyvLS4rq1W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83122'),
  ('471511380954995582', 'Ken and Barbie Killers: The Lost Murder Tapes', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Paul Bernardo, Karla Homolka', 'TV-14', 'Three schoolgirl murders. Two killers hiding in plain sight. Six video tapes that horrify the world and lead to one of the most controversial murder trials in modern history: one that left a nation shamed, victims denied justice, and a serial killer roaming free in Canada today. Over the course four parts, THE KEN AND BARBIE KILLERS: THE LOST MURDER TAPES follows the extraordinary twists and turns of the case and trial of glamour couple Paul Bernardo and Karla Homolka, the "demonic duo of dark kink", who quickly became the most notorious killers in Canadian history.', 'Three schoolgirl murders. Two killers hiding in plain sight. Six video tapes that horrify the world and lead to one of the most controversial murder trials in modern history: one that left a nation shamed, victims denied justice, and a serial killer roaming free in Canada today. Over the course four parts, THE KEN AND BARBIE KILLERS: THE LOST MURDER TAPES follows the extraordinary twists and turns of the case and trial of glamour couple Paul Bernardo and Karla Homolka, the "demonic duo of dark kink", who quickly became the most notorious killers in Canadian history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLUEokWiO097RPq4CkDFrqR2p4j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153263'),
  ('1130857566963787377', 'Kenan', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Kenan Thompson, Chris Redd, Don Johnson, Kimrie Lewis, Dani Lane, Dannah Lane, Taylor Louderman', 'TV-PG', 'The recently widowed host of Atlanta''s No. 2 morning show struggles to balance his job and his young daughters despite all the “help” he gets from his grifter father-in-law and his brother/assistant/manager/house guest.', 'The recently widowed host of Atlanta''s No. 2 morning show struggles to balance his job and his young daughters despite all the “help” he gets from his grifter father-in-law and his brother/assistant/manager/house guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aQRh17CO64vLMYpGw7nXO2l7MA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:116609'),
  ('727254130993336956', 'Kenan & Kel', 1996, 'Family, Comedy, Kids', 'Kim Bass', 'Nick Cannon', 'Kenan Thompson, Kel Mitchell, Vanessa Baden Kelly, Ken Foree, Teal Marchande, Dan Frischman', 'TV-Y7', 'Set in Chicago, the show follows the kid-friendly misadventures of two high-school friends who are always scheming and dreaming. Kenan, who works at a grocery store, constantly devises crazy plans to strike it rich, while orange-soda-loving buddy Kel is always dragged along for the ride despite his track record for messing things up.', 'Set in Chicago, the show follows the kid-friendly misadventures of two high-school friends who are always scheming and dreaming. Kenan, who works at a grocery store, constantly devises crazy plans to strike it rich, while orange-soda-loving buddy Kel is always dragged along for the ride despite his track record for messing things up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftRkgMhF1CofVSLMeonh9Hjz7a4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1835'),
  ('994974312281235731', 'KENGAN ASHURA', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki', 'TV-MA', 'Ohma Tokita enters a hidden world where corporate disputes are settled in brutal gladiator bouts. Forget the money, he just wants to fight — and win.', 'Ohma Tokita enters a hidden world where corporate disputes are settled in brutal gladiator bouts. Forget the money, he just wants to fight — and win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqR96OMBKzHNCNwJB3f3NsCkXbL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90660'),
  ('94553248564278134', 'Kenichi: The Mightiest Disciple', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Tomoko Kawakami, Jurota Kosugi, Unsho Ishizuka, Hiroshi Arikawa, Mamiko Noto, Hiroya Ishimaru, Issei Futamata', 'NR', 'Yeah, Kenichi’s a total wimp. He’s always getting picked on and doesn’t have a lot of friends to stick up for him. The guy needs motivation if he hopes to graduate in one piece. Well, Miu’s the perfect motivation. She’s hot, she accepts him, and she just so happens to live at a dojo with six martial arts masters. You could say fate has led Kenichi to their door, or you could say he was just following the hottie. Either way, he’s about to get whipped into serious shape. If he can survive some hard-core training, he might survive another day at school. He might even score with Miu. Yeah, you could call Kenichi a wimp. But let’s go with underdog instead.', 'Yeah, Kenichi’s a total wimp. He’s always getting picked on and doesn’t have a lot of friends to stick up for him. The guy needs motivation if he hopes to graduate in one piece. Well, Miu’s the perfect motivation. She’s hot, she accepts him, and she just so happens to live at a dojo with six martial arts masters. You could say fate has led Kenichi to their door, or you could say he was just following the hottie. Either way, he’s about to get whipped into serious shape. If he can survive some hard-core training, he might survive another day at school. He might even score with Miu. Yeah, you could call Kenichi a wimp. But let’s go with underdog instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLzfW5xWN9sOId6C6vgcv8otnN7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37585'),
  ('252208017118357736', 'Kenka Banchou Otome: Girl Beats Boys', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hibiku Yamamura, KENN, Shouta Aoi, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Saori Onishi, Tetsuya Kakihara, Tomoaki Maeno, Tsubasa Yonaga', 'TV-14', 'Kenka Banchou Otome - Girl Beats Boys, Hinako Nakayama has spent all of her life being raised in state-run orphanages, without ever knowing her family. As she''s about to enter high school, Hinako is approached by Hikaru, a boy who claims to be her twin brother. According to Hikaru, Hikaru and Hinako are the children of the head of the powerful Onigashima yakuza family, and Hikaru wants Hinako to switches places with him at Shishiku Academy, an all-boys school overrun with the nation''s toughest delinquents. Can Hinako save her brother, find romance, and become the new boss of the school?', 'Kenka Banchou Otome - Girl Beats Boys, Hinako Nakayama has spent all of her life being raised in state-run orphanages, without ever knowing her family. As she''s about to enter high school, Hinako is approached by Hikaru, a boy who claims to be her twin brother. According to Hikaru, Hikaru and Hinako are the children of the head of the powerful Onigashima yakuza family, and Hikaru wants Hinako to switches places with him at Shishiku Academy, an all-boys school overrun with the nation''s toughest delinquents. Can Hinako save her brother, find romance, and become the new boss of the school?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHu1XbwBCZfGcPzLuGlvVkjKqJA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71010'),
  ('893936287727338794', 'Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umishou', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mamiko Ikeda', null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Hitomi Nabatame, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Yukari Fukui, Ai Shimizu, Sayuri Yahagi, Ryoko Shintani, Makoto Yasumura', null, 'Kaname Okiura, a student of Umineko Shougyou High ("Umishou" for short), joined the school’s swimming club in order to learn how to swim, but the club is filled with weirdos. Then, a sunny, happy-go-lucky girl named Amuro Ninagawa who transferred from Okinawa joined the club. Her extraordinary underwater speed and unorthodox swimming style surprised every club member, especially Okiura, because she reminds him of a mermaid he saw only once in his early childhood.', 'Kaname Okiura, a student of Umineko Shougyou High ("Umishou" for short), joined the school’s swimming club in order to learn how to swim, but the club is filled with weirdos. Then, a sunny, happy-go-lucky girl named Amuro Ninagawa who transferred from Okinawa joined the club. Her extraordinary underwater speed and unorthodox swimming style surprised every club member, especially Okiura, because she reminds him of a mermaid he saw only once in his early childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWJlUIDU27NtDrvirW4eQEV34Wc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79041'),
  ('400252013708010260', 'Kennedy', 1983, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Reg Gadney', 'Martin Sheen, Kevin Conroy, Nesbitt Blaisdell, Peter Boyden, Kent Broadhurst, James Burge, William Cain, Joanne Camp', 'NR', 'Kennedy is a five-hour miniseries written by Reg Gadney and directed by Jim Goddard. The miniseries was produced by Central Independent Television and originally aired in the United States starting on 20 November 1983 around the time of the 20th anniversary of the Kennedy assassination. The TV miniseries was a biography of the 1961-1963 presidency of John F. Kennedy. The mini-series stars Martin Sheen as President John F. Kennedy, John Shea as Robert F. Kennedy, Blair Brown as Jacqueline Kennedy, E.G. Marshall as Joseph P. Kennedy, Vincent Gardenia as J. Edgar Hoover and Kelsey Grammer as Stephen Smith amongst many others. The series was broadcast on NBC, and was also sold to 50 Countries, with 27 of them broadcasting the series simultaneous. The series was nominated for 3 Golden Globes and 4 BAFTA, and won Baftas for Best Drama Series and Best Make Up.', 'Kennedy is a five-hour miniseries written by Reg Gadney and directed by Jim Goddard. The miniseries was produced by Central Independent Television and originally aired in the United States starting on 20 November 1983 around the time of the 20th anniversary of the Kennedy assassination. The TV miniseries was a biography of the 1961-1963 presidency of John F. Kennedy. The mini-series stars Martin Sheen as President John F. Kennedy, John Shea as Robert F. Kennedy, Blair Brown as Jacqueline Kennedy, E.G. Marshall as Joseph P. Kennedy, Vincent Gardenia as J. Edgar Hoover and Kelsey Grammer as Stephen Smith amongst many others. The series was broadcast on NBC, and was also sold to 50 Countries, with 27 of them broadcasting the series simultaneous. The series was nominated for 3 Golden Globes and 4 BAFTA, and won Baftas for Best Drama Series and Best Make Up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a41msrYPkMZe0q9rMAhBBacvz0V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15800'),
  ('189325950145040651', 'Kenny Starfighter', 1997, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Kids', 'Mats Lindberg, Carl Åstrand', null, 'Johan Rheborg, Maja Rung, Kiwi Casslind, Kolbjörn Skarsgård, Oliver Andersen, Anas Mounir, Mattias Kindberg', 'TV-Y7', 'Kenny Starfighter fights against the evil lord Dr. Deo.', 'Kenny Starfighter fights against the evil lord Dr. Deo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRQzhNQi4iOvgubyhCBV5zEPohV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8939'),
  ('267148732484112586', 'Kenny vs. Spenny', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Kenny Hotz, Spencer Rice', null, 'Kenny Hotz, Spencer Rice', null, 'Kenny and Spenny are two best friends who compete against each other. Their competitions are ridiculous, immature and totally intense.', 'Kenny and Spenny are two best friends who compete against each other. Their competitions are ridiculous, immature and totally intense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62lyGEvbOMYAQFFEGh1yMjmpTMO.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3540'),
  ('711523923568236311', 'Keurmeesters', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:317398'),
  ('921392005554787671', 'Kevin (Probably) Saves the World', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Michele Fazekas, Tara Butters', null, 'Jason Ritter, Kimberly Hébert Gregory, Chloe East, JoAnna Garcia Swisher, J. August Richards, Dustin Ybarra, India de Beaufort', 'TV-14', 'One day while returning home to stay with his widowed twin sister and her daughter, Kevin Finn, a self-centered man whose life brings him more trouble than he bargained for, is recruited by a celestial being named Yvette, who enlists Kevin with a new purpose in his life, which is to save the world.', 'One day while returning home to stay with his widowed twin sister and her daughter, Kevin Finn, a self-centered man whose life brings him more trouble than he bargained for, is recruited by a celestial being named Yvette, who enlists Kevin with a new purpose in his life, which is to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3uUik3FsGN3sn4g8pXseRwdRSp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71725'),
  ('466228307629918368', 'Kevin Can F**K Himself', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valerie Armstrong', 'Kate Loveless, Jasmyne peck', 'Annie Murphy, Eric Petersen, Mary Hollis Inboden, Alex Bonifer, Brian Howe, Candice Coke', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the secret life of a woman we all grew up watching: the sitcom wife. The series looks to break television convention and ask what the world looks like through her eyes. Alternating between single-camera realism and multi-camera zaniness, the formats will inform one another as we imagine what happens when the sitcom wife escapes her confines, and takes the lead in her own life.', 'Explore the secret life of a woman we all grew up watching: the sitcom wife. The series looks to break television convention and ask what the world looks like through her eyes. Alternating between single-camera realism and multi-camera zaniness, the formats will inform one another as we imagine what happens when the sitcom wife escapes her confines, and takes the lead in her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wW8j4xiU27ZClUpkSP6si3x8BHA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99652'),
  ('92359524592052238', 'Kevin Can Wait', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Barton Dean', null, 'Kevin James, Taylor Spreitler, Leah Remini, Ryan Cartwright, Gary Valentine, Leonard Earl Howze, Mary-Charles Jones, James DiGiacomo', 'TV-14', 'A newly retired police officer looks forward to spending more quality time with his wife and three kids only to discover he faces much tougher challenges at home than he ever did on the streets.', 'A newly retired police officer looks forward to spending more quality time with his wife and three kids only to discover he faces much tougher challenges at home than he ever did on the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpuNe29T0ZnBhw7nHpDDgimfObe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67132'),
  ('9328016767825843', 'Kevin from Work', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Barbara ''Barbie'' Adler', null, 'Noah Reid, Paige Spara, Jordan Danger, Matt Murray, Punam Patel, Jason Rogel', 'TV-14', 'A workplace comedy centered on Kevin, a young man who declares his unrequited love for his coworker Audrey in a letter, believing he’ll never see her again after he accepts a job overseas. But when the opportunity falls through and Kevin is forced to return to his old job, how will he and Audrey continue to work together now that his feelings are no longer secret?', 'A workplace comedy centered on Kevin, a young man who declares his unrequited love for his coworker Audrey in a letter, believing he’ll never see her again after he accepts a job overseas. But when the opportunity falls through and Kevin is forced to return to his old job, how will he and Audrey continue to work together now that his feelings are no longer secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4IZKQDS8fh1EJuRglfDYNkDxnu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62412'),
  ('627588504650123987', 'Kevin Hart: Don''t F**k This Up', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Kevin Hart', null, 'Kevin Hart', 'TV-MA', 'Amid turmoil in his career and marriage, comedian and film star Kevin Hart opens up about his personal breakthroughs as he navigates crises and fame.', 'Amid turmoil in his career and marriage, comedian and film star Kevin Hart opens up about his personal breakthroughs as he navigates crises and fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryPDavyhFj1FMCln4j1U6Je0PBI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95609'),
  ('60978846913958687', 'Key & Peele', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Keegan-Michael Key, Jordan Peele', null, 'Keegan-Michael Key, Jordan Peele', 'TV-14', 'Key & Peele is an American sketch comedy television show. It stars Keegan-Michael Key and Jordan Peele, both former cast members of MADtv. Each episode of the show consists of several pre-taped sketches starring the two actors, introduced by Key and Peele in front of a live studio audience.', 'Key & Peele is an American sketch comedy television show. It stars Keegan-Michael Key and Jordan Peele, both former cast members of MADtv. Each episode of the show consists of several pre-taped sketches starring the two actors, introduced by Key and Peele in front of a live studio audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24csSdkE6gbYBCK6ngknvsJ1Zdj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:43082'),
  ('336597897963748454', 'Khakee: The Bengal Chapter', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Debatma Mandal, Samrat Chakraborty, Neeraj Pandey', 'Jeet, Prosenjit Chatterjee, Chitrangada Singh, Ritwik Bhowmik, Aadil Khan, Mimoh Chakraborty, Saswata Chatterjee, Parambrata Chatterjee', 'TV-MA', 'When upright cop Arjun Maitra takes on Kolkata''s feared don Bagha and his henchmen, he must battle a broken system and navigate bloody gang wars.', 'When upright cop Arjun Maitra takes on Kolkata''s feared don Bagha and his henchmen, he must battle a broken system and navigate bloody gang wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fasJ27kLhHdzF9cBDq0vGXFVkvI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282394'),
  ('1065072901789194767', 'Khakee: The Bihar Chapter', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Umashankar Singh', 'Karan Tacker, Avinash Tiwary, Ashutosh Rana, Anup Soni, Jatin Sarna, Abhimanyu Singh, Ravi Kishan, Vinay Pathak', 'TV-14', 'As a righteous cop pursues a merciless criminal in Bihar, he finds himself navigating a deadly chase and a moral battle mired in corruption.', 'As a righteous cop pursues a merciless criminal in Bihar, he finds himself navigating a deadly chase and a moral battle mired in corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvr3WrwAQMlcb00OZEos9nLekTE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213635'),
  ('572632357857902026', 'Khatron Ke Khiladi', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rohit Shetty', null, 'Twelve celebrity contestants face their worst fears and perform a series of death-defying stunts under the supervision of a host to win the coveted title.', 'Twelve celebrity contestants face their worst fears and perform a series of death-defying stunts under the supervision of a host to win the coveted title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjsALDD7siA1aka8cHQDfIsAVbG.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:85518'),
