  ('346280368895066273', 'Khemjira', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Cali', null, 'Harit Buayoi, Napatsakorn Pingmuang, Wannakorn Reungrat, Matimun Sreeboonrueang, Ausadaporn Siriwattanakul', null, 'With a deadly curse set to claim him at 21, a young man flees to a master of ancient magic—only to face ghosts more dangerous than his fate.', 'With a deadly curse set to claim him at 21, a young man flees to a master of ancient magic—only to face ghosts more dangerous than his fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJHVYs4e8yLyxJvs3PikQV1mBUN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230915'),
  ('155873427616801924', 'Khichdi', 2002, 'Comedy, Family', 'Aatish Kapadia', null, 'Rajeev Mehta, Anang Desai, Supriya Pathak, Vandana Pathak, JD Majethia, Richa Bhadra, Yash Mittal, Amit Varma', null, 'A family comedy about an angry old man, his good-for-nothing son Praful and daughter-in-law Hansa, widowed daughter-in-law Jayshree, and grandchildren Jackie and Chakki, who are the smartest ones of all.', 'A family comedy about an angry old man, his good-for-nothing son Praful and daughter-in-law Hansa, widowed daughter-in-law Jayshree, and grandchildren Jackie and Chakki, who are the smartest ones of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LxhBhB5i493EvJbvFD5Ki2SeUn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91511'),
  ('637656781505055605', 'Khloé & Lamar', 2011, 'Reality', 'Ryan Seacrest', null, 'Khloé Kardashian, Lamar Odom, Rob Kardashian, Malika, Jamie Sangouthai, Kourtney Kardashian Barker, Kris Jenner, Kim Kardashian', 'TV-14', 'Khloé & Lamar is an American reality television series that debuted on E! in the United States and Canada on April 10, 2011. The series is the third spin-off of the show Keeping Up with the Kardashians and features reality star Khloé Kardashian Odom and her husband, basketball player Lamar Odom. The series returned for its second season on February 19, 2012.', 'Khloé & Lamar is an American reality television series that debuted on E! in the United States and Canada on April 10, 2011. The series is the third spin-off of the show Keeping Up with the Kardashians and features reality star Khloé Kardashian Odom and her husband, basketball player Lamar Odom. The series returned for its second season on February 19, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBK94VmS57Fh4XVaxE3UZZf5A2d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38937'),
  ('1123191634607807067', 'Khon La Khob Fah', 2018, null, null, null, null, null, 'Chanika returns home from abroad because her father is in the hospital. Upon returning home, she learns that her father is in huge debt and they need money to cover the medical expenses. Her college roommate introduces her to a high paying job out in the suburbs. Chinapat is the owner a rubber tree plantation and hires Chanika as a favor to his cousin. They don''t get along because Chinapat has anger management issues and there are rumors about him. In order to avoid being engaged to his mom''s friend''s daughter, Chinapat asks Chinika to marry him for a large sum of money. Will they ever learn to get along?', 'Chanika returns home from abroad because her father is in the hospital. Upon returning home, she learns that her father is in huge debt and they need money to cover the medical expenses. Her college roommate introduces her to a high paying job out in the suburbs. Chinapat is the owner a rubber tree plantation and hires Chanika as a favor to his cousin. They don''t get along because Chinapat has anger management issues and there are rumors about him. In order to avoid being engaged to his mom''s friend''s daughter, Chinapat asks Chinika to marry him for a large sum of money. Will they ever learn to get along?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8GSqgdFMS24FiIlgIbUaybCMjh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105951'),
  ('590656060793740126', 'Kiba', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuma Horie, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Nana Mizuki, Hiromi Hirata, Hiroshi Yanaka, Hiroshi Yanaka, Kappei Yamaguchi, Kikuko Inoue', null, 'Kiba, a fantasy anime by Madhouse and Aniplex, began broadcasting on TV Tokyo on April 5, 2006. The series is directed by Hiroshi Kōjina with Upper Deck Japan, a trading card game company, as the main sponsor. The anime has been licensed by Upper Deck USA and produced by ADV Films for North American distribution. The series is more violent than other trading-card-game-tie-in animations with many characters being killed. According to an interview with the March 2006 issue of Animage, Hiroshi Kamishina, the show''s director, noted that the show "absolutely will not have any plot elements that curry favor to children". The producers of the show has also commented that Kiba will not be the type of show to put "human drama" on the back burner while concentrating on promotional tie-ins. While Upper Deck owns the rights to the series, ADV Films is the distributor and their production studio Amusement Park Media is producing the dub. Kiba aired on Toonami Jetstream from July 14, 2008 to January 21, 2009 and is now showing on The Anime Network''s Video on Demand service.', 'Kiba, a fantasy anime by Madhouse and Aniplex, began broadcasting on TV Tokyo on April 5, 2006. The series is directed by Hiroshi Kōjina with Upper Deck Japan, a trading card game company, as the main sponsor. The anime has been licensed by Upper Deck USA and produced by ADV Films for North American distribution. The series is more violent than other trading-card-game-tie-in animations with many characters being killed. According to an interview with the March 2006 issue of Animage, Hiroshi Kamishina, the show''s director, noted that the show "absolutely will not have any plot elements that curry favor to children". The producers of the show has also commented that Kiba will not be the type of show to put "human drama" on the back burner while concentrating on promotional tie-ins. While Upper Deck owns the rights to the series, ADV Films is the distributor and their production studio Amusement Park Media is producing the dub. Kiba aired on Toonami Jetstream from July 14, 2008 to January 21, 2009 and is now showing on The Anime Network''s Video on Demand service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roNaULLgqVA8SnLoOntOaPFvY8L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31739'),
  ('735026782134828800', 'Kick Buttowski: Suburban Daredevil', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', 'Sandro Corsaro', null, 'Charlie Schlatter, Danny Cooksey, John DiMaggio, Eric Christian Olsen, Matt Jones, Maria Bamford, Kari Wahlgren, Brian Stepanek', 'TV-Y7', 'Clarence Buttowski, a young boy, aspires to become the world''s greatest daredevil, as he gets help from Gunther, his loyal friend and partner-in-crime.', 'Clarence Buttowski, a young boy, aspires to become the world''s greatest daredevil, as he gets help from Gunther, his loyal friend and partner-in-crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkkpMA6EBCxwVP7niDeJVlRACp3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17572'),
  ('1148149556629742249', 'Kickin'' It', 2011, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Jim O''Doherty', null, 'Leo Howard, Mateo Arias, Jason Earles, Dylan Riley Snyder', 'TV-Y7', 'Run by Sensei Rudy, the Bobby Wasabi Martial Arts Academy is the worst dojo in the nationwide Bobby Wasabi chain and is in danger of closing. But things change when Jack reluctantly joins the dojo and meets his new crew, including tough guy slacker Jerry and confident martial arts expert Kim. The crew teaches a group of neighborhood goofballs about life, karate, and how to "kick it." Jack and the gang quickly realize their newfound friendship will take them places they''ve never imagined and, united, they can become unstoppable.', 'Run by Sensei Rudy, the Bobby Wasabi Martial Arts Academy is the worst dojo in the nationwide Bobby Wasabi chain and is in danger of closing. But things change when Jack reluctantly joins the dojo and meets his new crew, including tough guy slacker Jerry and confident martial arts expert Kim. The crew teaches a group of neighborhood goofballs about life, karate, and how to "kick it." Jack and the gang quickly realize their newfound friendship will take them places they''ve never imagined and, united, they can become unstoppable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40qRQPoUnCx6g50NIyQBS0OdxaP.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:32716'),
  ('945800652386643695', 'Kid Cosmic', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Craig McCracken', null, 'Jack Fisher, Bennett Abara, Lily Rose Silver', 'TV-Y7', 'A boy''s superhero dreams come true when he finds five powerful cosmic stones. But saving the day is harder than he imagined — and he can''t do it alone.', 'A boy''s superhero dreams come true when he finds five powerful cosmic stones. But saving the day is harder than he imagined — and he can''t do it alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88HdcCMumGqGAt2kR3vVOr8NYiA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:116249'),
  ('752017720779743149', 'Kid vs. Kat', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Kids', 'Rob Boutilier', null, 'Brian Drummond, Kathleen Barr, Trevor Devall, Grey DeLisle, Tara Strong, Kath Soucie, Carter Jenkins, Rob Paulsen', 'TV-Y7', 'Ten-year-old Coop Burtonburger''s life takes a turn for the worse when his little sister, Millie, brings home a mysterious stray cat who, in reality, is an evil cybernetic alien in disguise. To make matters worse, neither his family nor anyone else believes him, except for his best friend, Dennis. Now, Coop risks his life every day as he attempts to foil the cat''s diabolical schemes and prove to the world that the family pet is an evil mastermind.', 'Ten-year-old Coop Burtonburger''s life takes a turn for the worse when his little sister, Millie, brings home a mysterious stray cat who, in reality, is an evil cybernetic alien in disguise. To make matters worse, neither his family nor anyone else believes him, except for his best friend, Dennis. Now, Coop risks his life every day as he attempts to foil the cat''s diabolical schemes and prove to the world that the family pet is an evil mastermind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f3DyCY4Xe6ZxN2blj0gNdWhS71.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17463'),
  ('484222906156291134', 'Kidding', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dave Holstein', null, 'Jim Carrey, Frank Langella, Judy Greer, Justin Kirk, Cole Allen, Juliet Morris, Catherine Keener', 'TV-MA', 'Jeff, aka Mr. Pickles, is an icon of children''s TV. But when his family begins to implode, Jeff finds no fairy tale or fable or puppet will guide him through this crisis, which advances faster than his means to cope. The result: a kind man in a cruel world faces a slow leak of sanity as hilarious as it is heartbreaking.', 'Jeff, aka Mr. Pickles, is an icon of children''s TV. But when his family begins to implode, Jeff finds no fairy tale or fable or puppet will guide him through this crisis, which advances faster than his means to cope. The result: a kind man in a cruel world faces a slow leak of sanity as hilarious as it is heartbreaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYqvxrvN5PVd4Kvp46LnXVl42nW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73925'),
  ('926700920544247054', 'Kiddy Grade', 2002, 'Mystery, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hidefumi Kimura', 'Akira Ishida, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Kikuko Inoue, Omi Minami, Mika Doi, Aya Hirano, Natsuko Kuwatani, Ryoko Nagata', 'TV-14', 'In Star century Zero-One-Sixty-Five, the Global Union was born. The G.O.T.T. was simultaneously formed to settle disputes amongst the member planets. Existing in the shadows, the ES Force serves as the primary law enforcement organization, seeing that the Galactic Organization’s orders are enforced. ES Force members Éclair and Lumiere are on the front line, pursuing all manner of criminals and bringing them to justice. This is their story.', 'In Star century Zero-One-Sixty-Five, the Global Union was born. The G.O.T.T. was simultaneously formed to settle disputes amongst the member planets. Existing in the shadows, the ES Force serves as the primary law enforcement organization, seeing that the Galactic Organization’s orders are enforced. ES Force members Éclair and Lumiere are on the front line, pursuing all manner of criminals and bringing them to justice. This is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPx4Z7STMWR4eucOB6KQs9lsHVL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9319'),
  ('726513976379594486', 'Kidnap', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Kinc', null, 'Pawat Chittsawangdee, Thanaphon U-sinsap, Thipakorn Thitathan, Phromphiriya Thongputtaruk, Kirati Puangmalee, Napapat Sattha-atikom, Supoj Janjareonborn', null, 'When a kidnapper defies orders and spares his captive, the two soon find themselves hostages to their hearts as new feelings emerge — and danger looms.', 'When a kidnapper defies orders and spares his captive, the two soon find themselves hostages to their hearts as new feelings emerge — and danger looms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d12KzJW9FnxQBRunuU2ixVbt9vG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237326'),
  ('1085321755499210234', 'Kidnap and Ransom', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Trevor Eve, Helen Baxendale, Amara Karan, Natasha Little', null, 'Kidnap and Ransom is a British television three-part miniseries, originally shown on ITV in January 2011 with a second series following in February 2012. The series follows the work of a British hostage negotiator Dominic King, played by Trevor Eve, who is also executive producer of the series.', 'Kidnap and Ransom is a British television three-part miniseries, originally shown on ITV in January 2011 with a second series following in February 2012. The series follows the work of a British hostage negotiator Dominic King, played by Trevor Eve, who is also executive producer of the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u25A8wGr126zOqh7gvM4Zao8WWu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43252'),
  ('179705533630296014', 'Kidnapped', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jason Smilovic', null, 'Jeremy Sisto, Carmen Ejogo, Delroy Lindo, Linus Roache, Will Denton, Timothy Hutton, Mykelti Williamson, Dana Delany', 'TV-14', 'Kidnapped is an American television drama series from Sony Pictures Television which aired on NBC from September 20, 2006, to August 11, 2007. The series returned on Universal HD in 2008.', 'Kidnapped is an American television drama series from Sony Pictures Television which aired on NBC from September 20, 2006, to August 11, 2007. The series returned on Universal HD in 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7B1Yp0lMGjyWmuFRI6Qb4DxfozV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1444'),
  ('87085130945548905', 'Kids on the Slope', 2012, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuuka Nanri, Ryohei Kimura, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Aya Endo, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'Two different students - a successful but aloof academic and a rebellious but kindhearted delinquent - form a friendship through their love for music.', 'Two different students - a successful but aloof academic and a rebellious but kindhearted delinquent - form a friendship through their love for music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2shFe5YRvzvUrjHpZgAxLNpIT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42557'),
  ('279813614377947911', 'Kids'' Choice Awards', 1987, null, 'Alan Goodman, Albie Hecht, Fred Seibert', null, null, 'TV-G', 'Honoring the year''s biggest in television, film, music, and sports as voted by viewers worldwide of Nickelodeon networks. Winners receive a hollow orange blimp figurine which also functions as a kaleidoscope.', 'Honoring the year''s biggest in television, film, music, and sports as voted by viewers worldwide of Nickelodeon networks. Winners receive a hollow orange blimp figurine which also functions as a kaleidoscope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXmN5IYM0zWtfe8MD0WNMZlHjeE.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:23521'),
  ('1110670546283474332', 'Kiff', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Lucy Heavens, Nic Smal', null, 'Kimiko Glenn, H. Michael Croner, James Monroe Iglehart, Lauren Ash, Lucy Heavens, Nic Smal, Deedee Magno Hall, Eugene Cordero', 'TV-Y7', 'This series follows Kiff, an optimistic squirrel whose best intentions often lead to complete chaos, and her best friend Barry, a sweet and mellow bunny. Set in the bustling mountains, where animals and magical creatures live together in harmony, the series features the duo, who take the town by storm with their endless adventures and zest for life.', 'This series follows Kiff, an optimistic squirrel whose best intentions often lead to complete chaos, and her best friend Barry, a sweet and mellow bunny. Set in the bustling mountains, where animals and magical creatures live together in harmony, the series features the duo, who take the town by storm with their endless adventures and zest for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7xhJ1uWu7FurJ3W5iKzrfiPF3K.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127706'),
  ('957965625990159374', 'Kiitaro''s Yokai Picture Diary', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiromi Igarashi, Arisa Nakada, Eri Kitamura, Maria Naganawa, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'Kiitarou is a boy with a strong sixth sense who is always surrounded by demons. He gets talked to by yukionna, gets his bath licked clean by akaname (licking demons), and lives with the zashiki-warashi Suzu, whom he just can''t come to dislike.', 'Kiitarou is a boy with a strong sixth sense who is always surrounded by demons. He gets talked to by yukionna, gets his bath licked clean by akaname (licking demons), and lives with the zashiki-warashi Suzu, whom he just can''t come to dislike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2kXAKcEUQAtM8RtbXFaQ74wmjC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68138'),
  ('387178191897712689', 'Kikai Sentai Zenkaiger', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kiita Komagine, Shintaro Asanuma, Yuki Kaji, Yume Miyamoto, Takuya Sato, Atsuki Mashiko, Hinami Mori, Ryota Suzuki', null, 'When an all-powerful enemy appears to destroy all parallel worlds, a hero with the spirit of all Super Sentai will rise to fight back. Transforming into Zenkaiser, he joins forces with four robots called Kikainoids with the spirit of Super Sentai robos from across history.', 'When an all-powerful enemy appears to destroy all parallel worlds, a hero with the spirit of all Super Sentai will rise to fight back. Transforming into Zenkaiser, he joins forces with four robots called Kikainoids with the spirit of Super Sentai robos from across history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDczj6VFpf5gaP1baJxb9Mvu66S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120398'),
  ('915693851084485300', 'Kiko Botones', 1986, null, 'Carlos Villagrán', null, 'Carlos Villagrán, Emilio Lovera, Leonardo Oliva, Irma Palmieri, Simon Garcia, Virgilio Galindo, Nancy Soto, César Quintana', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPzavhFeq7KlVCvHMz4RDuYP8r8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105620'),
  ('382282133034853276', 'Kikoriki', 2004, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Anatoly Prokhorov, Ilya Popov, Salavat Shaykhinurov', 'Svetlana Murdagolimova, Iordan Kefalidi, Dmitry Yakovenko', 'Svetlana Pismichenko, Sergey Mardar, Mikhail Chernyak, Anton Vinogradov, Vadim Bochanov, Vladimir Maslakov, Igor Yakovel', 'TV-Y', 'The Smeshariki are stylized rounded animals. Each of the nine characters has a unique personality and a range of interests with no negative characters among them. Plots are built not on the battle of opposing forces but on the unexpected situations the animated characters stumble upon in their interactions deemed similar to the ones that children may encounter in their everyday lives. Many of the topics foreground the guidance that friendship and community provide to the individual making his or her way in the world. Complex themes and specific cultural references place this cartoon firmly within the Russian tradition of animation. Much attention was devoted to the humor in the series, some of which has attracted adults as well.', 'The Smeshariki are stylized rounded animals. Each of the nine characters has a unique personality and a range of interests with no negative characters among them. Plots are built not on the battle of opposing forces but on the unexpected situations the animated characters stumble upon in their interactions deemed similar to the ones that children may encounter in their everyday lives. Many of the topics foreground the guidance that friendship and community provide to the individual making his or her way in the world. Complex themes and specific cultural references place this cartoon firmly within the Russian tradition of animation. Much attention was devoted to the humor in the series, some of which has attracted adults as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR5Jzs1JpfIkVZGAGJPkLm85pKC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6589'),
  ('387760422991751697', 'KILL BLUE', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuko Sanpei', null, 'Legendary hitman Juzo Ogami has never failed an assignment. But after a mission, he’s stung by a mysterious wasp and wakes up in the body of a 13-year-old boy. And to make things even weirder, he receives a bizarre new order: infiltrate a middle school. Now the once-feared assassin must balance the chaos of school life with his deadly work, all while searching for a way to regain his adult body.', 'Legendary hitman Juzo Ogami has never failed an assignment. But after a mission, he’s stung by a mysterious wasp and wakes up in the body of a 13-year-old boy. And to make things even weirder, he receives a bizarre new order: infiltrate a middle school. Now the once-feared assassin must balance the chaos of school life with his deadly work, all while searching for a way to regain his adult body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPfbiVmr3uzF2tUnlToxmJiWorr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300131'),
  ('482735865447312124', 'Kill Heel', 2022, 'Drama', 'No Do-cheol', 'Lee Chun-woo, Shin Kwang-ho', 'Kim Ha-neul, Kim Sung-ryung, Lee Hye-young, Jung Eui-jae, Jeon No-min, Shin Joo-ah, Park So-eun, Yoon Hyun-soo', null, 'Set within the competitive power struggles of TV home shopping hosts, three hosts compete each other with intense desires to achieve success and gain fame in the industry field. Among them is Hyun, who has a mundane and just ordinary career. Because she does not get much shine as Ok-sun, she falls in anxiety.', 'Set within the competitive power struggles of TV home shopping hosts, three hosts compete each other with intense desires to achieve success and gain fame in the industry field. Among them is Hyun, who has a mundane and just ordinary career. Because she does not get much shine as Ok-sun, she falls in anxiety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqEWuDcg9oRlEvuY5qIEgAg4yR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155535'),
  ('310194072468778904', 'Kill It', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery', null, '손현수', 'Jang Ki-yong, Nana, Ji Il-ju, Lee Jae-won, Roh Jeong-eui, Jung Hae-kyun, David Lee McInnis, Jung Jae-eun', null, 'The story of a veterinarian killer who saves animals and a detective who saves people.', 'The story of a veterinarian killer who saves animals and a detective who saves people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxTNyRhEUBK6r3o3ZJakcSsvO2b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87185'),
  ('1036693117160785347', 'Kill la Kill', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Ryoka Yuzuki, Aya Suzaki, Akio Nojima, Katsuyuki Konishi, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Tetsu Inada, Romi Park', 'TV-MA', 'Honnouji Academy is forcefully ruled by the iron-fisted control of its student council and its president, Satsuki Kiryuin. Transfer student, Ryuko Matoi, arrives on campus carrying a giant sword, that is actually half of a scissor. She is looking for the woman who holds the other half of her sword who killed her father. It is said that Satsuki Kiryuin knows the identity of the killer but when Ryuko confronts her she is beaten by the student council and their powerful "Goku Uniforms" whom she cannot match in strength. However, once Ryuko receives her own "Kamui" by the name of Senketsu, the odds are lifted in her favor.', 'Honnouji Academy is forcefully ruled by the iron-fisted control of its student council and its president, Satsuki Kiryuin. Transfer student, Ryuko Matoi, arrives on campus carrying a giant sword, that is actually half of a scissor. She is looking for the woman who holds the other half of her sword who killed her father. It is said that Satsuki Kiryuin knows the identity of the killer but when Ryuko confronts her she is beaten by the student council and their powerful "Goku Uniforms" whom she cannot match in strength. However, once Ryuko receives her own "Kamui" by the name of Senketsu, the odds are lifted in her favor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4F1WtP3dFIwLPOfa3u29VEVnNkf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60728'),
  ('305994480041303722', 'Kill Me Baby', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Chinatsu Akasaki, Ai Takabe, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-PG', 'Kill Me Baby is the touching story of Yasuna, a normal (?) high school girl, and Sonya, her best friend who happens to be an assassin. Unfortunately, little Sonya''s trained assassin instincts often work against her and others in her daily high school life, as Yasuna''s often-broken wrist can attest to. She just wanted a hug, but she ended up with a broken neck. Isn''t it sad? No, it''s hilarious.', 'Kill Me Baby is the touching story of Yasuna, a normal (?) high school girl, and Sonya, her best friend who happens to be an assassin. Unfortunately, little Sonya''s trained assassin instincts often work against her and others in her daily high school life, as Yasuna''s often-broken wrist can attest to. She just wanted a hug, but she ended up with a broken neck. Isn''t it sad? No, it''s hilarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roi29pllxcLud3wVAky4msljKE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73598'),
  ('1114761925637170858', 'Kill Me Love Me', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Hei Yan', 'Xu Hui Miao', 'Liu Xueyi, Wu Jinyan, Bi Wenjun, Zhao Xiaotang, Baron Chen, Huang Riying, Shao Weitong, Jiang Kai', 'TV-14', 'In a land torn by war, the three kingdoms of Dayan, Xiyan, and Nanyue have battled for years. Prince Murong Jinghe of Dayan, renowned for his military prowess, suffers a devastating betrayal, leading to the annihilation of his army. Determined to uncover the truth behind the treachery, he seeks justice while navigating the treacherous court politics. Amid this turmoil, Mei Lin, a warrior presumed dead, becomes Murong’s only ally in his quest for revenge. As they fight together, a complex bond forms between them, blending love and sacrifice, as they both struggle to survive and seek justice.', 'In a land torn by war, the three kingdoms of Dayan, Xiyan, and Nanyue have battled for years. Prince Murong Jinghe of Dayan, renowned for his military prowess, suffers a devastating betrayal, leading to the annihilation of his army. Determined to uncover the truth behind the treachery, he seeks justice while navigating the treacherous court politics. Amid this turmoil, Mei Lin, a warrior presumed dead, becomes Murong’s only ally in his quest for revenge. As they fight together, a complex bond forms between them, blending love and sacrifice, as they both struggle to survive and seek justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kDZpnHamK38Q0b7wzWsoDSpZWk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243073'),
  ('510966726457519321', 'Kill Me, Heal Me', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Han Hee', null, 'Ji Sung, Hwang Jung-eum, Park Seo-jun, Oh Min-suk, Kim Yoo-ri, Kim Young-ae, Shim Hye-jin, Kim Yong-geon', null, 'A business mogul''s grandson, who has 7 personalities, and a female physician who becomes his secret doctor.', 'A business mogul''s grandson, who has 7 personalities, and a female physician who becomes his secret doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNH6NO0akHMIqbq5EC4qnCeeuC6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62266'),
  ('605834857885874505', 'Kill My Sins', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Liu Shishi, Shawn Dou, Zheng Yecheng, Xuan Lu, Josie Xu Jiao, Huang Haibing, Lan Xi, Ding Jie', null, 'The story follows Ye Ping''an, a heart doctor who arrives in Shengdu to investigate an old case. Rumors spread that she manipulates hearts and minds, earning her the title of "witch." When a sudden murder occurs, she''s accused of the crime. Yuan Shaocheng, an ambitious official, realizes there''s more to the case yet still seeks to have her executed. But Ye Ping''an has already made her first move on the path to vengeance.', 'The story follows Ye Ping''an, a heart doctor who arrives in Shengdu to investigate an old case. Rumors spread that she manipulates hearts and minds, earning her the title of "witch." When a sudden murder occurs, she''s accused of the crime. Yuan Shaocheng, an ambitious official, realizes there''s more to the case yet still seeks to have her executed. But Ye Ping''an has already made her first move on the path to vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAh7OlSQ8JzkoW4Jy5BuUlqNuE6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254477'),
  ('895162135033007813', 'Kill to Love', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Yi Han He', null, 'Zhang Zhexu, Mi Jin, Cheng Fang, Wang Ding, Li Yixiang, Yang Shuwei, Luo Datao', null, 'A Southern prince and a Northern assassin, bound since childhood, struggle with love and betrayal as political intrigue threatens to tear them apart.', 'A Southern prince and a Northern assassin, bound since childhood, struggle with love and betrayal as political intrigue threatens to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbCmoqJBI01aB4SZIhwqiMwTDeH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296772'),
  ('691739595556755169', 'Killed Again, Mr. Detective.', 2026, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Rikuya Yasuda, Shion Wakayama', null, 'Sakuya Otsuki is the son of a legendary detective, following in his father''s footsteps with his assistant, Lilithea. However, something''s different about this high-school sleuth. Wherever he goes, he always manages to get himself entangled in his cases—as a murder victim. When Sakuya is tasked to infiltrate a luxury cruise ship, he finds himself killed once again. But every time he reopens his eyes, Lilithea is there by his side, ready to help him get to the bottom of the mystery…', 'Sakuya Otsuki is the son of a legendary detective, following in his father''s footsteps with his assistant, Lilithea. However, something''s different about this high-school sleuth. Wherever he goes, he always manages to get himself entangled in his cases—as a murder victim. When Sakuya is tasked to infiltrate a luxury cruise ship, he finds himself killed once again. But every time he reopens his eyes, Lilithea is there by his side, ready to help him get to the bottom of the mystery…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/appBVX9NZFCUb8gnp49Tlqel5OM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312293'),
  ('870158275875105943', 'Killer by the Lake', 2017, 'Crime', 'Jérôme Cornuau', null, 'Lannick Gautry, Julie de Bona, Julie Depardieu, Claire Borotra, Justine Le Pottier, Marie-Anne Chazel', null, 'Three years after Vanished by the Lake, Lise and Clovis are now by another lake, in Annecy, and face the challenge of a new family life with their nine-month-old son Tom as the couple takes on a demanding new investigation.', 'Three years after Vanished by the Lake, Lise and Clovis are now by another lake, in Annecy, and face the challenge of a new family life with their nine-month-old son Tom as the couple takes on a demanding new investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ39TgTQQnp4e0QqBD34gsQRvsh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73820'),
  ('472055948202562832', 'Killer Cases', 2020, 'Crime, Documentary', null, 'Brian Ross', 'Brian Ross', 'TV-14', 'All the emotion, drama and suspense of America''s most memorable murder trials are captured. Produced by an Emmy-award winning team, each episode takes viewers through the criminal justice process, from the crime to the investigation to the courtroom testimony and finally, the verdict. It''s a journey through the criminal justice process that gives viewers an inside look at real cases like never before.', 'All the emotion, drama and suspense of America''s most memorable murder trials are captured. Produced by an Emmy-award winning team, each episode takes viewers through the criminal justice process, from the crime to the investigation to the courtroom testimony and finally, the verdict. It''s a journey through the criminal justice process that gives viewers an inside look at real cases like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCGjZedRCAvnA5lW9n1Yx7zSzko.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:114635'),
  ('377968399916801299', 'Killer Coaster', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Thomas Mansuy, Nikola Lange', 'Nikolay Lange-Nielsen, Thomas Mansuy', 'Alexandra Lamy, Chloé Jouannet, Audrey Lamy, Oscar Berthe, Lola Le Lann, Yvan Naubron, Alex Lutz', null, 'Summer 1998. Palavas-les-Flots. While the World Cup is in full swing, Sandrine Laplace, a bumbling contract worker who thinks she''s a CIA agent, decides to investigate a mysterious accident that happened on the ghost train at the local fair. Incompetent but reckless, Sandrine infiltrates a brutal world - made up of clan wars, cotton candy and bumper cars - and will have to form an alliance with Carmen and Yvane, two showmen who are completely opposite. What if there was a murderer in the carnival?', 'Summer 1998. Palavas-les-Flots. While the World Cup is in full swing, Sandrine Laplace, a bumbling contract worker who thinks she''s a CIA agent, decides to investigate a mysterious accident that happened on the ghost train at the local fair. Incompetent but reckless, Sandrine infiltrates a brutal world - made up of clan wars, cotton candy and bumper cars - and will have to form an alliance with Carmen and Yvane, two showmen who are completely opposite. What if there was a murderer in the carnival?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aXQHY6SZ8M6IAzCgP4Wn3b3Sqs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215636'),
  ('264688379711473255', 'Killer Inside: The Mind of Aaron Hernandez', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Kevin Armstrong, Aaron Hernandez', 'TV-MA', 'Via interviews with friends, players and insiders, this docuseries examines how Aaron Hernandez went from an NFL star to a convicted killer.', 'Via interviews with friends, players and insiders, this docuseries examines how Aaron Hernandez went from an NFL star to a convicted killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MfrqxkMGIqsCHYTz2pMhEoOJpB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97062'),
  ('748046789449444241', 'Killer Instinct', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Josh Berman', null, 'Johnny Messner, Kristin Lehman, Chi McBride, Ramon De Ocampo', null, 'Killer Instinct is an American crime drama television series filmed in Vancouver that originally aired on the Fox Network. The pilot episode aired on September 23, 2005, and the final episode aired on December 2, 2005. Fox ordered 13 episodes, only nine of which were broadcast in the United States; the remaining four premiered in the UK on Five. The series also been broadcast in France, New Zealand, Croatia, Italy, Netherlands, Australia, Japan, and Poland.', 'Killer Instinct is an American crime drama television series filmed in Vancouver that originally aired on the Fox Network. The pilot episode aired on September 23, 2005, and the final episode aired on December 2, 2005. Fox ordered 13 episodes, only nine of which were broadcast in the United States; the remaining four premiered in the UK on Five. The series also been broadcast in France, New Zealand, Croatia, Italy, Netherlands, Australia, Japan, and Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9DHz419Oe8CQmCdB2ARSeAtegf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9849'),
  ('602890839499758079', 'Killer Kids', 2011, 'Mystery, Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Killer Kids provides an in-depth profile of the lives of kids who kill. What can possibly motivate kids to commit criminal acts and even murder? From hate crimes to gang initiations, murders of family members to occult ceremonies, each case in the series exposes different motives and methods of murders by children.', 'Killer Kids provides an in-depth profile of the lives of kids who kill. What can possibly motivate kids to commit criminal acts and even murder? From hate crimes to gang initiations, murders of family members to occult ceremonies, each case in the series exposes different motives and methods of murders by children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NEqpd5S4QVssqtvZQU54RCZGe7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:42840'),
  ('479077774330762978', 'Killer Ratings', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Eamonn Matthews, Dinah Lord', null, 'Wallace Souza', 'TV-MA', 'Brazilian TV personality and politician Wallace Souza faces accusations of masterminding the violent crimes he reported on and rallied against.', 'Brazilian TV personality and politician Wallace Souza faces accusations of masterminding the violent crimes he reported on and rallied against.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgBwvT83hq9qDxQi5aeN40yWmrD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89899'),
  ('90211986886524364', 'Killer Sally', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Sally McNeil, John Lowden, Shantina Lowden, Shannon Brown, Peggy Hook', 'TV-MA', 'Interviews with friends, family and Sally McNeil herself chart a bodybuilding couple’s rocky marriage — and its shocking end in a Valentine''s Day murder.', 'Interviews with friends, family and Sally McNeil herself chart a bodybuilding couple’s rocky marriage — and its shocking end in a Valentine''s Day murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46WBP1KGrI9pPstPhxkBvNR0T0m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212870'),
  ('399223330411274540', 'Killer Soup', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Unaiza Merchant, Anant Tripathy, Abhishek Chaubey', 'Unaiza Merchant, Harshad Nalawade, Anant Tripathy', 'Konkona Sen Sharma, Manoj Bajpayee, Nassar, Sayaji Shinde, Anula Navlekar, Lal, Vaishali Bisht, Kani Kusruti', 'TV-MA', 'Swathi dreams of owning a restaurant. But when a murder derails her plan, she and her lover take an outrageous step — to replace him with her husband.', 'Swathi dreams of owning a restaurant. But when a murder derails her plan, she and her lover take an outrageous step — to replace him with her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jm08lHmvZulDzxd5koPs8pf8Mir.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238419'),
  ('59211775445571941', 'Killer Vacation', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'José Francisco Tapajós, Flavia Kamenetz, Martin Caamaño', 'Lara Tremouroux, Filipe Bragança, Julianna Gerais, João Vithor Oliveira, Luana Nastas, Michel Joelsas, Ronald Sotto, Eucir de Souza', 'NR', 'At the end of a year full of competitions, a group of young athletes decides to spend their last vacation together on an island paradise. Far from their families and isolated from the world, it seemed like the perfect trip. But when the body of one of them is found lifeless in the sea, friendships are tested and secrets come to light in a breathtaking thriller where each and every one is a suspect.', 'At the end of a year full of competitions, a group of young athletes decides to spend their last vacation together on an island paradise. Far from their families and isolated from the world, it seemed like the perfect trip. But when the body of one of them is found lifeless in the sea, friendships are tested and secrets come to light in a breathtaking thriller where each and every one is a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ps1n9t7KCUqEIH9dV2kDzxzBOyS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210391'),
  ('838283069016114703', 'Killer Wave', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Karine Vanasse, Stephen McHattie, Angus Macfadyen, Tom Skerritt, Louis-Philippe Dandenault, Ellen David, Bruce Dinsmore, Christopher Heyerdahl', 'TV-14', 'Two engineers try to save Boston after terrorists use nuclear missiles to create huge tidal waves.', 'Two engineers try to save Boston after terrorists use nuclear missiles to create huge tidal waves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wra50hZXEQqfhiYgEzLere7G9Gd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35426'),
  ('260987984724930970', 'Killer Women', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Marisa Grinstein', 'Luis Felipe Ybarra Rivera, Marisa Grinstein', 'Rosa María Bianchi, Mauricio Castillo, Wdeth Gabriel, Ricardo Franco', null, 'Mujeres Asesinas is a series that shows the dark side of women who have been mistreated or abused and become cruel murderers. The series shows how violence and death can overcome the feminine mind.', 'Mujeres Asesinas is a series that shows the dark side of women who have been mistreated or abused and become cruel murderers. The series shows how violence and death can overcome the feminine mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6BUGwKWyFX6DiLyVYAz680JxgE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:19125'),
  ('109967424486364844', 'Killer Women', 2014, 'Western, Drama', 'Hannah Shakespeare', null, 'Tricia Helfer, Marc Blucas, Michael Trucco, Alex Fernandez, Marta Milans', 'TV-14', 'Of all the notorious lawmen that ever patrolled the violent frontier, none are more storied than ballsy and badass Molly Parker, one of the first women to join the Texas Rangers.', 'Of all the notorious lawmen that ever patrolled the violent frontier, none are more storied than ballsy and badass Molly Parker, one of the first women to join the Texas Rangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EeME94QLIethmBA2w3vM7AVTb8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51036'),
  ('409969352392423809', 'Killer Women with Piers Morgan', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Piers Morgan', null, 'Piers Morgan travels through the southern states of Texas and Florida to meet some of America''s most notorious female murderers. Piers'' journey of discovery is aimed at gaining a full understanding of three complex cases. He ventures behind bars to come face to face with women who have carried out the most unspeakable crimes in a quest to discover what drove these women to kill and investigate the truth behind each case.', 'Piers Morgan travels through the southern states of Texas and Florida to meet some of America''s most notorious female murderers. Piers'' journey of discovery is aimed at gaining a full understanding of three complex cases. He ventures behind bars to come face to face with women who have carried out the most unspeakable crimes in a quest to discover what drove these women to kill and investigate the truth behind each case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LIVToGbe6Ooy8EROtsLPPvPNd0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66512'),
  ('493319642226344186', 'Killing Bites', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Wataru Hatano, Sora Amamiya, Sumire Uesaka, Yuichi Nakamura', null, 'Yuuya Nomoto was horrified to discover that the vehicle he was driving was being used to kidnap a high school girl, but he''s even more shocked when the girl, Hitomi Uzaki, literally tears her kidnappers to pieces instead! Then she forces Yuuya to drive her to an arena where she bets the value of his organs on herself to win in a death match against a half-lion hybrid! Even more astonishing: Hitomi wins! That''s because she''s a Therianthrope, a genetically engineered fighter created specifically for the underground death matches known as Killing Bites! And now that Yuuya has been pulled into this dark underworld, he has no choice but to continue working for Hitomi. Because who''s going to fight against a girl who''s part honey badger?', 'Yuuya Nomoto was horrified to discover that the vehicle he was driving was being used to kidnap a high school girl, but he''s even more shocked when the girl, Hitomi Uzaki, literally tears her kidnappers to pieces instead! Then she forces Yuuya to drive her to an arena where she bets the value of his organs on herself to win in a death match against a half-lion hybrid! Even more astonishing: Hitomi wins! That''s because she''s a Therianthrope, a genetically engineered fighter created specifically for the underground death matches known as Killing Bites! And now that Yuuya has been pulled into this dark underworld, he has no choice but to continue working for Hitomi. Because who''s going to fight against a girl who''s part honey badger?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyIowoKd2SGu3ahUs669QuLFHbF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76130'),
  ('1010244628951233236', 'Killing Eve', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge', null, 'Sandra Oh, Jodie Comer, Fiona Shaw, Kim Bodnia, Camille Cottin, Robert Gilbert, Anjana Vasan', 'TV-14', 'A security consultant hunts for a ruthless assassin. Equally obsessed with each other, they go head to head in an epic game of cat-and-mouse.', 'A security consultant hunts for a ruthless assassin. Equally obsessed with each other, they go head to head in an epic game of cat-and-mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wKhTVw8aGq5AZMa0Q1spERdi7n.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:72750'),
  ('474762067008405503', 'Killing Fields', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'True-crime thriller that follows a team of homicide detectives as they open an 18-year-old cold case that occurred in one of America''s notorious body-dumping grounds, the Louisiana swamplands.', 'True-crime thriller that follows a team of homicide detectives as they open an 18-year-old cold case that occurred in one of America''s notorious body-dumping grounds, the Louisiana swamplands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eQpAFJwsKH9Su4s13I0TYnOiru.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65437'),
  ('924543143450655082', 'Killing It', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel J. Goor, Luke Del Tredici', null, 'Craig Robinson, Claudia O''Doherty, Rell Battle', 'TV-MA', 'Craig Foster, a Miami bank security guard, enters a state-sponsored snake-hunting contest to achieve his American dream of becoming a successful entrepreneur.', 'Craig Foster, a Miami bank security guard, enters a state-sponsored snake-hunting contest to achieve his American dream of becoming a successful entrepreneur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/531oH3x2cnNAO2ubDQgLYrwJIsC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156878'),
