  ('972453542635145738', 'Kim Kong', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Alexis Le Sec, Simon Jablonka', null, 'Audrey Giacomini, Henri Courseaux, Christophe Tek, Isabelle Girardet, Stephen Cafiero, Anthony Pho, Jonathan Lambert, Frédéric Chau', 'NR', 'Taken by an asian dictatorship in order to direct a "King Kong" remake to the glory of the regime, a depressed director (Jonathan Lambert) is about to rediscover the taste for creation. A surprising comedy of the absurd.', 'Taken by an asian dictatorship in order to direct a "King Kong" remake to the glory of the regime, a depressed director (Jonathan Lambert) is about to rediscover the taste for creation. A surprising comedy of the absurd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mujcvuPCRKudxEeI0wQKppclRs3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73908'),
  ('1076970559446324276', 'Kim Possible', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', 'Mark McCorkle, Bob Schooley', null, 'Christy Carlson Romano, Will Friedle, Nancy Cartwright, Tahj Mowry', 'TV-Y7', 'If there''s danger or trouble, Kim Possible is there on the double to save the world from villains... and still make it home in time for cheerleading practice! Luckily, Kim has her sidekick Ron Stoppable and his pet naked mole-rat Rufus by her side.', 'If there''s danger or trouble, Kim Possible is there on the double to save the world from villains... and still make it home in time for cheerleading practice! Luckily, Kim has her sidekick Ron Stoppable and his pet naked mole-rat Rufus by her side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAIm6KkiQKl0UsagMUyhLFzX2X2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2345'),
  ('653460931372022749', 'Kim Soo Ro', 2010, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ji Sung, Park Gun-tae, Bae Jong-ok, Yu Oh-seong, Seo Ji-hye, Go Joo-won, Lee Pil-mo, Wang Bit-na', 'NR', 'This drama charts the life of Kim Soo Ro, legendary founder of Geumgwan Gaya, the ruling city-state of the Gaya confederacy, which dominated sea trade and iron working during the Three Kingdoms Period. Kim Soo Ro''s fiery temperament, charisma and intelligence are his only defense in the extended political struggle, with competition for the throne from his half-brother and lifelong rival, Ijinashi, his former friend Suk Tal Hae, and the dangerous ambitions of Shin Kwi Gan.', 'This drama charts the life of Kim Soo Ro, legendary founder of Geumgwan Gaya, the ruling city-state of the Gaya confederacy, which dominated sea trade and iron working during the Three Kingdoms Period. Kim Soo Ro''s fiery temperament, charisma and intelligence are his only defense in the extended political struggle, with competition for the throne from his half-brother and lifelong rival, Ijinashi, his former friend Suk Tal Hae, and the dangerous ambitions of Shin Kwi Gan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XWiBy0dITJ4bHCJ5xTbgmYFXdP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35448'),
  ('537564546577837655', 'Kim''s Convenience', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Kevin White, Ins Choi', null, 'Paul Sun-Hyung Lee, Jean Yoon, Andrea Bang, Simu Liu, Andrew Phung, Nicole Power', 'TV-14', 'The funny, heartfelt story of The Kims, a Korean-Canadian family, running a convenience store in downtown Toronto. Mr. and Mrs. Kim (''Appa'' and ''Umma'') immigrated to Toronto in the ''80s to set up shop near Regent Park and had two kids, Jung and Janet who are now young adults. However, when Jung was 16, he and Appa had a major falling out involving a physical fight, stolen money and Jung leaving home. Father and son have been estranged since.', 'The funny, heartfelt story of The Kims, a Korean-Canadian family, running a convenience store in downtown Toronto. Mr. and Mrs. Kim (''Appa'' and ''Umma'') immigrated to Toronto in the ''80s to set up shop near Regent Park and had two kids, Jung and Janet who are now young adults. However, when Jung was 16, he and Appa had a major falling out involving a physical fight, stolen money and Jung leaving home. Father and son have been estranged since.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82Vue6MPuYZzlpggR65cvWdBdy.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:68106'),
  ('156735515798844343', 'Kimagure Orange Road', 1987, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiromi Tsuru, Toru Furuya, Eriko Hara, Chieko Honda, Michie Tomizawa, Kei Tomiyama, Keiichi Nanba, Kenichi Ogata', 'NR', 'It can be hard moving to a new school, and fifteen-year-old Kyosuke has it harder than most. He’s fallen head over heels for his classmate Madoka, a girl who won’t even give him the time of day, and unintentionally ended up dating her best friend, Hikaru, instead. Worst of all, Kyosuke and his family have amazing supernatural powers, but he has to keep them hidden from the rest of the world! How is Kyosuke ever going to balance the affections (or lack thereof) of two girls, schoolwork, and his secret abilities all at the same time?', 'It can be hard moving to a new school, and fifteen-year-old Kyosuke has it harder than most. He’s fallen head over heels for his classmate Madoka, a girl who won’t even give him the time of day, and unintentionally ended up dating her best friend, Hikaru, instead. Worst of all, Kyosuke and his family have amazing supernatural powers, but he has to keep them hidden from the rest of the world! How is Kyosuke ever going to balance the affections (or lack thereof) of two girls, schoolwork, and his secret abilities all at the same time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixN9gGjfw5ecnK2qjgkTBPl1cvg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9103'),
  ('613416846079132461', 'Kimba the White Lion', 1965, 'Animation, Drama', null, 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Gorō Naya, Yoshiko Ohta, Hajime Akashi, Hisashi Katsuta, Junji Chiba, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Yoshiko Matsuo, Kinto Tamura', null, 'The adventures of Leo, a young lion cub who becomes king of the jungle when his father, the previous king of the jungle is killed by a human hunter.', 'The adventures of Leo, a young lion cub who becomes king of the jungle when his father, the previous king of the jungle is killed by a human hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOErQhpDuvj1K1U2RPkOu4w9GBw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8853'),
  ('782168532367569800', 'Kimi no na wa', 1991, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kyoka Suzuki, Tetsuo Kurata, Hiroshi Fuse, Yoshiko Tanaka, Mitsuru Hirata, Kai Shishido, Takehiro Murata, Kaku Takashina', null, 'A story of a man and a woman who meet amid the Great Tokyo Air Raid in 1945.', 'A story of a man and a woman who meet amid the Great Tokyo Air Raid in 1945.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApPIfZotblqFAEfbdDdsByrmQOD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207228'),
  ('1005661035508332098', 'Kimse Bilmez', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Hasan Burak Kayacı', null, 'Keremcem, Özgü Kaya, Engin Hepileri, Burak Serdar Şanal, Zeynep Elçin, Ferdi Kurtuldu, Zehra Yılmaz, Kubilay Penbeklioğlu', null, 'Sevda is a very beautiful and energetic girl who dreams of being a star. Ali has a mysterious past. Ali and Sevda''s extraordinary love story.', 'Sevda is a very beautiful and energetic girl who dreams of being a star. Ali has a mysterious past. Ali and Sevda''s extraordinary love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16VpiP8RmsCWHeZOIowQW5R2cQP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90210'),
  ('1123154135959688180', 'Kin', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Peter McKenna, Ciarán Donnelly', null, 'Charlie Cox, Aidan Gillen, Clare Dunne, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Emmett J. Scanlan, Sam Keeley, Yasmin Seky, Francis Magee', 'TV-MA', 'The lives of a Dublin family embroiled in a gangland war and the consequences of their choices.', 'The lives of a Dublin family embroiled in a gangland war and the consequences of their choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wTsgQQBruGQcjM0PjFr5l5MjEw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112693'),
  ('996275543266266907', 'Kindaichi Case Files', 1997, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Taiki Matsuno, Haruna Ikezawa, Akiko Nakagawa, Jurota Kosugi, Mayumi Izuka, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'Kindaichi Hajime may look dumb, but he is one of the smartest you will ever see. He encounters mysteries after mysteries with his good friend, Miyuki, and he swears to solve them in the name of his grandfather, which was a great detective.', 'Kindaichi Hajime may look dumb, but he is one of the smartest you will ever see. He encounters mysteries after mysteries with his good friend, Miyuki, and he swears to solve them in the name of his grandfather, which was a great detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMCA5F3szGY3ckx2EDWWgwHZdh9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23587'),
  ('915524515844734691', 'Kindred', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Branden Jacobs-Jenkins', null, 'Mallori Johnson, Micah Stock, Ryan Kwanten, Gayle Rankin, Austin Smith, Antoinette Crowe-Legacy, David Alexander Kaplan, Jayden Braddock', 'TV-MA', 'A young aspiring writer discovers secrets about her family''s past when she finds herself mysteriously being pulled back and forth in time to a 19th century plantation.', 'A young aspiring writer discovers secrets about her family''s past when she finds herself mysteriously being pulled back and forth in time to a 19th century plantation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSrPT4PQmrVDGdp55cCShrpBMlj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138561'),
  ('434413310347902852', 'Kindred Spirits', 2016, 'Reality, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Adam Berry, Amy Bruni, Chip Coffey', 'TV-14', 'Ghost hunters Adam Berry and Amy Bruni help real families who claim to be bedeviled by paranormal activity in their homes.', 'Ghost hunters Adam Berry and Amy Bruni help real families who claim to be bedeviled by paranormal activity in their homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iWu5nDiY3YHTE6o5P3gVvDax2d.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:68432'),
  ('742114035738131292', 'Kindred: The Embraced', 1996, 'Drama', 'John Leekley', null, 'C. Thomas Howell, Mark Frankel, Kelly Rutherford, Stacy Haiduk, Erik King, Patrick Bauchau, Brigid Brannagh, Channon Roe', null, 'Kindred: The Embraced is an American television series produced by John Leekley Productions and Spelling Television. Loosely based on the role-playing game Vampire: The Masquerade, the series premiered on Fox on April 2, 1996, and ran for eight episodes before it was canceled on May 9, 1996. The series focused on San Francisco Police Detective Frank Kohanek who discovers his city is home to numerous vampires while investigating alleged mobster, Julian Luna. Julian is the "prince" of the city, ruler of five groups of vampires in the city, collectively called "The Kindred". The vampires survive through the "masquerade", disguising themselves as humans, and Julian strictly enforces the laws that govern them to protect their anonymity. Julian and Frank form an uneasy bond as they work together to try to prevent a vampire war and Julian struggles with his romantic feelings for human reporter Caitlin Byrne. The eight episodes of the series have been released on VHS and DVD.', 'Kindred: The Embraced is an American television series produced by John Leekley Productions and Spelling Television. Loosely based on the role-playing game Vampire: The Masquerade, the series premiered on Fox on April 2, 1996, and ran for eight episodes before it was canceled on May 9, 1996. The series focused on San Francisco Police Detective Frank Kohanek who discovers his city is home to numerous vampires while investigating alleged mobster, Julian Luna. Julian is the "prince" of the city, ruler of five groups of vampires in the city, collectively called "The Kindred". The vampires survive through the "masquerade", disguising themselves as humans, and Julian strictly enforces the laws that govern them to protect their anonymity. Julian and Frank form an uneasy bond as they work together to try to prevent a vampire war and Julian struggles with his romantic feelings for human reporter Caitlin Byrne. The eight episodes of the series have been released on VHS and DVD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcI72282j6X2Dw6HNq5H7XLhVBQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3576'),
  ('207674164283042427', 'King', 1978, 'Drama', null, 'Abby Mann', 'Paul Winfield, Cicely Tyson, Tony Bennett, Roscoe Lee Browne, Lonny Chapman, Ossie Davis, Cliff DeYoung, Al Freeman Jr.', null, 'The story of Dr. Martin Luther King Jr., stretching from his days as a Southern Baptist minister in the South of the 1950s until his assassination in Memphis in 1968.', 'The story of Dr. Martin Luther King Jr., stretching from his days as a Southern Baptist minister in the South of the 1950s until his assassination in Memphis in 1968.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tD71a5wWJqLFuCOXdnBP5uD5kFc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17780'),
  ('269537296964105490', 'King', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Amy Price-Francis, Gabriel Hogan, Alan van Sprang, Tony Nardi, Aaron Poole, Ari Cohen, Rossif Sutherland, Karen Robinson', null, 'King is a Canadian police drama which premiered April 17, 2011 on Showcase. The series stars Amy Price-Francis as Jessica King, a veteran police officer who gets promoted to head of the Major Crimes Task Force in Toronto after her predecessor has a breakdown on television. Season 2 began production in September 2011 and premiered 29 February 2012. On June 2, 2012, it was reported that King had been cancelled after 2 seasons.', 'King is a Canadian police drama which premiered April 17, 2011 on Showcase. The series stars Amy Price-Francis as Jessica King, a veteran police officer who gets promoted to head of the Major Crimes Task Force in Toronto after her predecessor has a breakdown on television. Season 2 began production in September 2011 and premiered 29 February 2012. On June 2, 2012, it was reported that King had been cancelled after 2 seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m67PLNDRRKqbPMUADd7XlUJ1pb3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38910'),
  ('255907992403083684', 'King & Conqueror', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Michael Robert Johnson', null, 'James Norton, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Emily Beecham, Clémence Poésy, Jason Forbes', null, 'The story of a clash that defined the future of a country and a continent for a thousand years. Harold of Wessex and William of Normandy were two men destined to meet at the Battle of Hastings in 1066. These two former allies with no design on the British throne found themselves forced by circumstance and personal obsession into a war for possession of its crown.', 'The story of a clash that defined the future of a country and a continent for a thousand years. Harold of Wessex and William of Normandy were two men destined to meet at the Battle of Hastings in 1066. These two former allies with no design on the British throne found themselves forced by circumstance and personal obsession into a war for possession of its crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SW0c0tUFWjpWBz2UYr0U57a8kB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240558'),
  ('735510998586462198', 'King & Jester', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rustam Mosafir', 'Dmitry Lemeshev', 'Konstantin Plotnikov, Vladislav Konoplev, Valeriia Zoidova, Daniil Vakhrushev, Ilya Lovkiy, Danila Rassomakhin, Yan Ilves, Vassa Bokova', null, 'A fantasy drama infused with music and horror fables based on the real story of the ''King and Jester'', a cult Russian punk-rock band, enormously popular in the 1990-2000s. The show goes along the band''s rocky road to success and tells the story of its polarizing-natured frontman Michael Gorshenev and his tragic death in 2013. Tricksters, evil spirits, noblemen, and other characters of the ''King and Jester'' song verse make their way into the lives of Gorshenev and his bandmates.', 'A fantasy drama infused with music and horror fables based on the real story of the ''King and Jester'', a cult Russian punk-rock band, enormously popular in the 1990-2000s. The show goes along the band''s rocky road to success and tells the story of its polarizing-natured frontman Michael Gorshenev and his tragic death in 2013. Tricksters, evil spirits, noblemen, and other characters of the ''King and Jester'' song verse make their way into the lives of Gorshenev and his bandmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5t6iLiVBululasgxut5Pz1maVS1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219806'),
  ('493675739448024155', 'King & Maxwell', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shane Brennan', null, 'Jon Tenney, Rebecca Romijn, Ryan Hurst, Michael O''Keefe, Chris Butler', 'TV-14', 'Sean King and Michelle Maxwell aren''t your typical pair of private investigators. As discredited Secret Service agents, their unique skills often give them a leg up on suspects and conventional law enforcement. He''s charming and always one step ahead of the game; she''s a fearless force to be reckoned with. As a team, they''re unstoppable.', 'Sean King and Michelle Maxwell aren''t your typical pair of private investigators. As discredited Secret Service agents, their unique skills often give them a leg up on suspects and conventional law enforcement. He''s charming and always one step ahead of the game; she''s a fearless force to be reckoned with. As a team, they''re unstoppable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kKzx5q7tbuKVLTMBH4EKHhVAQl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56401'),
  ('1047694833004144786', 'King Arthur & the Knights of Justice', 1992, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jean Chalopin, Diane Eskenazi', 'Jean Chalopin', 'Kathleen Barr, Michael Donovan, Garry Chalk, Andrew Kavadas, Scott McNeil, Jim Byrnes, Mark Hildreth, Teryl Rothery', null, 'King Arthur and the Knights of Justice is an American animated series. It lasted for two seasons and 13 episodes each. The cartoon was produced by Golden Films, C&D Entertainment and Bohbot Entertainment. The series was created by Diane Eskenazi and Avi Arad who were also executive producers of the series. Its first episode aired on September 13, 1992, and the last episode was on December 12, 1993.', 'King Arthur and the Knights of Justice is an American animated series. It lasted for two seasons and 13 episodes each. The cartoon was produced by Golden Films, C&D Entertainment and Bohbot Entertainment. The series was created by Diane Eskenazi and Avi Arad who were also executive producers of the series. Its first episode aired on September 13, 1992, and the last episode was on December 12, 1993.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIaphv08v2RrIDvqE9pifJmWtE8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11120'),
  ('835387603130219348', 'King Arthur and the Knights of the Round Table', 1979, 'Animation', null, null, 'Makio Inoue, Akira Kamiya, Keiko Han', null, 'King Arthur and the Knights of the Round Table is a Japanese anime series based on the Arthurian legend.', 'King Arthur and the Knights of the Round Table is a Japanese anime series based on the Arthurian legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9c5wiIgkKRwQetmoIZXT8g0ECDs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:22002'),
  ('28372448700508139', 'King David', 2012, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Leonardo Brício, Renata Dominguez, Maria Ribeiro, Gracindo Júnior, Iran Malfitano, Camila Rodrigues, Ângela Leal, Marly Bueno', 'NR', 'Our story begins in Bethlehem, an Israelite territory, in the year 1045 B.C. David is 10 years old and is preparing to herd his father Jesse’s flock of sheep. Being the youngest of seven brothers, David is tasked with being the household servant. He’s been relegated beneath his brothers because they all have the honor of being brave warriors for King Saul.', 'Our story begins in Bethlehem, an Israelite territory, in the year 1045 B.C. David is 10 years old and is preparing to herd his father Jesse’s flock of sheep. Being the youngest of seven brothers, David is tasked with being the household servant. He’s been relegated beneath his brothers because they all have the honor of being brave warriors for King Saul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sWqEJSGfLq6ssXFexDAB5PdopR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43062'),
  ('616772207744030650', 'King Gary', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Tom Davis, James de Frond', null, 'Tom Davis, Simon Day, Camille Coduri, Romesh Ranganathan, Neil Maskell, Riley Burgin, Laura Checkley', null, 'A larger-than-life working-class sitcom that follows the trials and tribulations of ''geezer diva'' Gary King and his childhood sweetheart Terri as they aspire to achieve moderate material success in competitive suburbia.', 'A larger-than-life working-class sitcom that follows the trials and tribulations of ''geezer diva'' Gary King and his childhood sweetheart Terri as they aspire to achieve moderate material success in competitive suburbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIXeeSRFBEW0NAAFm7tYuWrxKsY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85190'),
  ('790695002101049276', 'King of Baking, Kim Tak Goo', 2010, 'Drama', null, 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Yoon Shi-yoon, Eugene, Joo Won, Lee Young-ah, Kim So-hyun, Choi Yoon-young, Jeon Mi-seon, Jun Kwang-ryul', 'NR', 'It tells the story of how a determined young baker overcomes many trials towards his goal of becoming the best baker in Korea. This story takes place in the 1970s to 1990s, starting after his conception and finishing when he reaches his mid-20s.', 'It tells the story of how a determined young baker overcomes many trials towards his goal of becoming the best baker in Korea. This story takes place in the 1970s to 1990s, starting after his conception and finishing when he reaches his mid-20s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfCVIauTvMp5hYhB1iYzqpr8AK7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33268'),
  ('597313251570416499', 'King of Boys: The Return of the King', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lord Frank, Richard Mofe-Damijo, Osas Ighodaro, Sola Sobowale, Remilekun Reminisce Safaru, Nse Ikpe-Etim, Efa Iwara, IllBliss', 'TV-MA', 'Alhaja Eniola Salami starts anew and sets her sights on a different position of power, fueled by revenge, regret and ruthlessness.', 'Alhaja Eniola Salami starts anew and sets her sights on a different position of power, fueled by revenge, regret and ruthlessness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWI6qVGOklBCfdcskDdVcm2JXA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131584'),
  ('946025339734483609', 'King of Collectibles: The Goldin Touch', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Ken Goldin and his smart team lead the action in this series that takes a look inside a leading auction house specializing in rare collectibles.', 'Ken Goldin and his smart team lead the action in this series that takes a look inside a leading auction house specializing in rare collectibles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOZfsfI258IAIdlgnjLvCGaAYTT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:223663'),
  ('958375118507135450', 'King of Gambler', 1996, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Thirteen Chan Sap-Sam', 'Patrick Tse Yin, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Cecilia Yip Tung, Michelle Yim, Kristy Yang Rongru, Annie Man Chung-Han, Michael Huang, David Lam Wai', null, 'After seven years in prison, Long Si returns to Shanghai to regain everything that he lost. On the train, he got to know more than a dozen heroes and soon thirteen of them became sworn brothers. Long Si only took seven days to regain the dominance of the Shanghai casino. As promised, he divided his casinos among twelve sworn brothers. Unfortunately, the twelve brothers fight against each other because of the greed for profit.', 'After seven years in prison, Long Si returns to Shanghai to regain everything that he lost. On the train, he got to know more than a dozen heroes and soon thirteen of them became sworn brothers. Long Si only took seven days to regain the dominance of the Shanghai casino. As promised, he divided his casinos among twelve sworn brothers. Unfortunately, the twelve brothers fight against each other because of the greed for profit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snkl3Ok6XoTRGtRj6PVaYvgTYk2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80166'),
  ('79721363618585392', 'King of Stonks', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Philipp Kässbohrer, Matthias Murmann', null, 'Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Thomas Schubert, Matthias Brandt, Larissa Sirah Herden, Maryam Zaree, Jasin Challah, Andreas Döhler, Eva Löbau', 'TV-MA', 'Desperate for startup stardom, an overly ambitious finance mastermind lies, cheats and schemes his less-than-authentic company up the ladder to success.', 'Desperate for startup stardom, an overly ambitious finance mastermind lies, cheats and schemes his less-than-authentic company up the ladder to success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dk2XFOpwG5oEVffAvvCILtW4F2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204852'),
  ('820624482333468955', 'King of the Braves GaoGaiGar FINAL', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Nobuyuki Hiyama, Maiko Itou, Miki Inoue, Tomoe Hanba, Koji Ishii, Hisao Egawa, Kozo Shioya, Koichi Chiba', 'TV-PG', 'A new threat makes its appearance on Earth. GGG - with Guy Shishio and the newly-constructed GaoFighGar - team up with their French counterpart Chasseur to battle the Eleven Kings of Sol.', 'A new threat makes its appearance on Earth. GGG - with Guy Shishio and the newly-constructed GaoFighGar - team up with their French counterpart Chasseur to battle the Eleven Kings of Sol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdxJ0d1HE6ODFANpVcZcDXXwQQD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44616'),
  ('778397499064579728', 'King of the Hill', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Greg Daniels, Mike Judge', null, 'Mike Judge, Kathy Najimy, Pamela Adlon, Stephen Root, Toby Huss, Lauren Tom, Ronny Chieng', 'TV-PG', 'Set in Texas, this animated series follows the life of propane salesman Hank Hill, who lives with his overly confident substitute Spanish teacher wife Peggy, wannabe comedian son Bobby, and naive niece Luanne. Hank has conservative views about God, family, and country, but his values and ethics are often challenged by the situations he, his family, and his beer-drinking neighbors/buddies find themselves in.', 'Set in Texas, this animated series follows the life of propane salesman Hank Hill, who lives with his overly confident substitute Spanish teacher wife Peggy, wannabe comedian son Bobby, and naive niece Luanne. Hank has conservative views about God, family, and country, but his values and ethics are often challenged by the situations he, his family, and his beer-drinking neighbors/buddies find themselves in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2xyMapmYgv4AuSoSDv9Y4pQlD6.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:2122'),
  ('426881671772662281', 'King of the Nerds', 2013, 'Reality', 'Curtis Armstrong, Robert Carradine', 'David Geberitt', 'Robert Carradine, Curtis Armstrong', null, 'King of the Nerds is the ultimate nerd-off. The series follows fierce competitors from across the nerd spectrum as they set out to win $100,000 and be crowned the greatest nerd of them all. King of the Nerds takes the glory of geekdom to a whole new level as the competitors live together in "Nerdvana." Each week, they must face challenges that will test their intellect, ingenuity, skills, and pop culture prowess. One competitor is eliminated each week until one nerd stands alone as the ultimate champion of all things nerdy.', 'King of the Nerds is the ultimate nerd-off. The series follows fierce competitors from across the nerd spectrum as they set out to win $100,000 and be crowned the greatest nerd of them all. King of the Nerds takes the glory of geekdom to a whole new level as the competitors live together in "Nerdvana." Each week, they must face challenges that will test their intellect, ingenuity, skills, and pop culture prowess. One competitor is eliminated each week until one nerd stands alone as the ultimate champion of all things nerdy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1edLqHEushuMeEBBldqdROYHZbe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68776'),
  ('69932858587783211', 'King Solomon''s Mines', 2004, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Patrick Swayze, Alison Doody, Roy Marsden, John Standing, Gavin Hood, Sidede Onyulo, Ian Roberts, Nick Boraine', null, 'Renowned safari hunter Allan Quatermain is lured back into the unknown recesses of the African jungles to find a man who disappeared while searching for the fabled King Solomon''s Mines--a destination of legendary riches from which no soul has ever returned alive.', 'Renowned safari hunter Allan Quatermain is lured back into the unknown recesses of the African jungles to find a man who disappeared while searching for the fabled King Solomon''s Mines--a destination of legendary riches from which no soul has ever returned alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZWMm5Gh6KeWmPbp59Mz9yJMOhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19699'),
  ('326819500140434653', 'King Star King', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Eric Kaplan, J.J. Villard', null, 'Robin Atkin Downes, Mallory McGill, J.J. Villard, Rachel Butera, Tommy Blacha, Eric Kaplan', 'TV-MA', 'King Star King is a tall, blond muscular man who after seducing his love, Princess Snow White, falls from his higher plane of existence to serve as a fry cook in a run-down waffle house. In order to reclaim his place in the heavens, he must battle his amnesia to defeat the evil Spring Bunny and rescue Snow White.', 'King Star King is a tall, blond muscular man who after seducing his love, Princess Snow White, falls from his higher plane of existence to serve as a fry cook in a run-down waffle house. In order to reclaim his place in the heavens, he must battle his amnesia to defeat the evil Spring Bunny and rescue Snow White.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzF6Xswd3UzsUwkDeMBiyGpKWIf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65520'),
  ('552973160519581349', 'King the Land', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chun Sung-il', null, 'Lee Jun-ho, Yoona, Go Won-hee, Kim Ga-eun, Ahn Se-ha, Kim Jae-won, Kim Sun-young, Son Byung-ho', 'TV-14', 'Amid a tense inheritance fight, a charming heir clashes with his hardworking employee who''s known for her irresistible smile — which he cannot stand.', 'Amid a tense inheritance fight, a charming heir clashes with his hardworking employee who''s known for her irresistible smile — which he cannot stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tW8BMRCYSe6nySvZ749pzc31x2m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198004'),
  ('37655931421841583', 'King''s Raid: Successors of the Will', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Ai Kakuma, Ari Ozawa, Kengo Kawanishi, Ryota Suzuki, Yoshino Nanjo, Juri Nagatsuma, Masaya Matsukaze', 'TV-14', 'A century has passed since King Kyle of the Orvelia kingdom destroyed the fierce demon lord Angmund, restoring peace to the lands. Now in a time of peace, the apprentice knight Kasel enjoys his life without worry. His fate begins to change, however, with news of demon appearances infesting the neighborhood. Guided by a wise man, Kasel finds friends he can rely on and sets off on his mission to seek a holy sword, capable of slaying his newfound enemies.', 'A century has passed since King Kyle of the Orvelia kingdom destroyed the fierce demon lord Angmund, restoring peace to the lands. Now in a time of peace, the apprentice knight Kasel enjoys his life without worry. His fate begins to change, however, with news of demon appearances infesting the neighborhood. Guided by a wise man, Kasel finds friends he can rely on and sets off on his mission to seek a holy sword, capable of slaying his newfound enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPw3m4DDmtJqDQ0m0f5U7WsgrsS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102871'),
  ('528708663714991965', 'Kingdom', 2007, 'Drama', 'Simon Wheeler, Alan Whiting', null, 'Stephen Fry, Celia Imrie, Karl Davies, Tony Slattery, Hermione Norris, Gerard Horan', 'TV-PG', 'Kingdom is a British television series created by Simon Wheeler and stars Stephen Fry as Peter Kingdom, a Norfolk solicitor who is coping with family, colleagues, and the strange locals who come to him for legal assistance.', 'Kingdom is a British television series created by Simon Wheeler and stars Stephen Fry as Peter Kingdom, a Norfolk solicitor who is coping with family, colleagues, and the strange locals who come to him for legal assistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hXjCwADXXUksnOG6FFN7xxKxSu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5287'),
  ('311288532265458328', 'Kingdom', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Masakazu Morita, Jun Fukuyama, Rie Kugimiya, Yoko Hikasa, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Hirofumi Nojima, Kenyu Horiuchi, Mie Sonozaki', 'TV-MA', 'In the Warring States period, young orphan Xin vows to aid King Zheng of Qin in his quest to unify China by becoming a general himself.', 'In the Warring States period, young orphan Xin vows to aid King Zheng of Qin in his quest to unify China by becoming a general himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dehuJJkKo50nYvCYppigrWejqLe.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:46437'),
  ('1107432597402940489', 'Kingdom', 2014, 'Drama', 'Byron Balasco', 'Scott Wilson', 'Frank Grillo, Jonathan Tucker, Nick Jonas, Matt Lauria, Kiele Sanchez, Joanna Going', 'TV-MA', 'A raw family drama set against the world of Mixed Martial Arts (MMA) in Venice, California. Alvey Kulina owns Navy St. MMA with the help of his girlfriend Lisa Prince. He is willing to go through extraordinary means to make sure his fighters are taken care of, but all of this responsibility comes at a steep price. He has complicated relationships with both of his sons, Jay and Nate, who are both struggling with their own identities and places within Alvey’s life and gym.', 'A raw family drama set against the world of Mixed Martial Arts (MMA) in Venice, California. Alvey Kulina owns Navy St. MMA with the help of his girlfriend Lisa Prince. He is willing to go through extraordinary means to make sure his fighters are taken care of, but all of this responsibility comes at a steep price. He has complicated relationships with both of his sons, Jay and Nate, who are both struggling with their own identities and places within Alvey’s life and gym.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkRyopANOnO60KWm6DjozXlq9w4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61427'),
  ('54741115259447508', 'Kingdom', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Kim Eun-hee, Kim Seong-hun', null, 'Ju Ji-hoon, Ryu Seung-ryong, Bae Doona, Kim Sang-ho, Kim Sung-kyu, Jun Suk-ho, Kim Hye-jun, Park Byung-eun', 'TV-MA', 'In this zombie thriller set in Korea''s medieval Joseon dynasty which has been defeated by corruption and famine, a mysterious rumor of the king’s death spreads, as does a strange plague that renders the infected immune to death and hungry for flesh. The crown prince, fallen victim to a conspiracy, sets out on a journey to unveil the evil scheme and save his people.', 'In this zombie thriller set in Korea''s medieval Joseon dynasty which has been defeated by corruption and famine, a mysterious rumor of the king’s death spreads, as does a strange plague that renders the infected immune to death and hungry for flesh. The crown prince, fallen victim to a conspiracy, sets out on a journey to unveil the evil scheme and save his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsICtiVtz4icMQQRwDvOzfaTzjK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70593'),
  ('800235368822938659', 'Kingdom Business', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kerry Lenhart, John J. Sakmar', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An exotic dancer with a powerful voice rises from the pole to the pulpit, forcing the reigning queen of gospel to guard her family and its many secrets.', 'An exotic dancer with a powerful voice rises from the pole to the pulpit, forcing the reigning queen of gospel to guard her family and its many secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wM8DTRNokHbXL7CgKBaDZR7bTb6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202158'),
  ('501691266974091818', 'Kingdom of Dreams', 2022, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Nick Green, Camilla Hall', 'Peter Ettedgui', null, null, '''Kingdom of Dreams'' is a stunning four-part series chronicling three critical decades of the fashion world, from the early 1990s through to the 2010s. Described as a Golden Age, this period of time was an era of disruption and innovation as the traditional fashion business bumped heads against the young and exciting international visionaries who were shaking up the industry. Using rare library material, never-before-seen personal archives and story-driven interviews, explore a pivotal time in fashion history up close.', '''Kingdom of Dreams'' is a stunning four-part series chronicling three critical decades of the fashion world, from the early 1990s through to the 2010s. Described as a Golden Age, this period of time was an era of disruption and innovation as the traditional fashion business bumped heads against the young and exciting international visionaries who were shaking up the industry. Using rare library material, never-before-seen personal archives and story-driven interviews, explore a pivotal time in fashion history up close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzSMHEY8LUGezMgfVSrqG5pmdF5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213705'),
  ('909737072309177562', 'Kingdom of Plants', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Martin Williams', null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'Sir David discovers a microscopic world that’s invisible to the naked eye, where insects feed and breed, where flowers fluoresce and where plants communicate with each other and with animals using scent and sound.', 'Sir David discovers a microscopic world that’s invisible to the naked eye, where insects feed and breed, where flowers fluoresce and where plants communicate with each other and with animals using scent and sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neQSLfHp7k4VnYJeZgCwNdtH0n6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58775'),
  ('309732013645297760', 'Kingdom of the White Wolf', 2019, 'Documentary', null, 'Neil Shea, Tony Gerber', 'Ronan Donovan', 'TV-PG', 'Ronan Donovan, our expert guide and National Geographic photographer, takes the audience on an intimate exploration of the Arctic during the endless day of the summer months, giving insight to the unexpected abundance of the ''Garden of the Arctic'' in Wolf Valley as he attempts to embed with a wolf family pack.', 'Ronan Donovan, our expert guide and National Geographic photographer, takes the audience on an intimate exploration of the Arctic during the endless day of the summer months, giving insight to the unexpected abundance of the ''Garden of the Arctic'' in Wolf Valley as he attempts to embed with a wolf family pack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf8pJiUEf5N00TxzUyr0HLNva1N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92894'),
  ('211903441079912454', 'Kingdom: Legendary War', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'MAX Changmin, Seo Eun-kwang, Lee Min-hyuk, Lee Chang-sub, Peniel Shin, Jinhwan, Bobby, Yunhyeong', null, 'Who is the best K-POP performer? Let''s throw away all our titles and compete solely through our performances! Here are six K-POP boy groups: the group that ensures your entertainment "BtoB," the idol of the nation "iKON," one-of-a-kind perfect performing group "SF9," group with a strong performance, "THE BOYZ," rising on the global market, "Stray Kids," and a global hot rookie "ATEEZ," who are different in music style and even their debut years. They are gathered here to compete on stage and only on stage. After the missions of recreating their representative songs, covering other groups'' songs, and bringing secret weapons, which group will become a legendary group? Bet everything you have and compete to write a new K-POP history! The performance survival show of global K-POP idols.', 'Who is the best K-POP performer? Let''s throw away all our titles and compete solely through our performances! Here are six K-POP boy groups: the group that ensures your entertainment "BtoB," the idol of the nation "iKON," one-of-a-kind perfect performing group "SF9," group with a strong performance, "THE BOYZ," rising on the global market, "Stray Kids," and a global hot rookie "ATEEZ," who are different in music style and even their debut years. They are gathered here to compete on stage and only on stage. After the missions of recreating their representative songs, covering other groups'' songs, and bringing secret weapons, which group will become a legendary group? Bet everything you have and compete to write a new K-POP history! The performance survival show of global K-POP idols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOfW0Ljkdy8VwSc8mUWuYAG8xq1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118895'),
  ('581586292061554571', 'Kingpin', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Mills', null, 'Yancey Arias, Sheryl Lee, Bobby Cannavale, Angela Alvarado, Brian Benben, Shay Roundtree, Neko Parham, Eduardo Palomo', 'TV-14', 'Kingpin is an American crime drama television series which debuted on the NBC network in the U.S. and CTV in Canada on February 2, 2003 and lasted 6 episodes. NBC''s answer to The Sopranos and also influenced by The Godfather, Macbeth and Traffik, the story was about a Mexican drug trafficker named Miguel Cadena and his family life. It was to be followed by a television series, but low ratings canceled those plans. Commercials for the mini-series on NBC featured the song "Más" by the Mexican band Kinky.', 'Kingpin is an American crime drama television series which debuted on the NBC network in the U.S. and CTV in Canada on February 2, 2003 and lasted 6 episodes. NBC''s answer to The Sopranos and also influenced by The Godfather, Macbeth and Traffik, the story was about a Mexican drug trafficker named Miguel Cadena and his family life. It was to be followed by a television series, but low ratings canceled those plans. Commercials for the mini-series on NBC featured the song "Más" by the Mexican band Kinky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTIeheTQTnCfkqFA16Qhvagv7Qc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4539'),
  ('50020814710026259', 'Kings', 2009, 'Drama', 'Michael Green', null, 'Ian McShane, Christopher Egan, Susanna Thompson, Allison Miller, Eamonn Walker, Sebastian Stan, Dylan Baker', 'TV-14', 'A riveting drama about a modern day monarchy, a contemporary re-telling of the timeless tale of David and Goliath. This series is an epic story of greed and power, war and romance, forbidden loves and secret alliances -- and a young hero who rises to power in a modern-day kingdom.', 'A riveting drama about a modern day monarchy, a contemporary re-telling of the timeless tale of David and Goliath. This series is an epic story of greed and power, war and romance, forbidden loves and secret alliances -- and a young hero who rises to power in a modern-day kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHDKbQ6l4OdgQ9W5OxaA9RP9YMO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7343'),
  ('555382281609348819', 'Kings', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, War & Politics', 'Raphaela Castro', null, 'Vittoria Seixas', null, 'Kings will tell the story of the nation of Israel, from the moment when the last judge, the prophet Samuel, is used by God to guide His people, to the sad fall of Jerusalem, caused by the armies of Babylon.', 'Kings will tell the story of the nation of Israel, from the moment when the last judge, the prophet Samuel, is used by God to guide His people, to the sad fall of Jerusalem, caused by the armies of Babylon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1K8FiVBk9nDAH0TZmkeMVZ5mR5i.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:51018'),
  ('219071955526352501', 'Kings of Jo''Burg', 2020, 'Crime', 'Shona Ferguson', null, 'Zolisa Xaluva, Buhle Samuels, Cindy Mahlangu, Thembi Seete, Connie Ferguson, Abdul Khoza, Altovise Lawrence, Clint Brink', 'TV-MA', 'The Masire brothers rule Johannesburg''s criminal underworld, but a supernatural family curse and a tangled web of betrayal threaten to destroy them.', 'The Masire brothers rule Johannesburg''s criminal underworld, but a supernatural family curse and a tangled web of betrayal threaten to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSM1FB86gr3QNelkk0jDovN5228.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114187'),
  ('63129183841036363', 'Kinmoza!', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Asuka Nishi, Manami Tanaka, Risa Taneda, Yumi Uchiyama, Nao Toyama, Satomi Sato, Yukari Tamura', 'TV-PG', 'The story begins with Oomiya Shinobu, a 15-year-old, seemingly pure Japanese girl who actually did a homestay in Great Britain. Even after coming back to Japan, she still misses her time overseas. One day, an airmail letter arrives from Alice, the girl in Shinobu''s host family in Great Britain. The letter reads: Shinobu, I''m coming to Japan! The Japanese/British girls'' mixed comedy follows the lives of Shinobu, Alice, and other girls from both Japan and Great Britain.', 'The story begins with Oomiya Shinobu, a 15-year-old, seemingly pure Japanese girl who actually did a homestay in Great Britain. Even after coming back to Japan, she still misses her time overseas. One day, an airmail letter arrives from Alice, the girl in Shinobu''s host family in Great Britain. The letter reads: Shinobu, I''m coming to Japan! The Japanese/British girls'' mixed comedy follows the lives of Shinobu, Alice, and other girls from both Japan and Great Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMIbQh40ahkj24qEUGVl8QbXqVC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78589'),
  ('1029606469100216178', 'Kinnikuman', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akira Kamiya', null, 'Kinnikuman (real name Suguru Kinniku), is a clumsy, foolish, comical superhero who discovers that he is the missing prince of the planet Kinniku (known for producing the greatest superheroes in the universe). Since he is a clumsy fool, however, he must prove himself worthy of the throne. To do so he enters wrestling competitions and battles evil Chojin.', 'Kinnikuman (real name Suguru Kinniku), is a clumsy, foolish, comical superhero who discovers that he is the missing prince of the planet Kinniku (known for producing the greatest superheroes in the universe). Since he is a clumsy fool, however, he must prove himself worthy of the throne. To do so he enters wrestling competitions and battles evil Chojin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/910k2Q2RlPNYbIj50gOUuAJlCjX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43231'),
  ('784307186656214688', 'Kinnikuman Perfect Origin Arc', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Akira Kamiya, Kendo Kobayashi, Daisuke Ono, Katsuyuki Konishi, Sumire Uesaka, Tomokazu Seki, Jun Kasama', 'TV-MA', 'Kinnikuman returns to the ring in an epic three-way battle between the Seigi, Akuma and Perfect Chojin factions and reveals the roots of the Chojin.', 'Kinnikuman returns to the ring in an epic three-way battle between the Seigi, Akuma and Perfect Chojin factions and reveals the roots of the Chojin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkhMzWi33pPpyxJDwAs3xiqLiGA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236000'),
  ('162177073599175308', 'KinnPorsche: The Series', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Sitthichai Panya, Patchayamon Theewasujaroen', null, 'Phakphum Romsaithong, Nattawin Wattanagitiphat, Wichapas Sumettikul, Jakapan Puttha, Jeff Satur, Tinnasit Isarapongporn, Nannakun Pakapatpornpob, Thanayut Thakoonauttaya', null, 'Porsche agrees to guard mafia heir Kinn for his family''s sake, but fighting off danger soon turns into fighting his own feelings.', 'Porsche agrees to guard mafia heir Kinn for his family''s sake, but fighting off danger soon turns into fighting his own feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdPLe50HbZHsETXQRcIP8gw7cKz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117067'),
