  ('1077378234619981341', 'Kleo', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Bob Konrad, Richard Kropf, Hanno Hackfort', null, 'Jella Haase, Dimitrij Schaad', 'TV-MA', 'After the fall of the Berlin Wall, a former East German spy resolves to find out who betrayed her and why — and use her lethal skills to exact revenge.', 'After the fall of the Berlin Wall, a former East German spy resolves to find out who betrayed her and why — and use her lethal skills to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs72cJXRYay3kuZaEiHB0EYhQtJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:206010'),
  ('1047259851977102875', 'Klinik am Südring', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Frederik Seehauser', null, 'At the Klinik am Südring, real doctors and nurses offer an insight into the unknown world of medicine and everyday hospital life: exciting medical research into causes and treatment meets personal stories. Our hospital staff are the heroes of the stories and always find a solution, are competent, empathetic and always there for the patients with a lot of heart and time.', 'At the Klinik am Südring, real doctors and nurses offer an insight into the unknown world of medicine and everyday hospital life: exciting medical research into causes and treatment meets personal stories. Our hospital staff are the heroes of the stories and always find a solution, are competent, empathetic and always there for the patients with a lot of heart and time.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:82550'),
  ('629714380895861647', 'Klondike', 2014, 'Drama, Western', 'Paul T. Scheuring, Rachel Abramowitz, Simon Cellan Jones', 'Charlotte Gray', 'Richard Madden, Augustus Prew, Abbie Cornish, Conor Leslie, Marton Csokas, Ian Hart, Greg Lawson, Tim Blake Nelson', null, 'The lives of two childhood best friends, Bill and Epstein, in the late 1890s as they flock to the gold rush capital in the untamed Yukon Territory. This man-versus-nature tale places our heroes in a land full of undiscovered wealth, but ravaged by harsh conditions, unpredictable weather and desperate, dangerous characters including greedy businessmen, seductive courtesans and native tribes witnessing the destruction of their people and land by opportunistic entrepreneurs.', 'The lives of two childhood best friends, Bill and Epstein, in the late 1890s as they flock to the gold rush capital in the untamed Yukon Territory. This man-versus-nature tale places our heroes in a land full of undiscovered wealth, but ravaged by harsh conditions, unpredictable weather and desperate, dangerous characters including greedy businessmen, seductive courtesans and native tribes witnessing the destruction of their people and land by opportunistic entrepreneurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GefrF8K5fqyiHoMF0M5Qh8LCi5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57389'),
  ('500028074715093072', 'Klopjacht', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Axel Daeseleire', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vW6VPpsviaIKyeyFMhfQ8RgMWLL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:131493'),
  ('274488809832919953', 'Klovn', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam', 'Frank Hvam, Casper Christensen', 'Casper Christensen, Frank Hvam, Mia Lyhne, Camilla Lehmann', null, 'Klovn is a Danish sitcom, which first aired on the Danish TV channel TV2 Zulu. It focuses on the life of the main character Frank and Casper. The show builds its comedy around quiet everyday situations, social awkwardness, uncomfortable silences and general faux pas. Klovn usually gets compared to the American sitcom Curb Your Enthusiasm by Larry David. It’s also shot handheld, in a pseudo-realistic style. Some have also mistakenly compared the theme to Curb Your Enthusiasm’s, despite it being a direct reference to Jacques Tati’s Mr. Hulot movies. The poster for the first film can be seen in Casper and Frank’s offices throughout the series. Klovn initially ran 6 seasons on TV2 Zulu from 2005-2009 and was renewed with an additional 3 seasons that aired from 2018-2022.', 'Klovn is a Danish sitcom, which first aired on the Danish TV channel TV2 Zulu. It focuses on the life of the main character Frank and Casper. The show builds its comedy around quiet everyday situations, social awkwardness, uncomfortable silences and general faux pas. Klovn usually gets compared to the American sitcom Curb Your Enthusiasm by Larry David. It’s also shot handheld, in a pseudo-realistic style. Some have also mistakenly compared the theme to Curb Your Enthusiasm’s, despite it being a direct reference to Jacques Tati’s Mr. Hulot movies. The poster for the first film can be seen in Casper and Frank’s offices throughout the series. Klovn initially ran 6 seasons on TV2 Zulu from 2005-2009 and was renewed with an additional 3 seasons that aired from 2018-2022.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lq4lTNeScVNoulCBUhtSTif5R6N.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:367'),
  ('183051708974442092', 'Knallerfrauen', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Martina Hill', null, 'Martina Hill, Michael Krabbe, Peggy Lukac, Marc Ben Puch, Claus Dieter Clausnitzer, Anna Schäfer, Matthias Deutelmoser', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWQOI7xf4ySqe4e4qXtWnpBTigr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:53130'),
  ('1049416318545573791', 'Knight Flower', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, 'Lee Saem, Jung Myung-in', 'Lee Hanee, Lee Jong-won, Kim Sang-joong, Jung Yong-ju, Lee Ki-woo, Park Se-hyun, Kim Mi-kyeong, Seo Yi-sook', null, 'Cho Yeo Hwa has been a widow for 15 years. Her in-laws are the most prestigious noble family in the kingdom. During the day, she leads the life of a widow devoted entirely to her dead husband''s memory and rarely ventures outside the gate of her home. At night, Yeo Hwa dons the mask of Hero, who secretly jumps over the surrounding wall to save the helpless.', 'Cho Yeo Hwa has been a widow for 15 years. Her in-laws are the most prestigious noble family in the kingdom. During the day, she leads the life of a widow devoted entirely to her dead husband''s memory and rarely ventures outside the gate of her home. At night, Yeo Hwa dons the mask of Hero, who secretly jumps over the surrounding wall to save the helpless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJDtFBsYkgqprDTqRCEA43FoiZp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220836'),
  ('49943443446370111', 'Knight Hunters', 1998, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Tomokazu Seki, Hikaru Midorikawa, Takehito Koyasu, Hiro Yuuki, Ryusei Nakao, Jurota Kosugi, Mami Horikoshi', null, 'Four assassins, members of a group called Weiß, work out of a flower shop called Kitty in the House.', 'Four assassins, members of a group called Weiß, work out of a flower shop called Kitty in the House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqfslCawWxdagvEjcndZRcmJWD7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34165'),
  ('1085735822730353534', 'Knight Rider', 1982, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'David Hasselhoff, Edward Mulhare, William Daniels, Patricia McPherson, Peter Parros', 'TV-PG', 'Michael Long, an undercover police officer, is shot while investigating a case and left for dead by his assailants. He is rescued by Wilton Knight, a wealthy, dying millionaire and inventor who arranges life-saving surgery, including a new face and a new identity--that of Michael Knight. Michael is then given a special computerized and indestructible car called the Knight Industries Two Thousand (nicknamed KITT), and a mission: apprehend criminals who are beyond the reach of the law. The series depicts Michael''s exploits as he and KITT battle the forces of evil on behalf of the Foundation for Law and Government.', 'Michael Long, an undercover police officer, is shot while investigating a case and left for dead by his assailants. He is rescued by Wilton Knight, a wealthy, dying millionaire and inventor who arranges life-saving surgery, including a new face and a new identity--that of Michael Knight. Michael is then given a special computerized and indestructible car called the Knight Industries Two Thousand (nicknamed KITT), and a mission: apprehend criminals who are beyond the reach of the law. The series depicts Michael''s exploits as he and KITT battle the forces of evil on behalf of the Foundation for Law and Government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t57NXzTrwp5rnPXiaX4BThrDxt1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2384'),
  ('152424608234925122', 'Knight Rider', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Justin Bruening, Deanna Russo, Bruce Davison, Sydney Tamiia Poitier, Yancey Arias, Paul Campbell, Smith Cho, Val Kilmer', 'TV-14', 'On the heels of NBC''s hit movie, the iconic 1980s television classic comes roaring back to life as a reinvented, updated and super-charged action series showcasing the new KITT (Knight Industries Three Thousand). Absolutely the coolest car ever created, KITT is equipped with an "AI" (artificial intelligence) that is capable of hacking almost any system. Its weapons systems match that of a jet fighter, and its body is capable of actually transforming into other vehicles and using sophisticated holographic imagery to elude villains.', 'On the heels of NBC''s hit movie, the iconic 1980s television classic comes roaring back to life as a reinvented, updated and super-charged action series showcasing the new KITT (Knight Industries Three Thousand). Absolutely the coolest car ever created, KITT is equipped with an "AI" (artificial intelligence) that is capable of hacking almost any system. Its weapons systems match that of a jet fighter, and its body is capable of actually transforming into other vehicles and using sophisticated holographic imagery to elude villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e93H0P6GYoDUhHR5uCdmfLDAvKt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15655'),
  ('259445658815361992', 'Knight Squad', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Sean William Cunningham', null, 'Owen Patrick Joyner, Daniella Taylor', 'TV-G', 'Two mismatched students at a magical school for knights in training form an unlikely alliance to protect each other’s secret and pursue their dreams.', 'Two mismatched students at a magical school for knights in training form an unlikely alliance to protect each other’s secret and pursue their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygglLYvILADpfl0RqwutWiZt3xs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75419'),
  ('1010307226082821001', 'Knight''s & Magic', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Shinsuke Sugawara, Ayaka Ohashi, Atsushi Imaruoka, Hidetaka Tenjin, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Masaru Ikeda, Natsumi Fujiwara', 'TV-14', 'A mecha otaku is reincarnated into another world as Ernesti Echevarria, also known as Eru. In this world, huge humanoid weapons known as Silhouette Knights exist. Dreaming of piloting those robots, Eru and his friends, Archid Olter and Adeltrud Olter, aim to become Knight Runners.', 'A mecha otaku is reincarnated into another world as Ernesti Echevarria, also known as Eru. In this world, huge humanoid weapons known as Silhouette Knights exist. Dreaming of piloting those robots, Eru and his friends, Archid Olter and Adeltrud Olter, aim to become Knight Runners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDzFHkWvZ0JGRsGesVTQE0S7Itu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72635'),
  ('757158802925814467', 'Knightfall', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Don Handfield, Richard Rayner', null, 'Tom Cullen, Pádraic Delaney, Simon Merrells, Julian Ovenden, Ed Stoppard, Nasser Memarzia, Jim High, Mark Hamill', 'TV-14', 'Go deep into the clandestine world of the legendary brotherhood of warrior monks known as The Knights Templar.', 'Go deep into the clandestine world of the legendary brotherhood of warrior monks known as The Knights Templar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5T3VJOF4ti3ep6JXqSgyzSGdv0h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:73117'),
  ('203257932490498042', 'Knightmare', 1987, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Tim Child', null, 'Hugo Myatt, Jackie Sawiris, Joanne Heywood, David Learner, Bill Cashmore, John Woodnutt', null, 'Knightmare is a British television programme for children and was broadcast on CITV from 7 September 1987 to 11 November 1994. An adventure game show, Knightmare involves a team of four children – one taking the role of the sightless dungeoneer, and the remaining three acting as their guide – traversing a medieval environment as they attempt to complete a quest and exit the dungeon, using their wits to overcome puzzles, obstacles and the unusual characters they meet along the journey. The show is most noted for its use of blue screen chroma key and use of ''virtual reality'' interactive gameplay on television. Broadcast to high viewing figures throughout its original run, it has garnered a cult status amongst its fans since its final television episode in 1994. It was revived for a one off special by YouTube in August 2013.', 'Knightmare is a British television programme for children and was broadcast on CITV from 7 September 1987 to 11 November 1994. An adventure game show, Knightmare involves a team of four children – one taking the role of the sightless dungeoneer, and the remaining three acting as their guide – traversing a medieval environment as they attempt to complete a quest and exit the dungeon, using their wits to overcome puzzles, obstacles and the unusual characters they meet along the journey. The show is most noted for its use of blue screen chroma key and use of ''virtual reality'' interactive gameplay on television. Broadcast to high viewing figures throughout its original run, it has garnered a cult status amongst its fans since its final television episode in 1994. It was revived for a one off special by YouTube in August 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hg8pctFXEAvoJfjAAQk8TI9dWHf.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2509'),
  ('554701834435537681', 'Knights of Bloodsteel', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Michael Heltay, Robin T. Rose, Carrie Anne Fleming, David James Elliott, Mackenzie Gray, Adrian Hough, Gwynyth Walsh, Heather Doerksen', 'TV-14', 'Once a paradise fueled by the all-powerful sorcery-grade metal known as bloodsteel, the distant land of Mirabilis begins to decay as supplies of the supernatural substance dwindle. The evil warlord Dragon Eye fights to gain control of the world''s supply of bloodsteel, which he will use to rule Mirabilis. But, an ancient prophecy propels four ordinary citizens to battle Dragon Eye. Their quest is to find the fabled Crucible - source of all bloodsteel - before the corrupt forces of darkness destroy their world.', 'Once a paradise fueled by the all-powerful sorcery-grade metal known as bloodsteel, the distant land of Mirabilis begins to decay as supplies of the supernatural substance dwindle. The evil warlord Dragon Eye fights to gain control of the world''s supply of bloodsteel, which he will use to rule Mirabilis. But, an ancient prophecy propels four ordinary citizens to battle Dragon Eye. Their quest is to find the fabled Crucible - source of all bloodsteel - before the corrupt forces of darkness destroy their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOmxB1ksrNydw041ecLRFf3W2Fo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31768'),
  ('526151603244738688', 'Knights of Sidonia', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Sayaka Ohara, Takahiro Sakurai, Aki Toyosaki, Tomohiro Tsuboi, Hisako Kanemoto, Satomi Arai, Eri Kitamura', 'TV-14', 'An alien race called Gauna has destroyed Earth. leaving humanity struggling to survive aboard the spaceship Sidonia. Even though it’s been a century since the last encounter with the Gauna, military service is mandatory. For Nagate Tanikaze, whose grandfather secretly hid him in the forgotten bowels of Sidonia, it’s a strange new world as he’s forced to come to the surface. Yet his recruitment comes just in time, for the Gauna have suddenly reappeared.', 'An alien race called Gauna has destroyed Earth. leaving humanity struggling to survive aboard the spaceship Sidonia. Even though it’s been a century since the last encounter with the Gauna, military service is mandatory. For Nagate Tanikaze, whose grandfather secretly hid him in the forgotten bowels of Sidonia, it’s a strange new world as he’s forced to come to the surface. Yet his recruitment comes just in time, for the Gauna have suddenly reappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGTx2Ec25bWjtanJe7D5vUmQUkA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60831'),
  ('1129990176871731121', 'Knock on My Door in Moscow', 2024, 'Drama', 'Vsevolod Aravin', null, null, null, 'Sasha Gordeeva, an excellent student, dreamed of a career as a landscape designer, but dropped out of her last year of university due to the fact that her personal scholarship was canceled without explanation. Offended, the girl decides to take revenge on the owner of the company that took away her scholarship, a young and talented architect Sergei Gradsky. But their acquaintance turns into a surprise — Sasha will get not only the opportunity to finish his studies, but also a place in Sergei''s company if he pretends to be his girlfriend for two months so that he can get his ex back.', 'Sasha Gordeeva, an excellent student, dreamed of a career as a landscape designer, but dropped out of her last year of university due to the fact that her personal scholarship was canceled without explanation. Offended, the girl decides to take revenge on the owner of the company that took away her scholarship, a young and talented architect Sergei Gradsky. But their acquaintance turns into a surprise — Sasha will get not only the opportunity to finish his studies, but also a place in Sergei''s company if he pretends to be his girlfriend for two months so that he can get his ex back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQzB7VytvnhIGouw070wlmgrqlR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246273'),
  ('802100530264381280', 'Knock Out', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Dawin', null, 'Natsakan Chairote, Boripat Jamsat, Kantapon Chompupan, Narongdet Rungarun, Wiset Pakjaidee, Thanakrit Talasopon, Jakarin Puribhat, Rawipa Srisanguan', null, 'After losing everything, Keen finds refuge in a Muay Thai gym and forms a bond with Than, a silent fighter carrying deep scars.', 'After losing everything, Keen finds refuge in a Muay Thai gym and forms a bond with Than, a silent fighter carrying deep scars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDRm2U656Z91DyiD8FnKvQPcBCt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240975'),
  ('702258589239071773', 'Knot to Treasure', 1994, null, null, null, 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Nadia Chan Chung-Ling, Marianne Chan, Louis Koo, Paul Chu Kong, Lester Chan Chit-Man, Cheung Fung-Lei, Mary Hon Ma-Lee', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUyWNozYvaIKYCyEgSHYRdHhUyY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109254'),
  ('602330561425892483', 'Knots Landing', 1979, 'Drama, Soap', 'Michael Filerman, David Jacobs', null, 'Michele Lee, Ted Shackelford, Kevin Dobson, William Devane, Nicollette Sheridan, Michelle Phillips, Stacy Galina, Kathleen Noone', 'NR', 'The domestic adventures, misdeeds and everyday interactions of five families living on a cul-de-sac in a small California community.', 'The domestic adventures, misdeeds and everyday interactions of five families living on a cul-de-sac in a small California community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohcRf8CyVpQiUw2ZTmGQ2I4fH8D.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:2595'),
  ('294037824910716140', 'Knowing Me Knowing You with Alan Partridge', 1994, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Armando Iannucci, Steve Coogan, Patrick Marber', null, 'Steve Coogan, Steve Brown', null, 'Knowing Me Knowing You with Alan Partridge is a BBC Television series of six episodes, and a Christmas special in 1995. It is named after the song "Knowing Me, Knowing You" by ABBA, which was used as the show''s title music. Steve Coogan played the incompetent but self-satisfied Norwich-based host, Alan Partridge. Alan was a spin-off character from the spoof radio show On the Hour. Knowing Me Knowing You was written by Coogan, Armando Iannucci and Patrick Marber, with contributions from the regular supporting cast of Doon Mackichan, Rebecca Front and David Schneider, who played Alan''s weekly guests. Steve Brown provided the show''s music and arrangements, and also appeared as Glen Ponder, the man in charge of the house band. The show was a parody of a chat show. It featured a live audience whose laughter meant that viewers could not mistake the show for a real chat show. Alan went on to appear in two series of the sitcom I''m Alan Partridge, following his life after both his marriage and TV career come to an end.', 'Knowing Me Knowing You with Alan Partridge is a BBC Television series of six episodes, and a Christmas special in 1995. It is named after the song "Knowing Me, Knowing You" by ABBA, which was used as the show''s title music. Steve Coogan played the incompetent but self-satisfied Norwich-based host, Alan Partridge. Alan was a spin-off character from the spoof radio show On the Hour. Knowing Me Knowing You was written by Coogan, Armando Iannucci and Patrick Marber, with contributions from the regular supporting cast of Doon Mackichan, Rebecca Front and David Schneider, who played Alan''s weekly guests. Steve Brown provided the show''s music and arrangements, and also appeared as Glen Ponder, the man in charge of the house band. The show was a parody of a chat show. It featured a live audience whose laughter meant that viewers could not mistake the show for a real chat show. Alan went on to appear in two series of the sitcom I''m Alan Partridge, following his life after both his marriage and TV career come to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mr2xRXoz8NoWu0oIUYXcnMgKLW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:960'),
  ('1092070800072190748', 'Knuckles', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'John Whittington, Toby Ascher', null, 'Idris Elba, Adam Pally', 'TV-PG', 'Knuckles embarks on a hilarious and action-packed journey of self-discovery as he agrees to train Wade as his protégé and teach him the ways of the Echidna warrior.', 'Knuckles embarks on a hilarious and action-packed journey of self-discovery as he agrees to train Wade as his protégé and teach him the ways of the Echidna warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK6Nr6KNUA4WlAHyNBTioz9FK87.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158300'),
  ('257614920567781640', 'KO One', 2005, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, '齊錫麟', 'Jiro Wang, Aaron Yan, Danson Tang, Pets Tseng, Melody Yin, Ma Zhenhuan, Wes Lo, Wen Yu-Fei', null, 'Gifted with special powers, fighting skills and slick hair, the rowdy KO One navigates tough friendships and high school romance.', 'Gifted with special powers, fighting skills and slick hair, the rowdy KO One navigates tough friendships and high school romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnrWCtRdYUiVMTTnAWvGLYXUj6I.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1149'),
  ('1138938780630335677', 'Koala Man', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Cusack', null, 'Michael Cusack, Sarah Snook, Demi Lardner', 'TV-MA', 'A powerless superhero and family patriarch in an Australian suburb lives a not-so-secret identity as Koala Man while possessing a burning passion to snuff out petty crime and bring order the community.', 'A powerless superhero and family patriarch in an Australian suburb lives a not-so-secret identity as Koala Man while possessing a burning passion to snuff out petty crime and bring order the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omhNXYjGpx0d3ovdTSLh27XjXCa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121567'),
  ('970839509118401376', 'Koala''s Diary', 2025, 'Animation', null, null, 'Aya Uchida', null, 'Koala writes about daily life, whether it''s good or bad, happy or sad. Koala treats every day as a precious day.', 'Koala writes about daily life, whether it''s good or bad, happy or sad. Koala treats every day as a precious day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IwLOuBjc9JhkJbkcyMft7OfKJK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296933'),
  ('567454234761567450', 'Kobato.', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tsubaki Nekoi, Satsuki Igarashi, Nanase Okawa', null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Tetsu Inada, Chiwa Saito, Daisuke Namikawa, Fumiko Orikasa, Hiroshi Kamiya, Houko Kuwashima, Megumi Nakajima', 'NR', 'Kobato is a girl who came to earth to fulfill her wish, which is to go to a certain place. To fulfill that wish, she has to find a bottle and fill it with scarred hearts. Together with her "teacher," which is a stuffed animal, she search for the scarred hearts. However she may not fall in love with any person whom she cures the heart of.', 'Kobato is a girl who came to earth to fulfill her wish, which is to go to a certain place. To fulfill that wish, she has to find a bottle and fill it with scarred hearts. Together with her "teacher," which is a stuffed animal, she search for the scarred hearts. However she may not fall in love with any person whom she cures the heart of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aWll5Yav9SWVH4TYVJUpR0aP5u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46344'),
  ('220702323643915110', 'KochiKame', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime, Family, Action & Adventure', null, 'Osamu Akimoto', 'LaSalle Ishii, Haruki Sayama, Yuko Doi, Shigeru Ushiyama, Yumi Morio, Maya Okamoto, Jin Nishimura, Mitsuru Miyamoto', null, 'Ryotsu Kankichi, or Ryo-san for short, is an unconventional cop working at the local police station who loves money. Together with famous celebrities like Nakagawa and Reiko, his strict boss Police Chief Ohara, and other wildly unique characters, he gets everyone caught up in all sorts of hijinks!', 'Ryotsu Kankichi, or Ryo-san for short, is an unconventional cop working at the local police station who loves money. Together with famous celebrities like Nakagawa and Reiko, his strict boss Police Chief Ohara, and other wildly unique characters, he gets everyone caught up in all sorts of hijinks!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujltFuzCZ9FLe07kTRLZ2gpIJVY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56426'),
  ('306577542148754107', 'Kocktails With Khloé', 2016, 'Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Khloé Kardashian, Sharone Hakman', 'TV-14', 'Kocktails with Khloé raises the bar on the fun, surprising and real conversation that happens when friends get together at home to dish on their lives, pop culture, fashion, celebrity gossip and more. The series will reflect what Khloé does at her own home: hosting meals, sharing opinions and experiences, encouraging fun and honesty, and inviting friends to join the party. Taped in Los Angeles, the non-traditional set for Kocktails with Khloé is designed to replicate a true, intimate home environment; as such, it will feature a functional kitchen, dining area and living spaces – but it will not include a studio audience. In each episode, celebrity guests – including Khloé''s friends and family – will join her in the kitchen and around the table for a lively dinner party where engaging and relevant conversations will pair with cooking, party games and, of course, Kocktails. Adding to the elegant and fun party atmosphere will be Chef Sharone Hakman who will collaborate on menus and assist in entertaining.', 'Kocktails with Khloé raises the bar on the fun, surprising and real conversation that happens when friends get together at home to dish on their lives, pop culture, fashion, celebrity gossip and more. The series will reflect what Khloé does at her own home: hosting meals, sharing opinions and experiences, encouraging fun and honesty, and inviting friends to join the party. Taped in Los Angeles, the non-traditional set for Kocktails with Khloé is designed to replicate a true, intimate home environment; as such, it will feature a functional kitchen, dining area and living spaces – but it will not include a studio audience. In each episode, celebrity guests – including Khloé''s friends and family – will join her in the kitchen and around the table for a lively dinner party where engaging and relevant conversations will pair with cooking, party games and, of course, Kocktails. Adding to the elegant and fun party atmosphere will be Chef Sharone Hakman who will collaborate on menus and assist in entertaining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6kzfVC7ZBkv5jNNzRyom5esgn8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65387'),
  ('622609735361556660', 'Kodocha', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Miho Obana', null, 'Shizue Oda, Ryou Naitou, Tatsuya Nakazaki, Hana Kino, Harumi Ikoma', 'NR', 'Sana Kurata has a charmed life. Not only is her mother is a famous, award-winning writer, but she''s the star of the hit TV comedy "Child''s Toy" while still in the fifth grade. But Sana''s biggest concern is Akito Hayama, a pint-sized hellion who''s organized the boys in their grade-school class into a mass of unending noise and violence. With the help of Rei, her manager, chauffeur and "pimp," Sana is determined to win back control of the classroom from her new arch-enemy. But as her crusade continues, Sana moves further into Akito''s life, and finds that he might not be entirely bad...or entirely safe.', 'Sana Kurata has a charmed life. Not only is her mother is a famous, award-winning writer, but she''s the star of the hit TV comedy "Child''s Toy" while still in the fifth grade. But Sana''s biggest concern is Akito Hayama, a pint-sized hellion who''s organized the boys in their grade-school class into a mass of unending noise and violence. With the help of Rei, her manager, chauffeur and "pimp," Sana is determined to win back control of the classroom from her new arch-enemy. But as her crusade continues, Sana moves further into Akito''s life, and finds that he might not be entirely bad...or entirely safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMv1xkUW2Il4HierrlzNrs8fyqo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25722'),
  ('757295042115921633', 'Kodomo no Jikan', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Yuri Amano, Yuichi Ishigami, Tomokazu Sugita, Yoko Soumi, Mai Kadowaki, Hikaru Isshiki, Kei Shindo', null, '23-year-old school teacher Aoki Daisuke has a huge problem. One of his students, Kokonoe Rin, has proclaimed herself to be Daisuke-sensei''s girlfriend and is now on the warpath to win him over or get him fired.', '23-year-old school teacher Aoki Daisuke has a huge problem. One of his students, Kokonoe Rin, has proclaimed herself to be Daisuke-sensei''s girlfriend and is now on the warpath to win him over or get him fired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6BeXOpOkP3lF0uHw99nUiWbAzb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46179'),
  ('572048064171290486', 'Koe de Oshigoto', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayaka Hirao, Yoshino Nakada, Akeno Watanabe, Shinya Takahashi, Masami Suzuki, Susumu Chiba, Fumi Morisawa, Takehiro Murozono', null, 'Koe de Oshigoto!, also known by the short title KoeGoto, is a 2008–2013 manga series by Azure Konno, about a girl working as a voice actress for an eroge development company. It was serialized in Wani Books'' monthly Comic Gum magazine. A two-episode anime adptation was produced by Studio Gokumi and released in 2010 and 2011.', 'Koe de Oshigoto!, also known by the short title KoeGoto, is a 2008–2013 manga series by Azure Konno, about a girl working as a voice actress for an eroge development company. It was serialized in Wani Books'' monthly Comic Gum magazine. A two-episode anime adptation was produced by Studio Gokumi and released in 2010 and 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNi4YrVEyscDIytxI8w85X7O5PQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38605'),
  ('481355688771262991', 'Koffee with Karan', 2004, 'Talk', 'Karan Johar', null, 'Karan Johar', 'TV-MA', 'Koffee with Karan is an Indian talk show hosted by filmmaker and television personality Karan Johar and produced by Dharmatic Entertainment, the digital content division of Johar''s production company Dharma Productions', 'Koffee with Karan is an Indian talk show hosted by filmmaker and television personality Karan Johar and produced by Dharmatic Entertainment, the digital content division of Johar''s production company Dharma Productions', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyaDqO917xzA0iQwtdMPHC5oJVV.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:14544'),
  ('1019273098305054241', 'Kogarashi Monjiro', 1972, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kon Ichikawa', null, 'Atsuo Nakamura, Takayuki Akutagawa', null, 'Monjiro was born into a poor farm family in Mikazuki Village, Nitta County, Ueshu, and abandoned his hometown when he was 10 years old. He has been traveling aimlessly with a long toothpick in his mouth. Monjiro avoided getting involved in anything, but wherever he went, he ended up getting involved in incidents', 'Monjiro was born into a poor farm family in Mikazuki Village, Nitta County, Ueshu, and abandoned his hometown when he was 10 years old. He has been traveling aimlessly with a long toothpick in his mouth. Monjiro avoided getting involved in anything, but wherever he went, he ended up getting involved in incidents', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oY7gNl0DfG1mHmmAASoPz9WH70k.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229237'),
  ('661479683506881902', 'Koh-Lanta', 2001, 'Reality', 'Charlie Parsons', null, null, 'NR', 'Fourteen to eighteen contestants have to survive on an uninhabited island for 40 days (20 days in the special editions). It''s up to them to find food to accompany the meagre ration of rice provided at the start of the adventure. They have to build a shelter to protect themselves from the elements (bad weather, insects, etc.) and maintain the fire that they managed to build or that they won in the first comfort test.', 'Fourteen to eighteen contestants have to survive on an uninhabited island for 40 days (20 days in the special editions). It''s up to them to find food to accompany the meagre ration of rice provided at the start of the adventure. They have to build a shelter to protect themselves from the elements (bad weather, insects, etc.) and maintain the fire that they managed to build or that they won in the first comfort test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6hw3Q2NLWZY3TkpfePFqeGLtVJ.jpg', 33, 'tmdb:tv:67997'),
  ('837555788020987172', 'Kohlrabenschwarz', 2023, 'Crime, Comedy, Mystery', 'Tommy Krappweis, Christian von Aster', 'Matthias Thönnissen', 'Michael Kessler, Bettina Lamprecht, Bettina Zimmermann, Peter Ketnath, Jürgen Tonkel, Axel Milberg, Tim Seyfi, Sogol Faghani', null, 'The focus is on the psychologist Stefan Schwab, who after overwork, burnout and divorce is actually just looking for the proverbial “Boarische Rua” ("Bavarian peace") in the tranquil foothills of the Alps. However, this wish is not fulfilled; instead, he is reluctantly drawn into the bloody awakening of ancient legends: children disappear, “sinners” are murdered and archaic legends suddenly take on a deadly relevance.', 'The focus is on the psychologist Stefan Schwab, who after overwork, burnout and divorce is actually just looking for the proverbial “Boarische Rua” ("Bavarian peace") in the tranquil foothills of the Alps. However, this wish is not fulfilled; instead, he is reluctantly drawn into the bloody awakening of ancient legends: children disappear, “sinners” are murdered and archaic legends suddenly take on a deadly relevance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iARrrwxjLC9tIlSSB2O4n8VUbM4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227047'),
  ('581306097342891949', 'Kohrra', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Diggi Sisodia, Sudip Sharma, Gunjit Chopra', null, 'Barun Sobti, Muskan Arora, Mona Singh, Rannvijay Singha, Davinder Singh Gill, Anuraag Arora', 'TV-MA', 'When an NRI bridegroom is found dead days before his wedding in the countryside of Punjab, two cops must unravel the troubling case as turbulence unfolds in their own lives.', 'When an NRI bridegroom is found dead days before his wedding in the countryside of Punjab, two cops must unravel the troubling case as turbulence unfolds in their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZbiASZweEKFOHsl56QTeNJ6a8R.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230034'),
  ('506530642681062439', 'Koi Kaze', 2004, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Miyu Matsuki, Yuki Nakamura, Kenta Miyake, Yuko Kato, Risa Shimizu, Akemi Okamura, Kousuke Okano, Ryoka Yuzuki', 'NR', 'Koshiro and Nanoka fall deeply in love, then discover they are the children of their divorced estranged parents... making them brother and sister. How will their relationship turn out?', 'Koshiro and Nanoka fall deeply in love, then discover they are the children of their divorced estranged parents... making them brother and sister. How will their relationship turn out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91EOvXwhKkNh72eynkn46BsATqx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42861'),
  ('568852073890625321', 'Koikimo', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yurie Kozakai, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Rena Hasegawa, Junya Enoki, Kana Hanazawa, Ryohei Kimura', 'TV-14', 'One rainy day, salaryman Amakusa Ryo is saved by a high school girl he doesn''t know at the station. He later finds out that the girl is Arima Ichika. Ryo is somewhat of a womanizer and to repay her for saving him, he suggests giving her a kiss or going out on a date with her, in which Ichika tells him he''s creepy. This, however, opens a new door for Ryo and he falls madly in love with her. Ever since then, Ryo tries to overly express his feelings to Ichika. Ichika just keeps insulting him and says he''s being creepy, but he just seems to take it as her way of showing affection towards him...', 'One rainy day, salaryman Amakusa Ryo is saved by a high school girl he doesn''t know at the station. He later finds out that the girl is Arima Ichika. Ryo is somewhat of a womanizer and to repay her for saving him, he suggests giving her a kiss or going out on a date with her, in which Ichika tells him he''s creepy. This, however, opens a new door for Ryo and he falls madly in love with her. Ever since then, Ryo tries to overly express his feelings to Ichika. Ichika just keeps insulting him and says he''s being creepy, but he just seems to take it as her way of showing affection towards him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPS6ip5T0W823Z0rlDhopXI6i1h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98309'),
  ('433310463153474539', 'Kojak', 1973, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Abby Mann', null, 'Telly Savalas, Dan Frazer, Kevin Dobson, George Savalas, Mark Russell, Vince Conti', 'TV-PG', 'A bald, lollipop sucking police detective with a fiery righteous attitude battles crime in New York City.', 'A bald, lollipop sucking police detective with a fiery righteous attitude battles crime in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F1eH97Bpi8zQbc172drbJCsOsG.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3572'),
  ('838458866605171651', 'Kokdu: Season of Deity', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kim Ho-jun', 'Kang Yi-heon, Heo Jun-woo', 'Kim Jung-hyun, Im Soo-hyang, An Woo-yeon, Kim Da-som, Cha Chung-hwa, Kim In-kwon, Lee Jung-jun, Choi Gwang-il', null, 'A fantasy medical drama about a high-ranking grim reaper named Kkok Du, who is the only being to exist in the underworld. Every 99 years, the cold and cruel Kkok Du must take a break from his job in the underworld and spend 49 days in the mortal realm—and this time, he winds up inhabiting the body of the human Do Jin Woo. While living as Do Jin Woo, he meets Han Gye Jeol, a female doctor who has the mysterious ability to order Kkok Du around.', 'A fantasy medical drama about a high-ranking grim reaper named Kkok Du, who is the only being to exist in the underworld. Every 99 years, the cold and cruel Kkok Du must take a break from his job in the underworld and spend 49 days in the mortal realm—and this time, he winds up inhabiting the body of the human Do Jin Woo. While living as Do Jin Woo, he meets Han Gye Jeol, a female doctor who has the mysterious ability to order Kkok Du around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PGUdVPeC9AogQCYqsbDDPRYbSd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210998'),
  ('34083666318109661', 'Kokkoku, Moment by Moment', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chika Anzai, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Ryuto Iwata, Koji Tsujitani, Hirofumi Nojima, Asami Seto, Hozumi Goda, Yuuya Uchida', null, 'In order to save her brother and nephew who have been kidnapped by a mysterious religious group known as the Genuine Love Society, Juri and her family cast a spell using a stone hidden by her grandfather to enter the world of stopped time known as Stasis. However, when they infiltrate the kidnapper''s base, they''re met by other people who can also move about freely. With grotesque creatures lurking about, will they be able to escape the parallel world and return to their normal lives?!', 'In order to save her brother and nephew who have been kidnapped by a mysterious religious group known as the Genuine Love Society, Juri and her family cast a spell using a stone hidden by her grandfather to enter the world of stopped time known as Stasis. However, when they infiltrate the kidnapper''s base, they''re met by other people who can also move about freely. With grotesque creatures lurking about, will they be able to escape the parallel world and return to their normal lives?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNqfchtJscTRd6Ar80zVHmIH4lI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76131'),
  ('634732013630717035', 'Kokoro Connect', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Takahiro Mizushima, Aki Toyosaki, Miyuki Sawashiro, Hisako Kanemoto, Takuma Terashima, Asuka Ohgame, Atsuko Tanaka, Ayane Sakura', 'TV-14', 'Five members of the school culture club—Taichi Yaegashi, Iori Nagase, Himeko Inaba, Yui Kiriyama, and Yoshifumi Aoki—encounter a bizarre phenomenon one day when Aoki and Yui switch personalities without warning. The same begins to happen to the other club members, throwing their daily lives into chaos. At first the five students find some amusement among the confusion, but this connection also exposes the painful scars hidden within their hearts... When their calm lives are shattered, the relationships between the five students also begin to change!', 'Five members of the school culture club—Taichi Yaegashi, Iori Nagase, Himeko Inaba, Yui Kiriyama, and Yoshifumi Aoki—encounter a bizarre phenomenon one day when Aoki and Yui switch personalities without warning. The same begins to happen to the other club members, throwing their daily lives into chaos. At first the five students find some amusement among the confusion, but this connection also exposes the painful scars hidden within their hearts... When their calm lives are shattered, the relationships between the five students also begin to change!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcIUwuVA0mHy3HHuEvUZyTz9lyh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45807'),
  ('426846847979604002', 'Kokoro Library', 2001, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Chiwa Saito, Yumi Ichihara, Miyuki Sawashiro', null, 'Kokoro Library lies nestled in an unpopulated mountain far away from town. Three sisters, Iina, Aruto and Kokoro, call the library home and run it from day to day. Kokoro is just beginning her adventures at the library. Will she be become a full-fledged librarian? Will the remote library ever attract readers? Kokoro tries her best to make her dreams come true at Kokoro Library, a place where miracles can happen.', 'Kokoro Library lies nestled in an unpopulated mountain far away from town. Three sisters, Iina, Aruto and Kokoro, call the library home and run it from day to day. Kokoro is just beginning her adventures at the library. Will she be become a full-fledged librarian? Will the remote library ever attract readers? Kokoro tries her best to make her dreams come true at Kokoro Library, a place where miracles can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjfTwrgBHNzlu6uIXB4sTXGc6w4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34715'),
  ('209211133676758997', 'Kolchak: The Night Stalker', 1974, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Grant Rice', null, 'Darren McGavin, Simon Oakland, Jack Grinnage', 'TV-PG', 'Kolchak: The Night Stalker is an American television series that aired on ABC during the 1974–1975 season. It featured a fictional Chicago newspaper reporter who investigated mysterious crimes with unlikely causes, particularly those that law enforcement authorities would not follow up. These often involved the supernatural or even science fiction, including fantastic creatures.', 'Kolchak: The Night Stalker is an American television series that aired on ABC during the 1974–1975 season. It featured a fictional Chicago newspaper reporter who investigated mysterious crimes with unlikely causes, particularly those that law enforcement authorities would not follow up. These often involved the supernatural or even science fiction, including fantastic creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgP91rWAjgqvA7IzwG3R96sAU8K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5084'),
  ('560994152502691930', 'Kölner Treff', 1976, 'Talk', null, null, 'Bettina Böttinger', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9U9XqUp41DjwCvolAgqSXhowPyB.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:64153'),
  ('1068615392151027661', 'Kom Ons Braai', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Our favorite pastime is now a social experiment. Three couples who don''t know each other braai together and a lot happens around the fire. And we''re not just talking about the delicious food!', 'Our favorite pastime is now a social experiment. Three couples who don''t know each other braai together and a lot happens around the fire. And we''re not just talking about the delicious food!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQfh5ShZzPdtEJtxuVT7O4a6f6F.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:294028'),
  ('578373108730619368', 'Kom-Emine', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Boiko Boyanov, Ivan Vladimirov', null, 'Atanas Atanasov, Vladimir Angelove, Alexander Trifonov, Alexander Kanev, Лидия Стефанова, Dessi Morales, Константин Еленков, Lora Hristova', null, 'Ten tourists with a guide set off on the "pearl in the crown" for mountaineers in Bulgaria - the Kom-Emine route. The group is diverse in age and occupation - from 18 to 70 years old. Among them are realists and adventurers, "stars" and intellectuals - a famous model, a successful vlogger, a professor of philosophy, an extravagant movie star and various enthusiasts and researchers. All of them set off on the road in the Balkans, charged with enthusiasm, desire and dreams, but also with fears and secrets. And the higher they climb, the more difficult it becomes, not only in the mountains, but also in their thoughts and relationships.', 'Ten tourists with a guide set off on the "pearl in the crown" for mountaineers in Bulgaria - the Kom-Emine route. The group is diverse in age and occupation - from 18 to 70 years old. Among them are realists and adventurers, "stars" and intellectuals - a famous model, a successful vlogger, a professor of philosophy, an extravagant movie star and various enthusiasts and researchers. All of them set off on the road in the Balkans, charged with enthusiasm, desire and dreams, but also with fears and secrets. And the higher they climb, the more difficult it becomes, not only in the mountains, but also in their thoughts and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qaUrBUXhAkdBtBujUclu48KH47.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317410'),
  ('702064646358809664', 'Kombinaciya', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nikita Vlasov', 'Egor Chichkanov, Nikita Vlasov', 'Nikita Kologrivyy, Anastasiya Ukolova, Elizaveta Bazykina, Ulyana Kravets, Tatyana Struzhenkova, Darya Rudenok, Polina Gukhman, Pavel Priluchnyy', null, 'The year is 1987. After the birth of his daughter, Alexander Shishinin, a former employee of the Saratov Regional Agricultural Academy, decides to drastically change his life and do what he always dreamed of — producing a musical group. He meets the talented composer Vitaly Okorokov. Together, they literally find the first vocalists on the street: Tatiana Ivanova, Alena Apina and assemble the first female group in the USSR.', 'The year is 1987. After the birth of his daughter, Alexander Shishinin, a former employee of the Saratov Regional Agricultural Academy, decides to drastically change his life and do what he always dreamed of — producing a musical group. He meets the talented composer Vitaly Okorokov. Together, they literally find the first vocalists on the street: Tatiana Ivanova, Alena Apina and assemble the first female group in the USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fI9Rhk8irApLZRkUzOsNBo2EGc9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270483'),
  ('25345522925282221', 'Komedi Dükkânı', 2007, 'Comedy, Family', 'Tolga Çevik', null, 'Tolga Çevik, Sarp Bozkurt, Özer Atik, Fırat Parlak', null, 'Komedi Dükkanı is a Turkish entertainment television program that was broadcast between 2007 and 2011.', 'Komedi Dükkanı is a Turkish entertainment television program that was broadcast between 2007 and 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65RbCbj8xmvrBmNuux2Q9uRijyh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:49926'),
  ('428721915915389715', 'Komi Can''t Communicate', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Elaiza Ikeda, Takahisa Masuda, Ai Yoshikawa, Yutaro', null, 'It''s Shouko Komi''s first day at the prestigious Itan Private High School, and she has already risen to the status of the school''s Madonna. With long black hair and a tall, graceful appearance, she captures the attention of anyone who comes across her. There''s just one problem though—despite her popularity, Shouko is terrible at communicating with others.', 'It''s Shouko Komi''s first day at the prestigious Itan Private High School, and she has already risen to the status of the school''s Madonna. With long black hair and a tall, graceful appearance, she captures the attention of anyone who comes across her. There''s just one problem though—despite her popularity, Shouko is terrible at communicating with others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5Mkb1Rs0RxaCtvc91nnHistWW7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129637'),
  ('402096429756442842', 'Kommissar Stolberg', 2006, 'Crime', null, null, 'Rudolf Kowalski, Eva Scheurer, Wanja Mues, Jasmin Schwiers', null, 'Stolberg is a German detective television series, starring chief inspector Martin Stolberg. The series is more serious and less flashy than other contemporary German detective series.', 'Stolberg is a German detective television series, starring chief inspector Martin Stolberg. The series is more serious and less flashy than other contemporary German detective series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79yh5aSFJyogpLkDmXfJgxkPM2U.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:20777'),
