  ('417058139948268458', 'Kumkum Bhagya', 2014, 'Family, Drama, Soap', 'Ekta Kapoor', null, 'Pranali Rathod, Akshay Bindra, Namik Paul', 'NR', 'Follow the life of Punjabi matriarch Sarla Arora who runs a marriage hall and lives with the hope of seeing her two daughters Pragya and Bulbul who''re poles apart, happily married some day.', 'Follow the life of Punjabi matriarch Sarla Arora who runs a marriage hall and lives with the hope of seeing her two daughters Pragya and Bulbul who''re poles apart, happily married some day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GGnq4bfBANUuYHK07zmMNC51CL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71734'),
  ('274783387735355775', 'Kummeli', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Olli Keskinen, Matti Grönberg, Heikki Silvennoinen', 'Heikki Silvennoinen, Timo Kahilainen, Olli Keskinen', 'Heikki Silvennoinen, Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Hela, Mikko Kivinen, Miia Selin', 'NR', 'Kummeli is the name of a Finnish comedy crew formed by Heikki Silvennoinen, Timo Kahilainen and Heikki Hela from Tampere. They are also the heads of Porkkana Ryhmä, the crew''s production company. Other famous members have included Olli Keskinen, better known for his on-screen persona Eero Kakko, and Heikki Vihinen who replaced Keskinen in the mid-90s. Kummeli appeared on television between 1991 and 1995. After a successful three-part pilot aired they were given their own show on YLE''s channel 2 with a completely new look. The Kummeli TV show was primarily composed of skits with insane characters, but would also feature musical guests as the core crew of the team were actually musicians rather than professional actors. Some episodes would also have a running set of skits that would reach a conclusion at the end of the episode. In the mid-90s, after the end of the show, the Kummeli crew would make random appearances on TV and at different events. During this time Keskinen left the crew and was replaced by Heikki Vihinen.', 'Kummeli is the name of a Finnish comedy crew formed by Heikki Silvennoinen, Timo Kahilainen and Heikki Hela from Tampere. They are also the heads of Porkkana Ryhmä, the crew''s production company. Other famous members have included Olli Keskinen, better known for his on-screen persona Eero Kakko, and Heikki Vihinen who replaced Keskinen in the mid-90s. Kummeli appeared on television between 1991 and 1995. After a successful three-part pilot aired they were given their own show on YLE''s channel 2 with a completely new look. The Kummeli TV show was primarily composed of skits with insane characters, but would also feature musical guests as the core crew of the team were actually musicians rather than professional actors. Some episodes would also have a running set of skits that would reach a conclusion at the end of the episode. In the mid-90s, after the end of the show, the Kummeli crew would make random appearances on TV and at different events. During this time Keskinen left the crew and was replaced by Heikki Vihinen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfh592wp50MHX3SkBaB1FRR2QEn.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:13484'),
  ('796553186368875601', 'Kumokiri Nizaemon', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Shotaro Ikenami', null, 'Toru Tezuka, Kiichi Nakai, Rina Uchiyama, Sen Yamamoto, Manko Kurenai, Jun Kunimura, Takehiro Murata, Ryota Nakanishi', null, 'During the Kyoho period in the reign of Tokugawa Yoshimune, there is a gang of thieves active not just in Edo but also the Tokaido and the Nakasendo, and all across the Kansai region, stealing large sums of money with skillful techniques. They only target the very wealthy and never kill or injure people. They appear with the clouds and disappear like the mist. On the night that the beautiful Ochiyo is to become the bride of a dry goods dealer, a large amount of money hidden inside the shop is stolen. The gang disappears without injuring anyone. It was a two-year plan to marry Ochiyo off so that she could bring them in. The leader of this gang is Kumokiri Nizaemon, the greatest bandit of all time. He keeps a rein on his highly-skilled and notorious followers Nanabake no Ochiyo, Kinezumi no Kichigoro, Subashiri no Kumagoro, Ingakozo Rokunosuke and others.', 'During the Kyoho period in the reign of Tokugawa Yoshimune, there is a gang of thieves active not just in Edo but also the Tokaido and the Nakasendo, and all across the Kansai region, stealing large sums of money with skillful techniques. They only target the very wealthy and never kill or injure people. They appear with the clouds and disappear like the mist. On the night that the beautiful Ochiyo is to become the bride of a dry goods dealer, a large amount of money hidden inside the shop is stolen. The gang disappears without injuring anyone. It was a two-year plan to marry Ochiyo off so that she could bring them in. The leader of this gang is Kumokiri Nizaemon, the greatest bandit of all time. He keeps a rein on his highly-skilled and notorious followers Nanabake no Ochiyo, Kinezumi no Kichigoro, Subashiri no Kumagoro, Ingakozo Rokunosuke and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GSrmP3rK0AGFiqP5yOgszSlOOM.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:84690'),
  ('402804725978524575', 'Kung Fu', 1972, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Western, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Herman Miller, Ed Spielman, Jerry Thorpe', null, 'David Carradine, Keye Luke, Philip Ahn, Radames Pera', 'TV-14', 'The adventures of a Shaolin Monk as he wanders the American West armed only with his skill in Kung Fu.', 'The adventures of a Shaolin Monk as he wanders the American West armed only with his skill in Kung Fu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUqmS40PRyAe3COHh7wHpDFnspC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1472'),
  ('23095479965368058', 'Kung Fu', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Christina M. Kim', null, 'Olivia Liang, Tan Kheng Hua, Eddie Liu, Shannon Dang, Jon Prasida, Gavin Stenhouse, Vanessa Kai, Tony Chung', 'TV-14', 'A quarter-life crisis causes a young Chinese-American woman to drop out of college and go on a life-changing journey to an isolated monastery in China. But when she returns to find her hometown overrun with crime and corruption, she uses her martial arts skills and Shaolin values to protect her community and bring criminals to justice…all while searching for the assassin who killed her Shaolin mentor and is now targeting her.', 'A quarter-life crisis causes a young Chinese-American woman to drop out of college and go on a life-changing journey to an isolated monastery in China. But when she returns to find her hometown overrun with crime and corruption, she uses her martial arts skills and Shaolin values to protect her community and bring criminals to justice…all while searching for the assassin who killed her Shaolin mentor and is now targeting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynpI9lvBe2gbNkH3a764xOeMajO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:114165'),
  ('336660242403159378', 'Kung Fu Panda: Legends of Awesomeness', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Mick Wingert, Kari Wahlgren, James Sie, Amir Talai, Fred Tatasciore, James Hong, Maria Bamford, John DiMaggio', 'TV-Y7', 'Now living in his permanent home at the Jade Palace with the rest of the Furious Five, Po the Panda trains, battles, learns, teaches, stumbles, gabs and "geeks out" as the newest hero in the Valley of Peace.', 'Now living in his permanent home at the Jade Palace with the rest of the Furious Five, Po the Panda trains, battles, learns, teaches, stumbles, gabs and "geeks out" as the newest hero in the Valley of Peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkq5Jt7boR5v65bDbELHz3DW7sv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:39898'),
  ('700531670412303668', 'Kung Fu Panda: The Dragon Knight', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mitch Watson, Peter Hastings', null, 'Jack Black, Rita Ora, Chris Geere, Della Saba, James Hong, Rahnuma Panthaky, Melissa Villaseñor, Dustin Hoffman', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow the adventures of Po, who partners up with a no-nonsense English knight named Wandering Blade to find a collection of four powerful weapons before a mysterious pair of weasels do, and save the world from destruction.', 'Follow the adventures of Po, who partners up with a no-nonsense English knight named Wandering Blade to find a collection of four powerful weapons before a mysterious pair of weasels do, and save the world from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7C9TKvU5dNyhvoG9kQvRFsg6vlA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:129959'),
  ('334379589938825560', 'Kung Fu Panda: The Paws of Destiny', 2018, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Elliott Owen', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'As the Dragon Master, Po has endured his fair share of epic challenges but nothing could prepare him for his greatest one yet-as a Kung Fu teacher to a group of rambunctious kids from Panda Village who have been imbued with a mysterious and powerful chi energy. Together they embark on amazing adventures, battle ferocious villains, and become legends!', 'As the Dragon Master, Po has endured his fair share of epic challenges but nothing could prepare him for his greatest one yet-as a Kung Fu teacher to a group of rambunctious kids from Panda Village who have been imbued with a mysterious and powerful chi energy. Together they embark on amazing adventures, battle ferocious villains, and become legends!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4yvmIVuXxYKfTlgRtSJnGC1Izs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82747'),
  ('14598427325106988', 'Kung Fu: The Legend Continues', 1993, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ed Spielman', null, 'David Carradine, Chris Potter, Kim Chan, Kate Trotter, Scott Wentworth, Victoria Snow', null, 'Like his legendary namesake, Kwai Chang Caine is a warrior monk, operating a Shaolin temple in Northern California. After an evil priest, Tan, destroys the temple, Caine and his young son, Peter each believe the other has perished. The two embark on very different paths -- Caine wanders the Earth, while Peter is a cop. When fate brings the two together, they work to overcome their differing philosophies to battle Tan, and then to help the innocent and bring justice to the new Wild West -- 90s urban America.', 'Like his legendary namesake, Kwai Chang Caine is a warrior monk, operating a Shaolin temple in Northern California. After an evil priest, Tan, destroys the temple, Caine and his young son, Peter each believe the other has perished. The two embark on very different paths -- Caine wanders the Earth, while Peter is a cop. When fate brings the two together, they work to overcome their differing philosophies to battle Tan, and then to help the innocent and bring justice to the new Wild West -- 90s urban America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncY99oMyS8kZvFcloSV4WNxqYjE.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:636'),
  ('1079361593596164476', 'Kunlun Tomb', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Zhang Muye', null, 'Pan Yueming, Zhang Yuqi, Jiang Chao, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Wang Yutian, Sonam Nyima, Yang Yitong, Sha Baoliang', null, 'Hong Kong antique dealer Ming Shu commissions Hu Bayi, Wang Kaixuan and Shirley Yang to look for the glacier corpse within the demonic kingdom from the legends of King Gesar. Having just escaped the "worm" valley, they embark on a new journey to unravel a curse.', 'Hong Kong antique dealer Ming Shu commissions Hu Bayi, Wang Kaixuan and Shirley Yang to look for the glacier corpse within the demonic kingdom from the legends of King Gesar. Having just escaped the "worm" valley, they embark on a new journey to unravel a curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQqJAYEN5YsHlFgIgLHIOjpHaKg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201722'),
  ('157846241206344696', 'Kunon the Sorcerer Can See', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Maaya Uchida, Akari Kito, Rikako Yamaguchi, Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'TV-14', 'Kunon, a young man who cannot see, has the goal of creating new eyes with water magic. After just five months of learning sorcery, Kunon surpassed his own mentor and honed his talent as he tried to do a feat that''s never been done before. A fantasy about a young man, a blind genius, who opens up the world through curiosity in the pursuit for magic is about to begin.', 'Kunon, a young man who cannot see, has the goal of creating new eyes with water magic. After just five months of learning sorcery, Kunon surpassed his own mentor and honed his talent as he tried to do a feat that''s never been done before. A fantasy about a young man, a blind genius, who opens up the world through curiosity in the pursuit for magic is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGGdMa1fEwMiyyFB1AnUox5cshy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282946'),
  ('832772064344708804', 'Kurau Phantom Memory', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Misa Kobayashi, Mitsuru Ogata, Tomoyuki Shimura, Yuhko Kaida, Fumihiko Tachiki, Miyuki Ichijou, Nobuo Tobita', 'TV-14', 'It’s the year 2100, and the moon is now home to a colony of scientists and pioneers. It’s also host to dangerous experiments into strange new forms of energy, and it isn’t long before one of them goes terribly wrong. In a freak accident young Kurau, the daughter of chief scientist Amami So, is struck by mysterious twin bolts of light. Rather than taking her life, the accident leaves her playing host to two mysterious entities that give her fantastic powers…and little love for the human race.', 'It’s the year 2100, and the moon is now home to a colony of scientists and pioneers. It’s also host to dangerous experiments into strange new forms of energy, and it isn’t long before one of them goes terribly wrong. In a freak accident young Kurau, the daughter of chief scientist Amami So, is struck by mysterious twin bolts of light. Rather than taking her life, the accident leaves her playing host to two mysterious entities that give her fantastic powers…and little love for the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5v386giaPRNsuowWCTdwyVLTp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31692'),
  ('1020154351198947982', 'KUROKAMI The Animation', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Noriko Shitaya, Daisuke Namikawa, Satoshi Hino, Katsuyuki Konishi, Jouji Nakata, Kenji Hamada, Yukari Tamura, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'In this world, there are three identical-looking people in existence who split between them an energy-like force called Terra. This energy can be attributed to the amount of Luck or Life Energy that an individual possesses. There also exist beings who observe the human world, maintaining the balance (Coexistence Equilibrium) of Terra. These beings possess abilities that surpass those of normal human beings. They live in hiding in places known as Pure Places, in tribes. They are called the Terra Guardians. This is a tale of battle that begins with a chance meeting between a human boy named Keita and a young Terra Guardian girl named Kuro.', 'In this world, there are three identical-looking people in existence who split between them an energy-like force called Terra. This energy can be attributed to the amount of Luck or Life Energy that an individual possesses. There also exist beings who observe the human world, maintaining the balance (Coexistence Equilibrium) of Terra. These beings possess abilities that surpass those of normal human beings. They live in hiding in places known as Pure Places, in tribes. They are called the Terra Guardians. This is a tale of battle that begins with a chance meeting between a human boy named Keita and a young Terra Guardian girl named Kuro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVtrOJOQ6mRZrM0JuG83Aie41xc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42902'),
  ('561530437628280332', 'Kuroko''s Basketball', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Yuki Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Daisuke Ono, Ryohei Kimura, Hiroshi Kamiya, Kenichi Suzumura, Chiwa Saito', 'TV-14', 'In the story, Kagami Taiga has just enrolled into Seirin High School when he meets Kuroko Tetsuya of the school''s basketball team. Kuroko happens to be the shadowy sixth member of the legendary Generation of Miracles basketball team. Together, Kagami and Kuroko aim to take their team to the inter-high school championship - against Kuroko''s former teammates.', 'In the story, Kagami Taiga has just enrolled into Seirin High School when he meets Kuroko Tetsuya of the school''s basketball team. Kuroko happens to be the shadowy sixth member of the legendary Generation of Miracles basketball team. Together, Kagami and Kuroko aim to take their team to the inter-high school championship - against Kuroko''s former teammates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qi8dlAgQEeahpEn1AOb5BJEOcVB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45783'),
  ('27671542220382453', 'Kuromukuro', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yohei Azakami, Mao Ichimichi, Reina Ueda, Asami Seto, Kaito Ishikawa, Yusuke Kobayashi, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Kanako Toujou', 'TV-14', 'When mecha attack a research center, its students, pilots, and researchers must fight back with the help of mysterious artifacts and a young samurai.', 'When mecha attack a research center, its students, pilots, and researchers must fight back with the help of mysterious artifacts and a young samurai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XMhVgeBlimKneB77AxLSpHqmHq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66080'),
  ('764844830420890773', 'Kurozuka', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Romi Park, Mamoru Miyano, Kazuhiko Inoue, Keiji Fujiwara, Toshiko Fujita, Jouji Nakata, Miyu Irino, Houko Kuwashima', null, 'In feudal Japan, Kurou and his servant Benkei are fleeing from Kurou''s elder brother, who has recently ascended to the throne. In a forest, they come across a house and a strange woman by the name of Kuromitsu, who agrees to harbor them under one condition: that they do not peer into the inner chambers. Soon, they are attacked by the Red Army; they are searching for Kuromitsu, whose blood holds immortality. Fatally wounded, Kurou drinks some of Kuromitsu''s blood and gains immortality along with strange abilities; but shortly after, Kurou is seemingly decapitated and wakes up centuries later in a ruined city. In this twisted future the Red Army is omnipresent and still searching for Kuromitsu’s blood, while a rebel army seeks to keep them from acquiring it. With threats at every turn and fueled by his obsession, Kurou sets forth to find Kuromitsu and seek his revenge on the Red Army.', 'In feudal Japan, Kurou and his servant Benkei are fleeing from Kurou''s elder brother, who has recently ascended to the throne. In a forest, they come across a house and a strange woman by the name of Kuromitsu, who agrees to harbor them under one condition: that they do not peer into the inner chambers. Soon, they are attacked by the Red Army; they are searching for Kuromitsu, whose blood holds immortality. Fatally wounded, Kurou drinks some of Kuromitsu''s blood and gains immortality along with strange abilities; but shortly after, Kurou is seemingly decapitated and wakes up centuries later in a ruined city. In this twisted future the Red Army is omnipresent and still searching for Kuromitsu’s blood, while a rebel army seeks to keep them from acquiring it. With threats at every turn and fueled by his obsession, Kurou sets forth to find Kuromitsu and seek his revenge on the Red Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hez6h5LZxedDfzHHPu3iqj2Gm82.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34861'),
  ('370769920671395262', 'Kurt Seyit & Sura', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Nermin Bezmen', 'Melek Gençoğlu, Ece Yörenç', 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Fahriye Evcen, Birkan Sokullu, Ushan Çakır, Seda Güven, Elçin Sangu, Aslı Orcan', null, 'A Turkish lieutenant and the daughter of Russian nobles fight for their love against forces of family and social expectation and historical events.', 'A Turkish lieutenant and the daughter of Russian nobles fight for their love against forces of family and social expectation and historical events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lYKjtegF62sdr1UtWnmXBE067z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62553'),
  ('971433847779867687', 'Kurukshetra: The Great War of Mahabharata', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Animation', 'Anu Sikka', null, 'Vinod Sharma, Sahil Vaid, Saumya Daan, Anamaya Verma, Manoj Pandey, Neha Gargawa, Pawan Kalra, Krutarth Trive', 'TV-14', 'An epic 18-day battle unfolds through the perspectives of 18 warriors, revealing their inner struggles and ethical challenges during a war between brothers.', 'An epic 18-day battle unfolds through the perspectives of 18 warriors, revealing their inner struggles and ethical challenges during a war between brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amNFukSD0hpj5omLkikfaNw42sp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300894'),
  ('334001906511817230', 'Kuruluş Osman', 2019, 'War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Mehmet Bozdağ', 'Asli Zeynep Peker Bozdag, Mehmet Bozdağ, Fatma Nur Guldali', 'Burak Özçivit, Özge Törer, Emre Bey, Ecem Sena Bayır, Ömer Faruk Aran, Belgin Şimşek, Leya Kırşan, Yiğit Uçan', 'TV-14', 'The life of Osman Bey, the son of Ertuğrul and the founder of the Ottoman Empire, as he established and controlled it, facing internal and external struggles against Byzantium and the Mongol Ilkhanate.', 'The life of Osman Bey, the son of Ertuğrul and the founder of the Ottoman Empire, as he established and controlled it, facing internal and external struggles against Byzantium and the Mongol Ilkhanate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu4BWsGFHcYDWulZwHxylA91vo0.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:95603'),
  ('603540476522455505', 'Kurzgesagt - In a Nutshell', 2013, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Philipp Dettmer', null, null, null, 'Kurzgesagt (German for "in a nutshell") is a Munich based design studio with a distinctive perspective on design and animation within the fields of education, science and commerce. Founded in 2012 by Philipp Dettmer & Stephan Rether, the studio engages in information design projects of all kinds. We love science, minimalism, colors and music. But most of all combining them to tell stories.', 'Kurzgesagt (German for "in a nutshell") is a Munich based design studio with a distinctive perspective on design and animation within the fields of education, science and commerce. Founded in 2012 by Philipp Dettmer & Stephan Rether, the studio engages in information design projects of all kinds. We love science, minimalism, colors and music. But most of all combining them to tell stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8auUgU0t4eatmHi9LKPpEgJ0QBT.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:94600'),
  ('111629978802535592', 'Kusunoki''s Garden of Gods', 2026, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Shinshu Fuji, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shinnosuke Tokudome, Makoto Koichi, Minako Kotobuki, Yoshiki Nakajima, Daiki Kobayashi', null, 'Minato Kusunoki is assigned to manage his family’s haunted, abandoned countryside estate. However, thanks to his overwhelming spiritual power, Minato accidentally purifies the entire place, turning the once-cursed property into a peaceful haven for wandering gods and deities! As Minato settles in, he finds himself surrounded by quirky divine neighbors and the lively chaos of life among the gods.', 'Minato Kusunoki is assigned to manage his family’s haunted, abandoned countryside estate. However, thanks to his overwhelming spiritual power, Minato accidentally purifies the entire place, turning the once-cursed property into a peaceful haven for wandering gods and deities! As Minato settles in, he finds himself surrounded by quirky divine neighbors and the lively chaos of life among the gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvuNkbVcGwvZyRmeIqmePO9nxwV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296870'),
  ('651376163456530164', 'Kuzey Yıldızı: İlk Aşk', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ersoy Güler', 'Ersoy Güler', 'Aslıhan Güner, İsmail Demirci, Nilsu Berfin Aktaş, Toygan Avanoğlu, Zeynep Kankonde, Hüseyin Soysalan, Uğur Demirpehlivan, Can Kızıltuğ', null, 'Yildiz has loved Kuzey for as long as she has known. She has seen no one but him. Families are also friendly to each other. Kuzey and Yildiz are engaged. But when Kuzey goes to Istanbul to study at university, he forgets all his words and sets sail for new love. When this is learned by his family, Kuzey is excommunicated by everyone in the village, including his own family. Kuzey married the woman he loved. He had three children. Twenty years later, he experienced the pain that Yildiz experienced. He was abandoned by the woman he loved. Kuzey returns to his hometown with his three daughters. Yildiz swore to send him where he came from.', 'Yildiz has loved Kuzey for as long as she has known. She has seen no one but him. Families are also friendly to each other. Kuzey and Yildiz are engaged. But when Kuzey goes to Istanbul to study at university, he forgets all his words and sets sail for new love. When this is learned by his family, Kuzey is excommunicated by everyone in the village, including his own family. Kuzey married the woman he loved. He had three children. Twenty years later, he experienced the pain that Yildiz experienced. He was abandoned by the woman he loved. Kuzey returns to his hometown with his three daughters. Yildiz swore to send him where he came from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufpbzxbIKekjwG2bLgqXtv5tbYU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93216'),
  ('378308336035005746', 'Kuzgun', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Özlem Yılmaz, Burcu Görgün Toptaş', 'Özlem Yılmaz, Burcu Görgün Toptaş', 'Barış Arduç, Burcu Biricik, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Onur Saylak, Hatice Aslan, Utku Ateş', null, 'Kuzgun''s family life changes completely as a result of the caliper held against his father, who is a police. Kuzgun will fall into a bondage, pain, anger, and struggle that will last 20 years.', 'Kuzgun''s family life changes completely as a result of the caliper held against his father, who is a police. Kuzgun will fall into a bondage, pain, anger, and struggle that will last 20 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs3z1KylHwbkywWYE4nMU9n8Rft.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88794'),
  ('407873400418031239', 'Kvarteret Skatan', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Mikael Syrén', null, 'Vanna Rosenberg, Johan Glans, Rachel Mohlin, David Batra, Anna Blomberg, Mikael Syrén', null, '"Kvarteret Skatan" was a Swedish comedy-series depicting a few characters living in a fictional block called Skatan (the magpie) in an unnamed suburb of Stockholm. Here we meet characters such as Paul and Tord, Horny Gun, Gert and the talibans Conny and Britt. It was aired between the years 2003 and 2006.', '"Kvarteret Skatan" was a Swedish comedy-series depicting a few characters living in a fictional block called Skatan (the magpie) in an unnamed suburb of Stockholm. Here we meet characters such as Paul and Tord, Horny Gun, Gert and the talibans Conny and Britt. It was aired between the years 2003 and 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6mSGKijDKLZpBWYKg3v06cxqWF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:29950'),
  ('77216352071761131', 'KVN Major League', 1986, 'Family, Comedy, Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'KVN is a Russian humour TV show and competition where teams compete by giving funny answers to questions and showing prepared sketches. The programme was first aired by the First Soviet Channel on November 8, 1961. Eleven years later, in 1972, when few programmes were being broadcast live, Soviet censors found the students'' impromptu jokes offensive and anti-Soviet and banned KVN. The show was revived fourteen years later during the Perestroika era in 1986, with Alexander Maslyakov as its host. It is one of the longest-running TV programmes on Russian Television. It also has its own holiday on November 8, the birthday of the game, which KVN players celebrate every year since it was announced and widely celebrated for the first time in 2001.', 'KVN is a Russian humour TV show and competition where teams compete by giving funny answers to questions and showing prepared sketches. The programme was first aired by the First Soviet Channel on November 8, 1961. Eleven years later, in 1972, when few programmes were being broadcast live, Soviet censors found the students'' impromptu jokes offensive and anti-Soviet and banned KVN. The show was revived fourteen years later during the Perestroika era in 1986, with Alexander Maslyakov as its host. It is one of the longest-running TV programmes on Russian Television. It also has its own holiday on November 8, the birthday of the game, which KVN players celebrate every year since it was announced and widely celebrated for the first time in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DtKLe8ZTSZfuav8DyedJrZDmIF.jpg', 40, 'tmdb:tv:15080'),
  ('1097716546489849852', 'Kyle XY', 2006, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'J. Mackye Gruber, Eric Bress', null, 'Matt Dallas, Marguerite MacIntyre, Bruce Thomas, April Matson, Jean-Luc Bilodeau, Chris Olivero, Kirsten Zien, Jaimie Alexander', 'TV-14', 'A suburban family that takes in a mysterious teen naive to the world around him. As Kyle begins to show signs of brilliance, solving the mystery of his origin and potential abilities becomes the family''s mission.', 'A suburban family that takes in a mysterious teen naive to the world around him. As Kyle begins to show signs of brilliance, solving the mystery of his origin and potential abilities becomes the family''s mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4omwjf3HgGx4nZXcA0Avmd9bQny.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:219'),
  ('1142239900375568362', 'Kyo Kara Maoh!', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Mitsuki Saiga, Akio Otsuka, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kouki Miyata', 'TV-PG', 'Yuri Shibuya is an average baseball-loving high school student. One day, Yuri tries to save his former classmate from a group of hoodlums. Turning on him, they drag Yuri into the bathroom and push his face into the toilet. When they flush the toilet, he is transported to another world! Yuri is then taken to a castle and crowned King of the Demon World! Is he going to end up as the leader of the land, surrounded by his extraordinarily handsome lieges or will he make it back home?', 'Yuri Shibuya is an average baseball-loving high school student. One day, Yuri tries to save his former classmate from a group of hoodlums. Turning on him, they drag Yuri into the bathroom and push his face into the toilet. When they flush the toilet, he is transported to another world! Yuri is then taken to a castle and crowned King of the Demon World! Is he going to end up as the leader of the land, surrounded by his extraordinarily handsome lieges or will he make it back home?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgRyegUvx95GJlufAvgV3Y6pfw9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43232'),
  ('1145830062496990945', 'Kyojo', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takuya Kimura, Asuka Kudo, Haruna Kawaguchi, Ryosuke Mikata, Shohei Miura, Ryouta Murai, Fumiyo Kohinata, Hitomi Sato', null, 'Kimichika Kazama is an instructor at a police academy. He is keenly observant and watches over his students. He is calm as an instructor and has charisma, but strict. Students with various backgrounds attend the police academy with their own reasons of becoming police officers. They feel pressure having to follow the strict rules and have anxiety about getting kicked out of the academy. How many students will graduate among the 90 students? What is the real purpose of Kimichika Kazama giving hardship to the students?', 'Kimichika Kazama is an instructor at a police academy. He is keenly observant and watches over his students. He is calm as an instructor and has charisma, but strict. Students with various backgrounds attend the police academy with their own reasons of becoming police officers. They feel pressure having to follow the strict rules and have anxiety about getting kicked out of the academy. How many students will graduate among the 90 students? What is the real purpose of Kimichika Kazama giving hardship to the students?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TKkFQ3xG4bnSFDsBOnLdZI6iHs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:97425'),
  ('484007939006512197', 'Kyousougiga', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Akira Ishida, Chiwa Saito, Eiji Takemoto, Eri Kitamura, Kazuki Yao, Kenichi Suzumura, Noriko Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Hidden within Kyoto is the "mirror capital" where youkai and humans live together and no one ever dies. It is protected by three people - Kurama, Yase, and Myoue - as they await the return of their parents, Myoue Jonin and Koto. One day a young girl named Koto (same name, different spelling) and her little brothers A and Un wander into the city from a different dimension looking for her mother. A mecha-geek with red eyes, it''s not immediately clear whether she''s human or youkai. Her arrival upsets the long peace that had ruled the city.', 'Hidden within Kyoto is the "mirror capital" where youkai and humans live together and no one ever dies. It is protected by three people - Kurama, Yase, and Myoue - as they await the return of their parents, Myoue Jonin and Koto. One day a young girl named Koto (same name, different spelling) and her little brothers A and Un wander into the city from a different dimension looking for her mother. A mecha-geek with red eyes, it''s not immediately clear whether she''s human or youkai. Her arrival upsets the long peace that had ruled the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MM2mZzzeqh7Sl03q1DtRqHAxMN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85065'),
  ('823900165659403856', 'Kyunki... Saas Bhi Kabhi Bahu Thi...', 2000, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Ekta Kapoor', 'Anantica Sahir, Rajesh Joshi, Dheeraj Sarna', 'Smriti Irani, Amar Upadhyay, Tanisha Mehta, Rohit Suchanti, Shagun Sharma, Aman Gandhi, Shakti Anand, Gauri Pradhan Tejwani', null, 'A mother-in-law''s struggle to put up with her three bahu''s. The three bahu''s have grown up sons. The bahu''s sons start to get involved with having girlfriends and the bahu''s try and break their relationships up.', 'A mother-in-law''s struggle to put up with her three bahu''s. The three bahu''s have grown up sons. The bahu''s sons start to get involved with having girlfriends and the bahu''s try and break their relationships up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJfoyxt7FOKr7WPB6FPuffarpcn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6060'),
  ('810119467463860646', 'L for Love', 2000, 'Soap', null, null, 'Rafał Mroczek, Teresa Lipowska, Dominika Ostałowska, Małgorzata Pieńkowska, Marcin Mroczek, Katarzyna Cichopek', null, 'M jak miłość is a Polish soap opera, revolving around the multiple generations of the Mostowiak family. The series premiered on November 4, 2000 on TVP2, primarily as a weekly drama, and after one season shifting into a new timeslot and extending to two episodes per week. For the last few years the show has been the most watched drama on Polish television. Its popularity led to a Russian adaptation, entitled Lyubov kak Lyubov. The series is also broadcast on the international channel TVP Polonia with English subtitles.', 'M jak miłość is a Polish soap opera, revolving around the multiple generations of the Mostowiak family. The series premiered on November 4, 2000 on TVP2, primarily as a weekly drama, and after one season shifting into a new timeslot and extending to two episodes per week. For the last few years the show has been the most watched drama on Polish television. Its popularity led to a Russian adaptation, entitled Lyubov kak Lyubov. The series is also broadcast on the international channel TVP Polonia with English subtitles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8agoxhXGlv6ICYa733bDrfKnJ3.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:14447'),
  ('363619487928258391', 'L.A. Doctors', 1998, 'Drama', 'John Lee Hancock', null, 'Ken Olin, Matt Craven, Rick Roberts, Sheryl Lee', 'TV-14', 'Four Los Angeles doctors run a practice in this drama that focuses as much on the problems in the American medical system as it does on the patients.', 'Four Los Angeles doctors run a practice in this drama that focuses as much on the problems in the American medical system as it does on the patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjBfHS7YSi91EzVd0r2hgFlCF6K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1694'),
  ('501526682687263230', 'L.A. Dragnet', 2003, 'Drama', 'Dick Wolf, Jack Webb', null, 'Ed O''Neill, Desmond Harrington, Eva Longoria, Evan Parke, Christina Chang, Roselyn Sánchez', null, 'Within L.A. incredibly diverse landscape, two dedicated cops are relentless when it comes to solving crime. Detective Joe Friday is a seasoned veteran who has seen it all. Through his voiceovers, viewers will gain insight into the crime investigation process, as well as hear the honest thoughts of a 21st century cop. Although a veteran of the beat, Friday still has the same passion and energy as his young partner, Frank Smith, who has recently been promoted to the robbery/homicide division from vice.', 'Within L.A. incredibly diverse landscape, two dedicated cops are relentless when it comes to solving crime. Detective Joe Friday is a seasoned veteran who has seen it all. Through his voiceovers, viewers will gain insight into the crime investigation process, as well as hear the honest thoughts of a 21st century cop. Although a veteran of the beat, Friday still has the same passion and energy as his young partner, Frank Smith, who has recently been promoted to the robbery/homicide division from vice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0W2fa6VuoHBKjVfAQ9ieas4uv7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45382'),
  ('491630360799811388', 'L.A. Heat', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Joseph Merhi, Richard Pepin', null, 'Wolf Larson, Steven Williams, Renee Tenison, Kenneth Tigar, Sugar Ray Leonard', null, 'Meet Chase McDonald and August Brooks. Two guys who will do anything to keep L.A. safe . . . even if it means blowing half of it up. An explosive crime drama that follows the action-packed cases of robbery/homicide detectives McDonald and Brooks, who are as different as night and day. L.A. Heat is an American action series starring Wolf Larson and Steven Williams as Los Angeles police detectives, in the tradition of films like Lethal Weapon. The series aired on TNT from March 15, 1999.', 'Meet Chase McDonald and August Brooks. Two guys who will do anything to keep L.A. safe . . . even if it means blowing half of it up. An explosive crime drama that follows the action-packed cases of robbery/homicide detectives McDonald and Brooks, who are as different as night and day. L.A. Heat is an American action series starring Wolf Larson and Steven Williams as Los Angeles police detectives, in the tradition of films like Lethal Weapon. The series aired on TNT from March 15, 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ0kZUZvKuVObrfVFWxjueHNfFH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2332'),
  ('327224565258079053', 'L.A. Law', 1986, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Steven Bochco, Terry Louise Fisher', null, 'Corbin Bernsen, Jill Eikenberry, Alan Rachins, Michael Tucker, Blair Underwood, Larry Drake, John Spencer, A Martinez', null, 'L.A. Law is an American television legal drama series that ran for eight seasons on NBC from September 15, 1986, to May 19, 1994. Created by Steven Bochco and Terry Louise Fisher, it contained many of Bochco''s trademark features including a large number of parallel storylines, social drama and off-the-wall humor. It reflected the social and cultural ideologies of the 1980s and early 1990s, and many of the cases featured on the show dealt with hot-topic issues such as abortion, racism, gay rights, homophobia, sexual harassment, AIDS, and domestic violence. The series often also reflected social tensions between the wealthy senior lawyer protagonists and their less well-paid junior staff. The show was popular with audiences and critics, and won 15 Emmy Awards throughout its run, four of which were for Outstanding Drama Series.', 'L.A. Law is an American television legal drama series that ran for eight seasons on NBC from September 15, 1986, to May 19, 1994. Created by Steven Bochco and Terry Louise Fisher, it contained many of Bochco''s trademark features including a large number of parallel storylines, social drama and off-the-wall humor. It reflected the social and cultural ideologies of the 1980s and early 1990s, and many of the cases featured on the show dealt with hot-topic issues such as abortion, racism, gay rights, homophobia, sexual harassment, AIDS, and domestic violence. The series often also reflected social tensions between the wealthy senior lawyer protagonists and their less well-paid junior staff. The show was popular with audiences and critics, and won 15 Emmy Awards throughout its run, four of which were for Outstanding Drama Series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs1TBk6KlPBlnb7ybpqgK6IzcCx.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:732'),
  ('405386159089577777', 'L.A.''s Finest', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Brandon Margolis, Brandon Sonnier', null, 'Gabrielle Union, Jessica Alba, Ryan McPartlin, Ernie Hudson, Duane Martin, Zach Gilford, Sophie Reynolds', 'TV-MA', 'Syd Burnett has left her complicated past behind to become an LAPD detective. Paired with a new partner, Nancy McKenna, a working mom with an equally complex past, Syd is pushed to examine whether her unapologetic lifestyle might be masking a greater personal secret. These two women don''t agree on much, but they find common ground when it comes to taking on the most dangerous criminals in Los Angeles.', 'Syd Burnett has left her complicated past behind to become an LAPD detective. Paired with a new partner, Nancy McKenna, a working mom with an equally complex past, Syd is pushed to examine whether her unapologetic lifestyle might be masking a greater personal secret. These two women don''t agree on much, but they find common ground when it comes to taking on the most dangerous criminals in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pecfFki7ADklKNuqMrcBD7U9lWc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85385'),
  ('533019766859723918', 'L.U.C.A.: The Beginning', 2021, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Chun Sung-il', 'Kim Rae-won, Lee Da-hee, Kim Seung-o, Kim Sang-ho, Jin Kyung, Park Hyuk-kwon, Ahn Nae-sang, Jeong Da-eun', null, 'Ji-O has a special power and a secret, but he doesn''t know who he really is. He is chased by mysterious figures, while he tries to find answers to numerous questions that surround him. Goo-Reum is a detective. When she decides on a course of action, she won''t change no matter what. Her parents disappeared when she was only a young child. Goo-Reum chases after the truth behind her parents'' disappearance. She meets Ji-O and her life changes.', 'Ji-O has a special power and a secret, but he doesn''t know who he really is. He is chased by mysterious figures, while he tries to find answers to numerous questions that surround him. Goo-Reum is a detective. When she decides on a course of action, she won''t change no matter what. Her parents disappeared when she was only a young child. Goo-Reum chases after the truth behind her parents'' disappearance. She meets Ji-O and her life changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcEikoCQsdKueYT20ekzhx6C6HY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116043'),
  ('91319400540940223', 'L''allieva', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Peter Exacoustos, Alessia Gazzola', null, 'Emmanuele Aita, Giorgia Gambuzza, Lino Guanciale, Alessandra Mastronardi, Pierpaolo Spollon, Anna Dalton, Francesca Agostini, Fabrizio Coniglio', null, 'Alice is a clumsy and passionate coroner resident. She fights between life and love complexities. Even tough she still has a lot to learn, she has a special quality: empathy with the victims that leads her to have crucial intuition in the cases that she works on.', 'Alice is a clumsy and passionate coroner resident. She fights between life and love complexities. Even tough she still has a lot to learn, she has a special quality: empathy with the victims that leads her to have crucial intuition in the cases that she works on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTTTDSWsyHRYzhXt0kALGqlEfcb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69272'),
