  ('1072197332187258205', 'La Bella y las Bestias', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Juan Camilo Ferrand', null, 'Osvaldo Benavides, Esmeralda Pimentel, Arturo Barba, Cassandra Sánchez Navarro, Jorge Alberti, Sebastián Martínez, Sebastián Ferrat, Jaume Mateu', null, 'A woman thirsty for revenge returns to Mexico to find her parents'' killers, who hide behind legal facades in high society.', 'A woman thirsty for revenge returns to Mexico to find her parents'' killers, who hide behind legal facades in high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AUUJWJ1tNjavKtuOm9ngzCwFQA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80241'),
