  ('754520061058594250', 'La nena', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Nerea Barros, Lucía Martín Abello, Ignacio Montes, Mona Martínez, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Francesc Garrido, Ginés García Millán, Daniel Ibáñez', null, 'Months after the events of The Purple Network, the hunt is not over yet. Following Lucas''s death, Elena Blanco has disappeared. Only Mariajo knows where she is, but she keeps it a secret, even from the rest of the team. The fight against The Network has taken too much of a toll on her, and in a desperate attempt to get her life back on track, she has left the BAC.', 'Months after the events of The Purple Network, the hunt is not over yet. Following Lucas''s death, Elena Blanco has disappeared. Only Mariajo knows where she is, but she keeps it a secret, even from the rest of the team. The fight against The Network has taken too much of a toll on her, and in a desperate attempt to get her life back on track, she has left the BAC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0dOqOT7XlHcPEoZ99lYz1D235D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281041'),
