  ('148723827616142522', 'La Venganza', 2002, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Humberto ''Kiko'' Olivieri', 'Humberto ''Kiko'' Olivieri, Luis Colmenares, Carolina Diaz', 'Nury Flores, Orlando Miguel, Gabriela Spanic, José Ángel Llamas, Catherine Siachoque, Carlos Duplat Sanjuan, Margalida Castro, Millie Ruperto', 'NR', 'La Venganza, is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo and RTI Colombia. This limited-run series ran for 127 episodes from November 4, 2002 to May 16, 2003. The soap opera was starred by Gabriela Spanic, José Ángel Llamas and Catherine Siachoque.', 'La Venganza, is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo and RTI Colombia. This limited-run series ran for 127 episodes from November 4, 2002 to May 16, 2003. The soap opera was starred by Gabriela Spanic, José Ángel Llamas and Catherine Siachoque.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihNUITIYGi45ApzcnGVcGdxR7kM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14794'),
