  ('1026773041281008661', 'La Voix', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Vocalists from across Quebec, Canada compete in a blockbusters vocal competition. The show''s innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.', 'Vocalists from across Quebec, Canada compete in a blockbusters vocal competition. The show''s innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFCBkpc7mOsYzac1yCjd6A0zBie.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:58561'),
  ('959667931547438753', 'Laakhon Mein Ek', 2017, 'Drama', 'Biswa Kalyan Rath', 'Biswa Kalyan Rath', 'Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Rupesh Tillu, Praveena Deshpande, Arun Nalawade, Suyash Joshi, Ishan Mishra, Sandeep Mehta, Milind Joshi', 'TV-14', 'All that 15-year-old Aakash wants to do is make mimicry videos and post them online. Instead, he finds himself in an IIT coaching institute called Genius Infinity, where he is a misfit, unable to cope with the syllabus, and placed in the notorious section D. Now, along with roommates Bakri and Chudail, Aakash will learn to answer life’s multiple-choice questions.', 'All that 15-year-old Aakash wants to do is make mimicry videos and post them online. Instead, he finds himself in an IIT coaching institute called Genius Infinity, where he is a misfit, unable to cope with the syllabus, and placed in the notorious section D. Now, along with roommates Bakri and Chudail, Aakash will learn to answer life’s multiple-choice questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cmPvN63JCTIcRGx8SLlftmEXcx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74538'),
  ('1073811407334665826', 'Lab Rats', 2012, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Bryan Moore, Greg A. Hampson, Tim Weber', 'Bryan Moore, Chris Peterson', 'William Brent, Spencer Boldman, Kelli Berglund, Tyrel Jackson Williams, Hal Sparks', 'TV-Y7', 'Leo is an ordinary teenager who has moved into a high-tech "smart'''' house with his mother, inventor stepfather and Eddy, the computer that runs the house. Leo''s life becomes less ordinary when, one day, he discovers a secret underground lab that houses three experiments: superhuman teenagers. The trio -- Adam, the strong one, Bree, the fast one and Chase, the smart one -- convinces Leo and his parents to let them leave their lab and join Leo at school, where they try to fit in while having to manage their unpredictable bionic strengths. As Leo figures out a way to keep his new pals'' bionic abilities a secret, they help him build self-confidence.', 'Leo is an ordinary teenager who has moved into a high-tech "smart'''' house with his mother, inventor stepfather and Eddy, the computer that runs the house. Leo''s life becomes less ordinary when, one day, he discovers a secret underground lab that houses three experiments: superhuman teenagers. The trio -- Adam, the strong one, Bree, the fast one and Chase, the smart one -- convinces Leo and his parents to let them leave their lab and join Leo at school, where they try to fit in while having to manage their unpredictable bionic strengths. As Leo figures out a way to keep his new pals'' bionic abilities a secret, they help him build self-confidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcQMvn9ZptPd3dxn0a17viRfi7Y.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:38867'),
  ('975895591730654116', 'Lab Rats: Elite Force', 2016, 'Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bryan Moore, Chris Peterson', 'Bryan Moore, Chris Peterson', 'Kelli Berglund, Paris Berelc, William Brent, Bradley Steven Perry, Jake Short', 'TV-Y7', 'In a bustling metropolis after the Mighty Med hospital is destroyed by a band of unknown super-villains, Adam and Leo volunteer to oversee the students at Davenport''s Bionic Academy. Kaz, Oliver and Skylar join forces with Chase and Bree to form a powerful elite force that combines bionic heroes and superheroes. Together, they vow to track down the villains and keep the world safe.', 'In a bustling metropolis after the Mighty Med hospital is destroyed by a band of unknown super-villains, Adam and Leo volunteer to oversee the students at Davenport''s Bionic Academy. Kaz, Oliver and Skylar join forces with Chase and Bree to form a powerful elite force that combines bionic heroes and superheroes. Together, they vow to track down the villains and keep the world safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5zm08nb0SRS7Pra4iImrQiROzk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65766'),
  ('379365799246004687', 'Labs Ko Si Babe', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jake Tordesillas, Enrico C. Santos', 'Gina Marissa Tagasa-Gil, Aloy Adlawan', 'Jolina Magdangal, Marvin Agustin, Gloria Romero, Gina Pareño, Johnny Delgado, Princess Punzalan, Jaclyn Jose, Bembol Roco', null, 'Labs Ko Si Babe is a Filipino drama-comedy aired by ABS-CBN in 1999 starring Marvin Agustin and Jolina Magdangal. It was a Comedy-Television sitcom that aired weeknights on its prime time slot after Saan Ka Man Naroroon. The show was memorable because of Jolina Magdangal and Marvin Agustin'' triumphant love team and as the lead stars of the series. The series ended in November 2000 and was replaced by the prime time television series Pangako sa ’Yo. The show also made Jolina Magdangal the box office queen of the decade.', 'Labs Ko Si Babe is a Filipino drama-comedy aired by ABS-CBN in 1999 starring Marvin Agustin and Jolina Magdangal. It was a Comedy-Television sitcom that aired weeknights on its prime time slot after Saan Ka Man Naroroon. The show was memorable because of Jolina Magdangal and Marvin Agustin'' triumphant love team and as the lead stars of the series. The series ended in November 2000 and was replaced by the prime time television series Pangako sa ’Yo. The show also made Jolina Magdangal the box office queen of the decade.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:31591'),
  ('438139469661869983', 'Labyrinth', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Jessica Brown Findlay, Vanessa Kirby, Emun Elliott, John Hurt, Katie McGrath, Sebastian Stan, Tom Felton, Tony Curran', 'TV-14', 'Jumping back and forth between modern and medieval France, the lives of two women separated by centuries, are united in their search for an ancient artifact.', 'Jumping back and forth between modern and medieval France, the lives of two women separated by centuries, are united in their search for an ancient artifact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ze6V3XYVBeQe3Y9opRw3Hbyhbh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43529'),
  ('592485573376996588', 'Labyrinth', 2015, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Petr Hudský', 'Petr Hudský', 'Jiří Langmajer, Lenka Vlasáková, Miroslav Donutil, David Švehlík, Petr Stach, Denisa Nesvačilová', null, 'Finding the body of the regional politician Karas, killed in the spirit of medieval torture and carefully arranged in a strange scene, unleash police hunt for a sadistic perpetrator. He puts investigation team in the way of a complex series of murders that shake the local region and criminologists themselves.', 'Finding the body of the regional politician Karas, killed in the spirit of medieval torture and carefully arranged in a strange scene, unleash police hunt for a sadistic perpetrator. He puts investigation team in the way of a complex series of murders that shake the local region and criminologists themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvqszdsEDnliSnzJvogpIewefSs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64070'),
  ('215413654717135050', 'Labyrinth of Passion', 1999, 'Soap, Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', 'Issa López, Tere Medina, María del Carmen Peña', 'Leticia Calderón, Francisco Gattorno, César Évora Díaz, Manuel Ojeda, Azela Robinson, María Rubio, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Mónika Sánchez', null, 'Laberintos de pasión is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 1999. Starring Leticia Calderon, Francisco Gattorno, César Évora, in addition to the participation of Manuel Ojeda, Monika Sanchez and Azela Robinson.', 'Laberintos de pasión is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 1999. Starring Leticia Calderon, Francisco Gattorno, César Évora, in addition to the participation of Manuel Ojeda, Monika Sanchez and Azela Robinson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIRvxrnGWkcdPFsNCYuxUbWvaJ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59574'),
  ('608782928842403422', 'Labyrinth of Peace', 2020, 'Drama', 'Petra Biondina Volpe, Michael Schaerer', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Miron Sharshunov, Gustav Strunz, Britta Güntert, Dimitri Stapfer, Annina Walt, Max Hubacher, Stefan Kurt, Urs Bosshardt', null, '1945 Zero hour. Europe is reduced to rubble. Thirty million displaced and uprooted people. At the heart of this ravaged continent lies Switzerland. This small neutral country, which has been all but spared by the war, becomes a hub for Nazi war criminals, Allied Secret Services and Holocaust survivors.', '1945 Zero hour. Europe is reduced to rubble. Thirty million displaced and uprooted people. At the heart of this ravaged continent lies Switzerland. This small neutral country, which has been all but spared by the war, becomes a hub for Nazi war criminals, Allied Secret Services and Holocaust survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhkEhMB0PdhfQiG8yrgOcl6OrvQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112370'),
  ('792132511713274151', 'Lace', 1984, 'Drama, Soap', 'William Hale', 'Elliott Baker', 'Bess Armstrong, Brooke Adams, Arielle Dombasle, Phoebe Cates, Anthony Higgins, Angela Lansbury, Herbert Lom, Honor Blackman', null, 'A young actress gathers three former school friends to find out which one is her natural mother, who gave her up for adoption as a newborn.', 'A young actress gathers three former school friends to find out which one is her natural mother, who gave her up for adoption as a newborn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ3GEdspc6OTLdvMr4cV0HM5GWt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9503'),
  ('28314097369448638', 'Lad', 2026, 'Drama', 'Recai Karagöz', 'Aybike Ertürk', 'Mert Ramazan Demir, Melis Sezen, Salih Bademci, Mina Demirtaş', null, 'Yusuf, who grew up in the suburbs of Istanbul, is a young man who tries to keep his family afloat and does not bow to injustice. While he dreams of a modest life with his childhood sweetheart Hazan, fate drags him into the middle of the underworld, power games and class conflict. When he reappears years later with a completely different identity, nothing is the same anymore; The wounds of the past and the hidden secrets will force him to follow both his heart and his revenge.', 'Yusuf, who grew up in the suburbs of Istanbul, is a young man who tries to keep his family afloat and does not bow to injustice. While he dreams of a modest life with his childhood sweetheart Hazan, fate drags him into the middle of the underworld, power games and class conflict. When he reappears years later with a completely different identity, nothing is the same anymore; The wounds of the past and the hidden secrets will force him to follow both his heart and his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zChQ3tTAtUn306xBrDdI1VQkagZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314048'),
  ('1078212485662976138', 'Lada Gold', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Nikita Vlasov, Egor Chichkanov', null, 'Pavel Priluchnyy, Eldar Kalimulin, Stasya Miloslavskaya, Roman Evdokimov, Anna Bogomolova, Marina Zudina, Linda Lapinsh, Polina Gukhman', null, 'Arthur, the grandson of crime boss Midas, is forced to return from the Netherlands to Russia for his grandfather''s funeral. Pavel, the grandson of the hero policeman Ogurtsov, famous throughout Tolyatti, got bogged down in problems with his family, girlfriend and money. Both guys embark on the adventure of a lifetime on Lada 21043, made entirely of gangster gold. The car and the guys are being hunted by the leaders of three gangster groups who have just been released from prison — Bald, Buba and Grishka the singer, as well as the boundless Shamray, who will do anything to regain gold, influence and power.', 'Arthur, the grandson of crime boss Midas, is forced to return from the Netherlands to Russia for his grandfather''s funeral. Pavel, the grandson of the hero policeman Ogurtsov, famous throughout Tolyatti, got bogged down in problems with his family, girlfriend and money. Both guys embark on the adventure of a lifetime on Lada 21043, made entirely of gangster gold. The car and the guys are being hunted by the leaders of three gangster groups who have just been released from prison — Bald, Buba and Grishka the singer, as well as the boundless Shamray, who will do anything to regain gold, influence and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XDCNC2iU3sX87WPNPEmIt3ELAU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235503'),
  ('849584214817393005', 'Ladhood', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Liam Williams', 'Liam Williams', 'Liam Williams, Oscar Kennedy, Shaun Thomas, Samuel Bottomley, Aqib Khan', 'NR', 'When did it all go wrong? Liam, who parties too hard and disappoints his girlfriend, turns to his teenage years for answers. A funny, frank evaluation of how lads become men.', 'When did it all go wrong? Liam, who parties too hard and disappoints his girlfriend, turns to his teenage years for answers. A funny, frank evaluation of how lads become men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjzIr1WF9bSe8FmVG3j5n1vwPLF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96183'),
  ('711539262199045727', 'Ladies of London', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Marissa Hermer, Juliet Angus, Caroline Stanbury', 'TV-14', 'Set in the glittering, class-conscious city of London, this docu-series follows a group of elite British socialites and American expats who run in similar social circles, but are worlds apart. From weekend getaways in the English countryside, to high tea at one of London’s exclusive polo-clubs, both groups adhere to London’s strict unwritten rules of engagement where reputation is everything. Although they lead lives of unimaginable wealth, in London’s high society, fortune has less influence than bloodlines and respect is not easily earned.', 'Set in the glittering, class-conscious city of London, this docu-series follows a group of elite British socialites and American expats who run in similar social circles, but are worlds apart. From weekend getaways in the English countryside, to high tea at one of London’s exclusive polo-clubs, both groups adhere to London’s strict unwritten rules of engagement where reputation is everything. Although they lead lives of unimaginable wealth, in London’s high society, fortune has less influence than bloodlines and respect is not easily earned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JUtGXHoMYuYa0gtjlVFlQMHMZ1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60939'),
  ('304295278365805498', 'Ladies of London: The New Reign', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Myka Meier, Missè Beqiri, Martha Sitwell, Mark Francis Vandelli, Margo Stilley, Lottie Kane, Kimi Murdoch, Emma Thynn', null, 'A new wave of British blue bloods, ambitious American expats and glamorous international socialites light up London’s elite social scene. As tradition collides with the fast-paced globalized world, these power players redefine what it means to belong to high society in one of the most iconic cities in the world.', 'A new wave of British blue bloods, ambitious American expats and glamorous international socialites light up London’s elite social scene. As tradition collides with the fast-paced globalized world, these power players redefine what it means to belong to high society in one of the most iconic cities in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JUtGXHoMYuYa0gtjlVFlQMHMZ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312200'),
  ('673163632948073839', 'Ladies on Top', 2026, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Hayato Takao, Kohaku Shida, Takuma Usa, Ryo Sekoguchi, Nanaka Yano', null, 'Mitsuki Kajitani, a fiercely independent woman who can’t stand being led by men finds an unexpected match in Noriyuki Shinomiya, an awkward elite employee hopeless at dating—sparking a role-reversed romance where she takes the lead and inspires him to grow.', 'Mitsuki Kajitani, a fiercely independent woman who can’t stand being led by men finds an unexpected match in Noriyuki Shinomiya, an awkward elite employee hopeless at dating—sparking a role-reversed romance where she takes the lead and inspires him to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9f68RV70l6ums5BzzR6MT7RVd0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313902'),
  ('633549560951495588', 'Ladies versus Butlers!', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mai Nakahara, Ami Koshimizu, Ayako Kawasumi, Rie Kugimiya, Saori Hayami, Kana Hanazawa, Haruka Tomatsu, Ayumi Fujimura', 'TV-14', 'Raised by his uncle after his parents’ deaths, Akiharu enrolls at a mostly female academy that specializes in training maids and butlers for high society placements.', 'Raised by his uncle after his parents’ deaths, Akiharu enrolls at a mostly female academy that specializes in training maids and butlers for high society placements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjBHuTjC7KAGSAfeYY5q0q8ZcWn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37867'),
  ('136679709899670355', 'Lady & Liar', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tang Yan, Hawick Lau Hau-Wai, Yang Rong, Tony Yang, Zhang Meng, Tai Chih-yuan, 臧洪娜, Wang Yanlin', null, 'Set in 1930s Shanghai, Jiang Xin, an heir to a wealthy family, loses her memory in an accident. Du Xiaohan assumes her identity, while the real Jiang Xin is captured by powerful businessman Bai Zhangjie.', 'Set in 1930s Shanghai, Jiang Xin, an heir to a wealthy family, loses her memory in an accident. Du Xiaohan assumes her identity, while the real Jiang Xin is captured by powerful businessman Bai Zhangjie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLl6lLC1ejCN7hwgmjeK8bA1Q4o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63191'),
  ('849805141312195194', 'Lady Chatterley', 1993, 'Drama', 'Ken Russell', 'Michael Haggiag, Ken Russell', 'Joely Richardson, Sean Bean, James Wilby, Shirley Anne Field, Melanie Hughes, David Sterne', null, 'After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband''s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.', 'After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband''s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR5MdtO4409hNVctaKYKN9DNcY8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36737'),
  ('321721902625538611', 'Lady Dynamite', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pam Brady, Mitchell Hurwitz', null, 'Maria Bamford, Fred Melamed, Mary Kay Place, Ana Gasteyer, Mo Collins, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Lennon Parham, Bridget Everett', 'TV-MA', 'A single-camera half-hour comedy based on what Maria Bamford has accepted to be "her life." It''s the sometimes surreal story of a woman who loses — and then finds — her s**t.', 'A single-camera half-hour comedy based on what Maria Bamford has accepted to be "her life." It''s the sometimes surreal story of a woman who loses — and then finds — her s**t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ke7ShO4UdZ3M2WwAooUTQXoZAua.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66309'),
  ('275755844842763546', 'Lady Georgie', 1983, 'Animation, Drama', null, 'Yumiko Igarashi', 'Yuriko Yamamoto, Hideyuki Hori, Isao Nagahisa, Reiko Kitō, Sakiko Tamagawa, Eiko Yamada, Kyōsuke Maki, Miyuki Ueda', 'NR', 'G''day mate! There''s never a dull moment to be had when you''re running around in the Australian bush with the Buttman kids - especially that rambunctious little Georgie and her koala buddy, Rapp! The only problem she seems to have is keeping that heavy gold bracelet around her wrist. Odd thing for a kid her age to have, but then again, the bubbly blonde seems to be slightly out of place herself. Growing up through her fair share of hijinks and tragedy, Georgie begins to discover not just love, but who she may really be.', 'G''day mate! There''s never a dull moment to be had when you''re running around in the Australian bush with the Buttman kids - especially that rambunctious little Georgie and her koala buddy, Rapp! The only problem she seems to have is keeping that heavy gold bracelet around her wrist. Odd thing for a kid her age to have, but then again, the bubbly blonde seems to be slightly out of place herself. Growing up through her fair share of hijinks and tragedy, Georgie begins to discover not just love, but who she may really be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzb99IFsfAr3swEspIBtnVEbOhW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36664'),
  ('1021215124519058987', 'Lady in the Lake', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alma Har''el', null, 'Natalie Portman, Moses Ingram, Y''lan Noel, Brett Gelman, Byron Bowers, Noah Jupe, Josiah Cross, Mikey Madison', 'TV-MA', 'When the disappearance of a young girl grips the city of Baltimore on Thanksgiving 1966, the lives of two women, Maddie Schwartz and Cleo Sherwood, converge on a fatal collision course.', 'When the disappearance of a young girl grips the city of Baltimore on Thanksgiving 1966, the lives of two women, Maddie Schwartz and Cleo Sherwood, converge on a fatal collision course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydA20m966HriSYiSfgnXxhQx995.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120549'),
  ('736969827059960579', 'Lady Killers', 1980, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pieter Rogers', null, 'Robert Morley', null, 'Compelling crime anthology looks at some of Britain''s most notorious murder trials, in which both male and female defendants stood accused of the murder of women. Presented by Robert Morley, seven hour-long dramas reconstruct sensational trials which shocked Britain, offering in-depth analyses of individuals'' motives and methods.', 'Compelling crime anthology looks at some of Britain''s most notorious murder trials, in which both male and female defendants stood accused of the murder of women. Presented by Robert Morley, seven hour-long dramas reconstruct sensational trials which shocked Britain, offering in-depth analyses of individuals'' motives and methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCnIAnf2GpZg2StMSQ4BA5QCNlW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:23953'),
