  ('480135820172974855', 'Lady of Law', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Maggie Jiang, Liu Mintao, Peng Yuchang, Shi Mingze, Gao Shuguang, Gao Xin, Dai Xiangyu, Zhao Yihuan', null, 'Xu Jie was recruited to Mingtang Law Firm to take on the bribery case involving Chen Wen Guang. Chen''s daughter Chen Ran has also been secretly investigating the case. The two female lawyers with clashing views eventually come to a mutual understanding as they work together to reveal the truth.', 'Xu Jie was recruited to Mingtang Law Firm to take on the bribery case involving Chen Wen Guang. Chen''s daughter Chen Ran has also been secretly investigating the case. The two female lawyers with clashing views eventually come to a mutual understanding as they work together to reveal the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMPFG0ihoFB3TPcFnOf22joUuBT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201628'),
  ('285467930463805196', 'Lady of Tides', 2024, 'Soap', 'Raquel Palermo, João Matos', 'Raquel Palermo', 'Sofia Ribeiro, Afonso Pimentel, Júlia Palha, João Jesus, Albano Jerónimo, João Reis, Cláudia Vieira, Vera Kolodzig', null, 'On her birthday, Joana''s joy turns to despair when her abusive husband discovers her pregnancy and attempts to harm her. Fleeing the city, she finds refuge on a boat with criminals, but realizing the danger, she sees land beyond so leaps into the water and swims to Terceira Island, leaving her life behind. Exhausted on the shore, she encounters Chico, a lost child, during a religious ceremony. Joana arrives with the child, inadvertently becoming mistaken for a saint ''Our Lady of the Sea'', revered by the island''s faithful.', 'On her birthday, Joana''s joy turns to despair when her abusive husband discovers her pregnancy and attempts to harm her. Fleeing the city, she finds refuge on a boat with criminals, but realizing the danger, she sees land beyond so leaps into the water and swims to Terceira Island, leaving her life behind. Exhausted on the shore, she encounters Chico, a lost child, during a religious ceremony. Joana arrives with the child, inadvertently becoming mistaken for a saint ''Our Lady of the Sea'', revered by the island''s faithful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKhty3yNrojAYv4HlIILzIS5ZpR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242099'),
  ('317282167384271510', 'Lady Voyeur', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Marcela Citterio', null, 'Débora Nascimento, Emanuelle Araújo, Ângelo Rodrigues, Nikolas Antunes, Débora Duarte', 'TV-MA', 'A talented, voyeuristic hacker finds herself thrust into a dangerous investigation after her sex worker neighbor leaves for a weekend trip.', 'A talented, voyeuristic hacker finds herself thrust into a dangerous investigation after her sex worker neighbor leaves for a weekend trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BqzppbUELOLDUSuS8d9mWz97iH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135814'),
  ('958592057028377907', 'Lady, la vendedora de rosas', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Natalia Reyes, Michell Orozco, Majida Issa, Ernesto Benjumea, Yuri Vargas, María José Vargas, Carlos Mariño, Brian Moreno', null, 'The life story of Colombian film star Lady Tabares, who was plucked off the mean streets to star in a film and quickly rose to fame.', 'The life story of Colombian film star Lady Tabares, who was plucked off the mean streets to star in a film and quickly rose to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkiNJTUqgltJvqEpFP1QpzuujO2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92396'),
  ('211670190426705880', 'Laetitia', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Antoine Lacomblez, Jean-Xavier de Lestrade', 'Antoine Lacomblez, Jean-Xavier de Lestrade', 'Denis Duval, Grégory Ghezzi, Sam Karmann, Alix Poisson, Kévin Azaïs, Nicolas Bourgasser, Julien Emirian, Sophie Breyer', null, 'Eighteen-year-old Laetitia has disappeared. Police quickly arrest Tony Meilhon but investigators still can’t find the body. This story follows the repercussions for Laetitia’s family and twin sister Jessica; the police force inner workings and social services; the judicial system and government itself.', 'Eighteen-year-old Laetitia has disappeared. Police quickly arrest Tony Meilhon but investigators still can’t find the body. This story follows the repercussions for Laetitia’s family and twin sister Jessica; the police force inner workings and social services; the judicial system and government itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6c7ro7AQHHdYRRNe0FWGiMqyGg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93831'),
