  ('248610852126162352', 'Lakshmi Niwas', 2026, 'Family, Drama', 'Rashmi Sharma', null, 'Manasi Joshi Roy, Rajendra Chawla, Akshita Mudgal, Gashmeer Mahajani, Mansi Srivastava', null, 'Born into wealth, Lakshmi chooses love over privilege and leads a life of sacrifice with Shriniwas. Years later, the couple still pursues a home of their own and their daughter’s perfect wedding.', 'Born into wealth, Lakshmi chooses love over privilege and leads a life of sacrifice with Shriniwas. Years later, the couple still pursues a home of their own and their daughter’s perfect wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zClbboNpgsibtZZ6tFWjU4TEv8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310695'),
