  ('998805190831939408', 'Lascars', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alexis Dolivet', 'Ismaël Sy Savané', 'Vincent Cassel, Diane Kruger', null, 'Lascars is a French animated series created by Boris Dolivet, aka El Diablo, it was aired on the French channel Canal + for the first time in 1998. This series spawned two seasons, the first one in 1998 and the second in 2007, a pilot for a project of a 20 minute series, a comic and a movie. The episodes follow the mishaps of young men living in a district, the series is rife with hip-hop culture, most of the voice cast are French rappers. Lascars shorts aired in Canada on Teletoon under the title Homiez in English.', 'Lascars is a French animated series created by Boris Dolivet, aka El Diablo, it was aired on the French channel Canal + for the first time in 1998. This series spawned two seasons, the first one in 1998 and the second in 2007, a pilot for a project of a 20 minute series, a comic and a movie. The episodes follow the mishaps of young men living in a district, the series is rife with hip-hop culture, most of the voice cast are French rappers. Lascars shorts aired in Canada on Teletoon under the title Homiez in English.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b45bxHEPMPsUrGlSyfo6p099b4J.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21523'),
  ('509390867818574672', 'Lassie', 1954, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Robert Maxwell', null, 'Hugh Reilly, Josh Albee, Larry Pennell, Larry Wilcox', 'TV-G', 'Lassie is the pet of Jeff Miller, an 11-year-old farm boy. The two become best friends and enjoy family adventures in the American countryside, teaching each other about love, nature and commitment.', 'Lassie is the pet of Jeff Miller, an 11-year-old farm boy. The two become best friends and enjoy family adventures in the American countryside, teaching each other about love, nature and commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqbVr4fYRZb28ywczaidn29JJTA.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:5368'),
  ('145056056678984093', 'Last Call with Carson Daly', 2002, 'Talk', null, null, 'Carson Daly', null, 'Last Call with Carson Daly is an American late night television program hosted by Carson Daly and broadcast on NBC In 2003 and 2004, Last Call was nominated for a Teen Choice Award for "Choice TV Show – Late Night".', 'Last Call with Carson Daly is an American late night television program hosted by Carson Daly and broadcast on NBC In 2003 and 2004, Last Call was nominated for a Teen Choice Award for "Choice TV Show – Late Night".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Zw7Bqx0QcncLOiyO0D4kliljPw.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:5330'),
  ('689210726061380639', 'Last Call: When a Serial Killer Stalked Queer New York', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, 'Howard Gertler, Anthony Caronna', 'Matt Foreman, Michael Ferreri, Bea Hanson, Andy Humm, Ceyenne Doroshow, Thomas Macauley, Edgar Rodriguez, Thomas Hayes', 'TV-MA', 'In the early 1990s, with homophobia and hate crimes on the rise as the AIDS crisis worsens, a serial killer preys upon gay men in New York City, infiltrating queer nightlife to find his victims.', 'In the early 1990s, with homophobia and hate crimes on the rise as the AIDS crisis worsens, a serial killer preys upon gay men in New York City, infiltrating queer nightlife to find his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efffniTkFy8ejfcCM1BaMzWDAIi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229166'),
  ('769379954416714372', 'Last Chance Kitchen', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Eliminated from "Top Chef," contestants have a chance at redemption and face off in competition.', 'Eliminated from "Top Chef," contestants have a chance at redemption and face off in competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GhAqzG3kwu9LKxhTQiJE5qQBXs.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:91851'),
  ('395128266556839769', 'Last Chance U', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Greg Whiteley', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'In a docuseries set at one of NCAA football''s most fertile recruiting grounds, guys with red flags seek to prove their worth on the field and in class.', 'In a docuseries set at one of NCAA football''s most fertile recruiting grounds, guys with red flags seek to prove their worth on the field and in class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Gu5OupZlwfO0cwfRgsi1LfdE1i.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67027'),
  ('659466341411674135', 'Last Chance U: Basketball', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'John Mosley, Kenneth Hunter, Rob Robinson', 'TV-MA', 'Hit the hardwood in East Los Angeles as a coach with strong convictions leads young men who hope to fulfill major college potential.', 'Hit the hardwood in East Los Angeles as a coach with strong convictions leads young men who hope to fulfill major college potential.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s31DU5sL0NFkRUAiXyQl18Icptr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118876'),
  ('968118793471014517', 'Last Exile', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junko Noda, Wakana Yamazaki, Natsuko Kuwatani, Eri Kitamura, Michiko Neya, Ai Kayano, Aki Toyosaki, Aoi Yuuki', 'TV-PG', 'A richly romantic action-adventure fantasy, set in a world where retro-futuristic vehicles permeate the skies. Against this lavish background are the lives of young and heroic van ship sky porters - Claus and Lavie - who are forced to take on the mission to deliver a mysterious girl, Alvis, to the battle ship Silvana. Before they know it, they become entangled in an aerial adventure between two countries gripped in an eternal war of magnificent air battleships.', 'A richly romantic action-adventure fantasy, set in a world where retro-futuristic vehicles permeate the skies. Against this lavish background are the lives of young and heroic van ship sky porters - Claus and Lavie - who are forced to take on the mission to deliver a mysterious girl, Alvis, to the battle ship Silvana. Before they know it, they become entangled in an aerial adventure between two countries gripped in an eternal war of magnificent air battleships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJpGLLUoc2cYI6mxobHcmBCKHwk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31679'),
  ('321048067034451107', 'Last Friends', 2008, 'Drama', null, null, 'Masami Nagasawa, Juri Ueno, Eita Nagayama, Ryo Nishikido, Asami Mizukawa, Ranka Rea, Nagashima Mitsuki, Aki Nishihara', null, 'Follow the life of Michiru Aida, a beauty parlor assistant who returns to Tokyo after 4 years. Bullied by her seniors at work and abused by her boyfriend, she is reunited with her best friend during high school, Ruka Kishimoto, a skilled motocross racer. Takeru, a make-up artist, is introduced to Ruka by her housemate, Eri and thus begin a journey of friendship.', 'Follow the life of Michiru Aida, a beauty parlor assistant who returns to Tokyo after 4 years. Bullied by her seniors at work and abused by her boyfriend, she is reunited with her best friend during high school, Ruka Kishimoto, a skilled motocross racer. Takeru, a make-up artist, is introduced to Ruka by her housemate, Eri and thus begin a journey of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MCIQ6o2cAXUd7L8tn3z5pVG8Ev.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7815'),
  ('884280750372903166', 'LAST HOPE', 2018, 'Drama, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Kenjiro Tsuda, Nao Toyama, Kana Hanazawa, Ai Kayano, Takayuki Kondo, Kaito Ishikawa, Akira Ishida', 'TV-14', 'After causing the near extinction of mankind seven years ago, genius scientist Leon Lau must now fight the ecological disaster he unwittingly created.', 'After causing the near extinction of mankind seven years ago, genius scientist Leon Lau must now fight the ecological disaster he unwittingly created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWMRcwNXoKefS53x0pLnZgOhg3R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78434'),
  ('519419490650864911', 'Last King of the Cross', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Lincoln Younes, Claude Jabbour, Naveen Andrews, Luke Arnold, Matuse Paz, Charlie Di Stefano', null, 'Inspired by John Ibrahim''s best-selling autobiography, this series is an operatic story of two brothers, Sam and John Ibrahim who organize the street but lose each other in their ascent to power. The story tracks John Ibrahim''s rise from a poverty-stricken immigrant with no education, no money, and no prospects, to Australia''s most infamous nightclub mogul in Sydney''s Kings Cross — a mini-Atlantic City, barely half a mile long with every form of criminality on offer.', 'Inspired by John Ibrahim''s best-selling autobiography, this series is an operatic story of two brothers, Sam and John Ibrahim who organize the street but lose each other in their ascent to power. The story tracks John Ibrahim''s rise from a poverty-stricken immigrant with no education, no money, and no prospects, to Australia''s most infamous nightclub mogul in Sydney''s Kings Cross — a mini-Atlantic City, barely half a mile long with every form of criminality on offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVjb3Zt0Hp1zxOXJ1pwZ2JRPqNC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:204290'),
  ('526793473220438080', 'Last Light', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Matthew Fox, Joanne Froggatt, Alyth Ross, Taylor Fay, Amber Rose Revah, Eliška Sládečková', null, 'Separated across continents, petro-chemist Andy Yeats and his family must survive the deadly effects of a sudden global oil crisis and find the mastermind behind it all.', 'Separated across continents, petro-chemist Andy Yeats and his family must survive the deadly effects of a sudden global oil crisis and find the mastermind behind it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eO3lnmd5ubKoweXhrGpoieGhmkJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195821'),
  ('930051262551460270', 'Last Man Standing', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Jack Burditt', null, 'Tim Allen, Nancy Travis, Héctor Elizondo, Christoph Sanders, Amanda Fuller, Jordan Masterson, Molly McCook', 'TV-PG', 'A married father of three tries to maintain his manliness in a world increasingly dominated by women.', 'A married father of three tries to maintain his manliness in a world increasingly dominated by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofUvbcwxcA0E7qYUlhBx4gZmAzX.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:39297'),
  ('609793825281813207', 'Last Minute Romance', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Han Seung-yeon, Lee Seo-won', null, 'Baek-Se (Han Seung-Yeon) lives an ordinary life. She is a big fan of a top star. One day, Baek-Se is diagnosed with a terminal disease and she doesn''t have much time left to live. She decides to have a contract date with Dong-Joon (Lee Seo-Won) who looks just like the top star she likes.', 'Baek-Se (Han Seung-Yeon) lives an ordinary life. She is a big fan of a top star. One day, Baek-Se is diagnosed with a terminal disease and she doesn''t have much time left to live. She decides to have a contract date with Dong-Joon (Lee Seo-Won) who looks just like the top star she likes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pIQsbKqh7d9U9QXjdliByjmHtw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74948'),
  ('7462466767643610', 'Last of the Summer Wine', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Roy Clarke', null, 'Peter Sallis, Frank Thornton, Jane Freeman, Jean Fergusson, Robert Fyfe, Juliette Kaplan, Sarah Thomas, Jean Alexander', 'TV-14', 'Unencumbered by wives, jobs or any other responsibilities, three senior citizens who''ve never really grown up explore their world in the Yorkshire Dales. They spend their days speculating about their fellow townsfolk and thinking up adventures not usually favored by the elderly. Last of the Summer Wine premiered as an episode of Comedy Playhouse in 1973. The show ran for 295 episodes until 2010. It is the longest running comedy Britain has produced and the longest running sitcom in the world.', 'Unencumbered by wives, jobs or any other responsibilities, three senior citizens who''ve never really grown up explore their world in the Yorkshire Dales. They spend their days speculating about their fellow townsfolk and thinking up adventures not usually favored by the elderly. Last of the Summer Wine premiered as an episode of Comedy Playhouse in 1973. The show ran for 295 episodes until 2010. It is the longest running comedy Britain has produced and the longest running sitcom in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjI4WdHda9ckCo5YIYVhc8rl6SR.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:4250'),
  ('1145107404418339460', 'Last One Standing', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Daigo Yamamoto, Nobuyuki Hayakawa', 'TV-MA', 'They''re comedians starring in a thrilling drama, but if their jokes don''t land in the unscripted scenes, they''re off the show. Let the mayhem begin!', 'They''re comedians starring in a thrilling drama, but if their jokes don''t land in the unscripted scenes, they''re off the show. Let the mayhem begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccrIAENWOZE7gcXFrTwL8QqcW99.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:157926'),
  ('672076448209553233', 'Last Period: the journey to the end of the despair', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Ayumu Murase, Ai Kayano, Akari Kito', null, 'There is a world where fantastic beasts called "Spirals" are born from isolation. Those who can defeat the beasts are called "Periods." Haru is an apprentice Period who belongs to the Arc End 8th Branch. However, after a mysterious theft incident, there is an economic collapse, and the Arc End headquarters abandons the 8th Division, leaving only three Periods left, including Haru. Haru and the other two Periods start their work to rebuild the 8th Division.', 'There is a world where fantastic beasts called "Spirals" are born from isolation. Those who can defeat the beasts are called "Periods." Haru is an apprentice Period who belongs to the Arc End 8th Branch. However, after a mysterious theft incident, there is an economic collapse, and the Arc End headquarters abandons the 8th Division, leaving only three Periods left, including Haru. Haru and the other two Periods start their work to rebuild the 8th Division.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGVLU23WFUOMXt9CFlwMrIaQbnZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78481'),
  ('631254525074371586', 'Last Resort', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Shawn Ryan, Karl Gajdusek', null, 'Andre Braugher, Scott Speedman, Daisy Betts, Camille De Pazzis, Dichen Lachman, Daniel Lissing, Sahr Ngaujah, Autumn Reeser', 'TV-14', 'When the crew of the U.S. ballistic missile submarine Colorado refuse to fire nuclear weapons at Pakistan without confirmation of the orders, they are fired upon and declared rogue enemies of their own country.', 'When the crew of the U.S. ballistic missile submarine Colorado refuse to fire nuclear weapons at Pakistan without confirmation of the orders, they are fired upon and declared rogue enemies of their own country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SxZtDZIEuc077pm8uacHiWTrBZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44652'),
  ('287626661860318177', 'Last Samurai Standing', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Junichi Okada, Yumia Fujisaki, Kaya Kiyohara, Masahiro Higashide, Shota Sometani, Taichi Saotome, Yuya Endo, Yasushi Fuchikami', 'TV-MA', 'In the early Meiji era, Shujiro, once known as an undefeated samurai, decides to participate in a deadly survival game to save his family and villagers.', 'In the early Meiji era, Shujiro, once known as an undefeated samurai, decides to participate in a deadly survival game to save his family and villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKNEFlrs68rzweVzfwkjWmkJqu7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:252193'),
  ('611813047494369914', 'Last Summer', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Deniz Dargı, Cem Görgeç, Cenk Boğatur', 'Ali Atay, Alperen Duymaz, Yaprak Medine, Hafsanur Sancaktutan, Birce Akalay, Arif Pişkin, Zuhal Gencer, Halil Babür', null, 'Idealist Public Prosecutor Selim Kara receives an offer he cannot refuse from the organized crime leader Selçuk Taşkın, whom he sent to prison 8 years ago. Selçuk Taşkın wants to testify in one of Prosecutor Selim''s cases and his testimony will destroy the whole criminal organization. However, there is only one condition for this; the personal protection of his son, Akgün Gökalp Taşkın.', 'Idealist Public Prosecutor Selim Kara receives an offer he cannot refuse from the organized crime leader Selçuk Taşkın, whom he sent to prison 8 years ago. Selçuk Taşkın wants to testify in one of Prosecutor Selim''s cases and his testimony will destroy the whole criminal organization. However, there is only one condition for this; the personal protection of his son, Akgün Gökalp Taşkın.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9OMWw7OIoAMmFV6vFidAoPt6QU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115464'),
  ('27050519069659962', 'Last Summer', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Min Yeon-hong', 'Jeon Yu-ri', 'Lee Jae-wook, Choi Sung-eun, Kim Gun-woo, Kwon Ah-reum, Ahn Dong-gu, Jung Bo-min, Choi Byung-mo, Jung Hee-tae', null, 'Every summer reunion between twin brothers and their neighbor blossoms into unspoken love, until adulthood and a past tragedy change their lives forever.', 'Every summer reunion between twin brothers and their neighbor blossoms into unspoken love, until adulthood and a past tragedy change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL0tinB01aOBlYmTJaybxIzc2qm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261902'),
  ('532005643880900187', 'Last Tango in Halifax', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sally Wainwright', null, 'Anne Reid, Derek Jacobi, Sarah Lancashire, Nicola Walker, Tony Gardner, Josh Bolt, Dean Andrews, Nina Sosanya', 'TV-14', 'Celia and Alan are both widowed and in their seventies. When their respective grandsons put their details on Facebook, they rediscover a passionate relationship that started over sixty years ago.', 'Celia and Alan are both widowed and in their seventies. When their respective grandsons put their details on Facebook, they rediscover a passionate relationship that started over sixty years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpIubS7v8ClGhlW3pciGnvzMQYP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:47801'),
  ('602418789503280132', 'Last Twilight', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kittisak Kongka', 'Pongsate Lucksameepong, Kittisak Kongka', 'Jitaraphol Potiwihok, Tawinan Anukoolprasert, Tipnaree Weerawatnodom, Pakin Kuna-anuwit, Premsinee Ratanasopha', null, 'A struggling student becomes a caregiver to a fading badminton star, and as his sight slips away, the two forge a bond tested by time and fate.', 'A struggling student becomes a caregiver to a fading badminton star, and as his sight slips away, the two forge a bond tested by time and fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buyQqbfJ2gNcog86HrTawMyxVPD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217800'),
  ('263354482425073925', 'Last Week Tonight with John Oliver', 2014, 'Talk, Comedy, News', 'John Oliver', null, 'John Oliver', 'TV-MA', 'A half-hour satirical look at the week in news, politics and current events.', 'A half-hour satirical look at the week in news, politics and current events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuuEjEr69uvRtGaQw70JfvdrUwb.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:60694'),
  ('1107550966223824084', 'Lastman', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Laurent Sarfati, Léonie de Rudder, Jérémie Périn', 'Laurent Sarfati', 'Vincent Ropion', null, 'Paxtown, a corrupt capital, torn by crime and preyed by the mafia. In this rotten megalopolis, Richard Aldana, street smart, without ties or ambitions, is a boxer in his off time. But this was all before everything got flipped on its head. Overnight, Aldana finds himself with Siri, a girl targeted by "The Order of the Lion," a religious group that thinks the girl is the key to "the other world".', 'Paxtown, a corrupt capital, torn by crime and preyed by the mafia. In this rotten megalopolis, Richard Aldana, street smart, without ties or ambitions, is a boxer in his off time. But this was all before everything got flipped on its head. Overnight, Aldana finds himself with Siri, a girl targeted by "The Order of the Lion," a religious group that thinks the girl is the key to "the other world".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wr7ew7w2zg3g2xWuSexaKzGXzo3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68888'),
  ('747744140544027371', 'Late motiv', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Andreu Buenafuente', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztX861v81n2cYZ3nGOR1Ypw4R5N.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:74179'),
  ('860621901219331476', 'Late Night with Conan O''Brien', 1993, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Lorne Michaels, Conan O''Brien', 'Jonathan Groff, Dino Stamatopoulos, Ned Goldreyer', 'Conan O''Brien, Joel Godard', 'TV-14', 'Stepping into the late-late slot vacated by David Letterman, Conan O''Brien stars in a show that far outdoes its competition in sheer strangeness. Along with the celebrity interviews and musical numbers typical of late-night talk shows, this program make frequent use of odd walk-on characters and frequent "visits" from celebrity guests.', 'Stepping into the late-late slot vacated by David Letterman, Conan O''Brien stars in a show that far outdoes its competition in sheer strangeness. Along with the celebrity interviews and musical numbers typical of late-night talk shows, this program make frequent use of odd walk-on characters and frequent "visits" from celebrity guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJZ1rhLLFpatuAeylJoUI82DKC7.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:4573'),
  ('1095765526241773445', 'Late Night with David Letterman', 1982, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Lorne Michaels', 'Jeff Martin, Matt Wickline, David Letterman', 'David Letterman', null, 'Late Night with David Letterman is a nightly hour-long comedy talk show on NBC that was created and hosted by David Letterman. It premiered in 1982 as the first incarnation of the Late Night franchise and went off the air in 1993, after Letterman left NBC and moved to Late Show on CBS. Late Night with Conan O''Brien then filled the time slot. As of March 2, 2009, the slot has been filled by Late Night with Jimmy Fallon. It will be filled by Seth Meyers in the spring of 2014, after Fallon becomes host of The Tonight Show.', 'Late Night with David Letterman is a nightly hour-long comedy talk show on NBC that was created and hosted by David Letterman. It premiered in 1982 as the first incarnation of the Late Night franchise and went off the air in 1993, after Letterman left NBC and moved to Late Show on CBS. Late Night with Conan O''Brien then filled the time slot. As of March 2, 2009, the slot has been filled by Late Night with Jimmy Fallon. It will be filled by Seth Meyers in the spring of 2014, after Fallon becomes host of The Tonight Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSraSPTeNoiR60ti9amNqLvM3Em.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:4467'),
  ('789931284782292466', 'Late Night with Jimmy Fallon', 2009, 'Talk', 'Lorne Michaels, Jimmy Fallon', null, 'Jimmy Fallon', null, 'Late Night with Jimmy Fallon is an American late-night talk show airing weeknights at 12:35 am Eastern/11:35 pm Central on NBC in the United States. The hour-long show premiered on March 2, 2009, and is hosted by actor, comedian and performer Jimmy Fallon, an alumnus of Saturday Night Live. Hip hop/neo soul band The Roots serve as the show''s house band, and Steve Higgins is the show''s announcer. The third incarnation of the Late Night franchise originated by David Letterman, the program originates from NBC Studio 6B in the GE Building at 30 Rockefeller Center in New York City. The show typically opens with a brief monologue from Fallon, followed by a comedy "desk piece," as well as prerecorded segments and audience competitions. The next segment is devoted to a celebrity interview, with guests ranging from actors and musicians to media personalities and political figures. The show then closes with either a musical or comedy performance. The show frequently employs digital media into its comedy, which has become crucial to its success. Fallon has been appointed to become the next host of The Tonight Show, where he will succeed the current host Jay Leno at the conclusion of the 2014 Winter Olympics, with fellow SNL alum Seth Meyers slated to replace Fallon.', 'Late Night with Jimmy Fallon is an American late-night talk show airing weeknights at 12:35 am Eastern/11:35 pm Central on NBC in the United States. The hour-long show premiered on March 2, 2009, and is hosted by actor, comedian and performer Jimmy Fallon, an alumnus of Saturday Night Live. Hip hop/neo soul band The Roots serve as the show''s house band, and Steve Higgins is the show''s announcer. The third incarnation of the Late Night franchise originated by David Letterman, the program originates from NBC Studio 6B in the GE Building at 30 Rockefeller Center in New York City. The show typically opens with a brief monologue from Fallon, followed by a comedy "desk piece," as well as prerecorded segments and audience competitions. The next segment is devoted to a celebrity interview, with guests ranging from actors and musicians to media personalities and political figures. The show then closes with either a musical or comedy performance. The show frequently employs digital media into its comedy, which has become crucial to its success. Fallon has been appointed to become the next host of The Tonight Show, where he will succeed the current host Jay Leno at the conclusion of the 2014 Winter Olympics, with fellow SNL alum Seth Meyers slated to replace Fallon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8WzbOr7vg3WDlB3hoy32wZDxwj.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:8621'),
  ('131742311767817103', 'Late Night with Seth Meyers', 2014, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Seth Meyers', 'TV-14', 'Seth Meyers, who is "Saturday Night Live''s" longest serving anchor on the show''s wildly popular "Weekend Update," takes over as host of NBC''s "Late Night" — home to A-list celebrity guests, memorable comedy and the best in musical talent. As the Emmy Award-winning head writer for "SNL," Meyers has established a reputation for sharp wit and perfectly timed comedy, and has gained fame for his spot-on jokes and satire. Meyers takes his departure from "SNL" to his new post at "Late Night," as Jimmy Fallon moves to "The Tonight Show".', 'Seth Meyers, who is "Saturday Night Live''s" longest serving anchor on the show''s wildly popular "Weekend Update," takes over as host of NBC''s "Late Night" — home to A-list celebrity guests, memorable comedy and the best in musical talent. As the Emmy Award-winning head writer for "SNL," Meyers has established a reputation for sharp wit and perfectly timed comedy, and has gained fame for his spot-on jokes and satire. Meyers takes his departure from "SNL" to his new post at "Late Night," as Jimmy Fallon moves to "The Tonight Show".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8VruEGv7mtyJihVn2CSA1u90pk.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:61818'),
  ('28625840880433505', 'Late Night! The Genius Bakabon', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Fujio Akatsuka', null, 'Arata Furuta, Miyu Irino, Noriko Hidaka, Ai Nonaka, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Akira Ishida, Takahiro Sakurai', null, 'Tensai Bakabon has been off the airwaves for almost 20 years! What''s a Papa to do in dire times like the late 2010s? How about break every rule in the anime books, throw in celebrity guests, and take a nonsensical peek into the little things in modern life like otome games, blind dates, and the possibility that a series from the Showa era could make it to now! Is this really how it should be?!', 'Tensai Bakabon has been off the airwaves for almost 20 years! What''s a Papa to do in dire times like the late 2010s? How about break every rule in the anime books, throw in celebrity guests, and take a nonsensical peek into the little things in modern life like otome games, blind dates, and the possibility that a series from the Showa era could make it to now! Is this really how it should be?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUQ5vabTMiSSlhkgZ36Po72rLVf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80400'),
  ('850630040506615487', 'Late Show with David Letterman', 1993, 'Talk, Comedy', null, 'David Letterman', 'David Letterman, Paul Shaffer, Alan Kalter', 'TV-PG', 'David Letterman uses mature humor to appeal to his audience in this weeknight series, which gets its music from a house band led by Paul Shaffer. Among the show''s most-famous segments are the Top Ten List and Stupid Pet Tricks, the latter of which subsequently led to an additional recurring segment called Stupid Human Tricks.', 'David Letterman uses mature humor to appeal to his audience in this weeknight series, which gets its music from a house band led by Paul Shaffer. Among the show''s most-famous segments are the Top Ten List and Stupid Pet Tricks, the latter of which subsequently led to an additional recurring segment called Stupid Human Tricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wzEg2MknkM5AGytRrb1DRife6F.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:498'),
  ('137461715719209266', 'Laugh Together', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Yang Di, Chen Xinhao', null, 'Each episode invites the main creators/leading actors of a production to customize a unique theme. Through themed interactive games and sharing amusing behind-the-scenes stories from the set, the guests bring joy and excitement. Fan wishes are directly incorporated into the show... Here, drama fans can enjoy a feast, and netizens can laugh so hard!', 'Each episode invites the main creators/leading actors of a production to customize a unique theme. Through themed interactive games and sharing amusing behind-the-scenes stories from the set, the guests bring joy and excitement. Fan wishes are directly incorporated into the show... Here, drama fans can enjoy a feast, and netizens can laugh so hard!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLidSaIRBqKwu5mBBWla0noPmU4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289210'),
  ('267519858500952373', 'Laughing in the Wind', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Zhang Jizhong', null, 'Li Yapeng, Xu Qing, Li Jie, Wei Zi, Bayaneruul, 苗乙乙, Chen Lifeng, Lü Xiaohe', null, 'Laughing in the Wind is a 2001 Chinese television series produced by Zhang Jizhong, starring Li Yapeng and Xu Qing in the leading roles. The series is an adaptation of Louis Cha''s novel The Smiling, Proud Wanderer. It was first broadcast on CCTV in China in 2001.', 'Laughing in the Wind is a 2001 Chinese television series produced by Zhang Jizhong, starring Li Yapeng and Xu Qing in the leading roles. The series is an adaptation of Louis Cha''s novel The Smiling, Proud Wanderer. It was first broadcast on CCTV in China in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz9NrreBwZNBlzhP7DD1vYucLE7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30689'),
  ('509440110712900986', 'Laughing Under the Clouds', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Yuichi Nakamura, Takahiro Sakurai, Tsubasa Yonaga', null, 'When swords were outlawed in the eleventh year of the Meiji era, the mighty samurai population began to dwindle. Those who rejected the ban on blades rebelled, causing violent unrest to erupt throughout the countryside. To combat the rise in criminal activity, an inescapable lake prison was constructed. Three young men, born of the Kumo line, were given the duty of delivering criminals to their place of confinement – but could there be more to their mission than meets the eye?', 'When swords were outlawed in the eleventh year of the Meiji era, the mighty samurai population began to dwindle. Those who rejected the ban on blades rebelled, causing violent unrest to erupt throughout the countryside. To combat the rise in criminal activity, an inescapable lake prison was constructed. Three young men, born of the Kumo line, were given the duty of delivering criminals to their place of confinement – but could there be more to their mission than meets the eye?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcrQycpGmyx3YUVE04NRff6i925.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61742'),
  ('17314341426080793', 'Laughter Chefs Unlimited Entertainment', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Bharti Singh, Harpal Singh Shokhi, Krishna Abhishek, Kashmera Shah, Karan Kundra, Aly Goni, Jannat Zubair Rahmani, Elvish Yadav', null, 'Colors presents an innovative blend of celebrity personalities, culinary skills, and comedy, all coming together for a delightful entertainment experience.', 'Colors presents an innovative blend of celebrity personalities, culinary skills, and comedy, all coming together for a delightful entertainment experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu9yTo3VOY5k7b3PQT5RT74W4GU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:257530'),
  ('449839322406140918', 'Laurel Canyon', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Alison Ellwood', null, 'Neil Young, Joni Mitchell, Eric Clapton, Jackson Browne, Linda Ronstadt, Don Henley, Michelle Phillips, Graham Nash', null, 'Featuring all-new, original interviews with Jackson Browne, Don Henley, Michelle Phillips, Graham Nash, Linda Ronstadt, Bonnie Raitt, Roger McGuinn and more, this uniquely immersive and experiential two-part docuseries takes us back in time to a place where a rustic canyon in the heart of Los Angeles became a musical petri dish.', 'Featuring all-new, original interviews with Jackson Browne, Don Henley, Michelle Phillips, Graham Nash, Linda Ronstadt, Bonnie Raitt, Roger McGuinn and more, this uniquely immersive and experiential two-part docuseries takes us back in time to a place where a rustic canyon in the heart of Los Angeles became a musical petri dish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBwT79gCXhTM7KP13T3tHVyAMJl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100248'),
  ('305091427842296851', 'Laverne & Shirley', 1976, 'Comedy, Family', 'Garry Marshall, Mark Rothman, Lowell Ganz', null, 'Penny Marshall, Cindy Williams, David L. Lander, Michael McKean, Phil Foster, Eddie Mekka, Leslie Easterbrook', 'TV-G', 'Best friends, roommates, and polar opposites, Laverne DeFazio and Shirley Feeney work together at the Shotz Brewery in Milwaukee and keep each other''s spirits up at home.', 'Best friends, roommates, and polar opposites, Laverne DeFazio and Shirley Feeney work together at the Shotz Brewery in Milwaukee and keep each other''s spirits up at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUMK8AZ5uvJoTXqgGjYQNoIkf5N.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:3033'),
  ('126794131120244232', 'Law & Order', 1990, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dick Wolf', null, 'Reid Scott, Maura Tierney, Tony Goldwyn, Hugh Dancy, Odelya Halevi', 'TV-14', 'In cases ripped from the headlines, police investigate serious and often deadly crimes, weighing the evidence and questioning the suspects until someone is taken into custody. The district attorney''s office then builds a case to convict the perpetrator by proving the person guilty beyond a reasonable doubt. Working together, these expert teams navigate all sides of the complex criminal justice system to make New York a safer place.', 'In cases ripped from the headlines, police investigate serious and often deadly crimes, weighing the evidence and questioning the suspects until someone is taken into custody. The district attorney''s office then builds a case to convict the perpetrator by proving the person guilty beyond a reasonable doubt. Working together, these expert teams navigate all sides of the complex criminal justice system to make New York a safer place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haJ9eHytVO3H3JooMJG1DiWwDNm.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:549'),
  ('536231994929279770', 'Law & Order Toronto: Criminal Intent', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tassie Cameron', null, 'Aden Young, Kathleen Munroe, K.C. Collins, Karen Robinson', null, 'An elite squad of detectives investigate high-profile crime and corruption in metro Toronto.', 'An elite squad of detectives investigate high-profile crime and corruption in metro Toronto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqD7W5EGue5Nvg0BNEnoRyMQAcz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:228026'),
  ('190214404875303599', 'Law & Order True Crime', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'René Balcer', null, 'Edie Falco, Gus Halper, Miles Gaston Villanueva', 'TV-14', 'An anthology series that delves into the players, the crime and the media circus, detailing the day-to-day battles of the trial and unveiling the shocking truth of what really went down when the cameras stopped rolling.', 'An anthology series that delves into the players, the crime and the media circus, detailing the day-to-day battles of the trial and unveiling the shocking truth of what really went down when the cameras stopped rolling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14T6cTwynqxU10e1cCnSc75AcNa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72496'),
  ('907335507075795985', 'Law & Order: Criminal Intent', 2001, 'Drama', 'Dick Wolf', null, 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Kathryn Erbe, Julia Ormond, Jay O. Sanders', 'TV-14', 'The third installment of the “Law & Order” franchise takes viewers deep into the minds of its criminals while following the intense psychological approaches the Major Case Squad uses to solve its crimes.', 'The third installment of the “Law & Order” franchise takes viewers deep into the minds of its criminals while following the intense psychological approaches the Major Case Squad uses to solve its crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgBg8gTCELQg73awE7qAuV06c4Z.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:4601'),
  ('622393964286596915', 'Law & Order: LA', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dick Wolf', null, null, 'TV-14', 'From the tony Beverly Hills to the seedy side of Hollywood, LAPD’s elite Robbery Homicide Division is on the case. Fusing classic ripped-from-the-headlines storytelling with the backdrop of LA, the series delves into the high profile crimes of the west coast.', 'From the tony Beverly Hills to the seedy side of Hollywood, LAPD’s elite Robbery Homicide Division is on the case. Fusing classic ripped-from-the-headlines storytelling with the backdrop of LA, the series delves into the high profile crimes of the west coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxYWv7XeeUqT0ikW9ccIyjeJKTQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32632'),
  ('715292281703289403', 'Law & Order: Organized Crime', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dick Wolf, Ilene Chaiken, Matt Olmstead', null, 'Christopher Meloni, Danielle Moné Truitt, Rick Gonzalez, Dean Norris', 'TV-14', 'The detectives of the Organized Crime Control Bureau work to dismantle New York City''s most vicious and violent illegal enterprises.', 'The detectives of the Organized Crime Control Bureau work to dismantle New York City''s most vicious and violent illegal enterprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOffjfafVLyav9CMDgBfIv49J9Y.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:106158'),
  ('541613598444201170', 'Law & Order: Special Victims Unit', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Dick Wolf', null, 'Mariska Hargitay, Ice-T, Kelli Giddish, Peter Scanavino, Aimé Donna Kelly, Kevin Kane, Corey Cott', 'TV-14', 'In the criminal justice system, sexually-based offenses are considered especially heinous. In New York City, the dedicated detectives who investigate these vicious felonies are members of an elite squad known as the Special Victims Unit. These are their stories.', 'In the criminal justice system, sexually-based offenses are considered especially heinous. In New York City, the dedicated detectives who investigate these vicious felonies are members of an elite squad known as the Special Victims Unit. These are their stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iofokHZoUB4Qhik4PflvJl8TT6a.jpg', 27, 'tmdb:tv:2734'),
  ('988549305645258934', 'Law & Order: Trial by Jury', 2005, 'Drama', 'Dick Wolf', null, 'Bebe Neuwirth, Amy Carlson, Kirk Acevedo, Fred Thompson', 'TV-14', 'The inner workings of the judicial system, beginning with the arraignment, and continuing through the prosecutors'' complicated process of building a case, investigating leads and preparing witnesses for trial.', 'The inner workings of the judicial system, beginning with the arraignment, and continuing through the prosecutors'' complicated process of building a case, investigating leads and preparing witnesses for trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nVHqaRDRqLCMpA2DQW0XSQnu5j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3357'),
  ('556958485094784719', 'Law & Order: UK', 2009, 'Drama', null, null, 'Bradley Walsh, Dominic Rowan, Peter Davison, Paterson Joseph, Georgia Taylor, Ben Bailey Smith', 'TV-14', 'Adapted from the hit US series, Law &amp; Order: UK follows a team of police detectives and prosecutors representing the public interest in the criminal justice system.', 'Adapted from the hit US series, Law &amp; Order: UK follows a team of police detectives and prosecutors representing the public interest in the criminal justice system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cQ76tkIVRTurBgktZxryH8cdh4.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:7098'),
  ('1050279977603770262', 'Law and the City', 2025, 'Drama', 'Park Seung-woo', 'Lee Seung-hyun', 'Lee Jong-suk, Mun Ka-young, Kang You-seok, Ryu Hye-young, Im Sung-jae, Yeom Hye-ran, Lee Seo-hwan, Kim Ji-hyun', null, 'Story of a lawyer who is known for his good appearance and straightforward personality and is working with Gyeongmin Law Firm for 9 years.', 'Story of a lawyer who is known for his good appearance and straightforward personality and is working with Gyeongmin Law Firm for 9 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVykmkPdo81mLToE2YLeZOLy7yd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273418'),
  ('63953860265956543', 'Law dis-Order', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Liu Kai-Chi, Ali Lee, Mandy Wong, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Griselda Yeung, Ram Chiang Chi-Kwong, Matthew Ho', null, 'As the co-founder of the Chinese law firm Donald & Co., Charles Cheuk, has been a chairman of its committee for many years. Though he had promised his managing partner KC Lau that he would step down, Charles hires the money-minded lawyer Kent Cheung as a new partner for the firm, hoping that he would be able to counterbalance KC’s growing obsession for authority.', 'As the co-founder of the Chinese law firm Donald & Co., Charles Cheuk, has been a chairman of its committee for many years. Though he had promised his managing partner KC Lau that he would step down, Charles hires the money-minded lawyer Kent Cheung as a new partner for the firm, hoping that he would be able to counterbalance KC’s growing obsession for authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptFv6evOrZDMOVgGq7c158WKib3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80114'),
  ('448467349393195240', 'Law Enforcers', 2001, null, null, null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Lau Nga-Lai, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Halina Tam Siu-Wan, Hawick Lau Hau-Wai, May Law Koon-Lan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBaLOn6vxGNyLFlg5byoc9dx28d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108232'),
  ('925704698313900420', 'Law of the Jungle', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kim Byung-man', null, 'Law of the Jungle is a hybrid reality show combining elements of drama and documentary. The show is hosted by comedian Kim Byung Man, and each episode invites various celebrities from the various field. So far, many of idol stars and famous actors have appeared on the show. The show introduces viewers to exotic locations around the world where celebrities must work together in order to complete missions and survive. The cast celebrities travel to less habituated, natural places to survive on their own and experience life with local tribes and people. In each location, the guests are tasked to hunt and prepare their meals and also create shelter for the tribe. They sometimes confronted by many difficult challenges. Where will the tribe visit? And how will they survive on their own? Stay tuned to check out!', 'Law of the Jungle is a hybrid reality show combining elements of drama and documentary. The show is hosted by comedian Kim Byung Man, and each episode invites various celebrities from the various field. So far, many of idol stars and famous actors have appeared on the show. The show introduces viewers to exotic locations around the world where celebrities must work together in order to complete missions and survive. The cast celebrities travel to less habituated, natural places to survive on their own and experience life with local tribes and people. In each location, the guests are tasked to hunt and prepare their meals and also create shelter for the tribe. They sometimes confronted by many difficult challenges. Where will the tribe visit? And how will they survive on their own? Stay tuned to check out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgMOq3H27nYikqjykeXCIIFRbjK.jpg', 57, 'tmdb:tv:52910'),
  ('169944898726346705', 'Law of the Plainsman', 1959, 'Western', null, null, 'Michael Ansara', null, 'Law of the Plainsman is a Western television series starring Michael Ansara that aired on the NBC television network from October 1, 1959, until May 5, 1960. The character of Native American U.S. Marshal Sam Buckhart was introduced in two episodes of the popular ABC Western television series The Rifleman starring Chuck Connors as Lucas McCain. Law of the Plainsman is distinctive and unique in that it was one of the few television programs that featured a Native American as the lead character, a bold move for U.S.network television at that time. Ansara had earlier appeared in the series Broken Arrow, having portrayed the Apache chief, Cochise. Ansara, however, was not Native American but of Syrian descent. Ansara played Sam Buckhart, an Apache Indian who saved the life of a U.S. Cavalry officer after an Indian ambush. When the officer died, he left Sam money that was used for an education at private schools and Harvard University. After school, he returned to New Mexico where he became a Deputy Marshal working for Marshal Andy Morrison. He lived in a boarding house run by Martha Commager. The only other continuing character was 8-year old Tess Logan, an orphan who had been rescued by Buckhart. Robert Harland, later of Target: The Corruptors! starred in seven episodes as Deputy Billy Lordan. Wayne Rogers, who went on to star in another Four Star western, Stagecoach West, and later, M*A*S*H, also played deputy Lordan in several episodes.', 'Law of the Plainsman is a Western television series starring Michael Ansara that aired on the NBC television network from October 1, 1959, until May 5, 1960. The character of Native American U.S. Marshal Sam Buckhart was introduced in two episodes of the popular ABC Western television series The Rifleman starring Chuck Connors as Lucas McCain. Law of the Plainsman is distinctive and unique in that it was one of the few television programs that featured a Native American as the lead character, a bold move for U.S.network television at that time. Ansara had earlier appeared in the series Broken Arrow, having portrayed the Apache chief, Cochise. Ansara, however, was not Native American but of Syrian descent. Ansara played Sam Buckhart, an Apache Indian who saved the life of a U.S. Cavalry officer after an Indian ambush. When the officer died, he left Sam money that was used for an education at private schools and Harvard University. After school, he returned to New Mexico where he became a Deputy Marshal working for Marshal Andy Morrison. He lived in a boarding house run by Martha Commager. The only other continuing character was 8-year old Tess Logan, an orphan who had been rescued by Buckhart. Robert Harland, later of Target: The Corruptors! starred in seven episodes as Deputy Billy Lordan. Wayne Rogers, who went on to star in another Four Star western, Stagecoach West, and later, M*A*S*H, also played deputy Lordan in several episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tReblyXSokbKbsxNKcDdsySmaMx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14656'),
  ('536607482875034291', 'Law School', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Seo In, Kim Sok-yun', null, 'Kim Myung-min, Kim Bum, Ryu Hye-young, Lee Jung-eun, Park Hyuk-kwon, Ahn Nae-sang, Jung Won-joong, Lee Soo-kyung', null, 'Following the case of the murder of a professor at South Korea''s top prestigious law school, professors and students become suspects in the murder.', 'Following the case of the murder of a professor at South Korea''s top prestigious law school, professors and students become suspects in the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52LCQBgB9Lu0djjIU24p6YI5sQk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119773'),
  ('658927974384762935', 'Lawless Lawyer', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kim Jin-min', 'Yoon Hyun-ho', 'Lee Joon-gi, Seo Yea-ji, Lee Hye-young, Choi Min-soo, Yeom Hye-ran, Ahn Nae-sang, Lee Han-wi, Lee Dae-yeon', 'TV-14', 'Driven by the desire to avenge his mother, a former gangster turned lawyer uses both his fists and the loopholes in law to fight against those with absolute power.', 'Driven by the desire to avenge his mother, a former gangster turned lawyer uses both his fists and the loopholes in law to fight against those with absolute power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2a6Rw1PDolj3APDtcg9vX2BCmE8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78796'),
  ('853918725685419278', 'Lawman', 1958, 'Western', null, null, 'John Russell, Peter Brown, Peggie Castle', 'TV-PG', 'Lawman is an American western television series originally telecast on ABC from 1958 to 1962 starring John Russell as Marshal Dan Troop and featuring Peter Brown as Deputy Marshal Johnny McKay. The series was set in Laramie, Wyoming during 1879 and the 1880s. Warner Bros. already had several western series on the air at the time, having launched Cheyenne with Clint Walker as early as 1955. The studio continued the trend in 1957 with the additions of Maverick with James Garner and Jack Kelly, Colt .45 with Wayde Preston, and Sugarfoot with Will Hutchins. One year later, Warner Bros. added Lawman and Bronco with Ty Hardin. Prior to the beginning of production, Russell and Brown and producer Jules Schermer made a pact to maintain the quality of the series so that it would not be seen as "just another western." At the start of season two, Russell and Brown were joined by Peggie Castle as Lily Merrill, the owner of the Birdcage Saloon, and a love interest for Dan.', 'Lawman is an American western television series originally telecast on ABC from 1958 to 1962 starring John Russell as Marshal Dan Troop and featuring Peter Brown as Deputy Marshal Johnny McKay. The series was set in Laramie, Wyoming during 1879 and the 1880s. Warner Bros. already had several western series on the air at the time, having launched Cheyenne with Clint Walker as early as 1955. The studio continued the trend in 1957 with the additions of Maverick with James Garner and Jack Kelly, Colt .45 with Wayde Preston, and Sugarfoot with Will Hutchins. One year later, Warner Bros. added Lawman and Bronco with Ty Hardin. Prior to the beginning of production, Russell and Brown and producer Jules Schermer made a pact to maintain the quality of the series so that it would not be seen as "just another western." At the start of season two, Russell and Brown were joined by Peggie Castle as Lily Merrill, the owner of the Birdcage Saloon, and a love interest for Dan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18XzHfhbRKw9Cl8cKH7WkV9yjYr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:13887'),
  ('358901642430952007', 'Lawmen: Bass Reeves', 2023, 'Drama', 'Chad Feehan', null, 'David Oyelowo, Lauren E. Banks, Demi Singleton, Forrest Goodluck, Barry Pepper, Dennis Quaid, Grantham Coleman, Donald Sutherland', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Bass Reeves, the legendary lawman of the wild West, is brought to life. Reeves worked in the post-Reconstruction era as a federal peace officer in the Indian Territory, capturing over 3,000 of the most dangerous criminals without ever being wounded—and is believed to be the inspiration for The Lone Ranger.', 'The story of Bass Reeves, the legendary lawman of the wild West, is brought to life. Reeves worked in the post-Reconstruction era as a federal peace officer in the Indian Territory, capturing over 3,000 of the most dangerous criminals without ever being wounded—and is believed to be the inspiration for The Lone Ranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94OpFcIZ3ZExqyJgrYafo41tZSt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157732'),
  ('312919799825884587', 'Laws of Attraction', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Thanapat Kawila, Rachata Hampanont, Parattakorn Kaiyanan, Satjakorn Chalard, Vorarit Fuangarome, Rasee Wacharapolmek, Pavida Moriggi, Duangdao Jarujinda', null, 'A ruthless lawyer seeking revenge teams up with a grieving uncle to uncover a high-profile conspiracy while falling in love with him.', 'A ruthless lawyer seeking revenge teams up with a grieving uncle to uncover a high-profile conspiracy while falling in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwBRpKXxF8LrsPlLwdFMVHf7IMJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222241'),
  ('1108060791265531208', 'Laws of love', 2018, 'Soap, Drama', 'Mónica Agudelo Tenorio, Vanesa Varela, José Alberto Castro', 'Vanesa Varela, Fernando Garcilita', 'Ana Brenda Contreras, David Zepeda, Julián Gil, José María Torre, Sergio Basañez, Altaír Jarabo, Guillermo García Cantú, Nataly Umaña', 'NR', 'The story of two lawyers specializing in family law, Ricardo and Alejandra, that despite coming from two disappointments and being in a world where it seems that love loses strength, before so much divorce, they still have faith in finding true love.', 'The story of two lawyers specializing in family law, Ricardo and Alejandra, that despite coming from two disappointments and being in a world where it seems that love loses strength, before so much divorce, they still have faith in finding true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npiUbnBvgzAKvFe0eqT8VqhQ0yn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77607'),
  ('661144034262774954', 'Layl', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Mahmoud Nasr, Carmen Bsaibes, Sabah Jazairi, وسام فارس, Joe Trad', null, 'An ambassador’s daughter and a farmer’s son share a love that defies class and time. When she vanishes, his world shatters – until her return years later with secrets that turn their love into a haunting reckoning.', 'An ambassador’s daughter and a farmer’s son share a love that defies class and time. When she vanishes, his world shatters – until her return years later with secrets that turn their love into a haunting reckoning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Fj7gDqNWcslqwDYwlYYPGPYhGG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:308689'),
  ('557522069599107256', 'Layton Mystery Detective Agency: Kat''s Mystery‑Solving Files', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Kids', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Koichi Yamadera, Kyousuke Ikeda, Hibiku Yamamura, Jurota Kosugi, Soma Saito, Yohei Tadano', null, 'The story is set in London and follows Katrielle as she solves mysteries with her talking dog Sherl.', 'The story is set in London and follows Katrielle as she solves mysteries with her talking dog Sherl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ce3KtE6u6n643mFM1RlIxn0xEUe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78479'),
  ('627384548852246958', 'Lazarus', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Shinichiro Watanabe', null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Makoto Furukawa, Maaya Uchida, Yuma Uchida, Manaka Iwami, Megumi Hayashibara', 'TV-14', 'In 2052, a Nobel Prize-winning neuroscientist develops a drug called Hapna — a cure-all that has the unexpected side-effect of causing death three years later. In response to this threat, a special force of agents—nicknamed "Lazarus"— is assembled to take on the malevolent Skinner.', 'In 2052, a Nobel Prize-winning neuroscientist develops a drug called Hapna — a cure-all that has the unexpected side-effect of causing death three years later. In response to this threat, a special force of agents—nicknamed "Lazarus"— is assembled to take on the malevolent Skinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ViqUWPWh6aPZGQA57FMRVmaXZ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231003'),
  ('292543632195440425', 'Lazy Company', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Samuel Bodin, Alexandre Philip', 'Alexandre Philip', 'Alexandre Philip, Alban Lenoir, Aurélia Poirier, Benoît Moret, Antoine Lesimple', null, 'Four American soldiers catastrophically take part in D-Day and commit blunder after blunder.', 'Four American soldiers catastrophically take part in D-Day and commit blunder after blunder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHA1If0n7bFe4ui5qtA3STAkS5h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61365'),
  ('625368953449578051', 'LazyTown', 2004, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Magnús Scheving', null, 'Chloe Lang, Magnús Scheving, Stefán Karl Stefánsson, Guðmundur Þór Kárason', 'TV-Y', 'A pink-haired girl named Stephanie moves to LazyTown with her uncle (the mayor of LazyTown), where she tries to teach its extremely lazy residents that physical activity is beneficial.', 'A pink-haired girl named Stephanie moves to LazyTown with her uncle (the mayor of LazyTown), where she tries to teach its extremely lazy residents that physical activity is beneficial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bkxU7kTMLuhBOPnkAYXtCsqZj3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1894'),
  ('348440285770994729', 'LBW: Love Beyond Wicket', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Aruna Rakhee', 'Vikranth, Niyathi Kadambi, Sindhu Shyam, Nikhil Nair, Akshathaa Ajit, Harish, Naveen, Karthi', 'TV-MA', 'A washed-up PT teacher, a legendary coach and a generation of misfit students come together to save a legacy.', 'A washed-up PT teacher, a legendary coach and a generation of misfit students come together to save a legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tC5K8MkLipwV9bIdJV9SQcCzgUF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307959'),
  ('653753897635987276', 'LBX Girls', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rikako Aida, Rie Murakawa, Saori Onishi, Ayaka Fukuhara, Saki Miyashita', 'TV-14', 'In an unplanned field trip, Riko is transported to an alternate Japan where metal-based life forms known as Mimesis ravage the world. Only girls equipped with LBX armored weaponry can stand up to this scourge. Joined by four other displaced young women, Riko will have to adapt to save humanity. The hope of a planet now rests on these heavy metal soldiers who desire one wish—to return home again!', 'In an unplanned field trip, Riko is transported to an alternate Japan where metal-based life forms known as Mimesis ravage the world. Only girls equipped with LBX armored weaponry can stand up to this scourge. Joined by four other displaced young women, Riko will have to adapt to save humanity. The hope of a planet now rests on these heavy metal soldiers who desire one wish—to return home again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMyUgCTuKoKiuU96l9Z2b3LdXSG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104155'),
