  ('651504693480375286', 'Le Cercle', 2005, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'As long as there is cinema, LE CERCLE will be there. It is the only television program of critical debates 100% devoted to cinema. Each week, it offers fiery, joyful and non-condescending jousts on the films on the bill; and invites with "Le questionnaire du CERCLE" directors to come and share their passion for cinema.', 'As long as there is cinema, LE CERCLE will be there. It is the only television program of critical debates 100% devoted to cinema. Each week, it offers fiery, joyful and non-condescending jousts on the films on the bill; and invites with "Le questionnaire du CERCLE" directors to come and share their passion for cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPz9qDxB4j6GcCFaXK94lyc3JNP.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:252500'),
  ('460174548845177128', 'Le Chevalier D''Eon', 2006, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Kaori Nazuka, Mayo Suzukaze, Takahiro Sakurai, Hideyuki Umezu, Ken Narita, Masami Suzuki, Yasunori Matsumoto, Akihiko Ishizumi', 'TV-14', 'Paris, 1742. While investigating the murder of his beautiful sister—Lia—D’Eon uncovers an evil which casts shadows in both the palaces of kings and the dark alleys of Europe. It is a dark and strange power—one which allows Lia’s soul to return from beyond and possess her brother in order to avenge her own death.', 'Paris, 1742. While investigating the murder of his beautiful sister—Lia—D’Eon uncovers an evil which casts shadows in both the palaces of kings and the dark alleys of Europe. It is a dark and strange power—one which allows Lia’s soul to return from beyond and possess her brother in order to avenge her own death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkTR8IWaqzhd0bE16JWVZPW3hp4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37513'),
  ('807822141696530600', 'Le cœur a ses raisons', 2005, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Marc Brunet', null, 'Anne Dorval, Marc Labrèche, Sophie Faucher, Pierre Brassard, Pascale Bussières, James Hyndman, Macha Grenon, Élise Guilbault', null, 'In the fictional city of Saint Andrews, Brett Montgomery, a wealthy cosmetics businessman and doctor at the local hospital, and Brad, his evil twin brother, battle for control of the Montgomery family fortune. Brett’s fiancée, Cricket, is a journalist with the local television station and has a twin sister, Ashley, who is a nurse at the hospital.', 'In the fictional city of Saint Andrews, Brett Montgomery, a wealthy cosmetics businessman and doctor at the local hospital, and Brad, his evil twin brother, battle for control of the Montgomery family fortune. Brett’s fiancée, Cricket, is a journalist with the local television station and has a twin sister, Ashley, who is a nurse at the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhS1R2vZAH4bVKVneBwZ0f3R0lB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2903'),
