  ('667753277482448197', 'Le Portrait de Petite Cossette', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mitsuki Saiga, Marina Inoue, Megumi Toyoguchi, Ikumi Hayama', 'TV-MA', 'Eiri works at his uncle''s antique shop, and one day stumbles across a glass. Upon touching the glass, he receives visions from what he finds out to be a girl, Cossette, haunting the glass. She''s been searching for over 250 years for someone who could see her, and now she needs his help.', 'Eiri works at his uncle''s antique shop, and one day stumbles across a glass. Upon touching the glass, he receives visions from what he finds out to be a girl, Cossette, haunting the glass. She''s been searching for over 250 years for someone who could see her, and now she needs his help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auZdNEDCeHfSfVXX971WH4M70a6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73501'),
