  ('601573733545614036', 'Lee San, Wind in the Palace', 2007, 'Drama', 'Kim Yi-young', 'Kim Yi-young, Jung Hae-ri', 'Lee Seo-jin, Han Ji-min, Lee Soon-jae, Kyeon Mi-ri, Sung Hyun-ah, Kim Yeo-jin, Park Eun-hye, Lee Jong-soo', null, 'Yi San, also known as Wind of the Palace, is a 2007 South Korean historical drama, starring Lee Seo-jin, Han Ji-min, Park Eun-hye, and Lee Jong-soo. It aired on Munhwa Broadcasting Corporation from September 17, 2007 to June 16, 2008 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55. The series was produced by Lee Byeong-Hoon, who also produced award-winning television series Dae Jang Geum. It won "Top Excellence Acting Award" for Lee Seo Jin and "Best Actress" for Han Ji-min at MBC''s Acting Awards.', 'Yi San, also known as Wind of the Palace, is a 2007 South Korean historical drama, starring Lee Seo-jin, Han Ji-min, Park Eun-hye, and Lee Jong-soo. It aired on Munhwa Broadcasting Corporation from September 17, 2007 to June 16, 2008 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55. The series was produced by Lee Byeong-Hoon, who also produced award-winning television series Dae Jang Geum. It won "Top Excellence Acting Award" for Lee Seo Jin and "Best Actress" for Han Ji-min at MBC''s Acting Awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Gv9g6YAMYMH84tQLTK5KG66xBU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15135'),
