  ('146958488653549529', 'Les Beaux Malaises', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Martin Matte', null, 'Martin Matte, Julie Le Breton, Émilie Bierre, Charles William Ross, Patrice Robitaille, Martin Perizzolo, Michèle Deslauriers', null, 'Fictional series based on the life (and starring) Martin Matte, a comedian and popular figure in PQ, Canada. It tells the story of the awkward but funny moments that the stand-up man has to face everyday.', 'Fictional series based on the life (and starring) Martin Matte, a comedian and popular figure in PQ, Canada. It tells the story of the awkward but funny moments that the stand-up man has to face everyday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4uRtF8qVvxrJ0fMVsjigz2jxBs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66406'),
