  ('979676541368342257', 'Limmy''s Show!', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Brian Limond', 'Brian Limond', 'Brian Limond, Paul McCole, Alan McHugh , Kirstin McLean', null, 'Limmy''s Show is a Scottish comedy sketch show written, animated and directed by Brian Limond. The show stars Brian Limond, Ryan Fletcher, Paul McCole, Alan McHugh and Kirstin McLean. Previous stars include Debbie Welsh, Tom Brogan and Raymond Mearns.', 'Limmy''s Show is a Scottish comedy sketch show written, animated and directed by Brian Limond. The show stars Brian Limond, Ryan Fletcher, Paul McCole, Alan McHugh and Kirstin McLean. Previous stars include Debbie Welsh, Tom Brogan and Raymond Mearns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8u5CpV3yRmTEXO8TdXcjST6mei.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32056'),
  ('900604003724988552', 'Lincoln', 1988, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Sam Waterston, Mary Tyler Moore, Richard Mulligan, Deborah Adair, Ruby Dee, Thomas Gibson, Tom Brennan, Gregory Cooke', null, 'The life of Abraham Lincoln, from his election as President of the United States to the time of his assassination. Based on Gore Vidal''s historical novel.', 'The life of Abraham Lincoln, from his election as President of the United States to the time of his assassination. Based on Gore Vidal''s historical novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc8lye6k3lJHwAXyFnuAAOfzJFG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17364'),
  ('686413539257841614', 'Lincoln Heights', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Seth Freeman', null, 'Russell Hornsby, Nicki Micheaux, Erica Hubbard, Rhyon Nicole Brown, Mishon Ratliff, Robert Adamson', null, 'Eddie Sutton is a dedicated police officer, his wife Jenn, a devoted nurse, but their most important job is as parents to their three teenage children Cassie, Tay and Lizzie. They''re your everyday American family living in the suburbs of Southern California, but the Suttons are thrown for a loop when Eddie decides to move his wife and three kids to the inner-city neighborhood where he grew up.', 'Eddie Sutton is a dedicated police officer, his wife Jenn, a devoted nurse, but their most important job is as parents to their three teenage children Cassie, Tay and Lizzie. They''re your everyday American family living in the suburbs of Southern California, but the Suttons are thrown for a loop when Eddie decides to move his wife and three kids to the inner-city neighborhood where he grew up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNhsM92gYftNFagus4aUIfj1iJU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:904'),
  ('137448230118481477', 'Lincoln Rhyme: Hunt for the Bone Collector', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Mark Bianculli, VJ Boyd', null, 'Russell Hornsby, Arielle Kebbel, Roslyn Ruff, Ramses Jimenez, Brooke Lyons, Tate Ellington, Brían F. O''Byrne, Michael Imperioli', 'TV-14', 'Former NYPD detective and forensic genius Lincoln Rhyme was at the top of his game until a serious accident at the hands of a notorious serial killer forced him out of the field. When Amelia Sachs, an intuitive young officer who has a gift for profiling, finds herself hot on the killer''s trail, Rhyme finds a partner for this new game of cat and mouse.', 'Former NYPD detective and forensic genius Lincoln Rhyme was at the top of his game until a serious accident at the hands of a notorious serial killer forced him out of the field. When Amelia Sachs, an intuitive young officer who has a gift for profiling, finds herself hot on the killer''s trail, Rhyme finds a partner for this new game of cat and mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIgxUeQRtnspj0BLm3H7rawSqPK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95272'),
  ('718509306543661951', 'Lindenstraße', 1985, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Hans W. Geißendörfer', null, 'Marie-Luise Marjan, Joachim Hermann Luger, Moritz A. Sachs, Knut Hinz, Andrea Spatzek, Georg Uecker, Ludwig Haas, Sybille Waury', null, 'Lindenstraße is a German television show on ARD''s Das Erste, one of Germany''s two publicly administered TV channels. The first episode was aired on 8 December 1985 and since then new episodes have been broadcast weekly. Its current timeslot on Das Erste is Sundays at 18:50. The events of the Sunday episode usually take place on the Thursday before the show, based on the TV station''s original plan of airing the episodes Thursday night. Prior of the start of the show, the timeslot was switched to Sunday evening but the Thursday remained the day the events usually take place as the show shall feature the daily life routine of the protagonists on a working day. Exceptions are the so-called holiday episodes that take place on Sunday, such as for Christmas and Easter and also on important election days. Setting the pace for other soap operas in Germany, the first episodes were met with mostly bad reviews. However, Lindenstraße soon became one of the most successful shows on German TV.', 'Lindenstraße is a German television show on ARD''s Das Erste, one of Germany''s two publicly administered TV channels. The first episode was aired on 8 December 1985 and since then new episodes have been broadcast weekly. Its current timeslot on Das Erste is Sundays at 18:50. The events of the Sunday episode usually take place on the Thursday before the show, based on the TV station''s original plan of airing the episodes Thursday night. Prior of the start of the show, the timeslot was switched to Sunday evening but the Thursday remained the day the events usually take place as the show shall feature the daily life routine of the protagonists on a working day. Exceptions are the so-called holiday episodes that take place on Sunday, such as for Christmas and Easter and also on important election days. Setting the pace for other soap operas in Germany, the first episodes were met with mostly bad reviews. However, Lindenstraße soon became one of the most successful shows on German TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtEfxxXIbGwslHryMuEvV9jvBsd.jpg', 35, 'tmdb:tv:11661'),
  ('758963837884148650', 'Line of Duty', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jed Mercurio', null, 'Martin Compston, Vicky McClure, Adrian Dunbar, Gregory Piper, Nigel Boyle, Kelly Macdonald, Owen Teale, Anneika Rose', 'TV-MA', 'A drama about the investigations of AC-12, a controversial police anticorruption unit.', 'A drama about the investigations of AC-12, a controversial police anticorruption unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysGUKnnR1pGYIndjXWcjupGbWpS.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:43982'),
  ('101398284101264907', 'Line of Separation', 2015, 'Drama', null, 'Silke Zertz', 'Henriette Confurius, Heiner Lauterbach, Martina Gedeck, Peter Schneider, Jonathan Berlin, Alexander Held, Rainer Bock, Florian Brückner', 'TV-14', 'After the fall of the Third Reich, the small town of Tannbach is cruelly divided between East and West regimes and the town’s inhabitants suffer the consequences. A gripping historical drama exploring the devastating effects decades of conflict had on communities from the end of the Second War War to the fall of the Berlin Wall.', 'After the fall of the Third Reich, the small town of Tannbach is cruelly divided between East and West regimes and the town’s inhabitants suffer the consequences. A gripping historical drama exploring the devastating effects decades of conflict had on communities from the end of the Second War War to the fall of the Berlin Wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfG2VaextaudDe0004mtGZOWufm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72796'),
  ('1070985611461917003', 'Line Walker', 2014, 'Crime', 'Tommy Leung Ga-Shu', null, 'Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Benjamin Yuen Wai-Ho, Priscilla Wong, Raymond Lam Fung, Kenneth Ma Kwok-Ming, Mandy Wong, Sisley Choi Si-Pui', null, 'Chief inspector of Hong Kong’s Criminal Intelligence Bureau, Cheuk Hoi, is suspicious of his close colleague’s mysterious death. Adding to the enigma, he discovers that the five undercover agents who were in constant contact with his dead friend have all vanished.', 'Chief inspector of Hong Kong’s Criminal Intelligence Bureau, Cheuk Hoi, is suspicious of his close colleague’s mysterious death. Adding to the enigma, he discovers that the five undercover agents who were in constant contact with his dead friend have all vanished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WLV2KTrvVZ7PoUlap5eBoKxYEp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75117'),
  ('1037010926734135802', 'Linebarrels of Iron', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Miyuki Sawashiro, Tetsuya Kakihara, Rie Kugimiya, Kana Ueda, Aya Hirano, Jun Fukuyama, Biichi Sato', null, 'Centers around Kouichi Hayase, a fourteen-year-old boy living a mediocre life, until an accident turns him into the pilot of a gigantic robot called "Linebarrel" and leads him to encounter a mysterious girl.', 'Centers around Kouichi Hayase, a fourteen-year-old boy living a mediocre life, until an accident turns him into the pilot of a gigantic robot called "Linebarrel" and leads him to encounter a mysterious girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieHjmuA24mG0InX2WZH7uQ9TfEy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36248'),
  ('838356893250339090', 'Ling Cage', 2019, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', null, null, '夏一可, Sheng Feng, Gu Jiangshan, Ji Guanlin, Liu Mingyue, Xu Jiaqi, Dafang Gong, Chang Rongshan', null, 'In the near future, human inhabitants would have been crowded and congested. It was an urgency to stride out to the universe and find a new home. When everything was under progress in an orderly way, dramatic geological transformations erupted over the courses of decades. Humanity was demolished by this disaster and hardly left anything. Until the nature gradually restored calm, people struggled to their feet from ruins and abysses, stepping again onto this familiar but strange earth. But for us people, dominating everything has been rooted into our blood. Are we still masters of this new world?', 'In the near future, human inhabitants would have been crowded and congested. It was an urgency to stride out to the universe and find a new home. When everything was under progress in an orderly way, dramatic geological transformations erupted over the courses of decades. Humanity was demolished by this disaster and hardly left anything. Until the nature gradually restored calm, people struggled to their feet from ruins and abysses, stepping again onto this familiar but strange earth. But for us people, dominating everything has been rooted into our blood. Are we still masters of this new world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p65f4XPIneEjFhASI9HuJId3D3d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91097'),
  ('710897293987420543', 'Lingerie', 2009, 'Drama', 'John Quinn', null, 'Jennifer Korbin, Amber Smith, Lana Tailor, Denise Cobar, Marcus Colby, Emily MacLeod, Michael Murray, Geoff Stevens', 'TV-MA', 'Lingerie is an erotic drama about a struggling New York City lingerie company, its owner Lacey Summers, and her friends and associates.', 'Lingerie is an erotic drama about a struggling New York City lingerie company, its owner Lacey Summers, and her friends and associates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juXv0TqEva03i2YnmdeXSVpeX4p.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40314'),
