  ('900776202069108416', 'Lisey''s Story', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stephen King', null, 'Julianne Moore, Clive Owen, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Dane DeHaan, Joan Allen', 'TV-MA', 'This terrifying thriller follows widow Lisey Landon as a series of disturbing events revives memories of her marriage to author Scott Landon and the darkness that plagued him.', 'This terrifying thriller follows widow Lisey Landon as a series of disturbing events revives memories of her marriage to author Scott Landon and the darkness that plagued him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBh4EuCmk3ZWfs16KKuhYHUqWdM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95839'),
  ('988505193274385943', 'Listen to Me, Girls. I''m Your Father!', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Wataru Hatano, Sumire Uesaka, Eri Kitamura, Hiromi Igarashi, Yui Horie, Daisuke Ono, Junji Majima, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'Segawa Yuta is a freshman of a university. He lost his parents when he was small and was raised by his sister Yuri. Yuta has been living alone since Yuri got married to a middle aged man when Yuta was a junior high student. One day, Yuri visited Yuta''s apartment and asked him to take care of her three daughters while Yuri and her husband were on a trip. He unwillingly accepted the job but the plane Yuri took went missing. In order to prevent the daughters from being adopted separately by relatives, Yuta decided to take in all three girls. A life of a strange family in a tiny apartment begins.', 'Segawa Yuta is a freshman of a university. He lost his parents when he was small and was raised by his sister Yuri. Yuta has been living alone since Yuri got married to a middle aged man when Yuta was a junior high student. One day, Yuri visited Yuta''s apartment and asked him to take care of her three daughters while Yuri and her husband were on a trip. He unwillingly accepted the job but the plane Yuri took went missing. In order to prevent the daughters from being adopted separately by relatives, Yuta decided to take in all three girls. A life of a strange family in a tiny apartment begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4LD5zdovH7WhqLWXRrTFNasV7t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46183'),
  ('28787967066016839', 'Listen Up!', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Tony Kornheiser', 'Tony Kornheiser', 'Jason Alexander, Malcolm-Jamal Warner, Wendy Makkena, Daniella Monet, Will Rothhaar', 'TV-PG', 'Listen Up! is an American situation comedy that aired on CBS from September 20, 2004 until April 25, 2005. The sitcom was based loosely on the life and exploits of the popular sportswriter and sports-media personality Tony Kornheiser. Its principal executive producer was Jason Alexander, who was also the lead actor. Despite decent-to-good ratings, the show was canceled by CBS on May 18, 2005; "rising production costs" was the major reason officially given for the cancellation.', 'Listen Up! is an American situation comedy that aired on CBS from September 20, 2004 until April 25, 2005. The sitcom was based loosely on the life and exploits of the popular sportswriter and sports-media personality Tony Kornheiser. Its principal executive producer was Jason Alexander, who was also the lead actor. Despite decent-to-good ratings, the show was canceled by CBS on May 18, 2005; "rising production costs" was the major reason officially given for the cancellation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rM5eQjhTlwYeYX7h91db2W8jEJf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10119'),
  ('823771316444215996', 'Listeners', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Takahashi, Ayumu Murase, Koichi Yamadera, Nana Mizuki, Junichi Suwabe, Sayaka Ohara, Yoko Hikasa, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-14', 'Set in a world where the concept of music ceases to exist. the story begins when a boy encounters Myuu, a mysterious girl who possesses an audio input jack in her body. The two intermingle with the history of rock music and embark on an unforgettable journey.', 'Set in a world where the concept of music ceases to exist. the story begins when a boy encounters Myuu, a mysterious girl who possesses an audio input jack in her body. The two intermingle with the history of rock music and embark on an unforgettable journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUYgm7JQIDojyOSWc14yc1RTWzn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98748'),
  ('504061638796507776', 'Little America', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Eisenberg', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Observe the funny, romantic, heartfelt, inspiring, and surprising stories of immigrants in America.', 'Observe the funny, romantic, heartfelt, inspiring, and surprising stories of immigrants in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lAMdxL8uirqyavsD6H3QGQmTkA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80336'),
  ('613982532491450922', 'Little Angel Face', 2000, 'Soap, Drama, Kids, Comedy', 'Kary Fajer', 'Kary Fajer, Abel Santacruz, Alberto Gómez', 'Daniela Aedo, Lisette Morelos, Miguel de León, Libertad Lamarque, Silvia Pinal, Nora Salinas, Marisol Santacruz, Manuel Saval', 'TV-PG', 'Carita de Angel is a remake of the telenovela Papa Corazon, which also was adapted for Mundo de juguete. Tells the story of Dulce Maria, a sweet, 5-year-old girl full of joy, compassion, and good feelings. After the death of her mother, her father Luciano Larios sinks into depression and lives abroad for a few years, leaving his daughter and loved ones behind. Dulce Maria enrolls in a Catholic boarding school for girls called "Reina de America" (Queen of America) to be taken care of by the nuns, as well as being taken care of by her uncle Gabriel, who is a priest.', 'Carita de Angel is a remake of the telenovela Papa Corazon, which also was adapted for Mundo de juguete. Tells the story of Dulce Maria, a sweet, 5-year-old girl full of joy, compassion, and good feelings. After the death of her mother, her father Luciano Larios sinks into depression and lives abroad for a few years, leaving his daughter and loved ones behind. Dulce Maria enrolls in a Catholic boarding school for girls called "Reina de America" (Queen of America) to be taken care of by the nuns, as well as being taken care of by her uncle Gabriel, who is a priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cQ8B9WwAlTfY7bkXJrPEecnAxu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58710'),
  ('1141763373992904142', 'Little Bear', 1995, 'Animation, Drama, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Else Holmelund Minarik, Maurice Sendak, Bob Boyle', null, 'Kristin Fairlie, Jennifer Martini, Amos Crawley, Tracy Ryan, Andrew Sabiston, Elizabeth Hanna, Janet-Laine Green, Dan Hennessey', 'TV-Y', 'Follows a young bear as he goes on exciting adventures in the forest, gets into trouble and learns new things with his friends, including Emily, Duck, Hen, Cat, and Owl. His parents are Mother Bear, who is always there when he needs her, and Father Bear, a fisherman who is often at sea. Based on books by Else Holmelund Minarik.', 'Follows a young bear as he goes on exciting adventures in the forest, gets into trouble and learns new things with his friends, including Emily, Duck, Hen, Cat, and Owl. His parents are Mother Bear, who is always there when he needs her, and Father Bear, a fisherman who is often at sea. Based on books by Else Holmelund Minarik.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLm7pkUAoi2AGsnPXrPnZ3ErlKs.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:9834'),
  ('533057591161942459', 'Little Bheem', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rajiv Chilaka', 'Raj Viswanadha, Arun Shendurnikar, Nidhi Anand', 'Sonal Kaushal, Pinky Rajput, Julie Tejwani, Rajesh Kava, Shailey Dubey, Vatsal Dubey, Rupa Bhimani, Jigna Bhardwaj', 'TV-Y7', 'Chhota Bheem is an Indian animated series adventures about a boy named Bheem and his friends in fictional village of Dholakpur.Bheem and his friends are usually involved in protecting the village from various evil forces.', 'Chhota Bheem is an Indian animated series adventures about a boy named Bheem and his friends in fictional village of Dholakpur.Bheem and his friends are usually involved in protecting the village from various evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc4GJ8jg8Ji8OtUBGKUlClH0zLx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32035'),
  ('235061032245034664', 'Little Big Shots', 2016, 'Reality, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Melissa McCarthy', 'TV-G', 'A comedy-variety series showcasing young musicians, singers, dancers and every form of wunderkind in the country. Harvey goes toe-to-toe with them in conversations and interviews, with hilarious results.', 'A comedy-variety series showcasing young musicians, singers, dancers and every form of wunderkind in the country. Harvey goes toe-to-toe with them in conversations and interviews, with hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inkDTbjxHMFJZDTWmWDw12z31Ft.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66043'),
  ('347455572225122180', 'Little Bill', 1999, 'Animation', 'Bill Cosby', null, 'Xavier Pritchett, Gregory Hines, Phylicia Rashād, Ruby Dee, Monique Beasley, Eunice Cho, Kianna Underwood', 'TV-Y', 'Little Bill is a television show for children that is presently on Nick Jr. The stories are based on Bill Cosby''s Little Bill book series, set in Philadelphia and feature Bill Jr. learning a lesson or moral. It was developed through research and in consultation with a panel of educational consultants. The show also aired on CBS as part of Nick Jr. on CBS, from September 16, 2000 - September 7, 2002, then as part of Nick on CBS from August 2, 2003 - September 10, 2005. The show returned with the return of Nick Jr. on CBS on September 17, 2005, and seen through September 9, 2006 when the block was replaced with The KOL Secret Slumber Party on CBS. The series went back into production in fall 2006 and a new season of 6 episodes aired on Noggin throughout April and July 2007, ending in the later month. Reruns are played on Nick Jr., on BET, as of January 7, 2008, and on Centric, as of May 1, 2010. Sonia Manzano, best known for playing Maria Rodriguez on Sesame Street, was a frequent writer for the show.', 'Little Bill is a television show for children that is presently on Nick Jr. The stories are based on Bill Cosby''s Little Bill book series, set in Philadelphia and feature Bill Jr. learning a lesson or moral. It was developed through research and in consultation with a panel of educational consultants. The show also aired on CBS as part of Nick Jr. on CBS, from September 16, 2000 - September 7, 2002, then as part of Nick on CBS from August 2, 2003 - September 10, 2005. The show returned with the return of Nick Jr. on CBS on September 17, 2005, and seen through September 9, 2006 when the block was replaced with The KOL Secret Slumber Party on CBS. The series went back into production in fall 2006 and a new season of 6 episodes aired on Noggin throughout April and July 2007, ending in the later month. Reruns are played on Nick Jr., on BET, as of January 7, 2008, and on Centric, as of May 1, 2010. Sonia Manzano, best known for playing Maria Rodriguez on Sesame Street, was a frequent writer for the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uud37MhZDe2GuQuRIMNuJ1aZQM7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:6208'),
  ('683818725810400512', 'Little Birds', 2020, 'Drama', 'Sophia Al-Maria', 'Sophia Al-Maria', 'Juno Temple, Raphael Acloque, Jean-Marc Barr, David Costabile, Amy Landecker, Yumna Marwan, Matt Lauria, Hugh Skinner', null, 'We arrive with New York heiress Lucy Savage fresh off the transatlantic steamer and ready for love and marriage in exotic climes. But when her husband Hugo does not receive her in the way she expected, she spins off into the surprising, diverse and degenerate world of Tangier in 1955.', 'We arrive with New York heiress Lucy Savage fresh off the transatlantic steamer and ready for love and marriage in exotic climes. But when her husband Hugo does not receive her in the way she expected, she spins off into the surprising, diverse and degenerate world of Tangier in 1955.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rX24A3fV8jjnsDnLZ9O8OL4td6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106149'),
  ('1019271537780349998', 'Little Boy Blue', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Jeff Pope', 'Stephen Graham, Sinéad Keenan, Brían F. O''Byrne, Stephen Walters, Sonny Begya, Matthew Roberts, Christine Tremarco, Michael Moran', null, 'Based on a true story, this four-part drama tells the story of the murder of 11-year-old Rhys Jones in Croxteth, Liverpool, in 2007. It explores Melanie’s and Steve’s ordeal, and tells of how Rhys’ murderer and associates were eventually brought to justice.', 'Based on a true story, this four-part drama tells the story of the murder of 11-year-old Rhys Jones in Croxteth, Liverpool, in 2007. It explores Melanie’s and Steve’s ordeal, and tells of how Rhys’ murderer and associates were eventually brought to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjz2G4NjDvg50yDAyeggWDuybj2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71414'),
  ('498209910774629102', 'Little Britain', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Matt Lucas, David Walliams', null, 'David Walliams, Matt Lucas, Tom Baker, Paul Putner, Ruth Jones, Joann Condon, Charu Bala Chokshi, Kevin Lucero Less', null, 'A zany comedy show with Matt Lucas and David Walliams, featuring characters from all over Little Britain.', 'A zany comedy show with Matt Lucas and David Walliams, featuring characters from all over Little Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8ss1109kLq2Z4K1eO9575CCKBe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:380'),
  ('980086648190102434', 'Little Britain USA', 2008, 'Comedy', null, 'David Walliams, Matt Lucas', 'David Walliams, Matt Lucas, Tom Baker, Geraldine James, Lorna Scott', null, 'Lucas and David Walliams, the stars of the smash-hit BBC comedy Little Britain, bring their unique blend of scripted comedy and characterization to America.', 'Lucas and David Walliams, the stars of the smash-hit BBC comedy Little Britain, bring their unique blend of scripted comedy and characterization to America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMuZKZtr45MvGKuSehQAa4Er2xl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14880'),
  ('1067943912522513256', 'Little Busters!', 2012, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Yui Horie, Tomoe Tamiyasu, Hikaru Midorikawa, Nobutoshi Canna, Yusei Oda, Natsumi Yanase, Hikaru Isshiki, Keiko Suzuki', 'TV-14', 'Riki was a child when his parents died, leaving him hopeless and depressed. What saved him was a group of four kids calling themselves the Little Busters. They took Riki out and played with him during his time of need. He really enjoyed being together with them, and his grief gradually faded away. Now in his second year of high school they still hang out, fight and live together, and enjoy their school life.', 'Riki was a child when his parents died, leaving him hopeless and depressed. What saved him was a group of four kids calling themselves the Little Busters. They took Riki out and played with him during his time of need. He really enjoyed being together with them, and his grief gradually faded away. Now in his second year of high school they still hang out, fight and live together, and enjoy their school life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyt2vTDIfpfBXKt7uTQn67YZK8z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:53715'),
  ('217199598256350721', 'Little Coincidences', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Javier Veiga', null, 'Alicia Rubio, Mariano Peña, Juan Ibáñez Pérez, Tomás Pozzi, Marta Hazas, Javier Veiga', 'NR', 'Marta and Javi don''t know each other and neither of them has the slightest intention of complicating their lives with anything, much less with anyone. And the idea of being parents has never crossed their minds…until now.', 'Marta and Javi don''t know each other and neither of them has the slightest intention of complicating their lives with anything, much less with anyone. And the idea of being parents has never crossed their minds…until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BxGr9gLlRGanvsD98I1nmXVhEK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84763'),
  ('483971908815189378', 'Little Demon', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Kieran Valla, Seth Kirschner, Darcy Fowler', null, 'Aubrey Plaza, Lucy DeVito, Danny DeVito', 'TV-MA', '13 years after being impregnated by Satan, a reluctant mother, Laura, and her Antichrist daughter, Chrissy, attempt to live an ordinary life in Delaware, but are constantly thwarted by monstrous forces, including Satan, who yearns for custody of his daughter''s soul.', '13 years after being impregnated by Satan, a reluctant mother, Laura, and her Antichrist daughter, Chrissy, attempt to live an ordinary life in Delaware, but are constantly thwarted by monstrous forces, including Satan, who yearns for custody of his daughter''s soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lyFPOe6JScMBiLQuMtf3pPZxAu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125392'),
  ('1013660517431680075', 'Little Disasters', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ruth Fowler', null, 'Diane Kruger, Jo Joyner, Shelley Conn, Emily Taaffe, Jax James, Patrick Baladi, Stephen Campbell Moore, JJ Feild', null, 'When Jess takes her baby to hospital with an unexplained head injury, her close friend, A&E doctor Liz, makes the excruciating decision to call social services, igniting an explosive chain of events.', 'When Jess takes her baby to hospital with an unexplained head injury, her close friend, A&E doctor Liz, makes the excruciating decision to call social services, igniting an explosive chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQJZBIEWw91O9MbpUOBRcd5JvJl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256585'),
  ('67828578841756801', 'Little Dorrit', 2008, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Claire Foy, Matthew Macfadyen, Tom Courtenay, Judy Parfitt, Emma Pierson, Alun Armstrong, Eddie Marsan, Jason Thorpe', 'TV-PG', 'Amy Dorrit spends her days earning money for the family and looking after her proud father who is a long term inmate of Marshalsea debtors'' prison in London. Amy and her family''s world is transformed when her employer''s son, Arthur Clennam, returns from overseas to solve his family''s mysterious legacy and discovers that their lives are interlinked.', 'Amy Dorrit spends her days earning money for the family and looking after her proud father who is a long term inmate of Marshalsea debtors'' prison in London. Amy and her family''s world is transformed when her employer''s son, Arthur Clennam, returns from overseas to solve his family''s mysterious legacy and discovers that their lives are interlinked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CTWoruhvpCGiR9PavoARnnV8Y1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13561'),
  ('1090974456787846401', 'Little Einsteins', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Douglas Wood', null, 'Natalia Wojcik, Jesse Schwartz, Erica Huang, Aiden Pompey, Harrison Chad', 'TV-Y', 'A group of musically gifted and ethnically diverse children travel around the world in an artificially intelligent rocket named Rocket.', 'A group of musically gifted and ethnically diverse children travel around the world in an artificially intelligent rocket named Rocket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ur6dZkHaUhLNkOo1ishRLJ10Tvc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3090'),
  ('1033523273838501773', 'Little Faith', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Pepón Montero, Juan Maidagán', null, 'Raúl Cimas, Esperanza Pedreño, Chani Martín, Julia de Castro, María Jesús Hoyos, Juan Lombardero, Marta Fernández Muro, Pilar Gómez', null, 'A comedy of manners that follows the daily miseries and constant micro-humiliations suffered by José Ramón and Berta, a married couple in whom no one, not even they themselves, has much faith.', 'A comedy of manners that follows the daily miseries and constant micro-humiliations suffered by José Ramón and Berta, a married couple in whom no one, not even they themselves, has much faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yCNbwqw8z5VZOG1zfmdY73BOUa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226469'),
  ('1026623941127215408', 'Little Fires Everywhere', 2020, 'Drama', 'Liz Tigelaar', null, 'Kerry Washington, Reese Witherspoon, Joshua Jackson, Rosemarie DeWitt, Jade Pettyjohn, Lexi Underwood, Megan Stott, Gavin Lewis', 'TV-MA', 'The intertwined fates of the picture-perfect Richardson family and an enigmatic mother and daughter who upend their lives. Explore the weight of secrets, the nature of art and identity, the ferocious pull of motherhood – and the danger in believing that following the rules can avert disaster.', 'The intertwined fates of the picture-perfect Richardson family and an enigmatic mother and daughter who upend their lives. Explore the weight of secrets, the nature of art and identity, the ferocious pull of motherhood – and the danger in believing that following the rules can avert disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EQQMl0mp8L0hMxAUZNfoCh1Tkb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90257'),
