  ('1009069810586233995', 'Live from E!', 2002, 'Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Ryan Seacrest, Giuliana Rancic', null, 'The pre-show to the major award shows that airs on E! Entertainment Television. Live From the Red Carpet covers celebrity arrivals and gets you right up for a first-row seat to see the stars and all the excitement with live coverage of the fashion, flair, glitz and glamour.', 'The pre-show to the major award shows that airs on E! Entertainment Television. Live From the Red Carpet covers celebrity arrivals and gets you right up for a first-row seat to see the stars and all the excitement with live coverage of the fashion, flair, glitz and glamour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XCI9ThFybnoHx7EXZdnVNw4l8x.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:14598'),
  ('85711142355814196', 'Live from Studio Five', 2009, 'Talk', 'Erron Gordon, James Haggar', null, 'Kate Walsh, Jayne Middlemiss, Emma Willis, Brian Dowling, Ian Wright, Melinda Messenger, Sian Welby', null, 'Live from Studio Five was an early-evening British magazine programme which was produced by Sky News for Channel 5. It was presented by Kate Walsh and a line-up of other co-presenters during its run. It consisted of interviews and discussing topical issues, with an emphasis on showbusiness news and celebrity gossip, after originally covering stories from a popular news agenda. It aired its final edition on 4 February 2011 and was replaced by OK! TV in February 2011 which lasted just nine months on air before itself being axed.', 'Live from Studio Five was an early-evening British magazine programme which was produced by Sky News for Channel 5. It was presented by Kate Walsh and a line-up of other co-presenters during its run. It consisted of interviews and discussing topical issues, with an emphasis on showbusiness news and celebrity gossip, after originally covering stories from a popular news agenda. It aired its final edition on 4 February 2011 and was replaced by OK! TV in February 2011 which lasted just nine months on air before itself being axed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvcklKVYE12ZUOniclBp1t2QsKP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30769'),
  ('83607954173613032', 'Live On', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bang Yoo-jung', 'Bang Yoo-jung', 'Minhyun, Jung Da-bin, Ro Jong-hyun, Yang Hye-ji, Yeon Woo, Choi Byung-chan, Woo Da-vi, Hyun Woo-seok', null, 'Baek Ho-rang is a high school student. Due to her pretty appearance, she is popular on social media and at her school. Yet, Baek Ho-rang only has one friend, due to her condescending personality. Baek Ho-rang encounters a problem. She learns that someone is trying to unveil her secret. To find that anonymous person, Baek Ho-rang joins her high school''s broadcasting club. Go Eun-taek is the chief of the broadcasting club. He is a perfectionist and respected by the club members.', 'Baek Ho-rang is a high school student. Due to her pretty appearance, she is popular on social media and at her school. Yet, Baek Ho-rang only has one friend, due to her condescending personality. Baek Ho-rang encounters a problem. She learns that someone is trying to unveil her secret. To find that anonymous person, Baek Ho-rang joins her high school''s broadcasting club. Go Eun-taek is the chief of the broadcasting club. He is a perfectionist and respected by the club members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dop9lujlpXaIGZImoTgUteHXt7a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111724'),
  ('952892651061923019', 'Live PD', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', null, null, 'Dan Abrams, Sean Larkin, Tom Morris', 'TV-14', 'Dash cams capture footage from urban and rural police forces while on the job. A live look inside the everyday calls of police officers across the nation.', 'Dash cams capture footage from urban and rural police forces while on the job. A live look inside the everyday calls of police officers across the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2I2KNf7jZhtkuVVTCqdIgGiNmlI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68430'),
