  ('413571026150778558', 'Live to 100: Secrets of the Blue Zones', 2023, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Clay Jeter', null, 'Dan Buettner', 'TV-PG', 'Travel around the world with author Dan Buettner to discover five unique communities where people live extraordinarily long and vibrant lives.', 'Travel around the world with author Dan Buettner to discover five unique communities where people live extraordinarily long and vibrant lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aI22aHKtFHQ5r6AVu0uf7q9UUAn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231483'),
  ('84936172548324816', 'Live Up to Your Name', 2017, 'Drama', 'Hong Jong-chan', 'Kim Seon-soo', 'Kim Nam-gil, Kim A-joong, Yoo Min-kyu, Mun Ka-young, Uhm Hyo-seop, Ahn Suk-hwan, Lee Dae-yeon, Oh Dae-hwan', 'TV-MA', 'Heo Im is an oriental doctor, acknowledged as the best in acupuncture and moxibustion in Joseon. His success is blocked due to his low status.', 'Heo Im is an oriental doctor, acknowledged as the best in acupuncture and moxibustion in Joseon. His success is blocked due to his low status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vH30aXwKeirVDxUyOWX9H1WJziu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72851'),
  ('418946840358976717', 'Live up to Your Youth', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Mantang Gao', 'Bai Yu, Zhang Ruonan, Lin Yun, Wang Yanlin, Song Jiateng, Alvin Cao', null, 'In 1990s Beijing, a small inn bears witness to the lives of a group of young men and women who have come from all corners of the country, to chase their dreams in the city. Xu Shengli, obsessed with scriptwriting, never gives up despite constant rejection. Singer Zhuang Zhuang, yearning to perform on prestigious stages, can only make a living through commercial gigs. Shen Ranran, hoping to play leading roles, faces opportunities and tough choices in the flashy entertainment industry. Talented cellist Tao Liangliang plays under overpasses, pursuing his musical dreams. Guo Zongbao, a background actor and an artist at heart, juggles odd jobs in order to treat his wife and children''s illnesses. Painter Cao Ye struggles in a world that does not understand him. They work tirelessly for their dreams, yet reality is always cruel and unyielding. As the new millennium arrives, some continue to persevere while others are forced to give up, but the flame of art never dies in their hearts.', 'In 1990s Beijing, a small inn bears witness to the lives of a group of young men and women who have come from all corners of the country, to chase their dreams in the city. Xu Shengli, obsessed with scriptwriting, never gives up despite constant rejection. Singer Zhuang Zhuang, yearning to perform on prestigious stages, can only make a living through commercial gigs. Shen Ranran, hoping to play leading roles, faces opportunities and tough choices in the flashy entertainment industry. Talented cellist Tao Liangliang plays under overpasses, pursuing his musical dreams. Guo Zongbao, a background actor and an artist at heart, juggles odd jobs in order to treat his wife and children''s illnesses. Painter Cao Ye struggles in a world that does not understand him. They work tirelessly for their dreams, yet reality is always cruel and unyielding. As the new millennium arrives, some continue to persevere while others are forced to give up, but the flame of art never dies in their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ta2a5WuhNi5jwTiWAVGb1fOIed.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291470'),
  ('774654889436451694', 'LIVE with Kelly and Mark', 1988, 'Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'A morning talk show with A-list celebrity guests, top-notch performances and one-of-a-kind segments that are unrivaled on daytime television, plus spontaneous, hilarious and unpredictable talk.', 'A morning talk show with A-list celebrity guests, top-notch performances and one-of-a-kind segments that are unrivaled on daytime television, plus spontaneous, hilarious and unpredictable talk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBkyypWN3EcOzkozatiCm5VeaG.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:1900'),
  ('386055280794026330', 'Live XXX TV', null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Live XXX TV was an interactive televised sex line aired in many western European nations on Sky. The channel was shown between the hours of 21:00 and 05:30 each night, with a subscription required after 23:30.', 'Live XXX TV was an interactive televised sex line aired in many western European nations on Sky. The channel was shown between the hours of 21:00 and 05:30 each night, with a subscription required after 23:30.', null, 0, 'tmdb:tv:8067'),
  ('945410509630716781', 'Live Your Own Life', 2023, 'Family, Drama', 'Jo Jung-seon', 'Jo Jung-seon', 'Uee, Ha Jun, Go Joo-won, Kim Doh-yon, Nam Sung-jin, Lee Kwang-gi, Nam Bo-ra, Yoon Mi-ra', null, 'The story of Hyo-sim, who sacrificed her life for her family trying to lead an independent life as she began to value herself.', 'The story of Hyo-sim, who sacrificed her life for her family trying to lead an independent life as she began to value herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sfKzecmftFv3EQclsDQC9kVebv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223213'),
  ('422305336834154245', 'Living', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Du Zheng-zhe', 'Du Zheng-zhe, Lin Yan-ru', 'Wu Kang-ren, Joe Cheng, JC Lin, Sandrine Pinna, Sun Ke-fang, Yang Kuei-mei, King Jieh-wen, Beatrice Fang', null, 'The defeated Kao Jia Yue suddenly comes back home after many years. Many people feel awkward about his return, and hope he will leave soon. His nephew Cheng Yu is the only exception, as he finds Jia Yue different from other adults. Jia Yue realizes everyone, including himself, is struggling in life with so many challenges. His parents have an unhappy marriage, his second brother doesn’t feel he belongs at home, and his third brother is bewildered about his future. However, they continue to stumble and move on in life. Witnessing how everyone works hard to survive, Jia Yue also starts to plan his next step. He thought it was time to carry out his suicide plan…', 'The defeated Kao Jia Yue suddenly comes back home after many years. Many people feel awkward about his return, and hope he will leave soon. His nephew Cheng Yu is the only exception, as he finds Jia Yue different from other adults. Jia Yue realizes everyone, including himself, is struggling in life with so many challenges. His parents have an unhappy marriage, his second brother doesn’t feel he belongs at home, and his third brother is bewildered about his future. However, they continue to stumble and move on in life. Witnessing how everyone works hard to survive, Jia Yue also starts to plan his next step. He thought it was time to carry out his suicide plan…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7BGl85huzvUFdcdy5iui5rSdaB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221847'),
  ('703016475287866713', 'Living Among the Rich', 2011, 'Family', 'Kim Sok-yun', 'Kim Soo-jin, Park Hae-young', 'Kim Hye-ja, Oh Ji-eun, Hyun Woo, Lee Sang-yeob, Lee Bo-hee, Seo Seung-hyeon, Woo Hyeon, Choi Moo-seong', null, 'Ji-Eun is thrilled to hear that her mother Hye-Ja is moving to Cheongdam neighborhood. Hye-Ja & Ji-Eun lived in the suburbs for thier whole life. Ji-Eun dreams of living a luxurious life, but her reality is quite different. The house they move into is on the 2nd story of a building which looks like it will collapse. The first floor of the building is a comic book shop and the second floor is a lodging house. Their building is located between luxurious buildings in Cheongdam neighborhood.', 'Ji-Eun is thrilled to hear that her mother Hye-Ja is moving to Cheongdam neighborhood. Hye-Ja & Ji-Eun lived in the suburbs for thier whole life. Ji-Eun dreams of living a luxurious life, but her reality is quite different. The house they move into is on the 2nd story of a building which looks like it will collapse. The first floor of the building is a comic book shop and the second floor is a lodging house. Their building is located between luxurious buildings in Cheongdam neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7d4HhXb0B9UGnEKWqF8aTHBYZ3Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97010'),
  ('845444821895046995', 'Living for the Dead', 2023, 'Reality, Comedy, Documentary', 'David Collins, Rob Eric, Renata Lombardo', null, 'Kristen Stewart, Alexandre LeMay, Roz Hernandez, Juju Bae, Ken Boggle, Logan Taylor', 'TV-14', 'Five fabulous, queer ghost hunters criss-cross the country, helping the living by healing the dead. As they explore some of the world’s most infamous haunted locations, they’ll shed light on those not seen and illuminate untold stories. Together they’ll push past boundaries to bring acceptance to the misunderstood – living and dead.', 'Five fabulous, queer ghost hunters criss-cross the country, helping the living by healing the dead. As they explore some of the world’s most infamous haunted locations, they’ll shed light on those not seen and illuminate untold stories. Together they’ll push past boundaries to bring acceptance to the misunderstood – living and dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrsZhFAOHNYqxf9robhjOszja9y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233269'),
  ('978025686955766159', 'Living Single', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Yvette Lee Bowser', null, 'Queen Latifah, Kim Coles, Erika Alexander, Terrence ''T.C.'' Carson, John Henton, Kim Fields, Mel Jackson', 'TV-PG', 'Living Single is an American television sitcom that aired for five seasons on the Fox network from August 22, 1993, to January 1, 1998. The show centered on the lives of six friends who share personal and professional experiences while living in a Brooklyn brownstone. Throughout its run, Living Single became one of the most popular African-American sitcoms of its era, ranking among the top five in African-American ratings in all five seasons. The series was produced by Yvette Lee Bowser''s company, Sister Lee, in association with Warner Bros. Television. In contrast to the popularity of NBC''s "Must See TV" on Thursday nights in the 1990s, many African American and Latino viewers flocked to Fox''s Thursday night line-up of Martin, Living Single, and New York Undercover. In fact, these were the three highest-rated series among black households for the 1996–1997 season.', 'Living Single is an American television sitcom that aired for five seasons on the Fox network from August 22, 1993, to January 1, 1998. The show centered on the lives of six friends who share personal and professional experiences while living in a Brooklyn brownstone. Throughout its run, Living Single became one of the most popular African-American sitcoms of its era, ranking among the top five in African-American ratings in all five seasons. The series was produced by Yvette Lee Bowser''s company, Sister Lee, in association with Warner Bros. Television. In contrast to the popularity of NBC''s "Must See TV" on Thursday nights in the 1990s, many African American and Latino viewers flocked to Fox''s Thursday night line-up of Martin, Living Single, and New York Undercover. In fact, these were the three highest-rated series among black households for the 1996–1997 season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgttYgspalxaLVrjJ9rxzDG9owO.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4270'),
  ('38653757187262753', 'Living Undocumented', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Eight undocumented families'' fates roller-coast as the United States'' immigration policies are transformed.', 'Eight undocumented families'' fates roller-coast as the United States'' immigration policies are transformed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG2hwUJShwqmJ4KmSV6KmcGZQIp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93723'),
  ('626201424510693445', 'Living with Fran', 2005, 'Comedy', 'David C. Garrett, Jr., Josh H. Etting, Jamie Kennedy', null, 'Fran Drescher, Ryan McPartlin, Misti Traya, Ben Feldman', null, 'Living With Fran is an American sitcom that debuted on The WB in April 2005 that starred Fran Drescher. The show last aired on March 24, 2006.', 'Living With Fran is an American sitcom that debuted on The WB in April 2005 that starred Fran Drescher. The show last aired on March 24, 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIteP87gv62nojxNzkkR83otRaq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:545'),
  ('91513594298903667', 'Living with Him', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miyata Toworu', null, 'Ryuga Sato, Sakai Sho, Hinami Mori, Sawamura Rei', null, 'They were best friends once. Now they’re roommates, and Ryota can’t stop thinking about what love might look like between them.', 'They were best friends once. Now they’re roommates, and Ryota can’t stop thinking about what love might look like between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aL6o7fg35ap9ZRgD6YrwuUenHXt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248497'),
  ('78007453368278138', 'Living with Yourself', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Timothy Greenberg', null, 'Paul Rudd, Aisling Bea, Ali Akbar Sepahi', 'TV-MA', 'Burned out on life, Miles undergoes a strange procedure at a strip mall spa -- and wakes to find he''s been replaced by a better version of himself.', 'Burned out on life, Miles undergoes a strange procedure at a strip mall spa -- and wakes to find he''s been replaced by a better version of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLo2TqZ4UHHZU0UJbhi3lraCJNu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81532'),
  ('400738841559820067', 'Liza on Demand', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Deborah Kaplan, Liza Koshy, Harry Elfont', null, 'Liza Koshy, Travis Coles, Kimiko Glenn', 'TV-14', 'LIZA ON DEMAND is a half-hour, single camera comedy that follows the chaotic misadventures of Liza, a young woman in Los Angeles who is trying to make a career out of juggling various gig economy jobs — for lack of a better idea of what to do with her life. Meanwhile, Liza''s best friends and roommates Oliver and Harlow try their best to both support and sometimes distract her.', 'LIZA ON DEMAND is a half-hour, single camera comedy that follows the chaotic misadventures of Liza, a young woman in Los Angeles who is trying to make a career out of juggling various gig economy jobs — for lack of a better idea of what to do with her life. Meanwhile, Liza''s best friends and roommates Oliver and Harlow try their best to both support and sometimes distract her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MlSuBsIQBau74cWQFD7tqCOox9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80604'),
  ('493429194530290767', 'Lizard Lick Towing', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Lizard Lick Towing is an American TV series that is filmed in the style of cinema verité. The show is a spin-off of the truTV series All Worked Up, and follows Ron, Amy, Bobby and their team of repossession agents in Wendell, North Carolina. The show is known for the large amount of fights and brawls that take place during the repossessions.', 'Lizard Lick Towing is an American TV series that is filmed in the style of cinema verité. The show is a spin-off of the truTV series All Worked Up, and follows Ron, Amy, Bobby and their team of repossession agents in Wendell, North Carolina. The show is known for the large amount of fights and brawls that take place during the repossessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mby7ORD8YUWFwON3iOqR5Iucsad.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:37745'),
  ('1081136900312975103', 'Lizzie McGuire', 2001, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Terri Minsky', null, 'Hilary Duff, Lalaine, Jake Thomas, Hallie Todd, Robert Carradine, Adam Lamberg', 'TV-G', 'Lizzie McGuire is all about the ordinary and not-so-ordinary adventures of a junior high student and her two best friends as they try to deal with the ups and downs of school, popularity, boys, parents, a bratty little brother--just life in general. And if Lizzie leaves anything unsaid, you can bet that her cartoon alter ego will say it for her!', 'Lizzie McGuire is all about the ordinary and not-so-ordinary adventures of a junior high student and her two best friends as they try to deal with the ups and downs of school, popularity, boys, parents, a bratty little brother--just life in general. And if Lizzie leaves anything unsaid, you can bet that her cartoon alter ego will say it for her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZOelP1XNP8eCwkhJvwRyVU9Ymd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4575'),
  ('580914164512019947', 'Lizzo''s Watch Out for the Big Grrrls', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lizzo', 'TV-MA', 'Superstar Lizzo is on the hunt for confident, badass women to join her world tour, and only the most talented dancers will have what it takes to twerk it out on world stages with her and join in the ranks of the elite BIG GRRRLS.', 'Superstar Lizzo is on the hunt for confident, badass women to join her world tour, and only the most talented dancers will have what it takes to twerk it out on world stages with her and join in the ranks of the elite BIG GRRRLS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/409B0IT2vsPfrW4vEzbZJhFnJrB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157903'),
  ('226100095048079869', 'Lloyd in Space', 2001, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Paul Germain, Joe Ansolabehere', null, 'Courtland Mead, Nicolette Little, April Winchell, Brian Doyle-Murray, Brian George, Justin Shenkarow, Pamela Hayden, Bill Fagerbakke', 'TV-G', 'Lloyd in Space is an animated television series, created by Joe Ansolabehere and Paul Germain, and released in 2001 on ABC-TV on Saturday mornings. The pilot was written by Ansolabehere, Germain and Mark Drop. The characters were designed by Eric Keyes.', 'Lloyd in Space is an animated television series, created by Joe Ansolabehere and Paul Germain, and released in 2001 on ABC-TV on Saturday mornings. The pilot was written by Ansolabehere, Germain and Mark Drop. The characters were designed by Eric Keyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysifCfQ5yrjsopi4d8kgycmYr3Y.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3085'),
  ('856509173530213888', 'Lo + plus', 1995, 'Talk', null, null, 'Ramón Arangüena, Máximo Pradera, Fernando Schwartz, Ana García Siñeriz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22QPBqR0C6Yr0ooaoL0DZcEBhzs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22770'),
  ('1005739463164874238', 'Lo imperdonable', 2015, 'Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', null, 'Ana Brenda Contreras, Iván Sánchez, Grettell Valdéz, Sergio Sendel, Sebastián Zurita, Gaby Mellado, Marcelo Buquet, Gabriela Goldsmith', 'TV-14', 'Martín (Iván Sánchez) hurries to Mina Escondida after getting an urgent letter from his brother begging to be rescued from the hell in which he''s living. On arrival, Martin despairs upon finding out that Demetrio (Pablo Montero), his brother, has committed suicide. His sorrow is transformed into hatred and a thirst for vengeance against the woman who caused his brother suffering and brought him to death.', 'Martín (Iván Sánchez) hurries to Mina Escondida after getting an urgent letter from his brother begging to be rescued from the hell in which he''s living. On arrival, Martin despairs upon finding out that Demetrio (Pablo Montero), his brother, has committed suicide. His sorrow is transformed into hatred and a thirst for vengeance against the woman who caused his brother suffering and brought him to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vYFr3aKxWKNDbvjO29p0Bbpc5p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62552'),
