  ('962051654921287753', 'Loups Garous', 2024, 'Reality', 'Fary Lopes, Panayotis Pascot', null, 'Yvick Letexier, Panayotis Pascot, Fary Lopes', null, 'The Werewolves of Miller''s Hollow, the best-selling French card game in the world, is reinvented like never before: CANAL+ transforms this cult game into a life-size social experience. Thirteen players, specialists in strategy and concealment, compete in real time for a game of life-size Werewolves.', 'The Werewolves of Miller''s Hollow, the best-selling French card game in the world, is reinvented like never before: CANAL+ transforms this cult game into a life-size social experience. Thirteen players, specialists in strategy and concealment, compete in real time for a game of life-size Werewolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YbGpoXRL7xcdz8GWQ2V6cr3QUa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:270963'),
