  ('281758782033113820', 'Luz Clarita', 1996, 'Soap, Family, Drama, Kids', 'Abel Santacruz', 'Dolores Ortega', 'Daniela Luján, César Évora Díaz, Verónica Merchant, Ximena Sariñana, Aitor Iturrioz, Paty Díaz, Frances Ondiviela, Lily Garza', null, 'Luz Clarita is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa that aired on Canal de las Estrellas in 1996. The series, a remake of Andrea Celeste and Chispita, stars Verónica Merchant and César Évora, as well as child actors Daniela Luján and Ximena Sariñana. It has a dual storyline intended to attract both children and adults.', 'Luz Clarita is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa that aired on Canal de las Estrellas in 1996. The series, a remake of Andrea Celeste and Chispita, stars Verónica Merchant and César Évora, as well as child actors Daniela Luján and Ximena Sariñana. It has a dual storyline intended to attract both children and adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPAOCWVuWF8QqeFhp5hXkvOHhhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32505'),
  ('716340492409355655', 'Luzie, der Schrecken der Straße', 1980, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jindřich Polák, Ota Hofman', null, null, null, '1980 German/Czech Children TV series', '1980 German/Czech Children TV series', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7incF5z2wpKyGowdOGrCl0NVZuN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60623'),
  ('1032687837300834656', 'Lycoris Recoil', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Chika Anzai, Shion Wakayama, Ami Koshimizu, Misaki Kuno, Kosuke Sakaki', 'TV-14', 'A spirited secret agent and her aloof colleague work in an unassuming, charming cafe while happily helping their customers'' out in any way they can.', 'A spirited secret agent and her aloof colleague work in an unassuming, charming cafe while happily helping their customers'' out in any way they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcPLwLGEU4alv9sOWvzSY4IorxV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154494'),
  ('887971404963733670', 'Lying Heart', 2016, 'Drama, Soap', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', null, 'Thelma Madrigal, Pablo Lyle, Dulce María, Diego Olivera, Alejandro Tommasi, Mayrín Villanueva, Alexis Ayala, Lourdes Reyes', null, 'Mariela Salvatierra is an orphan and was only 11 when her grandfather Manuel died because of Demián Ferrer. Being left on her own, destiny pushed her to leave the country under the care of Leonardo Del Río. 15 years have passed since they left, but now Mariela and Leonardo have returned to face Demián Ferrer. Demián is a fairly powerful and unscrupulous business man who doesn’t even honor his own family. He disregards Santiago, his youngest son, and manipulates and deceives his oldest son, Alonso. This attitude affects Mariela too, since Alonso doesn’t dare to turn his back on his father, which tinges their relationship with love and hatred at once. To make things worse, Renata, a luscious and dishonest girl, moves in to the Ferrer’s home and becomes obsessed with Alonso, doing everything she can to separate him from Mariela and making her come closer to another man who is in love with her.', 'Mariela Salvatierra is an orphan and was only 11 when her grandfather Manuel died because of Demián Ferrer. Being left on her own, destiny pushed her to leave the country under the care of Leonardo Del Río. 15 years have passed since they left, but now Mariela and Leonardo have returned to face Demián Ferrer. Demián is a fairly powerful and unscrupulous business man who doesn’t even honor his own family. He disregards Santiago, his youngest son, and manipulates and deceives his oldest son, Alonso. This attitude affects Mariela too, since Alonso doesn’t dare to turn his back on his father, which tinges their relationship with love and hatred at once. To make things worse, Renata, a luscious and dishonest girl, moves in to the Ferrer’s home and becomes obsessed with Alonso, doing everything she can to separate him from Mariela and making her come closer to another man who is in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmH51jGILGGaGdnGTZnQFo7QwSj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106969'),
  ('1060252973660269638', 'Lykke', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stig Thorsboe, Hanna Lundblad', 'Stig Thorsboe, Hanna Lundblad', 'Mille Lehfeldt, Ann Eleonora Jørgensen, David Dencik, Laus Høybye, Mathilde Norholt, Lars Brygmann, Timm Vladimir, Rasmus Botoft', 'TV-G', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ke7bgt0yDUw9DVsDoG2vam6sX4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69995'),
  ('904957798182827867', 'Lynch', 2012, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Juliana Barrera', null, 'Natalia Oreiro, Tatán Ramírez, Katia del Pino, Jorge Perugorría, Alejandro Calva, Marcela Carvajal, Jorge Monterrosa, Paula Castaño', null, 'A macabre and funny business of fake deaths explores the different reasons why a person fakes their own funeral to start a new life.', 'A macabre and funny business of fake deaths explores the different reasons why a person fakes their own funeral to start a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oUIAJZMZ014NoqERAKnmuGEs6P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44977'),
  ('925761759601641208', 'Lynley', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Steve Thompson', null, 'Leo Suter, Sofia Barclay, Daniel Mays, Michael Workéyè', null, 'Tommy Lynley, an aristocratic detective, and Barbara Havers, a working-class maverick sergeant, share little in common; except a passion for justice. His intellect and her instincts make them an unlikely but formidable team.', 'Tommy Lynley, an aristocratic detective, and Barbara Havers, a working-class maverick sergeant, share little in common; except a passion for justice. His intellect and her instincts make them an unlikely but formidable team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBwCKjg3CNonSWMmE7VghNc4qBm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274479'),
  ('420059706957123157', 'M - A City Hunts a Murderer', 2019, 'Crime', 'David Schalko', null, 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Lars Eidinger, Udo Kier, Brigitte Hobmeier, Verena Altenberger, Sophie Rois, Bela B., Julia Stemberger', 'NR', 'Winter in Vienna. Children disappear. For now without a trace, then their bodies are found. A gift for the tabloid press. For the police a series of defeats. Politically a problem. And at the same time the long-awaited opportunity for the ambitious interior minister. The organized crime is in trouble. The child murderer must be found so that all other dirty jobs can go on.', 'Winter in Vienna. Children disappear. For now without a trace, then their bodies are found. A gift for the tabloid press. For the police a series of defeats. Politically a problem. And at the same time the long-awaited opportunity for the ambitious interior minister. The organized crime is in trouble. The child murderer must be found so that all other dirty jobs can go on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNei188pcYJqWEkRSd5OZhIJWRK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83047'),
  ('821044163244200032', 'M Countdown', 2004, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sung Hanbin, Lee So-hee, Jaehyun', 'NR', 'M Countdown, the World No.1 K-POP Chart Show, is broadcast in 13 countries worldwide, including Mnet USA and Japan. Featuring a dazzling lineup of K-Pop stars delivering charismatic performances, spectacular stages, and even online voting for active fan engagement! M Countdown announces the top 10 songs of the week as "MCD''s Top 10" by combining weekly album and song sales, online music fan votes, and votes from a panel of music experts. Viewers can directly vote for the winner during the live broadcast, providing a glimpse of the latest K-Pop trends. Since its debut in 2004, M COUNTDOWN has aired over 800 episodes as of 2023. Experience the WORLD NO.1 K-POP Premium Chart Show leading the global K-Pop craze and music trends.', 'M Countdown, the World No.1 K-POP Chart Show, is broadcast in 13 countries worldwide, including Mnet USA and Japan. Featuring a dazzling lineup of K-Pop stars delivering charismatic performances, spectacular stages, and even online voting for active fan engagement! M Countdown announces the top 10 songs of the week as "MCD''s Top 10" by combining weekly album and song sales, online music fan votes, and votes from a panel of music experts. Viewers can directly vote for the winner during the live broadcast, providing a glimpse of the latest K-Pop trends. Since its debut in 2004, M COUNTDOWN has aired over 800 episodes as of 2023. Experience the WORLD NO.1 K-POP Premium Chart Show leading the global K-Pop craze and music trends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hORGaqUt13CTLlVUx5KUdiwaGl0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35026'),
  ('351148166493588654', 'M Squad', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Lee Marvin, Paul Newlan', 'TV-PG', 'Lt. Frank Ballinger is a no-nonsense plain clothes cop in the elite M Squad Division. The Squad''s task is to root out organised crime and corruption in America''s Second City, Chicago.', 'Lt. Frank Ballinger is a no-nonsense plain clothes cop in the elite M Squad Division. The Squad''s task is to root out organised crime and corruption in America''s Second City, Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mDoUftlI60WeGmlp35NJ6XRfrk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:12512'),
  ('745826739601629166', 'M.A.N.T.I.S.', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sam Raimi', null, 'Carl Lumbly, Roger Rees, Chris Gartin, Galyn Görg, Jerry Wasserman, Gary Graham, Robert Hooks, Blu Mankuma', null, 'M.A.N.T.I.S. is an American science fiction television series that aired for one season on the Fox Network between August 1994 and March 1995. The original two-hour pilot was produced by Sam Raimi and developed by Sam Hamm. It stars actor Carl Lumbly. The show is unique in that it depicts an African-American superhero.', 'M.A.N.T.I.S. is an American science fiction television series that aired for one season on the Fox Network between August 1994 and March 1995. The original two-hour pilot was produced by Sam Raimi and developed by Sam Hamm. It stars actor Carl Lumbly. The show is unique in that it depicts an African-American superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwYUeCoxiDScgFqE7m8n7Qc9hWY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12431'),
  ('298594670789090642', 'M.A.S.K.', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Doug Stone, Brendan McKane, Sharon Noble, Brennan Thicke, Graeme McKenna, Mark Halloran, Martine Reigner, Cyrille Artaux', 'TV-Y7', 'The ‘80s animated series about masked crime fighters, the Mobile Armored Strike Kommand, out to stop the chaotic crime syndicate known as V.E.N.O.M.', 'The ‘80s animated series about masked crime fighters, the Mobile Armored Strike Kommand, out to stop the chaotic crime syndicate known as V.E.N.O.M.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGkNcWubSCTD5HLCscBhVcvh8tt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4961'),
  ('144774334544344458', 'M.I. High', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Family', 'Keith Brumpton', null, 'Chris Stanton, Jonny Freeman, Oyiza Momoh, Sam Strike, Oscar Jacques, Julia Brown, Channelle Owen, Megan McGill', 'NR', 'A team of undercover teenage spies working for the fictional British secret intelligence agency MI9 who have to balance their school life with their jobs as secret agents.', 'A team of undercover teenage spies working for the fictional British secret intelligence agency MI9 who have to balance their school life with their jobs as secret agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOqLG4MMaIIh7e4hH5ani1jgKlG.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:6513'),
  ('409489704439492068', 'M*A*S*H', 1972, 'War & Politics, Drama, Comedy', 'Larry Gelbart', null, 'Alan Alda, Mike Farrell, Harry Morgan, Loretta Swit, David Ogden Stiers, Jamie Farr, William Christopher', 'TV-PG', 'The 4077th Mobile Army Surgical Hospital is stuck in the middle of the Korean war. With little help from the circumstances they find themselves in, they are forced to make their own fun. Fond of practical jokes and revenge, the doctors, nurses, administrators, and soldiers often find ways of making wartime life bearable.', 'The 4077th Mobile Army Surgical Hospital is stuck in the middle of the Korean war. With little help from the circumstances they find themselves in, they are forced to make their own fun. Fond of practical jokes and revenge, the doctors, nurses, administrators, and soldiers often find ways of making wartime life bearable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rhuM3oMoEWKxAdrm7IyM8oq8cC.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:918'),
  ('751734104897143006', 'M/S Romantic', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tommi Korpela, Jani Volanen', 'Jani Volanen, Tommi Korpela', 'Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Tommi Korpela, Anna Paavilainen, Santeri Kinnunen, Petteri Pennilä, Antti Tuomas Heikkinen, Antti Luusuaniemi, Markku Maalismaa', null, 'One night on a cruise ship between Helsinki and Stockholm, six stories of happiness and misfortune.', 'One night on a cruise ship between Helsinki and Stockholm, six stories of happiness and misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biYCvu4jyoG2oo2GNKmm6Z90g3i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87086'),
  ('401938549856336619', 'M3: The Dark Metal', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Ayumu Murase, Kotori Koiwai, Sayuri Yahagi, Tetsuya Kakihara, Tomoaki Maeno, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Misato Fukuen', 'TV-MA', 'In a dark void known as the Lightless Realm, a group of children meet and bond, but are then separated and returned to their own dimension. Years later, these children reunite to fight "Admonitions," monsters that originate from the same void, using robots known as "Vess." However, their efforts only slow the ever-encroaching and expanding Lightless Realm from infecting their world. Their lives take a drastic turn when a new foe appears in the form of a "Corpse," whose song is rumored to kill any who hear it within nine days. The "Corpse Song" is heard by the group, and with this, they each begin to pull away and become caught up in their own personal problems—ultimately threatening the fate of humanity.', 'In a dark void known as the Lightless Realm, a group of children meet and bond, but are then separated and returned to their own dimension. Years later, these children reunite to fight "Admonitions," monsters that originate from the same void, using robots known as "Vess." However, their efforts only slow the ever-encroaching and expanding Lightless Realm from infecting their world. Their lives take a drastic turn when a new foe appears in the form of a "Corpse," whose song is rumored to kill any who hear it within nine days. The "Corpse Song" is heard by the group, and with this, they each begin to pull away and become caught up in their own personal problems—ultimately threatening the fate of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14GDH4WEXa6tmwxea10pxZl4eoH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60807'),
  ('407805352882518329', 'Ma Boy', 2012, 'Comedy', null, 'Moon Sun-Hee', 'Kim So-hyun, Sun Woong, Min Hoo, Lee Jong-Bak, Kim Hye-ji, Kang Hyun-joong, Yeon Song-ha, Hong Yun-hwa', null, 'Jang Geu Rim (Kim So Hyun) is a student at an arts high school who dreams of becoming a pop singer. At school she gets a new roommate, Irene (Sun Woong) who’s actually a boy. Irene’s persona is a pretty Female CF star and his actual name is Hyun Woo.', 'Jang Geu Rim (Kim So Hyun) is a student at an arts high school who dreams of becoming a pop singer. At school she gets a new roommate, Irene (Sun Woong) who’s actually a boy. Irene’s persona is a pretty Female CF star and his actual name is Hyun Woo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3TNH3r1VjNr7rGxEip2InBUVGP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72255'),
  ('868372447543146504', 'Ma Dashuai', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Zhao Benshan', 'Zhao Benshan, Bai Tiejun', 'Fan Wei, Zhao Benshan, Wang Yajie, Zhen Meng, Gang Zhao, XiaoGuang Zhang, Tang Jianjun, Guan Tingna', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFVFD3ZaOkNWR3ZjHooSyEtp1Ec.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111697'),
